(1,171,'plamod',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','2025-12-24 16:07:47','2025-12-24 16:07:47'),
(2,171,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-100-scale-mg-gundam-gp03s-ban901788','1/100 MG Gundam GP03S','<p>The GP-03S gets the MG treatment and as usual the results are superb. Includes a folding bazooka, beam rifle, beam saber and folding shield. The core fighter is detachable. Armor is detachable to expose the skeleton and hydraulics.Like all the kits in the MG series, the level of detail is superb, and virtually everything moves. The rocket packs are moveable and the hatch opens on top to allow access to the beam sword. The shield folds up to be stored on the arm. The left arm opens and the claw extends outward. Two types of hands are included -- fists, and posable (moving fingers).All of Bandai&amp;#x27;s MG (as well as HG) kits are completely snap-together, and parts are molded in color, so no painting is necessary. Of course, the use of cement and paints will improve the appearance of a finished model.</p>',NULL,'2025-12-24 17:05:02','2025-12-27 04:07:58'),
(3,156,'plamod',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','2025-12-24 18:52:54','2025-12-24 18:52:54'),
(4,156,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-100-scale-mg-00-qan-t-full-saber-bans55328','1/100 MG 00 Qan[T] Full Saber','<p>This variant of the 00 Qan[T] appeared in Mobile Suit Gundam Senki, and now it appears in Bandai&amp;#x27;s Master Grade model kit lineup! Equipped with its armor, it also comes with new parts for the GN Sword IV Full Saber, the GN capacitor, and the head antenna. It also comes with stickers, foil stickers and dry-transfer decals for its markings, and a base to support the GN Sword IV. Order it now![Includes]:GN Sword IVGN Gamblade (x3)GN Sword VGN Sword BitGN ShieldBase for GN Sword IVStickersFoil stickersDry-transfer decals</p>',NULL,'2025-12-24 18:52:56','2025-12-25 22:02:03'),
(5,2,'plamod','https://plamod.com/retailer/products/5060358',NULL,NULL,'[]','2025-12-24 19:01:14','2026-02-05 04:20:53'),
(6,2,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-144-scale-hg-gundam-astray-blue-frame-ban924120','HG Gundam Astray Blue Frame | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, high-grade or better injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             This crisp new Gundam Astray (blue frame) comes to us in a High Grade model, superbly molded in color and of course featuring snap-fit assembly for ease in building.  Nicely engineered, it\'s extremely poseable thanks to matching blue polycaps (instead of the standard grey!), and can even drop to one knee to use the included shoulder-mount bazooka!  Foil stickers for shiny bits and clear stickers for other markings are included as well, for added detail.',NULL,'2025-12-24 19:01:16','2026-02-05 04:20:57'),
(7,3,'plamod','https://plamod.com/retailer/products/5068840',NULL,NULL,'[]','2025-12-24 19:02:47','2026-02-05 05:52:05'),
(8,4,'plamod','https://plamod.com/retailer/products/5067428',NULL,NULL,'[]','2025-12-24 19:04:24','2026-02-05 04:46:44'),
(9,4,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-144-scale-hg-destiny-gundam-spec-ii-zeus-sillouette-banh674289','HG Destiny Gundam Spec II &amp; Zeus Sillouette | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, high-grade or better injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>The Destiny Gundam Spec II now joins Bandai\'s \"HG (High Grade)\" model-kit series, together with its super-large armament, the Zeus Silhouette! The Zeus Silhouette can also transform into a standalone MA form. It\'ll be over 50cm long, and can be displayed on the included action base. The hatches on the back and legs of the Zeus Silhouette can be opened and closed, and you can recreate the exposed state of the missile warhead with parts replacement. The HG Destiny Gundam Spec II is molded in color; clear molded parts such as the Wings of Light, effect parts for the Palma Fiocina, beam shield, and beam boomerang are also included. Weapons for the Destiny Gundam are also included, such as the Arondight beam sword and the high-energy long-range beam cannon. Order yours today!</p><p><b>[Includes]</b>:</p><ul><li>High-energy beam rifle</li><li>Shield</li><li>Beam shield</li><li>Arondight beam sword</li><li>High-energy long-range beam cannon</li><li>Beam parts for beam boomerang (x2)</li><li>Effect parts for Palma Fiocina (x1 set)</li><li>Hand parts for Palma Fiocina (x1 set)</li><li>Wings of Light effect parts (x1 set)</li><li>Missile parts for Zeus Silhouette (x1 set)</li><li>Display base (x2)</li><li>Joint parts for display (x1 set)</li><li>Stickers<br></li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Please note that the first release of this item may be limited, and in some cases it may not be possible to fill all orders at the time of its initial release. Any order not filled at the time of the initial release will be filled by subsequent restocks, but we recommend placing an order as soon as possible for your best chance to receive a piece from the first release!  </p>',NULL,'2025-12-24 19:04:26','2026-02-05 04:46:48'),
(10,5,'plamod','https://plamod.com/retailer/products/5068707',NULL,NULL,'[]','2025-12-24 19:05:57','2026-02-06 20:28:03'),
(11,6,'plamod','https://plamod.com/retailer/products/5069215',NULL,NULL,'[]','2025-12-24 19:07:35','2026-02-07 01:06:47'),
(12,8,'plamod','https://plamod.com/retailer/products/5068554',NULL,NULL,'[]','2025-12-24 19:11:10','2026-02-04 17:43:07'),
(13,8,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/30mm-armored-core-vi-fires-of-rubicon-balam-industries-bd-011-melander-banh685544','30MM ARMORED CORE VI FIRES OF RUBICON Balam Industries BD-011 Melander | HLJ.com','<p>This is an injection-plastic kit of a science-fiction/anime item. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>Bandai brings items from \"Armored Core VI Fires of Rubicon\" into their \"30MM (30 Minutes Missions)\" series! Based on the series\' key concepts of simple assembly and customization, the Balam Industries BD-011 Melander is now available! </p><p>The head, core, arms, and legs all feature the same structure as seen in the game, allowing you to enjoy assembly with the plastic model. 3mm joints are used to attach both shoulder weapons and some left-hand weapons, allowing for a variety of assembly possibilities. The MG-014 LUDLOW, which changes shape when equipped on either the right or left, comes with parts for both sides, and you can choose which side to assemble it for. Order it for your own collection today!</p><p><b>[Includes]</b>:</p><ul><li>MG-014 LUDLOW (x1 set)</li><li>Joint parts (x1 set)</li><li>Stickers</li></ul>',NULL,'2025-12-24 19:11:12','2026-02-04 17:43:11'),
(14,9,'plamod','https://plamod.com/retailer/products/5068575',NULL,NULL,'[]','2025-12-24 19:12:46','2026-02-04 18:18:55'),
(15,9,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/30mm-armored-core-vi-fires-of-rubicon-rad-cc-3000-wrecker-milk-tooth-banh685759','30MM ARMORED CORE VI FIRES OF RUBICON RaD CC-3000 Wrecker Milk Tooth | HLJ.com','<p>This is an injection-plastic kit of a science-fiction/anime item. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>Bandai brings items from \"Armored Core VI Fires of Rubicon\" into their \"30MM (30 Minutes Missions)\" series! Based on the series\' key concepts of simple assembly and customization, the Milktooth, operated by Honest Brute, is now available! </p><p>The head, core, arms, and legs all feature the same structure as seen in the game, allowing you to enjoy assembly with the plastic model. 3mm joints are used to attach both shoulder weapons and some left-hand weapons, allowing for a variety of assembly possibilities. Weapons included are WB-0000 BAD COOK, WB-0010 DOUBLE TROUBLE, BML-G2/P19SPL-12, and SB-033M MORLEY. The chainsaw part of WB-0010 DOUBLE TROUBLE is provided in both stored and deployed versions. Order it for your own collection today!</p><p><b>[Includes]</b>:</p><ul><li>WB-0000 BAD COOK</li><li>WB-0010 DOUBLE TROUBLE</li><li>BML-G2/P19SPL-12 </li><li>SB-033M MORLEY</li><li>Joint parts (x1 set)</li><li>Stickers</li></ul>',NULL,'2025-12-24 19:12:49','2026-02-04 18:18:58'),
(16,10,'plamod',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[]','2025-12-24 19:14:23','2025-12-24 19:14:23'),
(17,10,'hlj',NULL,'SD Gundam EX Standard RX-78-2 Gundam','<p>Bandai Brings us a new line of Super Deformed (SD) Gundam called the EX Standard!&amp;amp;nbsp; These new EX Standard kits come molded in multiple colors and feature limited articulation so you can get that perfect pose to display them!&amp;amp;nbsp; Foil marking stickers are also included to add extra colors and markings to your kit.&amp;amp;nbsp; A new gimmick added with these EX Standard kits is the ability to borrow parts and combine them to make new weapons that can be used with 1/144 scale HG Gundam kits!</p>',NULL,'2025-12-24 19:14:25','2025-12-24 19:14:25'),
(18,11,'plamod','https://plamod.com/retailer/products/5067155',NULL,NULL,'[]','2025-12-24 19:15:59','2026-02-04 09:15:00'),
(19,11,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-144-scale-rg-rx-78-2-gundam-ver-2-0-banh671554','RG RX-78-2 Gundam Ver.2.0 | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, Real-Grade injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>\nPlease note that the first release of this item may be limited, and in some cases it may not be possible to fill all orders at the time of its initial release. Any order not filled at the time of the initial release will be filled by subsequent restocks, but we recommend placing an order as soon as possible for your best chance to receive a piece from the first release!</p><p>Bandai\'s newest \"RG\" (Real Grade) 1/144-scale model kit of the RX-78-2 Gundam from \"Mobile Suit Gundam\" features a newly designed internal frame that\'s inspired by a semi-monocoque strture, allowing you to relive the construction of a Mobile Suit! The joint structure has a new design in which the parts that look like joints bend properly by reinterpreting the movable axis. The legs are a reconsideration of the hand-to-hand combat-style Gundam, and use composite frame joints to have an outline similar to that of a human body in motion. Details are engraved on parts that are not visible from the outside, such as joints and the backs of parts. It has a seamless design that eliminates conspicuous mounting holes and integrates it with the kit. The intricately colored head is molded in color; details have been added down to the smallest level, such as the twin eyes, main camera, magazine drum and cheek duct. Panel lines are divided into functional blocks, designed with the image of an actual dividing line in mind. The exterior design is a fusion of the latest interpretation and a return to origins, not only by the addition of small details, but also by taking into account the overall shape of each part, such as the edges and curved surfaces. By composing the white body with two-tone molding colors, the amount of shading and information as a three-dimensional object is fully produced. The Core Fighter can be transformed into the Core Block. In addition to reproducing the proportions of the Gundam\'s form, the newly developed auxiliary joint gimmick is built into the compact core block, contributing to the realization of free posing. As an RG-series original gimmick, the chest armor covering the cockpit opens and closes up and down. Order this groundbreaking kit for your own collection today!</p><p><b>[Includes]</b>:</p><ul><li>Beam rifle</li><li>Beam saber (x2)</li><li>Shield</li><li>Hyper Bazooka</li><li>Landing gear parts for Core Fighter (x1 set)</li><li>Hand parts (x1 set)</li><li>Realistic decals<br></li></ul>',NULL,'2025-12-24 19:16:02','2026-02-04 09:15:04'),
