(224,190,'hlj',NULL,'Nu Gunpla-Kun 3D Rubber Mascot Keychain','<p>Bandai brings us a fun 3D mascot keychain featuring Nu Gunpla-kun, the character who conveys the fun of Gunpla! A rubber charm with the character&amp;#x27;s name is included. You&amp;#x27;ll love it -- order yours today!</p>',NULL,'2025-12-25 00:12:08','2025-12-25 00:12:08'),
