(235,205,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/hg-ashsaviour-banh685735','HG Ashsaviour | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, high-grade or better injection-plastic kit of a science-fiction/anime item. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>Bandai brings us the first HG (High Grade) model kit of the Ashsaviour from the \"Super Robot Wars OG\" series! The tip of the Swordbreaker can be deployed, and a display base for the Swordbreaker is included so you can display it in its ejected state. The barrel of the Halberd Launcher can be deployed to recreate the firing scene; a warhead part is included to recreate the firing of the Fire Dagger. The Gun Rapier and Laser Blade are included too, and an Action Base 7 is also included to expand the range of posing! Place your order today!</p><p><b>[Includes]</b>:</p><ul><li>Interchangeable hand (x1)</li><li>Halberd Launcher</li><li>Gun Rapier</li><li>Laser Blades (x2)</li><li>Display base for Swordbreaker</li><li>Warhead part for Fire Dagger firing</li><li>Action Base 7</li><li>Stickers</li></ul>',NULL,'2025-12-25 00:38:19','2026-02-05 07:19:22'),
