(257,231,'hlj',NULL,'PLAMAX Asuka Shikinami Langley (Evangelion: 2.0 You Can (Not) Advance)','<p>Max Factory&amp;#x27;s newest PLAMAX model kit of Asuka Shikinami Langley from Evangelion: 2.0 You Can (Not) Advance was originally released as a PVC scale figure in 2011! Each part of the original figure has been individually scanned in order to recreate the figure as a plastic model kit. The kit snaps together for easy assembly (you can use adhesives for more secure assembly if you like), and is molded in color; pad-printed facial expressions and a base are included too. You&amp;#x27;ll love her -- order her for your own collection today! [Figure Size]: Approximately 20cm tall</p>',NULL,'2025-12-25 01:24:14','2025-12-25 01:24:14'),
