(263,241,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-144-scale-hg-hyakuren-bann01892','HG Hyakuren | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, high-grade or better injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>From the new hit series \"Mobile Suit Gundam: Iron-Blooded Orphans\" comes the Hyakuren.  This 1/144 HG kit comes with parts molded in light bluish purple, dark blue, grey and white.  Foil stickers for the markings are also included.    </p>',NULL,'2025-12-25 01:41:44','2026-02-05 19:12:24'),
