(286,275,'hlj',NULL,'SD Gundam EX Standard Sazabi','<p>The Sazabi now joins the SD Gundam EX model-kit lineup from Bandai! He&amp;#x27;s highly posable after assembly with his 3mm joints, and he&amp;#x27;s armed with his beam hot rifle, beam tomahawk and shield. Display together with the SD Gundam EX Nu Gundam to recreate Char&amp;#x27;s legendary battle with Amuro -- order yours now! [Includes]:Beam shot rifleBeam tomahawkShieldFoil seals</p>',NULL,'2025-12-25 02:41:09','2025-12-25 02:41:09'),
