(292,280,'hlj',NULL,'Gundam Option Parts Set Gunpla 02 (Launcher Striker &amp; Sword Striker)','<p>This option parts set from Bandai includes everything you need to convert your Entry Grade 1/144 Strike Gundam into Launcher Strike Gundam or Sword Strike Gundam, and the set is also compatible with other HG items! 3mm joints and C-type joint parts are included that can be selected depending on the kit it&amp;#x27;s used with. The Agni is movable with a ball joint and 3mm joint; the Panzer Eisen comes with a lead wire.&amp;amp;nbsp; You can also recreate Perfect Strike Gundam by combining It with the Gundam Option Parts Set 1, sold separately! Order yours today![Includes]:Launcher Striker (x1 set)Sword Striker (x1 set)Effect parts (x1 set)Joint parts (x1 set)Lead wire</p>',NULL,'2025-12-25 02:49:26','2025-12-25 02:49:26'),
