(302,298,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/gmpla-kun-3d-rubber-mascot-keychain-banh683816','GMpla-Kun 3D Rubber Mascot Keychain | HLJ.com','<p>This is a strap, keyholder, or charm. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>Bandai brings us a fun 3D mascot keychain featuring GMpla-kun, the character who conveys the fun of Gunpla! A rubber charm with the character\'s name is included. You\'ll love it -- order yours today!</p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2025-12-25 03:21:41','2026-02-05 03:47:58'),
