(310,50,'hlj',NULL,'SD Gundam Cross Silhouette Mighty Strike Freedom Gundam (Mobile Suit Gundam SEED Freedom)','<p>The Mighty Strike Freedom Gundam from Mobile Suit Gundam Seed Freedom will be joining the SD Gundam Cross Silhouette model-kit lineup from Bandai! This kit includes two different types of internal frames: a taller one (CS) and a shorter, more super-deformed version (SD) unique to the SD Gundam Cross Silhouette series. Gold-colored parts reproduce its distinctive appearance; by replacing the parts inside the head, you can choose to display it with or without eyes. The Proud Defender can reproduce its flight status by sliding the wing armor. The anti-ship sword Futsunomitama is also included, so Mighty Strike Freedom Gundam can dual-wield with a beam saber! The forehead beam cannon can be opened and closed, and the waist railgun unfolds too. The beam saber and beam rifle both reproduce the connected gimmick. Order it for your own collection today![Includes]:Anti-ship sword (Futsunomitama)Beam rifle (x2)Beam saber (x2)Head partsStickers</p>',NULL,'2025-12-25 04:35:47','2025-12-25 04:35:47'),
(311,55,'plamod','https://plamod.com/retailer/products/5065429',NULL,NULL,'[]','2025-12-25 04:43:45','2026-02-05 03:34:25'),
(312,55,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-100-scale-full-mechanics-forbidden-gundam-bans65429','FULL MECHANICS Forbidden Gundam | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, injection-plastic kit of a character or mobile suit from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>The Forbidden Gundam from \"Mobile Suit Gundam SEED\" joins the \"FULL MECHANICS\" model-kit lineup from Bandai! This kit achieves both high-density detail and ease of assembly; it\'s loaded with dense mechanical modeling, from the inside of the exhaust port to the mold behind the armor. The place parts of the Jufunshuren \"Nidhoggr\" have two types of surface finish to express the difference in texture; the energy cable connected to the backpack is reproduced with the attached varnish tube. The \"Geschmeidig Panzer\" energy deflection armor has a flexible arm and a shield. Multiple axes of movement are provided at the connecting part of the backpack so the angle of movement can be adjusted. The collar is movable in conjunction with the rotate of the chest intake block. With a structure in which the head sinks according to the movement, the backpack moves without interfering, and transforms into a high-speed assault form with minimal motion. In addition to deploying the 88mm railgun \"Eckzahn,\" it\'s also possible to rotate the local generator that changes the trajectory of Fresberg. Order it for your own collection today!<br></p><p><b>[Includes]</b>:</p><ul><li>Nidhoggr</li><li>Action base joint</li><li>Varnish tube (x2)</li><li>Sticker (x2 types) </li></ul><p> </p>',NULL,'2025-12-25 04:43:48','2026-02-05 03:34:28'),
(313,64,'plamod','https://plamod.com/retailer/products/5061620',NULL,NULL,'[]','2025-12-25 04:59:34','2026-02-05 22:10:48'),
(314,64,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-144-scale-rg-rx-0-unicorn-gundam-bann16741','RG RX-0 Unicorn Gundam | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, Real-Grade injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>In the fall of 2017, a 1/1 scale RX-0 Unicorn Gundam will be installed at the Diver City Tokyo Plaza shopping center, and to commemorate the event, Bandai is bringing out this amazingly detailed RG Unicorn Gundam!  It features an advanced inner framework, and it can transform between Unicorn mode and Destroy mode. It\'s armed with a Beam Magnum, a Hyper Bazooka, a shield and two beam sabers.  Don\'t wait on this one, order it today!</p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2025-12-25 04:59:37','2026-02-05 22:10:52'),
