(319,92,'hlj',NULL,'1/144 HGBF Gundam Exia Dark Matter','<p>From the Gundam Build Fighters series, here&amp;amp;#39;s the mysterious Gundam Exia Dark Matter! This highly detailed and articulated snapfit kit is molded in multiple colors with stickers for the markings.</p>',NULL,'2025-12-25 05:47:01','2025-12-25 05:47:01'),
