(322,107,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-144-scale-rg-zgmf-x42s-destiny-gundam-ban981595','RG ZGMF-X42S Destiny Gundam | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, Real-Grade injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>The Real Grade Destiny Gundam might be the best looking Gundam kit of them all.  Comes complete with his massive weapons and enough markings to take up an evening or two! Molded in multiple colors so painting is not necessary. </p>',NULL,'2025-12-25 06:12:10','2026-02-05 21:10:38'),
