(359,221,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/hg-scopedog-turbo-custom-banh685599','HG Scopedog Turbo-Custom | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, high-grade or better injection-plastic kit of a science-fiction/anime item. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>The improved version of the Scopedog with an enhanced roller dash mechanism, as seen in the OVA \"Armored Trooper Votoms: The Last Red Shoulder,\" is now available in Bandai\'s \"HG (High Grade)\" model-kit series! The deployment and storage of the leg jet roller dash unit unique to the Turbo Custom is reproduced; when the leg cover is opened, the jet roller dash unit moves forward in tandem. New shoulder parts that expand the range of motion of the shoulder are included, so now it\'s possible to raise the arms without interference. The movable legs can reproduce the landing mechanism, too! Order it for your own collection today!</p><p><b>[Includes]</b>:</p><ul><li>Heavy machine gun</li><li>Interchangeable hands (x1 set)</li><li>Exterior parts for customization (x1 set)</li><li>Joint parts (x1 set)</li><li>3D metallic stickers</li></ul>',NULL,'2025-12-25 09:20:22','2026-02-05 07:53:55'),
(360,226,'plamod','https://plamod.com/retailer/products/5067168',NULL,NULL,'[]','2025-12-25 09:29:12','2026-02-04 18:08:46'),
(361,226,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/30mm-armored-core-vi-fires-of-rubicon-rad-cc-2000-orbiter-nightfall-banh671684','30MM Armored Core VI Fires of Rubicon RaD CC-2000 Orbiter Nightfall | HLJ.com','<p>This is an injection-plastic kit of a science-fiction/anime item. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p> \nPlease note that the first release of this item may be limited, and in some cases it may not be possible to fill all orders at the time of its initial release. Any order not filled at the time of the initial release will be filled by subsequent restocks, but we recommend placing an order as soon as possible for your best chance to receive a piece from the first release!</p><p>Bandai adds items from the game \"Armored Core VI Fires of Rubicon\" to their \"30MM (30 Minutes Missions)\" model-kit series! The impressive armored core Nightfall, piloted by Raven, helps debut the new lineup! The head, core, arms, and legs each use the same structure as other \"30MM\" items, allowing you to enjoy them as a plastic model kit just like in the game; 3mm joints are used to attach both shoulder weapons and some left-handed weapons. The left-handed weapon PB-0-33M Ashmead comes with replacement parts to display it in its ejected state, and head parts are included to reproduce the assault boost. Order yours today!</p><p><b>[Set Contents]</b>:</p><ul><li>Nightfall</li><li>PB-033M Ashmead injection state reproduction parts (x1 set)</li><li>Head parts</li><li>Stickers<br></li></ul>',NULL,'2025-12-25 09:29:14','2026-02-04 18:08:49'),
(362,227,'plamod','https://plamod.com/retailer/products/5067411',NULL,NULL,'[]','2025-12-25 09:30:47','2026-02-04 23:29:37'),
(363,227,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-144-scale-best-mecha-collection-rx-78-2-gundam-revival-ver-banh674111','Best Mecha Collection RX-78-2 Gundam (REVIVAL Ver.) | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, injection-plastic kit of a character or mobile suit from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>Bandai\'s \"Best Mecha Collection\" RX-78-2 Gundam is back after more than 40 years! This revival version of this classic model kit is packed with technology cultivated over the course of its evolution in a retro form. Its original shape has been retained, with improvements such as color plates, touch gates and snap-fit assembly added. The shape of each part has been kept intact, and the color-coding of the entire body is reproduced in detail through a refined part configuration. The structure is designed so that the seams in each part will not be visible from the front once assembled; the beam sabers come in two different lengths, and are attached to a backpack. Get in touch with the Gunpla hobby\'s roots, and order this amazing kit for your own collection today!<br></p><p><b>[Includes]</b>:</p><ul><li>Beam rifle</li><li>Beam sabers (x2)</li><li>Shield<br></li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,'2025-12-25 09:30:49','2026-02-04 23:29:40'),
(364,228,'plamod','https://plamod.com/retailer/products/5068362',NULL,NULL,'[]','2025-12-25 09:32:28','2026-02-05 06:48:42'),
(365,228,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-144-scale-hguc-psycho-gundam-mk-ii-mobile-suit-zeta-gundam-banh683625','HGUC Psycho Gundam Mk-II (Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam) | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, high-grade or better injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>The Psycho Gundam Mk-II, the largest in the series and the last of the main Mobile Suits from \"Mobile Suit Z Gundam,\" is finally joining Bandai\'s \"High Grade (HG)\" model-kit lineup! This impressively sized model can transform into its Mobile Fortress form, and it\'s molded in different colors so it\'ll look great after assembly. A half-destroyed head part is included that evokes a pivotal scene in the anime, and an Action Base 4 and a special weapon display base are included too. Order this mighty mech for your own collection today!</p><ul>\n	<li>\n		<strong>[Size]</strong>: Approximately 27cm tall when completed</li>\n</ul><p><br></p><p>\n\n\n<strong>[Includes]</strong>:</p><ul><li>Shield</li><li>Head (half-destroyed)</li><li>Lead wire unit for arms (x2)</li><li>Reflector bit (stored) (x1 set)</li><li>Reflector bit (deployed) (x1 set)</li><li>Beam effect parts (x1 set)</li><li>Action Base 4</li><li>Weapon display base (x1 set)</li><li>Stickers</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Please note that the first release of this item may be limited, and in some cases it may not be possible to fill all orders at the time of its initial release. Any order not filled at the time of the initial release will be filled by subsequent restocks, but we recommend placing an order as soon as possible for your best chance to receive a piece from the first release!<br></p>',NULL,'2025-12-25 09:32:30','2026-02-05 06:48:46'),
(366,232,'plamod','https://plamod.com/retailer/products/5068382',NULL,NULL,'[]','2025-12-25 09:39:15','2026-02-05 00:19:52'),
(367,232,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/charzaku-kun-3d-rubber-mascot-keychain-banh683823','CharZaku-Kun 3D Rubber Mascot Keychain | HLJ.com','<p>This is a strap, keyholder, or charm. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>Bandai brings us a fun 3D mascot keychain featuring CharZaku-kun, the character who conveys the fun of Gunpla! A rubber charm with the character\'s name is included. You\'ll love it -- order yours today!</p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2025-12-25 09:39:17','2026-02-05 00:19:55'),
