(382,266,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-100-scale-mg-ams-119-geara-doga-banh554567-up','MG AMS-119 Geara Doga | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, Master-Grade injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>A highly detailed and articulated snapfit kit, molded in multiple colors. Includes the accessories shown here. </p>',NULL,'2025-12-25 10:35:43','2026-02-05 12:43:31'),
