(410,285,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/action-base-4-black-bann23030','Action Base 4 Black | HLJ.com','<p>This is a display base or stand. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>Assemble your own display stand for your Gundams and other mecha model kits! This new base from Bandai features three bases (each 2.3cm by 2cm) that can all interlock to form one base, each with lots of openings for support poles. A long support pole 11cm in length is included, as are joint parts and other support parts. Perfect for larger kits like Master Grades and RE/100! This version is black in color. Order today and put your Gundams on display!</p>',NULL,'2025-12-25 19:16:42','2026-02-04 20:02:54'),
