(437,288,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/sd-gundam-ex-standard-gundam-barbatos-banh656247','SD Gundam EX Standard Gundam Barbatos | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, injection-plastic SD or BB kit from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p><b>Note: Bandai Hobby product orders are assigned on a first come, first served basis. Please note that if you do not receive this product after is initial released, you will be placed on the \'backorder\' list until additional stock can be allocated. </b><br><br><br>The Gundam Barbatos from \"Mobile Suit Gundam: Iron-Blooded Orphans\" is now available as part of Bandai\'s \"SD Gundam EX Standard\" model-kit lineup! The design arrangement unique to the \"SD Gundam EX Standard\" series provides an enhanced range of motion for bold action poses. It\'s armed with its mace, long sword, and Barbatos smoothbore cannon; you can combine the equipment to customize it with the \"HG\" series! Order yours today!</p><p><b>[Includes]</b>:</p><ul><li>Mace</li><li>Long sword</li><li>Barbatos smoothbore cannon</li><li>Stickers</li></ul>',NULL,'2025-12-25 21:56:35','2026-02-06 17:36:03'),
(438,530,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/entry-grade-rx-78-2-gundam-1-144?_pos=1&_sid=0b69db500&_ss=r','Entry Grade RX-78-2 Gundam 1/144','<p>This super-affordable and easy-to-assemble kit is ready to introduce the joy of Gunpla to a new generation of modelers! Just snap the pre-colored parts off the trees by hand -- no tools, paint or glue are needed to build this awesome kit! It&#039;s posable after assembly, too. It&#039;s an excellent gift for new modelers and Gun</p>',NULL,'2025-12-26 18:30:33','2026-02-05 02:13:19'),
(439,530,'hobby_bee','https://hobby-bee.com/products/bandai-hobby-entry-grade-1-144-rx-78-2-gundam-mobile-suit-gundam','Bandai Hobby Entry Grade 1/144 RX-78-2 Gundam ','<p>From Bandai Hobby. Consisting of only 74 parts, the Entry Grade RX-78-2 Gundam is the ultimate introduction item for GunPla. The plastic is color molded requiring no paint, snaps together requiring no glue, uses easy twist off parts, requiring no tools, and now doesn&#039;t even require stickers for tiny details! Comes with</p>',NULL,'2025-12-26 18:30:35','2025-12-26 18:30:35'),
(440,530,'meeplemart','https://www.meeplemart.com/gundam-entry-grade-1/144-rx-78-2-gundam.aspx','Bandai - Gundam Entry Grade (1/144): RX-78-2 Gundam #5061064 5060747 [4573102610645] [4573102607478]','<p>#5061064 5060747 [4573102610645] [4573102607478] - Gundam Entry Grade (1/144): RX-78-2 Gundam</p>',NULL,'2025-12-26 18:30:57','2025-12-26 18:30:57'),
(441,530,'argama_hobby','https://argamahobby.com/products/entry-grade-1-144-rx-78-2-gundam?_pos=1&_psq=ENTRY+GRADE+1%2F144+RX-78-2+GUNDAM&_ss=e&_v=1.0','Entry Grade (EG) 1/144 RX-78-2 Gundam','<p>This super-affordable and easy-to-assemble kit is ready to introduce the joy of Gunpla to a new generation of modelers! Just snap the pre-colored parts off the trees by hand -- no tools, paint or glue are needed to build this awesome kit! It&#039;s posable after assembly, too. It&#039;s an excellent gift for new modelers and Gun</p>',NULL,'2025-12-26 18:31:00','2026-02-05 02:13:32'),
