(531,257,'hobby_bee','https://hobby-bee.com/products/bandai-hobby-mg-1-100-wing-gundam-zero-ew-ver-ka-endless-waltz','Bandai Hobby MG 1/100 Wing Gundam Zero (EW) Ver.Ka ','<p>The Wing Gundam Zero from &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz&quot; now gets a new Ver.Ka release, directly supervised by Hajme Katoki! Each joint has been thoroughly inspected, and the development of the white wings, interlocking gimmicks, and twin-buster rifle shooting poses has been pursued. As a new gimmick, the twi</p>',NULL,'2026-01-23 22:20:12','2026-01-23 22:20:12'),
(532,257,'argama_hobby','https://argamahobby.com/products/gundam-base-limited-master-grade-mg-1-100-xxxg-00w0-wing-gundam-zero-ew-ver-ka-titanium-finish?_pos=2&_psq=MG+1%2F100+WING+GUNDAM+ZERO+EW+Ver.Ka&_ss=e&_v=1.0','Gundam Base Limited Master Grade (MG) 1/100 XXXG-00W0 Wing Gundam Zero EW Ver.Ka (Titanium Finish)','<p>Bandai Spirits has released the Master Grade Ver. Ka 1/100 Wing Gundam Zero EW in the pretty Titanium Finish treatment, and sold in Gundam Base as a limited release! The kit is featured with titanium finish for its white armor pieces also to emphasize its white wings! In addition to the titanium white parts, the kit is</p>',NULL,'2026-01-23 22:20:36','2026-01-23 22:20:36'),
(533,259,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/mg-narrative-gundam-c-packs-ver-ka-1-100?_pos=1&_sid=99790cfc5&_ss=r','MG Narrative Gundam C-Packs Ver. Ka 1/100','<p>The mobile suit &quot;Narrative Gundam C Equipment&quot; developed as a psycho frame test machine is made into a three-dimensional version of MG Ver.Ka. Equipped with a number of gimmicks created by Hajime Katoki from both the story and plastic model perspectives. The thickness of the clear parts of the Psycho Frame are adjusted</p>',NULL,'2026-01-23 23:02:55','2026-01-23 23:02:55'),
