(679,21,'argama_hobby','https://argamahobby.com/products/master-grade-1-100-aile-strike-gundam-ver-rm?_pos=3&_sid=767f968ac&_ss=r','Master Grade (MG) 1/100 GAT-X105 Aile Strike Gundam ver.RM','<p>An amazingly detailed and fully posable snap-fit Master Grade model of Aile Strike Gundam Ver. RM. Molded in multiple colors, so painting is not entirely necessary. A stand is included as well.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-03 00:11:58','2026-02-03 00:11:58'),
(680,142,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/0af7b240-ab87-11e7-eddc-ab8e2a6f42d2?_pos=1&_sid=862699ad8&_ss=r','MG MS-06S Char\'s Zaku Ver. 2.0 1/100','<p>Here&#039;s Char&#039;s Zaku II, getting a &quot;Ver. 2.0&quot; update more than a decade after its first MG kit release.  This kit features a completely revamped inner frame construction that allows for even greater range of articulation and realistic movement; it&#039;s even able to be posed kneeling on one leg as seen in the show!  Aside fr</p>',NULL,'2026-02-03 00:12:11','2026-02-05 15:52:06'),
