(683,142,'argama_hobby','https://argamahobby.com/products/master-grade-1-100-chars-zaku-ii-ver-2-0?_pos=1&_psq=MG+MS-06S+Char%27s+Zaku+Ver.2.0&_ss=e&_v=1.0','Master Grade (MG) 1/100 MS-06S Char\'s Zaku II Ver 2.0','<p>Ver. 2.0 of the &quot;Char&#039;s Zaku&quot; piloted by Char Aznable, nicknamed the Red Comet from &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam,&quot; is now part of the MG series lineup. Features of the S-type Zaku, such as the backpack on the back and the thrusters on the legs, are reproduced. Two types of antennas on the head, &quot;normal&quot; and &quot;stabilized,&quot; are in</p>',NULL,'2026-02-03 00:12:55','2026-02-03 00:12:55'),
