(685,643,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/30mf-class-up-armor-liber-bishop-banh683236','30MF Class-Up Armor (Liber Bishop) | HLJ.com','<p>This is a set of optional parts for modifying or detailing robot and other science-fiction kits. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>This \"Class Up Armor (Liber Bishop)\" armor set from Bandai can be used with their \"30MF (30 Minutes Fantasy)\" series of plastic models! This set of armor and weapons allows your figure to be \"classed up\" to a higher-tier job with armor replacement -- you can \"class up\" to Liber Bishop by combining this armor with that of the Liber Priest (sold separately). The elemental core\'s attribute is \"water,\" and this set has a different face design and coloring from that of the Rozen Bishop (sold separately). Order yours today!</p><p><b>[Includes]</b>:</p><ul><li>Armor parts (x1 set)</li><li>Weapon parts (x1 set)</li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,'2026-02-04 03:54:11','2026-02-04 03:54:11'),
