(705,650,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/30mf-class-up-armor-rozen-assassin-slash-banh685889','30MF Class Up Armor (Rozen Assassin Slash) | HLJ.com','<p>This is a set of optional parts for modifying or detailing robot and other science-fiction kits. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>This \"Class Up Armor\" set from Bandai can be used with their \"30MF (30 Minutes Fantasy\" series of plastic models. This set of armor and weapons allows your figure to be \"classed up\" to a higher-tier job with armor replacement -- you can \"class up\" to Rozen Assassin Slash by combining this armor with that of the Rozen Assassin (sold separately). A long sword and a pair of short swords are included, and the Elemental Core\'s attribute is \"water,\" and this set has a different face design and coloring from that of the Liber Assassin Slash (sold separately). Place your order today!</p><p><b>[Includes]</b>:</p><ul><li>Long sword</li><li>Short swords (x2)</li><li>Armor parts (x1 set)</li><li>Weapon parts (x1 set)</li><li>Joint parts (x1 set)</li></ul>',NULL,'2026-02-04 06:13:31','2026-02-04 06:13:31'),
