(707,655,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/30mf-customized-structure-1-banh691644','30MF Customized Structure 1 | HLJ.com','<p>This is a set of optional parts for modifying or detailing robot and other science-fiction kits. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>This set from Bandai allows you to expand your \"30MF (30 Minutes Fantasy)\" displays! </p><ul><li>This set filled with monsters and scenery parts can expand the range of adventure situations you can create.</li><li>Includes signs, logs and rocks as scenery parts to create different situations; monsters in the shape of mushrooms, birds and slime are also included.</li><li>Some of the monsters can be used as customization parts.</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Place your order today!</p><p><b>[Includes]</b>:</p><ul><li>Monster (mushroom)</li><li>Monster (bird)</li><li>Monster (slime) (x3 types)</li><li>Sign</li><li>Log</li><li>Rock</li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><b>Please note that the first release of this item may be limited, and in some cases it may not be possible to fill all orders at the time of its initial release. Any order not filled at the time of the initial release will be filled by subsequent restocks, but we recommend placing an order as soon as possible for your best chance to receive a piece from the first release!<br></b></p><p><br><br></p>',NULL,'2026-02-04 06:17:21','2026-02-04 06:17:21'),
(708,638,'plamod','https://plamod.com/retailer/products/5067449',NULL,NULL,'[]','2026-02-04 06:25:28','2026-02-04 06:25:28'),
(709,638,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/30mf-item-shop-2-fighter-option-banh674494','30MF Item Shop 2 (Fighter Option) | HLJ.com','<p>This is a set of optional parts for modifying or detailing robot and other science-fiction kits. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>Bandai\'s \"30MF (30 Minutes Fantasy)\" model-kit series expands with their 30MF Item Shop 2 (Fighter Option)! This set is filled with weapons and items that expand the range of their Class-Up Armor lineup! In addition to shoulder and chest armor parts, two types of face parts are included; a lance and twin sword are included, and the twin sword can be connected with joint parts. A wooden box and wooden mug are included; the lid of the wooden box can be opened and closed. Place your order today!</p><p><b>[Includes]</b>:</p><ul><li>Lance</li><li>Twin Sword (x1 set)</li><li>Armor parts (x1 set)</li><li>Wooden mug (x2)</li><li>Wooden box</li><li>Joint part<br></li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Please note that the first release of this item may be limited, and in some cases it may not be possible to fill all orders at the time of its initial release. Any order not filled at the time of the initial release will be filled by subsequent restocks, but we recommend placing an order as soon as possible for your best chance to receive a piece from the first release!  </p>',NULL,'2026-02-04 06:25:31','2026-02-04 06:25:31'),
(710,651,'plamod','https://plamod.com/retailer/products/5068589',NULL,NULL,'[]','2026-02-04 06:32:23','2026-02-04 06:32:23'),
(711,651,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/30mf-item-shop-3-weapon-option-banh685896','30MF Item Shop 3 (Weapon Option) | HLJ.com','<p>This is a set of optional parts for modifying or detailing robot and other science-fiction kits. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>From \"30 MINUTES FANTASY,\" a line where you can create your own original fantasy job, comes the \"30MF Item Shop 3 (Weapon Option)\"!</p><ul><li>A set packed with weapons and items to expand the possibilities of \"Armor Cross\" [armor swapping].</li><li>The \"Weapon Rack\" can be used to display various parts such as faces, armor, and weapons sold separately.</li><li>The weapon rack can be connected in all directions: up, down, left, right, front, and back.</li><li>Included weapons: knife, scimitar, longsword, and mace.</li><li>The mace can be converted into a horseman\'s flail by rearranging parts.</li></ul><p><br></p><p>[Included Items]</p><ul><li>Longsword x 1</li><li>Scimitar x 1</li><li>Knife x 1</li><li>Mace set x 1</li><li>Weapon rack set x 1</li><li>Joint parts set x 1</li></ul><p>*Product images and illustrations may differ slightly from the actual product.<br>*Some items may no longer be produced or sold depending on the time since release.<br>*Product name, specifications, release date, and price are subject to change without notice.<br>*Packaging, logos, and product specifications may change without prior notice.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2026-02-04 06:32:26','2026-02-04 06:32:26'),
(712,647,'plamod','https://plamod.com/retailer/products/5068579',NULL,NULL,'[]','2026-02-04 06:40:15','2026-02-04 06:40:15'),
(713,647,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/30mf-liber-assassin-banh685797','30MF Liber Assassin | HLJ.com','<p>This is an injection-plastic kit of a science-fiction/anime item. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>Bandai\'s \"30MF (30 Minutes Fantasy)\" figure-kit series allows you to create your own fantasy-based figures and characters! The starter set includes armor and armed parts in addition to the base \"silhouette\" (elementary body). The body included with the Liber Assassin is the same as the 30MF Liber Knight; the \"silhouette\" is fully posable like a human body, including movable axes on the head and neck that allow natural flexibility. The shoulder joints are designed with great care to keep the body line intact even in bold poses; the movable axes on the chest, torso, and waist work together with the sliding mechanism at the base of the waist joint to achieve natural poses. Armor and weapon parts are included to combine with the \"silhouette\" to \"change jobs\" to that of the Liber Assassin! Two daggers are included as weapons; flexible movement is achieved by attaching the shoulder and waist armor via the joint on the back. The attribute of the Element Core is \"water.\" The face design and color are different from the Rozen Assassin (sold separately). Order him for your own collection today!</p><p><b>[Includes]</b>:</p><ul><li>Dagger (x2)</li><li>Armor parts (x1 set)</li><li>Hand parts (x1 set)</li><li>Joint parts (x1 set)</li></ul>',NULL,'2026-02-04 06:40:18','2026-02-04 06:40:18'),
(714,646,'plamod','https://plamod.com/retailer/products/5068376',NULL,NULL,'[]','2026-02-04 06:45:55','2026-02-04 06:45:55'),
(715,646,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/s-h-figuarts-yuta-okkotsu-jujutsu-kaisen-0-bans63876','S.H.Figuarts Yuta Okkotsu -Jujutsu Kaisen 0- | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable action figure. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>Yuta Okkotsu from \"Jujutsu Kaisen 0\" is now available in Bandai\'s S.H.Figuarts line up! Boasting multiple points of articulation, Yuta is highly posable and comes with a variety of accessories such as a sword, a sword in a carrying case, and a megaphone. You definitely don\'t want to miss out, so be sure to order yours today!</p><ul>\n	<li>\n		<strong>[Figure Size]</strong>: 150mm</li>\n<li>\n		<strong>[Materials]</strong>: PVC, ABS</li>\n</ul><p><br></p><p>\n\n\n<strong>[Set Contents]</strong>:</p><ul><li>Main Body x 1</li><li>Replacement Expressions x 3</li><li>Replacement Wrists Left and Right x 3</li><li>Megaphone</li><li>Sword Bag (handheld)</li><li>Sword Bag (shoulder strap)</li><li>Sword</li></ul>',NULL,'2026-02-04 06:45:58','2026-02-04 06:45:58'),
(716,635,'plamod','https://plamod.com/retailer/products/5067424',NULL,NULL,'[]','2026-02-04 06:51:34','2026-02-04 06:51:34'),
(717,635,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/30mf-liber-fighter-banh674241','30MF Liber Fighter | HLJ.com','<p>This is an injection-plastic kit of a science-fiction/anime item. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>The Liber Fighter hails from Bandai\'s \"30 Minutes Fantasy (30MF)\" model-kit series, where you can create your own fantasy job! This starter set includes the base Silhouette (body) as well as armor and weapons. The Silhouette is capable of flexible human-like actions, and can be used for just about any sort of fantasy job. The head and neck have movable axes, allowing you to tuck his chin in, or stick his face out! The shoulder joints are designed with great care to keep the body line intact, even in bold poses. The movable axes on the chest, torso and waist work in conjunction with the sliding mechanism at the base of the waist joint, allowing for natural poses. The Silhouette has a more substantial form than the separately sold Liber Knight. </p><p>Combine the Silhouette with the armor and weapon parts to create the Liber Fighter! The shoulder and waist armor can be attached via the joint on the back to allow for flexible movement; the Axe and Round Shield can be mounted on the back or waist using joint parts. The attribute of the Element Core is Earth. The face design and coloring are different from the Rozen Empire Silhouette and Fighter, sold separately. Order yours today!</p><p><b>[Includes]</b>:</p><ul><li>Axe</li><li>Round Shield</li><li>Armor parts (x1 set)</li><li>Hand parts (x1 set)</li><li>Joint parts (x1 set)<br></li></ul><p><br></p><p>Please note that the first release of this item may be limited, and in some cases it may not be possible to fill all orders at the time of its initial release. Any order not filled at the time of the initial release will be filled by subsequent restocks, but we recommend placing an order as soon as possible for your best chance to receive a piece from the first release!  <br></p>',NULL,'2026-02-04 06:51:38','2026-02-04 06:51:38'),
(718,632,'plamod','https://plamod.com/retailer/products/5067165',NULL,NULL,'[]','2026-02-04 06:57:15','2026-02-04 06:57:15'),
(719,632,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/s-h-figuarts-cell-first-form-reissue-banc676153','S.H.Figuarts Cell First Form (Reissue) | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable action figure. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>Cell in his first form from \"Dragon Ball\" returns to Bandai\'s \"S.H.Figuarts\" action-figure lineup! He\'s fully posable for maximum action, including special joints at the base of his wings! He comes with four sets of interchangeable hands, three interchangeable facial expressions, and a replacement tail part, too. Order him for your own collection today!</p><ul>\n	<li>\n		<strong>[Figure Size]</strong>: Approximately 17cm tall</li>\n<li>\n		<strong>[Materials]</strong>: PVC, ABS</li>\n</ul><p><br></p><p>\n\n\n<strong>[Set Contents]</strong>:</p><ul><li>Main figure</li><li>Interchangeable facial expressions (x3)</li><li>Interchangeable head parts</li><li>Interchangeable hands (x4 each, left and right)</li><li>Tail parts (x1 set)</li><li>Interchangeable tail part</li></ul>',NULL,'2026-02-04 06:57:19','2026-02-04 06:57:19'),
