(729,627,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/30ms-option-parts-set-10-reaper-armor-bans65446','30MS Option Parts Set 10 (Reaper Armor) | HLJ.com','<p>This is a set of optional parts for modifying or detailing robot and other science-fiction kits. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>This \"30 Minutes Sisters\" weapon set from Bandai includes a scythe, a scissors, and a large sword! The scissors can be used as two swords by separating the blades; the blade of the large sword is made up of multiple parts, and can be attached to the back as a tail-shaped armor piece that can be flexed by using connecting joints (a selection of joints is included). Utilizing the 3mm-diameter ports and posts common throughout the \"30 Minutes\" series, these weapons can be used with just about any \"30 Minutes Sisters\" figure! Order yours today!<br></p><p><b>[Includes]</b>:</p><ul><li>Great sword</li><li>Scythe</li><li>Scissors</li><li>Joint parts (x1 set)</li><li>\"30Minutes\" general-purpose joint runner</li><li>Thick thigh parts (x1 set)</li><li>Leg above knee parts (x1 set)</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Figures shown are not included.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-04 07:35:30','2026-02-04 07:35:30'),
