(747,657,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-48-scale-moderoid-side-gr-edelstein-ii-zwei-titanomachia-rerelease-gsc20997','MODEROID SIDE:GR Edelstein II (Zwei) (Titanomachia) (Rerelease) | HLJ.com','<p>This is an injection-plastic kit of a science-fiction/anime item. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>The Edelstein II (Zwei) from \"Titanomachia,\" an original work by modeler, designer, producer and multimedia creator NAOKI, returns to the \"MODEROID\" model-kit lineup from Good Smile Company! Closely supervised by NAOKI himself, this model kit features articulated joints for easy posing after assembly. Its rifle is included, and can be displayed in a number of forms with interchangeable parts; two blades are also included that can be attached to its waist. Two unpainted pilot figures are also included, and this kit can be combined with other \"Titanomachia\"-series items for more customization options! Place your order today!</p><ul>\n	<li>\n		<strong>[Size]</strong>: Approximately 17.5cm tall when completed</li>\n</ul><p><br></p>',NULL,'2026-02-04 09:00:10','2026-02-04 09:00:10'),
(748,93,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-144-scale-hgac-wing-gundam-zero-banh588913-up','HGAC Wing Gundam Zero | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, high-grade or better injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>This highly detailed and articulated snap-fit kit is molded in multiple colors, with stickers for decoration. A display stand is not included. </p>',NULL,'2026-02-04 14:35:03','2026-02-04 14:35:03'),
(749,93,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/hgac-174-wing-gundam-zero-1-144?_pos=1&_sid=4979512b8&_ss=r','HGAC 174 Wing Gundam Zero 1/144','<p>A new lineup for the HG All Gundam Project. HGAC version of Wing Gundam Zero for TV. It can be transformed into a neo-bird form by replacing it. Twin Buster Rifle can be connected and separated. Shoulder machine cannon can also be deployed. Includes: Molded product x 9, foil seal x 1, assembly manual x 1</p>',NULL,'2026-02-04 14:36:32','2026-02-04 14:36:32'),
(750,93,'canada_computers','https://www.canadacomputers.com/en/model-building-kits-14/275308/bandai-hobby-rg-1-144-wing-gundam-zero-5069215.html?keyword=1144 hgac wing gundam zero','BANDAI HOBBY RG 1/144 WING GUNDAM ZERO','<p>BANDAI HOBBY RG 1/144 WING GUNDAM ZERO</p>',NULL,'2026-02-04 14:36:39','2026-02-04 14:36:39'),
