(752,93,'argama_hobby','https://argamahobby.com/products/high-grade-hg-hgac-1-144-xxxg-00w0-wing-gundam-zero?_pos=1&_psq=1%2F144+HGAC+WING+GUNDAM+ZERO&_ss=e&_v=1.0','High Grade (HG) HGAC 1/144 XXXG-00W0 Wing Gundam Zero','<p>This highly detailed and articulated snap-fit kit is molded in multiple colors, with stickers for decoration. A display stand is not included. </p>',NULL,'2026-02-04 14:36:49','2026-02-04 14:36:49'),
(753,45,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-144-scale-hg-gx-9900-gundam-x-banh648716-up','HG GX-9900 Gundam X | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, high-grade or better injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>The GX-9900 Gundam X was previously released as a No Grade kit. Well, now Bandai has put that one to shame with their latest High Grade After War version. The X\'s armaments include the Shoulder Vulcans, large Beam Sabers, and Shield Buster Rifle (which is both shield and rifle). Also unique to this release is the reflector sticker which Bandai pulled off wonderfully.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-04 14:38:23','2026-02-04 14:38:23'),
(754,45,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/0af7b240-ab87-11e7-eddc-9801ea649ae1?_pos=1&_sid=b363227a6&_ss=r','HGAW 109 GX-9900 Gundam X 1/144','<p>A new development in HG!! The start of a lineup that transcends the Universal Century!! As with HGUC, the proportion balance has been carefully considered by Hajime Katoki. A wide range of included weapons is included. Two types of shield buster rifles are included: open and closed. Improved range of motion. Using the</p>',NULL,'2026-02-04 14:43:36','2026-02-04 14:43:36'),
(755,45,'hobby_bee','https://hobby-bee.com/products/bandai-hobby-hg-aw-1-144-gx-9900-dv-gundam-x-divider-5064116','Bandai Hobby HG AW 1/144 #109 GX-9900 Gundam X (5064871)','<p>This is a posable, High-Grade injection-plastic kit.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-04 14:43:43','2026-02-04 14:43:43'),
