(757,74,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-144-scale-hguc-gouf-banh580078-up','HGUC Gouf | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, high-grade or better injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>Ramba Ral’s MS-07B Gouf gets the “Revive” treatment with this new release from Bandai!  This kit features a slick new redesign with better details and articulation.  All parts come come molded in multiple colors and features a snap-fit construction.  Comes with two Heat Swords, Heat Rod, Shield and 5-barrel 75mm Machine Gun left hands!</p>',NULL,'2026-02-04 14:46:54','2026-02-04 14:46:54'),
