(765,104,'argama_hobby','https://argamahobby.com/products/high-grade-hg-hguc-1-144-gundam-operation-v-set?_pos=2&_psq=1%2F144+HGUC+V+GUNDAM&_ss=e&_v=1.0','High Grade (HG) HGUC 1/144 Gundam Operation V Set','<p>High Grade Universal Century kits of the original three Gundam mecha - Gundam, Guncannon and the Guntank. The actual contents, with the exception of the plastic color and a newly printed instruction book with color photos, are identical to the individually boxed items. Really nice box art and packaging. Note: The hange</p>',NULL,'2026-02-04 14:56:48','2026-02-04 14:56:48'),
(766,84,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-144-scale-hguc-v2-assault-buster-gundam-banh577511-up','HGUC V2 Assault Buster Gundam | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, high-grade or better injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>This amazing kit enables you to build the V2 Assault, the V2 Buster or the V2 Assault Buster Gundam!  Whatever you choose, it\'ll be armed to the teeth with the Mega Beam Rifle, Mega Beam Shield, Beam Rifle, V2 Core Fighter, Assault parts and Buster parts. Molded in white, dark gray, blue red, metallic yellow and yellow, with foil stickers for markings. </p>',NULL,'2026-02-04 14:58:22','2026-02-04 14:58:22'),
