(772,636,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/30mf-class-up-armor-liber-warrior-banh674258','30MF Class Up Armor (Liber Warrior) | HLJ.com','<p>This is a set of optional parts for modifying or detailing robot and other science-fiction kits. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>This new \"30MF (30 Minutes Fantasy)\" set from Bandai allows you to \"class up\" your 30MF Silhouette to a higher-level job! Combine this set with the separately-sold 30MF Liber Fighter to create the Liber Warrior! Warrior is a job for professional fighters with high combat skills and a strong physique. This set includes a different face design and coloring from the Rozen Empire Warrior, sold separately. Order yours today!</p><p><b>[Includes]</b>:</p><ul><li>Armor parts (x1 set)</li><li>Weapon parts (x1 set)<br></li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,'2026-02-04 15:18:49','2026-02-04 15:18:49'),
(773,648,'plamod','https://plamod.com/retailer/products/5068581',NULL,NULL,'[]','2026-02-04 15:50:10','2026-02-04 15:50:10'),
(774,648,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/30mf-class-up-armor-liber-assassin-slash-banh685810','30MF Class Up Armor (Liber Assassin Slash) | HLJ.com','<p>This is a set of optional parts for modifying or detailing robot and other science-fiction kits. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>This \"Class Up Armor\" set from Bandai can be used with their \"30MF (30 Minutes Fantasy\" series of plastic models. This set of armor and weapons allows your figure to be \"classed up\" to a higher-tier job with armor replacement -- you can \"class up\" to Liber Assassin Slash by combining this armor with that of the Liber Assassin (sold separately). A long sword and a pair of short swords are included, and the Elemental Core\'s attribute is \"water,\" and this set has a different face design and coloring from that of the Rozen Assassin Slash (sold separately). Place your order today!</p><p><b>[Includes]</b>:</p><ul><li>Long sword</li><li>Short swords (x2)</li><li>Armor parts (x1 set)</li><li>Weapon parts (x1 set)</li><li>Joint parts (x1 set)</li></ul>',NULL,'2026-02-04 15:50:14','2026-02-04 15:50:14'),
(775,633,'plamod','https://plamod.com/retailer/products/5067176',NULL,NULL,'[]','2026-02-04 16:04:44','2026-02-04 16:04:44'),
(776,633,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/30mf-item-shop-1-knight-option-banh671769','30MF Item Shop 1 (Knight Option) | HLJ.com','<p>This is a set of optional parts for modifying or detailing robot and other science-fiction kits. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>\nPlease note that the first release of this item may be limited, and in some cases it may not be possible to fill all orders at the time of its initial release. Any order not filled at the time of the initial release will be filled by subsequent restocks, but we recommend placing an order as soon as possible for your best chance to receive a piece from the first release!</p><p>Bandai brings an extensive lineup into their \"30MF (30 Minutes Fantasy)\" action figure kit line with the Item Shop 1: Knight Option set! This set is packed with weapons and items that expand the range of armor replacement and customization; face, shoulder, and chest armor parts are offered in two different designs. A shield that\'s lighter than the knight\'s equipment is included, and two types of treasure boxes and potions are included: gray and clear blue. The treasure box has a lid that can be opened and closed. 30MS joint parts are also included that are convenient for mixing 30MF and 30MS items. Order yours today!</p><p><b>[Set Contents]</b>:</p><ul><li>Kite shield</li><li>Armor parts (x1 set)</li><li>Potion (x2 types)</li><li>Treasure box (x2 types)</li><li>Joint parts (x1 set)</li><li>Joint parts for 30MS (x1 set)<br></li></ul>',NULL,'2026-02-04 16:04:47','2026-02-04 16:04:47'),
(777,639,'plamod','https://plamod.com/retailer/products/5067450',NULL,NULL,'[]','2026-02-04 17:03:37','2026-02-04 17:03:37'),
(778,639,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/30mf-rozen-fighter-banh674500','30MF Rozen Fighter | HLJ.com','<p>This is an injection-plastic kit of a science-fiction/anime item. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>The Rozen Fighter hails from Bandai\'s \"30 Minutes Fantasy (30MF)\" model-kit series, where you can create your own fantasy job! This starter set includes the base Silhouette (body) as well as armor and weapons. The Silhouette is capable of flexible human-like actions, and can be used for just about any sort of fantasy job. The head and neck have movable axes, allowing you to tuck his chin in, or stick his face out! The shoulder joints are designed with great care to keep the body line intact, even in bold poses. The movable axes on the chest, torso and waist work in conjunction with the sliding mechanism at the base of the waist joint, allowing for natural poses. The Silhouette has a more substantial form than the separately sold Rozen Knight. </p><p>Combine the Silhouette with the armor and weapon parts to create the Rozen Fighter! The shoulder and waist armor can be attached via the joint on the back to allow for flexible movement; the Axe and Round Shield can be mounted on the back or waist using joint parts. The attribute of the Element Core is Earth. The face design and coloring are different from the Liber Republic Silhouette and Fighter, sold separately. Order yours today!</p><p><b>[Includes]</b>:</p><ul><li>Axe</li><li>Round Shield</li><li>Armor parts (x1 set)</li><li>Hand parts (x1 set)</li><li>Joint parts (x1 set)<br></li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Please note that the first release of this item may be limited, and in some cases it may not be possible to fill all orders at the time of its initial release. Any order not filled at the time of the initial release will be filled by subsequent restocks, but we recommend placing an order as soon as possible for your best chance to receive a piece from the first release!  </p>',NULL,'2026-02-04 17:03:41','2026-02-04 17:03:41'),
(779,644,'plamod','https://plamod.com/retailer/products/5068339',NULL,NULL,'[]','2026-02-04 17:14:45','2026-02-04 17:14:45'),
(780,644,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/30mf-rozen-priest-banh683397','30MF Rozen Priest | HLJ.com','<p>This is an injection-plastic kit of a science-fiction/anime item. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>The Rozen Priest is the newest member of Bandai\'s \"30 Minutes Fantasy (30MF)\" figure-kit series! This lineup allows you to create your own fantasy-based figures and characters! This starter set includes armor and weapon parts in addition to the base \"silhouette\" (elementary body). The \"silhouette,\" which is the same as that of the Rozen Knight, is fully posable like a human body; movable axes are provided on the head and neck for natural flexibility. The new structure of the shoulder joint keeps the body line intact, even in bold poses. The movable parts of the chest, torso, and waist work together with the sliding mechanism at the base of the waist joint to create natural poses. Armor and armed parts are included to combine with the \"silhouette\" to create the Rozen Priest! A new mechanism for attaching shoulder and waist armor via joints on the back allows for flexible movement; the attribute of the Element Core is Fire. Order him for your own collection today!</p><p><b>[Includes]</b>:</p><ul><li>Staff</li><li>Armor parts (x1 set)</li><li>Hand parts (x1 set)</li><li>Joint parts (x1 set)</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Please note that the first release of this item may be limited, and in some cases it may not be possible to fill all orders at the time of its initial release. Any order not filled at the time of the initial release will be filled by subsequent restocks, but we recommend placing an order as soon as possible for your best chance to receive a piece from the first release!<br></p>',NULL,'2026-02-04 17:14:49','2026-02-04 17:14:49'),
(781,652,'plamod','https://plamod.com/retailer/products/5068863',NULL,NULL,'[]','2026-02-04 17:22:51','2026-02-04 17:22:51'),
(782,652,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/30mf-rosan-wizard-banh688637','30MF Rosan Wizard | HLJ.com','<p>This is an injection-plastic kit of a science-fiction/anime item. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>The Rosan Wizard joins the \"30MF (30 Minutes Fantasy)\" series from Bandai, which allows you to create your own fantasy job! </p><ul><li>This starter set includes the base \"Silhouette (body),\" as well as armor and weapon parts. </li><li>The Silhouette is capable of flexible human-type motion, and it can be used for any job. </li><li>The head and neck have movable axes, allowing the figure to tuck its chin in, or stick its face out.</li><li>The shoulder joints are designed with care to ensure that the lines of the body do not collapse, even in bold poses.</li><li>The Silhouette has a sleeker form than the 30MF Rosan Knight (sold separately). </li><li>The movable axes on the chest, torso, and waist work together with the sliding mechanism at the base of the waist joint to achieve natural poses.</li><li>Armor and weapon parts are included to combine with the Silhouette to change jobs to Liber Wizard.</li><li>The shoulder and waist armor can be attached via the joint on the back, allowing for flexible movement. </li><li>The attribute of the Element Core is Lightning.</li><li>The face design and coloring are different from the Liber Silhouette and Wizard, sold separately.</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Order yours today!</p><p><b>[Includes]</b>:</p><ul><li>Magic staff</li><li>Armor parts (x1 set)</li><li>Hand parts (x1 set)</li><li>Joint parts (x1 set)</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Please note that the first release of this item may be limited, and in some cases it may not be possible to fill all orders at the time of its initial release. Any order not filled at the time of the initial release will be filled by subsequent restocks, but we recommend placing an order as soon as possible for your best chance to receive a piece from the first release!</p>',NULL,'2026-02-04 17:22:54','2026-02-04 17:22:54'),
