(817,624,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/30ms-optional-parts-set-4-stealth-armor-bans62073','30MS Optional Parts Set 4 (Stealth Armor) | HLJ.com','<p>This is a set of optional parts for modifying or detailing robot and other science-fiction kits. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>Customize your 30MS (30 Minutes Sisters) figure kit to your liking with this optional stealth armor parts set! This armor is made in the image of a fox, and a general-purpose runner of joints is included. Order yours now!<br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n\n<strong>[Set Contents]</strong>:<ul><li>Stealth armor parts (x1 set)</li><li>30Minutes general joint parts (x1 runner)<br></li></ul>',NULL,'2026-02-04 19:01:59','2026-02-04 19:01:59'),
