(954,210,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/megami-device-modeling-library-hbj63715','Megami Device Modeling Library | HLJ.com','<p>This is a magazine about general modeling subjects. </p>\n            <br>\n             Introducing the highly popular Kotobukiya plastic model series \"Megami Device\" compilation!<br>\nThe compilation of examples from the Kotobukiya plastic model series \"Megami Device\" is here.<br>\nFeaturing how-to guides, it includes over 20 examples starting with 4 showcased models.<br>\nThere are plenty of examples from the new \"Block2\" series kits.<br>\nIn the new examples, various production themes are established, introducing techniques for creating original works.<br>\nEach Megami\'s settings and kit explanations are also included. Additionally, as a bonus, eye decals compatible with the \"BUSTER DOLL Gunner/Tank\" are included!<br>\n<br><br>',NULL,'2026-02-05 00:13:48','2026-02-05 00:13:48'),
