(958,232,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/3d-rubber-mascot-keychain-charzaku-kun?_pos=1&_sid=feeaeca2c&_ss=r','3D Rubber Mascot Keychain - CharZaku-Kun','<p>CHARZAKU-KUN 3D RUBBER MASCOT KEYCHAIN A series of six 3D mascot keychains featuring a character that conveys the fun of Gunpla! The keychain comes with a rubber charm with the character&#039;s name printed on it.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-05 00:21:14','2026-02-05 00:21:14'),
