(973,530,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-144-scale-entry-grade-rx-78-2-gundam-round-box-gunpla-snow-image-color-ver-hea64360-sn','ENTRY GRADE RX-78-2 Gundam - Round Box Gunpla (Snow Image Color Ver.) | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, injection-plastic kit of a character or mobile suit from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p><b><i>Gundam fans rejoice!</i></b> Check out this collectible round container full of an ENTRY GRADE 1/144 RX-78-2 Gundam Gunpla kit in \'Snow Image Color\' and delicious corn snacks! This set is perfect for a Birthday or holiday gift, or to just treat yourself with! Order now!</p><p><br></p><p><b>Expiration Date on Snacks: March 5th, 2022</b></p><p><b><i>Note:</i></b> This item includes a Gunpla kit as well as two packages of snacks. If the food items pass their expiration date, they will be removed from the package and the Gunpla will be shipped by itself in the box. Please order this item only if you accept that it may be opened to remove the food items before shipment to you. Additionally, please note that it will not be discounted if the snacks are removed.<br></p>',NULL,'2026-02-05 02:10:54','2026-02-05 02:10:54'),
