(978,48,'argama_hobby','https://argamahobby.com/products/entry-grade-eg-1-144-mbf-02-strike-rouge?_pos=1&_psq=ENTRY+GRADE+1%2F144+STRIKE+ROUGE&_ss=e&_v=1.0','Entry Grade (EG) 1/144 MBF-02 Strike Rouge','<p>Cagalli&#039;s Strike Rouge from &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam Seed&quot; is now available in Bandai&#039;s &quot;Entry Grade&quot; model-kit series, with easy assembly and high quality! It has excellent color reproduction for an appearance that&#039;s true to the anime, and the completed model has a wide range of motion that can handle bold action poses! Va</p>',NULL,'2026-02-05 02:21:46','2026-02-05 02:21:46'),
