(1008,283,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/haropla-sd-sangoku-sojuden-haro-banh581693-up','Haropla SD Sangoku Sojuden Haro | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, injection-plastic SD or BB kit from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>Bandai expands its SD Gundam model kit lineup with more characters based on \"Sangokushi\"! They feature improved proportions and redesigned head and body joint structures for dynamic poses; they also look better than ever once assembled thanks to their full-color parts!</p><p>This Haropla Sojuden Haro comes with a dedicated base that can store up to four Memories! It can also hold a Memory in its right hand; stickers for the markings are also included. Order yours today!</p><p> </p>',NULL,'2026-02-05 04:11:45','2026-02-05 04:11:45'),
