(1247,40,'argama_hobby','https://argamahobby.com/products/hguc-amx-014-doven-wolf-high-grade-mobile-suit-zz-gundam-1-144?_pos=1&_sid=5383e8869&_ss=r','HGUC AMX-014 Doven Wolf (High Grade Mobile Suit ZZ Gundam 1/144)','<p>The Doven Wolf from Mobile Suit Gundam ZZ is now available in HGUC! The chest and sleeve designs faithfully reproduce the original version from when it appeared in Mobile Suit Gundam ZZ. In addition to connecting to the mega launcher, a variety of gimmicks are also reproduced, such as incom deployment. Includes 10 mold</p>',NULL,'2026-02-05 10:30:25','2026-02-05 10:30:25'),
(1248,273,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/hguc-018-gundam-gp01fb-zephyranthes-full-burnern-1-144?_pos=1&_sid=6b515272a&_ss=r','HGUC 018 Gundam GP01fb Zephyranthes (Full Burnern) 1/144','<p>A full vernian version of GP01 converted to space specifications has been made into a kit. The chest and shoulder vernier have been reproduced in an open state. Shoulder armor can move back and forth. The display model of Core Fighter II reproduces the space specifications in detail. The backpack&#039;s boost pod uses poly</p>',NULL,'2026-02-05 10:34:13','2026-02-05 10:34:13'),
