(1258,32,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-144-scale-hguc-bawoo-production-type-banh557278-up','HGUC Bawoo Production Type | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, high-grade or better injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             Green version.',NULL,'2026-02-05 10:49:27','2026-02-05 10:49:27'),
(1259,32,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/hg31bawooproductiontype1144?_pos=1&_sid=1986d2ed2&_ss=r','HGUC 031 Bawoo Production Type 1/144','<p>A plastic model of the &quot;Bow mass production type&quot; that appears in &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam ZZ&quot;. The biggest feature of deformation and coalescence can be reproduced without destroying the MS form. The bow attacker can also be reproduced with the deformed form as it is. The weapon comes with a beam rifle and a shield.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-05 10:50:48','2026-02-05 10:50:48'),
(1260,32,'canada_computers','https://www.canadacomputers.com/en/server-graphics-cards/137578/amd-firepro-s7150-8gb-pci-e-gpu-server-workstation-graphics-controller-passive-100-505721-100-505721.html?keyword=5055727','AMD FirePro S7150 8GB PCI-E GPU-Server / Workstation Graphics Controller - Passive (100-505721)','<p>AMD FirePro S7150 8GB PCI-E GPU-Server / Workstation Graphics Controller - Passive (100-505721)</p>',NULL,'2026-02-05 10:50:51','2026-02-05 10:50:51'),
(1261,32,'argama_hobby','https://argamahobby.com/products/high-grade-hg-hguc-1-144-amx-107-bawoo-mass-production-type?_pos=1&_sid=10352cf46&_ss=r','High Grade (HG) HGUC 1/144 AMX-107 Bawoo (Mass Production Type)','<p>This sharp-looking bad-guy variation on the ZZ Gundam is transformable to Bawoo Attacker and Bawoo Natter modes. Comes with beam saber and beam rifle, too. Sharp assembly. Molded in final colors.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-05 10:51:19','2026-02-05 10:51:19'),
