(1263,600,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-144-scale-hguc-gaplant-banh635693-up','HGUC Gaplant | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, high-grade or better injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             This superb HGUC offering allows you to transform the Gaplant, once it\'s completed, into Mobile armor mode!  The booster is built separately and can be added or removed as you wish.  The Gaplant comes armed with beam sabres and protected with a movable shield binder.  Molded entirely in colored plastic and featuring snap-fit assembly, it\'s a lot less intimidating than it might sound!  Stickers are included for details.',NULL,'2026-02-05 10:52:53','2026-02-05 10:52:53'),
(1264,37,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-144-scale-hguc-dom-rick-dom-banh558770-up','HGUC Dom/Rick-Dom | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, high-grade or better injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             Build yourself a Dom or a Rick-Dom with this set; parts are included to build one or the other (unfortunately not both!). The pictorial instructions indicate where the alternate parts go, so be careful when building! Weapons for both versions are included, as are foil stickers for the eyes. All the parts are molded in color and snap together so paint and glue are not necessary.',NULL,'2026-02-05 11:00:53','2026-02-05 11:00:53'),
(1265,37,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/hguc59domrickdom1144?_pos=1&_sid=17b55ec31&_ss=r','HGUC 059 Dom / Rickdom 1/144','<p>It is an HGUC series plastic model of the famous One Year War machine &quot;Dom&quot; that appears in &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam&quot;. It is a compatibility kit that becomes &quot;Rickdom&quot; by exchanging vernier, skirt, and sole parts. Two types of bazooka, Giant Bazooka and Beam Bazooka, are attached, and a heat saber can be stored behind.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-05 11:04:06','2026-02-05 11:04:06'),
