(1276,140,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-144-scale-hguc-zock-banh577436-up','HGUC Zock | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, high-grade or better injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             The amphibious green mobile suit from \"Mobile Suit Gundam\" has arrived in Bandai\'s HGUC series! This snap-fit-assembly kit comes molded in color and features articulated joints, plus impressive inner mechanical detailing for its head and chest areas. Its multi-directional mono eye is movable through its rails underneath the armor.',NULL,'2026-02-05 11:11:14','2026-02-05 11:11:14'),
