(1337,124,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-100-scale-mg-00-qan-t-banh615879-up','MG 00 QAN[T] | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, Master-Grade injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>00 Gundam is all the buzz in Japan and Bandai\'s newest Master Grade, the 00 QAN[T], or Quanta, is creating a buzz all its own.   The 00 QAN[T] will come with its massive transformable weapon, which can function as a sword, rifle, and shield, and there\'s even the option of adding a <strong>sold-separately LED</strong> for the GN drive (only one needed)!  The markings are created by a mix of stickers, dry-transfers, and foil-stickers.  Bandai has even included an action base!  </p>',NULL,'2026-02-05 13:31:46','2026-02-05 13:31:46'),
(1338,124,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/0af7b240-ab87-11e7-eddc-51570ccb1b08?_pos=1&_sid=87f718db6&_ss=r','MG Gundam 00 Qan[T] 1/100','<p>The leading machine of the movie version &quot;Gundam OO&quot; has appeared in MG. Completely reproduce the union / separation gimmick of the sword gimmick. Adopted GN shield bit firing form as a new mechanism. Reproduction of panel line mold unique to MG. Each part lens is clear and vividly reproduced. Molded product x 16 Foil</p>',NULL,'2026-02-05 13:35:59','2026-02-05 13:35:59'),
