(1348,54,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/mg-sinanju-stein-narrative-ver-ver-ka-1-100?_pos=1&_sid=9f3a2613a&_ss=r','MG Sinanju Stein (Narrative Ver.) Ver. Ka 1/100','<p>An MS that became the &quot;original stone&quot; of the full psychoframe MS that led to the RX-0 series. Updated to the narrative version design and released in Ver.Ka. The engraving in the shape of Zeon&#039;s emblem, which is the reason for the &quot;sleeved&quot; design, is divided into parts to reproduce the color coding. The beam ax can b</p>',NULL,'2026-02-05 14:28:42','2026-02-05 14:28:42'),
