(1357,77,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/0af7b240-ab87-11e7-eddc-51570ddb623c?_pos=1&_sid=9cc7b6356&_ss=r','MG V2 Gundam Ver. Ka 1/100','<p>From &quot;Mobile Suit V Gundam&quot;, &quot;V2 Gundam&quot;, which is ranked first in the MG commercialization hope ranking, is finally here! Utilizing the technology cultivated in the armor expansion gimmick of &quot;MG V Gundam Ver.Ka&quot;, it realizes both proportions while having a deformation mechanism! In addition to two V2 core fighters, a</p>',NULL,'2026-02-05 14:47:47','2026-02-05 14:47:47'),
