(1361,168,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-100-scale-mg-xxxg-01s-shenlong-gundam-ew-ver-banh640956-up','MG XXXG-01S Shenlong Gundam EW Ver. | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, Master-Grade injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>This past year has seen plenty of kits from Endless Waltz in master grade form and here\'s the newest of them all; Shen Long!  Shen Long comes with its most cool Dragon Fang attachment and also his shield and Beam Trident which can attach to its backpack when he\'s on the move.  Shen Long also comes with foil stickers, dry transfers and marking stickers.  Stand not included. </p>',NULL,'2026-02-05 14:55:23','2026-02-05 14:55:23'),
(1362,168,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/mgxxxg-01sshenlonggundamewver?_pos=1&_sid=a6c7abf0c&_ss=r','MG XXXG-01S Shenlong Gundam EW Ver. 1/100','<p>The first three-dimensional version of the EW version of Shenlong Gundam that appears in &quot;New Mobile Report Gundam W Endless Waltz&quot;. We adopt XXX-G frame with high mobility. Double movement of the ankle allows for bold poses. Reproduce the newly designed dragon hang. The deployment gimmick of the &quot;fang&quot; part can be rep</p>',NULL,'2026-02-05 14:58:35','2026-02-05 14:58:35'),
