(1365,168,'argama_hobby','https://argamahobby.com/products/master-grade-1-100-xxxg-01s-shenlong-gundam-ew?_pos=1&_sid=89647ede7&_ss=r','Master Grade (MG) 1/100 XXXG-01S Shenlong Gundam EW','<p>Shen Long comes with its most cool Dragon Fang attachment and also his shield and Beam Trident which can attach to its backpack when he&#039;s on the move.  Shen Long also comes with foil stickers, dry transfers and marking stickers.  Stand not included. </p>',NULL,'2026-02-05 14:59:01','2026-02-05 14:59:01'),
(1366,25,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-100-scale-mg-xxxg-01w-wing-gundam-ew-ver-banh640963-up','MG XXXG-01W Wing Gundam EW Ver. | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, Master-Grade injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>This year looks to be the year of the Endless Waltz. The Deathscythe Hell and Shenlong, both linked below, are here and so is the Wing Gundam EW Version.  This kit is exactly the same as the previously released Version Ka kit only with slightly different shades of color and less markings. It does however include attachment allowing you to attach it to an action base, something the previous kit did not have. A true Master Grade with plenty of detail and engineering, over 260 pieces on 13 runners, plus polycaps; everything is molded in color and snaps together, for ease of assembly -- and no need for paint! What could be next? Tallgeese?</p><p> </p>',NULL,'2026-02-05 15:00:35','2026-02-05 15:00:35'),
(1367,25,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/mgxxxg-01wwinggundamewver1100?_pos=1&_sid=167567d17&_ss=r','MG XXXG-01W Wing Gundam EW Ver. 1/100','<p>MG Wing Gundam appears as an EW version that appears in &quot;New Mobile Report Gundam W Endless Waltz&quot;. Action-based parts have been added to improve posing performance. Marking is a new design by Mr. Hajime Katoki. Molded product x 14, foil seal x 1, marking seal x 1, Gundam decal x 1, assembly instructions</p>',NULL,'2026-02-05 15:03:52','2026-02-05 15:03:52'),
