(1371,169,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/mg-zeta-gundam-ver-ka-1-100?_pos=1&_sid=b168e6845&_ss=r','MG Zeta Gundam Ver.Ka 1/100','<p>MASTER GRADE Ver.Ka 20th anniversary! &quot;MG 1/100 Zeta Gundam Ver.Ka&quot; has appeared from &quot;Mobile Suit Z Gundam&quot;. Pursuing the proportions in the anime setting draft by Mr. Kazumi Fujita. Refine the structure and shape of each unit so that both MS form and wave rider form are not broken, and build a transformation mechanis</p>',NULL,'2026-02-05 15:12:18','2026-02-05 15:12:18'),
