(1406,31,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-100-scale-wing-gundam-ver-ka-banh628398-up','Wing Gundam Ver. Ka | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, Master-Grade injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             The gorgeous and ever-popular Wing Gundam gets the \"Katoki\" treatment, and in a Master Grade kit, no less!  Katoki Hajime\'s designs are unique and appealing; combined with Master Grade detail and engineering, this is bound to be one of the hottest machines in the Master Grade lineup!  Over 260 pieces on 13 runners, plus polycaps; everything is molded in color and snaps together, for ease of assembly -- and no need for paint!  The usual foil stickers for eyes and other \"glowing\" parts are included, as is a sheet of clear \"Gundam Stickers\" with various warnings and markings on them; and of course Bandai\'s not forgotten their super-crisp rub-on transfers for the major designation markings!  Highly-poseable and heavily-armed, this high-tech beauty also transforms into flight mode once completed!  A real bargain for only 3,500 yen!',NULL,'2026-02-05 16:34:44','2026-02-05 16:34:44'),
(1407,31,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/mgxxxg-01wwinggundamverka1100?_pos=1&_sid=d88cfda78&_ss=r','MG XXXG-01W Wing Gundam Ver. Ka 1/100','<p>The long-awaited second edition, supervised by mechanic designer Hajime Katoki from modeling to packaging, is now available. The coloring of the aircraft is reproduced by dividing the parts. The shoulder joint swings back and forth to achieve a wider range of movement. It can be transformed into a flight form, and the</p>',NULL,'2026-02-05 16:37:04','2026-02-05 16:37:04'),
(1408,31,'canada_computers','https://www.canadacomputers.com/en/collectibles/276173/bandai-hobby-mg-xxxg-01w-wing-gundam-ver-ka-5062839.html?keyword=5062839','BANDAI Hobby MG XXXG-01W Wing Gundam Ver. Ka','<p>BANDAI Hobby MG XXXG-01W Wing Gundam Ver. Ka</p>',NULL,'2026-02-05 16:37:07','2026-02-05 16:37:07'),
