(1411,146,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-100-scale-mg-yms-15-gyan-banh635105-up','MG YMS-15 Gyan | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, Master-Grade injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             Um, yay! A Master Grade... Gyan.  Well, though the Gundam mopped the proverbial floor with it in the series, the MG kit itself is actually pretty impressive.  Featuring the version 2.0 frame designed by Bandai, the kit also comes with a gimmicky beam sabre that will light up with an LED (powered by a watch-type battery, not included), plus the shield, hide bomb, and all the other Gyan armament -- including a 1/20 scale unpainted figure of M\'Quve.',NULL,'2026-02-05 16:38:55','2026-02-05 16:38:55'),
