(1445,241,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/pokemon-model-kit-050-cinderace?_pos=1&_sid=cc83ca920&_ss=r','Pokemon Model Kit 050 Cinderace','<p>The 50th item in the Pokepla Select series! &quot;Ace Burn&quot; is lined up with effect parts!Thorough pursuit of lower body movement to reproduce the action pose of Aceburn. Achieves movable thighs, knees, and ankles.Head and arms can move up, down, left and right. Dynamic poses are possible by turning the chest left and right</p>',NULL,'2026-02-05 19:16:41','2026-02-05 19:16:41'),
