(1447,241,'argama_hobby','https://argamahobby.com/products/pokemon-model-kit-cinderace?_pos=1&_psq=Pokemon+Model+Kit+CINDERACE&_ss=e&_v=1.0','Pokemon Model Kit CINDERACE','<p>Cinderace has arrived in Bandai&#039;s Pokepla Select lineup! Moveable thighs, knees and ankles mean Cinderace can get into any of his signature poses, and his head and arms can be moved too; even his chest is jointed. A display stand is included to support him, and a Kaen Ball effect part and support are also included.  [I</p>',NULL,'2026-02-05 19:16:59','2026-02-05 19:16:59'),
(1448,236,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/pokemon-plastic-model-collection-quick-no-01-pikachu-bans60771','Pokemon Plastic Model Collection Quick!! No.01 Pikachu | HLJ.com','<p>This is an injection-plastic kit of a science-fiction/anime item. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>This model kit of the beloved Pikachu from \"Pokemon\" is part of a brand-new lineup from Bandai! It assembles fast and easy, with just 15 pre-colored parts and a minimum amount of stickers. Tools aren\'t necessary to remove the parts from the sprues, too, making it perfect for anyone who\'s new to building plastic models. Pikachu will be about 7.5cm tall when assembled. Makes a great gift for anyone, including you -- order today!</p><ul>\n<li>\n		<strong>[Includes]</strong>: Foil stickers</li><li><b>[Size]</b>: Approximately 7.5cm tall</li></ul>',NULL,'2026-02-05 19:37:34','2026-02-05 19:37:34'),
