(1597,296,'hobby_bee','https://hobby-bee.com/products/bandai-hobby-hguc-1-144-06-zgok-5056829','Bandai Hobby HGUC 1/144 #06 Zgok (5056829)','<p>This is a posable, high-grade injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-06 18:37:49','2026-02-06 18:37:49'),
(1598,296,'argama_hobby','https://argamahobby.com/products/high-grade-hg-hguc-1-144-msm-07-zgok?_pos=1&_sid=91b739709&_ss=r','High Grade (HG) HGUC 1/144 MSM-07 Z\'gok','<p>HG version of the MSM-07. The iconic amphibian Mobile Suit as appeared in the original Gundam TV series . Molded in Bandai&#039;s patented multi-gate technology which allows multiple colors on one tree. Painting is not required. Posable via multi-segmented arms and legs. Claws are moveable. The thrusters on back can also be</p>',NULL,'2026-02-06 18:38:09','2026-02-06 18:38:09'),
(1599,34,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-144-scale-hguc-gun-tank-banh568304-up','HGUC Gun-Tank | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, high-grade or better injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>Driven by Hayato, and almost as regular a fixture in the original anime as Amuro and the Gundam, the Guntank has languished for years with only a sub-par kit to represent it. Bandai has now corrected this injustice with a top-quality HG rendering of this longtime favorite!</p><p>Tracks are made of flexible, easy to assemble plastic strips, but they don\'t move on the completed kit. Arms, back cannons and cockpit/head are posable. Molded in the final colors and featuring snap-fit assembly.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-06 18:39:42','2026-02-06 18:39:42'),
(1600,34,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/hguc-007-guntank-1-144?_pos=1&_sid=9386277ec&_ss=r','HGUC 007 Guntank 1/144','<p>From &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam&quot; comes a 1/144 scale HGUC Guntank.The unique form of the tank has been faithfully three-dimensionalized. The head unit is made by molding the canopy with clear parts, and the inside of the cockpit is also reproduced. The caterpillar that determines the impression uses soft resin to pursue a rea</p>',NULL,'2026-02-06 18:41:03','2026-02-06 18:41:03'),
