(1641,147,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-144-scale-hguc-gelgoog-j-banh609557-up','HGUC Gelgoog J | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, high-grade or better injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             Excellent high-grade kit of the Gelgoog J is molded all in color and features snap-fit assembly; so no paint or glue are required.  Polycaps are included for joint movement; the finished product is fairly poseable.  Included weapons are the beam machinegun, and \'beam spot gun\' (in the forearms).',NULL,'2026-02-06 19:21:06','2026-02-06 19:21:06'),
(1642,147,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/hguc45ms-14jggelgoogjager1144?_pos=1&_sid=041f7eea2&_ss=r','HGUC 045 MS-14JG Gelgoog Jager 1/144','<p>HGUC specification plastic model of the rival machine &quot;Gelgoog J (Jaeger)&quot; that appears in the OVA &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam 0080&quot;. The characteristic shape of the elbow joint is reproduced by a new mechanism. In addition, the bulging and swelling shapes of each part are faithfully reproduced. The sniper pose in the play can</p>',NULL,'2026-02-06 19:23:15','2026-02-06 19:23:15'),
(1643,147,'canada_computers','https://www.canadacomputers.com/en/flight-simulator-panels/245943/thrustmaster-viper-panel-4060255-4060255.html?keyword=5060955','THRUSTMASTER Viper Panel (4060255)','<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin-top: 0em; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: 1em;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">This realistic replica of the Viper controls for PC provides a premium feel with metal buttons and realistic controls — including landing gear lever, and jettison function (for emergencies). The panel is backlit with adjustable indicator lights on the landing gear controls and TWA (Threat Warning Aux) panel for absolute realism! Viper Panel is made for intense takeoffs, combat and landings with 43 metal action buttons (including 11 virtual buttons), one trim wheel (axis), MODE and PGRM rotary selectors on the CMDS panel, plus laser sighting, jammer and weapon launch switches. Unleash the potential of Viper Panel by expanding its flight and combat capabilities with Viper TQS (Throttle Quadrant System), sold separately. The lower part of Viper TQS can be detached to fit Viper Panel and create the complete Viper experience. Viper Panel is compatible with PC and is Plug and Play in DCS World, with no setup required: the device is automatically recognized in the game.</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin-top: 0em; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: 1em;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br/></span></p>',NULL,'2026-02-06 19:23:18','2026-02-06 19:23:18'),
(1644,147,'hobby_bee','https://hobby-bee.com/products/bandai-hobby-hguc-1-144-45-ms-14jg-gelgoog-jager','Bandai Hobby HGUC 1/144 #45 MS-14JG Gelgoog Jager (5060955)','<p>Excellent high-grade kit of the Gelgoog J is molded all in color and features snap-fit assembly; so no paint or glue are required. Polycaps are included for joint movement; the finished product is fairly poseable. Included weapons are the beam machinegun, and &#039;beam spot gun&#039; (in the forearms).</p>',NULL,'2026-02-06 19:23:19','2026-02-06 19:23:19'),
