(1655,132,'argama_hobby','https://argamahobby.com/products/high-grade-hg-hguc-1-144-hi-nu-gundam?_pos=1&_sid=726c71e99&_ss=r','High Grade (HG) HGUC 1/144 RX-93-ν2 Hi-Nu Gundam','<p>The Hi-Nu Gundam from the novel &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam Char&#039;s Counterattack Beltorchika Children&quot; is now available in HGUC! The pieces are molded with color, and once completed, the figure is highly articulated and can be posed with a variety of accessories to build!</p>',NULL,'2026-02-06 19:36:01','2026-02-06 19:36:01'),
