(1657,594,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-144-scale-hguc-revive-rx-77-2-guncannon-banh574022-up','HGUC Revive RX-77-2 Guncannon | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, high-grade or better injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>The RX-77-2 Guncannon from \"Mobile Suit Gundam\" is back in the High Grade line sporting new proportions for a sleeker look with improved posability! Includes parts for his 240mm cannon set, beam rifle, and a pair of open hands and closed hands. Don\'t miss this new and improved version of the classic Guncannon!</p>',NULL,'2026-02-06 19:42:44','2026-02-06 19:42:44'),
