(1681,24,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-100-scale-mg-xxxg-01h-gundam-heavy-arms-ew-ver-banh630445-up','MG XXXG-01H Gundam Heavy Arms EW Ver. | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, Master-Grade injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>Check out the guns on this guy! And the amazing amount of missile pods.  Heavy Arms lives up to its name by sporting missile pods on its shoulders, skirt, and legs and if that wasn\'t enough he also carries around that massive gun!  Molded completely in color the Heavy Arms snaps together easily and once finished will stand in a variety of poses.  It also comes with an option assembly for the arm allowing it to store a beam saber handle and a whole lot of markings (sticker and dry transfer).  </p>',NULL,'2026-02-06 20:51:07','2026-02-06 20:51:07'),
(1682,24,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/mggundamheavyarmsewver?_pos=1&_sid=d23ffd49b&_ss=r','MG Gundam Heavyarms EW Ver. 1/100','<p>Heavy Arms EW from &quot;New Mobile Report Gundam W Endless Waltz&quot;. Hajime Katoki refined the TV version of Heavy Arms as the Endless Walts version. Full hatch open of all bullets can be reproduced. The army knife on the right arm is equipped with a deployment gimmick and a detachable function. The marking design and detail</p>',NULL,'2026-02-06 20:55:28','2026-02-06 20:55:28'),
(1683,24,'canada_computers','https://www.canadacomputers.com/en/model-building-kits-14/261010/bandai-hobby-mg-1-100-gundam-heavyarms-ew-gundam-wing-endless-waltz-model-kit-5063044.html?keyword=5063044','BANDAI Hobby MG 1/100 Gundam Heavyarms (EW) \'Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz\' Model Kit','<p>BANDAI Hobby MG 1/100 Gundam Heavyarms (EW) &#039;Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz&#039; Model Kit</p>',NULL,'2026-02-06 20:55:30','2026-02-06 20:55:30'),
(1684,24,'hobby_bee','https://hobby-bee.com/products/bandai-hobby-mg-1-100-gundam-heavyarms-ew-gundam-wing-endless-waltz-5063044','[Backorder] Bandai Hobby MG 1/100 Gundam Heavyarms (EW) ','<p>This is a posable, Master-Grade injection-plastic kit.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-06 20:55:31','2026-02-06 20:55:31'),
(1685,24,'argama_hobby','https://argamahobby.com/products/mg-1-100-gundam-heavyarms-ew?_pos=1&_sid=482db358b&_ss=r','Master Grade (MG) 1/100 XXXG-01H Gundam Heavyarms EW','<div id=\"productDescription_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"productDescription\" data-template-name=\"productDescription\" class=\"a-row feature\" data-cel-widget=\"productDescription_feature_div\">\n<div id=\"productDescription\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-small\">\n<p>This version of Heavyarms by Hajime Katoki was designed in the style of the Gundam Wing OVA \"Endless Waltz\" (EW) and was created as part of the new Gundam Wing manga, \"Glory of the Defeated,\" which uses the Endless Waltz design aesthetic for its mobile suits. Featuring its iconic gattling gun and full load out of missiles, this release also includes its arm mounted combat knife as well as an optional beam saber attachement in the arm to recreate a fight in the TV series.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-06 20:55:59','2026-02-06 20:55:59'),
(1686,18,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-100-scale-mg-msn-00100-type-100-hyakushiki-ver-2-0-banh615923-up','MG MSN-00100 Type 100 Hyakushiki Ver.2.0 | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, Master-Grade injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>It\'s been a number of years since we saw a new MG 2.0 kit released and now Bandai\'s chosen an amazing suit to bring it to us again: the fan favorite Hyakushiki!</p><p>This kit\'s armour will be mekki-plated with undergates so no gate marks are visible after assembly.  It will come with various eye parts so you can choose how you want the face to look, and the binders on its back will be attached via a flexible joint to allow a lot of movement.  </p><p>This golden beauty will come with a Bazooka, Beam Rifle, two beam sabers, and marking stickers.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-06 20:57:36','2026-02-06 20:57:36'),
