(1710,151,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-100-scale-mg-gundam-ez-8-banh631459-up','MG Gundam EZ-8 | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, Master-Grade injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             Yet another amazing kit from Bandai\'s MG series. The Gundam Ez8 is one of latest to get \"The MG Treatment\".  This \"ground pounder\" carries a backpack (could hold a car) which opens for weapons storage. Cockpit armor panels fold down. Includes an unpainted figure of Pilot Shiroh Amada. The instruction book is 19 pages and includes a \"Documentary photographs\" page, and painting guides. Weapons include Beam Rifle, 10mm Machine Gun, Hyper Bazooka (Ground Type), Beam Saber and Shield. Snap assembly. Molded in final colors.',NULL,'2026-02-06 21:54:41','2026-02-06 21:54:41'),
