(1720,185,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-100-scale-mg-char-s-z-gok-banh615763-up','MG Char&#x27;s Z&#x27;Gok | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, Master-Grade injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             The Master Grade version of Char\'s customised shiny red Z\'Gok is here! The expertly designed inner frame system allows flexibility and poseability to equal the \"real\" thing in the animated series. The bellows rims (the loopy things on its arms and legs) even stretch out a little, for added reach and flexibility. All in all, a superb kit of an incredibly cool machine.',NULL,'2026-02-06 22:04:07','2026-02-06 22:04:07'),
