(1744,66,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-144-scale-hg-helmwige-reincar-banh554505-up','HG Helmwige Reincar | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, high-grade or better injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>Piloted by Isurugi Camice, the Helmwige Reincar appears in season 2 of \"Mobile Suit Gundam: Iron-Blooded Orphans,\" and it\'s equipped with its immense Valkyria Buster Sword, which is longer than it is tall!  Molded in color, and features snap-fit assembly and stickers for the markings. Order today and start building!</p>',NULL,'2026-02-06 22:39:43','2026-02-06 22:39:43'),
