(1749,76,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-144-scale-hg-man-rodi-banh579782-up','HG Man Rodi | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, high-grade or better injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>It\'s the Man Rodi from the anime series \"Iron-Blooded Orphans\"!  This cool looking big green suit comes equipped with a beam rifle and a big axe ready to go into action.  Parts come molded in multiple colors and includes a small sticker sheet for the eye.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-06 22:43:54','2026-02-06 22:43:54'),
