(1753,76,'meeplemart','https://www.meeplemart.com/gundam-high-grade-ibo-1/144-man-rodi.aspx','Bandai Hobby - Gundam Iron Blooded Orphans HG 1/144: #009 Man Rodi #5057978 [4573102579782]','<p>#5057978 [4573102579782] - Gundam Iron Blooded Orphans HG 1/144: #009 Man Rodi</p>',NULL,'2026-02-06 22:47:24','2026-02-06 22:47:24'),
(1754,76,'argama_hobby','https://argamahobby.com/products/high-grade-hg-iron-blooded-orphans-1-144-man-rodi?_pos=1&_psq=Orphans+HG+1%2F144+Man+Rodi&_ss=e&_v=1.0','High Grade (HG) Iron Blooded Orphans 1/144 Man Rodi','<p>It&#039;s the Man Rodi from the anime series &quot;Iron-Blooded Orphans&quot;!  This cool looking big green suit comes equipped with a beam rifle and a big axe ready to go into action.  Parts come molded in multiple colors and includes a small sticker sheet for the eye.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-06 22:47:27','2026-02-06 22:47:27'),
