(1771,235,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/pokemon-plamo-collection-quick-lite-eevee-banh693631','Pokemon Plamo Collection Quick!! Lite Eevee | HLJ.com','<p>This is an injection-plastic figure kit. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p><b>Note: Bandai Hobby product orders are assigned on a first come, first served basis. Please note that if you do not receive this product after is initial released, you will be placed on the \'backorder\' list until additional stock can be allocated. </b><br></p><p><br></p><p>Eevee joins Bandai\'s \"Pokemon Plamo Collection Quick!! Lite\" model-kit lineup, which features a runnerless design to make assembly even faster and easier! The carefully divided parts allow for easy assembly and a colorful finish; the use of stickers is minimal, and the figure will be the same as Bandai\'s \"Pokemon Plamo Collection Quick!! 04 Eevee\" when completed. Place your order today!</p><ul>\n	<li>\n		<strong>[Figure Size]</strong>: Approximately 7.5cm tall when completed</li>\n</ul><p><br></p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2026-02-06 23:22:37','2026-02-06 23:22:37'),
