(1776,253,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/nbpm-096-nano-block-pokemon-gardevoir-kaw22553','NBPM_096 Nano Block Pokemon Gardevoir | HLJ.com','<p>This is a set of building blocks designed for children and/or collectors. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p></p><p>The iconic Gardevoir from Pokemon Ruby is the latest addition to the PokeNano series!</p><p>This grass-psychic type Pokemon has the ability to predict the future, and uses its greatest power, Psycho-Energy, when it encounters threats. Gardevoir has a long, elongated body which makes it look as if it is wearing a dress, which has faithfully recreated in this Nanoblock model.</p><p>NBPM_097 Pokemon Milocaros and NBPM_098 Pokemon Metagross are also being released at the same time! Metagross\' are also released at the same time!</p><ul><li>Finished size: (W x H x D): 45 x 65 x 50 (mm)</li><li>Number of pieces: 130</li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,'2026-02-06 23:27:52','2026-02-06 23:27:52'),
