(1805,240,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/pokemon-plamo-collection-quick-07-eevee-good-night-pose-bans61670','Pokemon Plamo Collection Quick!! 07 Eevee (Good Night Pose) | HLJ.com','<p>This is an injection-plastic kit of a science-fiction/anime item. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>From Bandai\'s Pokemon Plamo (plastic model) Collection Quick series comes an adorable little sleeping Eevee!</p><p>The kit is snap-fit so you can assemble it without any glue, and you don\'t even need tools to remove the parts from the runners! Just snap the colored parts loose from the runner then press them together and you\'ll have yourself a figure of Eevee in no time. The kit features 16 parts in total, and will be 115mm long when completed. Reserve Eevee for your collection today!</p><ul><li><strong>[Figure Size]:</strong> About 115mm long when completed</li><li><strong>[Includes]</strong>: Sticker sheet<br></li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL,'2026-02-07 00:09:21','2026-02-07 00:09:21'),
