(1841,87,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-144-scale-rg-wing-gundam-zero-ew-banh616029-up','RG Wing Gundam Zero EW | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, Real-Grade injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>Bandai\'s Real Grade lineup just got even more awesome with the addition of the highly anticipated Wing Gundam Zero from \"Endless Waltz\"!  It\'s built on a \"Zero Frame,\" which allows amazing posability.  Some of the feathers on its magnificent wings will also be posable thanks to unique joints. It comes with two buster rifles which can be joined into one for the ultimate in firepower! Don\'t miss out on this iconic Gundam, and order now!</p><p>Parts are molded in pale grey, dark grey, navy blue, red, clear, and yellow plastic. Paint is not required, but may be used for more a more realistic look. Instructions are in Japanese, but are fully-illustrated for ease of assembly regardless. Decals are included with this kit.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-07 01:14:15','2026-02-07 01:14:15'),
(1842,87,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/rg-17-wing-gundam-zero-ew-1-144?_pos=1&_sid=9fcc19e5b&_ss=r','RG 17 Wing Gundam Zero EW 1/144','<p>The iconic XXXG-00W0 Wing Gundam Zero (Endless Waltz) joins the Real Grade line! After the original Wing Zero was heavily damaged again (we lost count), it was repurposed into the Wing Zero EW. Equipped with the brain-interface Zero System, it can calculate all conditions for victory, although a warrior of great will l</p>',NULL,'2026-02-07 01:19:35','2026-02-07 01:19:35'),
