(1851,90,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-144-scale-rg-msm-07s-char-s-z-gok-banh616012-up','RG MSM-07S Char&#x27;s Z&#x27;Gok | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, Real-Grade injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>This 1/144-scale Real Grade kit of Char\'s custom version of the fast and agile Z\'gok features full posability thanks to its internal \"skeleton.\" Parts come molded in color, so no paint is required to complete this easy to build kit, but it can be used to add detail! Includes stickers for markings. </p>',NULL,'2026-02-07 01:27:32','2026-02-07 01:27:32'),
(1852,90,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/rgmsm-07szgokcharcustom1144?_pos=1&_sid=dff6df3b3&_ss=r','RG 16 Char\'s Z\'Gok 1/144','<p>It came from the deep!  The 16th Real Grade kit is none other than the Red Comet&#039;s pink red MSM-07S Z&#039;Gok. A key factor in Zeon&#039;s assault on Jaburo base, this amphibian close combat monster is capable of punching straight through a GM with its big meaty claws. It also sports six missile launchers, as well as Mega Parti</p>',NULL,'2026-02-07 01:28:54','2026-02-07 01:28:54'),
