(1856,44,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/sd-sangoku-soketsuden-soso-wing-gundam-banh567680-up','SD Sangoku Soketsuden Soso Wing Gundam | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, injection-plastic SD or BB kit from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>Bandai expands its SD Gundam model kit lineup with more characters based on \"Sangokushi\"! They feature improved proportions and redesigned head and body joint structures for dynamic poses; they also look better than ever once assembled thanks to their full-color parts! </p><p>Soso Wing Gundam is equipped with the two swinging Futaba Swords; combine them to create the large Futabaken sword! Foil seals are also included. Order yours today!</p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2026-02-07 01:51:55','2026-02-07 01:51:55'),
(1857,44,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/sdsangokucaocaowinggundam?_pos=1&_sid=57af96a79&_ss=r','SD Sangoku 04 Cao Cao Wing Gundam','<p>After more than 10 years, a new trilogy, birth! SD Gundam based on &quot;okushi&quot; will also be on the look! We realize color coding of SD highest ever in SD only by assembling by sticking to evolved proportion and parts division. Recurring pose by dynamic body and body balance and joint structure of various places! We can re</p>',NULL,'2026-02-07 01:55:21','2026-02-07 01:55:21'),
