(1863,12,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/sdw-heroes-musha-gundam-the-78th-banh662934-up','SDW HEROES Musha Gundam The 78th | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, injection-plastic SD or BB kit from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>The new generation of Musha Gundam proudly enters the \"SDW Heroes\" battle lineup with new \"Kirako\" parts! The Kirako parts are made with an in-mold technology that performs injection molding and film attachment at the same time, to produce parts that have a rich, gleaming appearance! \"Kira steel\" is used for the sword, and the stance of drawing a sword from its sheath can be easily reproduced thanks to the superior range of motion in his elbows! You can also use the Kirako parts included with SDW Heroes Onmitsu Gundam Aerial! Order yours today!</p><p><b>[Includes]</b>:</p><ul><li>Sword</li><li>Sheath</li><li>Stickers</li></ul>',NULL,'2026-02-07 02:03:21','2026-02-07 02:03:21'),
