(1923,94,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/0af7b240-ab87-11e7-eddc-717117dd5d87?_pos=1&_sid=f9971ad79&_ss=r','MG Build Strike Full Package 1/100','<p>Build Strike Gundam from &quot;Gundam Build Fighters&quot; appears with MG series&#039; tastes. Based on the concept &quot;What kind of MG would the protagonist Sei make?&quot; it is built based on MG Aile Strike Gundam Ver. RM:     The Build Booster is detachable. You can display the Build Booster independently on the included stand by using</p>',NULL,'2026-02-08 04:30:55','2026-02-08 04:30:55'),
(1924,94,'canada_computers','https://www.canadacomputers.com/en/model-building-kits-14/261929/bandai-hobby-mg-1-100-build-strike-gundam-full-package-gundam-build-fighters-model-kit-5066135.html?keyword=5066135','BANDAI Hobby MG 1/100 Build Strike Gundam Full Package \"Gundam Build Fighters\" Model kit','<p>BANDAI Hobby MG 1/100 Build Strike Gundam Full Package &quot;Gundam Build Fighters&quot; Model kit</p>',NULL,'2026-02-08 04:30:57','2026-02-08 04:30:57'),
