(1926,94,'argama_hobby','https://argamahobby.com/products/master-grade-1-100-build-strike-gundam-full-package?_pos=1&_psq=MG+1%2F100+Build+Strike+Full+Package&_ss=e&_v=1.0','Master Grade (MG) 1/100 Build Strike Gundam Full Package','<p>This highly detailed and articulated snap-fit kit is molded in multiple colors, with stickers for decoration. Comes with a display stand!</p>',NULL,'2026-02-08 04:31:17','2026-02-08 04:31:17'),
(1927,289,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/sd-gundam-ex-standard-00-gundam-bann04936','SD Gundam EX Standard 00 Gundam | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, injection-plastic SD or BB kit from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>Bandai brings us a new line of Super Deformed (SD) Gundam called the EX Standard!  These new EX Standard kits come molded in multiple colors and feature limited articulation so you can get that perfect pose to display them!  Foil marking stickers are also included to add extra colors and markings to your kit.  A new gimmick added with these EX Standard kits is the ability to borrow parts and combine them to make new weapons that can be used with 1/144 scale HG Gundam kits!</p>',NULL,'2026-02-08 04:37:27','2026-02-08 04:37:27'),
(1928,289,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/ex-standard00800gundam?_pos=1&_sid=d7f1527a1&_ss=r','SD EX-Standard 008 00 Gundam','<p>The &quot;SD Gundam EX Standard&quot; series, which was developed overseas, has landed in Japan! Compared to the conventional SD Gundam series kit, the range of motion has been greatly improved, various poses are possible, and it is compatible with sophisticated and stylish proportions! Furthermore, it is compatible with the HG</p>',NULL,'2026-02-08 04:37:53','2026-02-08 04:37:53'),
