(1935,79,'argama_hobby','https://argamahobby.com/products/sd-gundam-ex-standard-xxxg-00w0-wing-gundam-zero-ew?_pos=1&_psq=SD+GUNDAM+EX-STANDARD+WING+GUNDAM+ZERO+EW&_ss=e&_v=1.0','SDEX XXXG-00W0 Wing Gundam Zero EW (Bandai SD Gundam EX-Standard 004)','<p>Bandai brings us a new line of Super Deformed (SD) Gundam called the EX Standard!  These new EX Standard kits come molded in multiple colors and feature limited articulation so you can get that perfect pose to display them!  Foil marking stickers are also included to add extra colors and markings to your kit.  A new gi</p>',NULL,'2026-02-08 04:50:24','2026-02-08 04:50:24'),
(1936,174,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/rg-37-god-gundam-1-144?_pos=1&_sid=bd16c65b4&_ss=r','RG 37 Burning Gundam 1/144','<p>Previously known as RG 37 God Gundam 1/144 From &quot;Mobile Fighter G Gundam&quot;, &quot;God Gundam&quot; appears in RG! Pursuing the largest range of motion in the history of RG by incorporating the human body structure as a test of the actual machine! Recreate movements that trace the human body unique to mobile fighters! With the adv</p>',NULL,'2026-02-09 03:12:35','2026-02-09 03:12:35'),
(1937,174,'hobby_bee','https://hobby-bee.com/products/bandai-hobby-rg-1-144-37-god-gundam','Bandai Hobby RG 1/144 #37 GOD GUNDAM (5063358)','<p>This is a posable, Real-Grade injection-plastic kit.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-09 03:12:45','2026-02-09 03:12:45'),
(1938,174,'argama_hobby','https://argamahobby.com/products/gundam-decal-138-rg-1-144-god-gundam?_pos=1&_psq=RG+1%2F144+GOD+GUNDAM&_ss=e&_v=1.0','Gundam Decal 138 - RG 1/144 God Gundam','<p>New to the &quot;Gundam Decal&quot; line up comes a sheet of water transfer decals that can be used for 1/144 scale! Versatile water transfer decals that include markings for unit insignia. [Accessories]:   Water transfer type decal x 1</p>',NULL,'2026-02-09 03:12:57','2026-02-09 03:12:57'),
(1939,45,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/Ly4MrmxndfnTEralMUXY/h/hgaw-163-gundam-double-x','Bandai HGAW 163 Gundam Double X - Newtype','<p>The powerful Gundam Double X from the TV series After War Gundam X appears in HG form! Utilizing the Gundam X’s internal frame for fictional accuracy, this powerful retrofit features an over-the-shoulder weapon called the Twin Satellite Cannon powered by dazzling energy reflectors on its backpack that can unfold.      Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic Based on the After War Gundam X        Box Contents  Pieces to build   Gundam Double X Twin satellite cannons Solar collectors Buster rifle 2 Beam swords Composite shield   Foil stickers Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\"}','2026-02-09 14:47:27','2026-02-09 18:10:13'),
(1940,93,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/RtKPoNDHiAAdbYkcDUAT/h/hgac-174-wing-gundam-zero','Bandai HGAC 174 Wing Gundam Zero - Newtype','<p>From the Gundam Wing anime series, this 1/144 scale Wing Gundam Zero Model Kit is a great addition to an collection! The twin burst rifles can be connected together or used seperately. This Gundam can also transform into its Neo Bird mode!      Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic From the anime series Gundam Wing Transforms into Neo Bird Mode        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Wing Gundam Zero Twin burst rifles 2 Beam Sabers Shield   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Wing\"}','2026-02-09 14:50:42','2026-02-09 18:10:11'),
(1941,74,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/66Q6Jea5YDubDvW3lzXq/h/hguc-117-gouf-custom','Bandai HGUC 117 Gouf Custom - Newtype','<p>Based on Mobile Suit Gundam: The 08th MS Team, this Gouf Custom model kit is in 1/144 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once built.       Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of PS, PE, and PVC Based on Mobile Suit Gundam: The 08th MS Team Part of the High Grade Universal Century model kit line        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Gouf Custom 35 MM machine gun Gatling gun Heat Saber Shield   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"The 08th MS Team\"}','2026-02-09 19:46:10','2026-02-09 19:46:10'),
(1942,104,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/7B79I5WsaOjNKW60EMBL/h/hguc-165-v-gundam','Bandai HGUC 165 V Gundam - Newtype','<p>Based on Mobile Suit Gundam Victory Gundam, this Victory Gundam model kit is in 1/144 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once built.       Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of PS, PE Based on Mobile Suit Gundam Victory Gundam anime Part of the High-Grade Universal Century model kit line Action Base not included        Box Contents  Pieces to build   Victory Gundam Core Fighter 2 Beam Sabers Beam Shield   Foil seal Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\"}','2026-02-09 19:47:11','2026-02-09 19:47:11'),
(1943,84,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/2WiBBegR8UFJ2mziF0ZE/h/gundam-artifact-010-v2-assault-buster-gundam','Bandai Gundam Artifact 010 V2-Assault Buster Gundam - Newtype','<p>This exclusive series allows you to recreate precise mini models of different kinds of Mobile Suits. Each Mobile Suit has a mechanical arrangement unique to this series, which consists of about 50 pale orange molded parts. The high-density design, despite its size of about 55 mm, is reminiscent of the newer Gundams. Collect and paint all 5 in this series!      Product Features  2.17 x 1.58 inches (5.5cm x 4cm) Made of ABS Part of the Gundam Artifact model kit line Based on the multiple Gundam series</p>','{\"line\": \"Gundam Artifact\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\"}','2026-02-09 19:48:09','2026-02-09 19:48:09'),
(1944,631,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/uUtc3jWUbA5CmmxRBaX6/h/30mf-class-up-armor-a-01-liber-holy-knight','Bandai 30MF Class Up Armor A-01 (Liber Holy Knight) - Newtype','<p>The Class Up Armor (Liber Holy Knight) set from Bandai’s 30 Minutes Fantasy (30MF) series allows you to upgrade your character to a higher-tier job through armor replacement! By combining this set with the Liber Knight (sold separately), you can class up to the Liber Holy Knight, a warrior with divine swordsmanship and exceptional defense. This set features a unique face design and color scheme different from the Rosan Empire’s Holy Knight (sold separately). Product Features  Part of the 30 Minutes Fantasy (30MF) series Allows class-up customization Multiple points of articulation upon assembly Compatible with other 30MF figures  Box Contents  Armor parts (x1 set) Armed parts (x1 set)</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Fantasy\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 19:50:10','2026-02-09 19:50:10'),
(1945,630,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/yfPc9MowdQ205BUIKLXA/h/30mf-class-up-armor-a-02-liber-paladin','Bandai 30MF Class Up Armor A-02 (Liber Paladin) - Newtype','<p>Elevate your warrior to the next tier with the Liber Paladin armor set from Bandai’s 30 Minute Fantasy model kit series! This powerful armor set is designed to upgrade your Liber Knight (sold separately) into the heroic and battle-ready Paladin class, perfect for defending allies and striking down foes. The Liber Paladin armor features ornate plate armor, a bold chest emblem, and elegant detailing that reflects the overwhelming power of its role. Included are newly designed armor parts for the shoulders, torso, arms, and legs, as well as an attachment sword part befitting a heavy frontline fighter. Figures not included. Liber Knight sold separately. Product Features  Made of plastic Part of the 30 Minutes Fantasy series Designed to upgrade the Liber Knight model kit (sold separately) Enhances customization with armor and weapons   Box Contents  Armor parts set Sword part  Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Fantasy\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 19:51:10','2026-02-09 19:51:10'),
(1946,637,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/RhmfdyGe4dGntYO9gBNs/h/30mf-class-up-armor-a-06-liber-viking','Bandai 30MF Class Up Armor A-06 (Liber Viking) - Newtype','<p>Elevate your 30MF Silhouette model to a higher-level class with this Liber Viking armor set! Designed to combine with the 30MF Liber Fighter (sold separately), this kit transforms your model into the powerful Liber Viking. Known for its exceptional combat abilities and rugged fighting style, the Viking job outmatches the Fighter with its formidable appearance and skills. This set features a unique face design and exclusive coloring, distinct from the Rozen Empire Viking (sold separately). Perfect for customizing your 30MF collection—don&#039;t miss out! Product Features  Part of the 30 Minutes Fantasy (30MF) series Enhances your 30MF Liber Fighter into the Liber Viking class Includes armor and weapon parts for a detailed upgrade Unique face design and exclusive coloring  Box Contents  Armor parts (x1 set) Weapon parts (x1 set)</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Fantasy\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 19:52:09','2026-02-09 19:52:09'),
(1947,636,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/Bm8kSL0EsRqRTCuJ2Vnh/h/30mf-class-up-armor-a-05-liber-warrior','Bandai 30MF Class Up Armor A-05 (Liber Warrior) - Newtype','<p>Upgrade your fantasy warrior to new heights with the Class-Up Armor Liber Warrior accessory set from the 30 Minutes Fantasy series! Designed to enhance and customize your figure, this set includes detailed armor and weapon parts that transform the Liber Fighter (sold separately) into the elite Liber Warrior—a battle-hardened class known for unmatched strength and combat prowess. With high compatibility and creative flexibility, this accessory pack allows builders to take their fantasy character to the next level of customization and storytelling. Whether for display or imaginative world-building, the Liber Warrior adds depth to your collection. Figures not included. Liber Fighter sold separately. Product Features   Made of plastic   Part of the 30 Minutes Fantasy series   Designed to upgrade the Liber Fighter model kit (sold separately)   Enhances customization with armor and weapons   Instructions may or may not include English translation   Box Contents   Pieces to build   Armor parts set   Armament parts set   Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Fantasy\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 19:53:11','2026-02-09 19:53:11'),
(1948,645,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/Pik7slzgxIXt2KMomh06/h/30mf-class-up-armor-a-10-rosan-bishop','Bandai 30MF Class Up Armor A-10 (Rosan Bishop) - Newtype','<p>Upgrade your 30 MINUTES FANTASY figures with the Rosan Bishop Class Up Armor Set! This expansion kit allows you to enhance and transform your character using the &quot;Armor Cross&quot; (Armor Replacement) system, elevating the Rosan Priest (sold separately) into the Rosan Bishop class. Designed with a water-element theme, this armor set features a unique color scheme distinct from the Bishop of the Republic of Liber (sold separately). Whether you&#039;re looking to customize, expand your display options, or craft your own fantasy character, this set provides dynamic versatility and detailed design. Product Features  Made of plastic Part of the 30 Minutes Fantasy series Compatible with the Rosan Priest model kit  Box Contents  Armor parts set Armament parts set Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Fantasy\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 19:54:10','2026-02-09 19:54:10'),
(1949,654,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/DVp7ChxV8Kj2X7QlPBzv/h/30mf-class-up-armor-a-16-rosan-enchanter','Bandai 30MF Class Up Armor A-16 (Rosan Enchanter) - Newtype','<p>Upgrade your fantasy warrior to new heights with the Class-Up Armor Rosan Enchanter accessory set from the 30 Minutes Fantasy series! Designed to enhance and customize your figure, this set includes detailed armor and weapon parts that transform the Rosan Wizard (sold separately) into the shadowy Rosan Enchanter— a dual-wielding battle mage clad in armor and flowing mantle. With high compatibility and creative flexibility, this accessory pack allows builders to take their fantasy character to the next level of customization and storytelling. Whether for display or imaginative world-building, the Rosan Enchanter adds depth to your collection. Figures not included. Rosan Wizard sold separately. Product Features  Made of plastic Part of the 30 Minutes Fantasy series Designed to upgrade the Rosan Wizard model kit (sold separately) Enhances customization with armor and weapons   Box Contents  Armor and mantle parts set Sword Short staff handle Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Fantasy\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 19:55:10','2026-02-09 19:55:10'),
(1950,634,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/jU7fhAh94it2LY502Pfp/h/30mf-class-up-armor-a-04-rosan-paladin','Bandai 30MF Class Up Armor A-04 (Rosan Paladin) - Newtype','<p>Elevate your warrior to the next tier with the Rosan Paladin armor set from Bandai’s 30 Minute Fantasy model kit series! This powerful armor set is designed to upgrade your Rosan Knight (sold separately) into the menacing and battle-ready Paladin class, perfect for defending allies and striking down foes. The Rosan Paladin armor features ornate plate armor, a bold chest emblem, and elegant detailing that reflects the overwhelming power of its role. Included are newly designed armor parts for the shoulders, torso, arms, and legs, as well as an attachment sword part befitting a heavy frontline fighter. Figures not included. Rosan Knight sold separately. Product Features  Made of plastic Part of the 30 Minutes Fantasy series Designed to upgrade the Rosan Knight model kit (sold separately) Enhances customization with armor and weapons   Box Contents  Armor parts set Sword part  Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Fantasy\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 19:56:10','2026-02-09 19:56:10'),
(1951,653,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/41ozIyM8lowJ9677aHdv/h/30mf-class-up-armor-a-15-rosan-sorcerer','Bandai 30MF Class Up Armor A-15 (Rosan Sorcerer) - Newtype','<p>Upgrade your fantasy warrior to new heights with the Class-Up Armor Rosan Sorceror accessory set from the 30 Minutes Fantasy series! Designed to enhance and customize your figure, this set includes detailed armor and weapon parts that transform the Rosan Wizard (sold separately) into the mysterious Rosan Sorcerer — a master of magic clad in dark, sinister armor. With high compatibility and creative flexibility, this accessory pack allows builders to take their fantasy character to the next level of customization and storytelling. Whether for display or imaginative world-building, the Rosan Sorcerer adds depth to your collection. Figures not included. Rosan Wizard sold separately. Product Features  Made of plastic Part of the 30 Minutes Fantasy series Designed to upgrade the Rosan Wizard model kit (sold separately) Enhances customization with armor and weapons   Box Contents  Armor parts set Weapon parts set Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Fantasy\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 19:57:11','2026-02-09 19:57:11'),
(1952,641,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/n6WR20UanMctRWKwS6uP/h/30mf-class-up-armor-a-08-rosan-viking','Bandai 30MF Class Up Armor A-08 (Rosan Viking) - Newtype','<p>This new 30 Minutes Fantasy (30MF) set from Bandai allows you to &quot;class up&quot; your 30MF Silhouette to a higher-level job! Combine this set with the separately sold 30MF Rosan Fighter to create the Rosan Viking! The Viking role offers advanced combat abilities far superior to the Fighter class and specializes in an aggressive, unrelenting fighting style. This set features a unique face design and coloring that distinguishes it from the Liber Republic Viking (sold separately), making it a standout addition to your fantasy collection. Box Contents:  Armor parts (1 set) Weapon parts (1 set)</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Fantasy\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 19:58:13','2026-02-09 19:58:13'),
(1953,640,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/iQvkDyOd0lOVh7RIqT70/h/30mf-class-up-armor-a-07-rosan-warrior','Bandai 30MF Class Up Armor A-07 (Rosan Warrior) - Newtype','<p>Enhance your 30 Minutes Fantasy (30MF) collection with this class-up armor and weapon set from Bandai! Designed to transform your 30MF Rosan Fighter (sold separately) into the Rosan Warrior, this set brings your fantasy figure to a higher-level job. The Rosan Warrior represents elite fighters with superior combat skills and a commanding presence on the battlefield. This upgrade includes a unique face design and coloring, distinct from the Liber Republic Warrior set (sold separately), offering a fresh look for your fantasy builds. Fully compatible with the 30MF lineup, these parts allow for endless customization possibilities. Product Features:  Class-up armor and weapons for the Rosan Fighter Exclusive face design and coloring for the Rosan Warrior Fully compatible with 30MF and 30MM parts for enhanced customization Perfect for creating a battle-ready figure  Box Contents:  Armor parts (1 set) Weapon parts (1 set)</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Fantasy\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 19:59:14','2026-02-09 19:59:14'),
(1954,648,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/S3GtCle0JaS3NcJaAwLM/h/30mf-class-up-armor-a-11-liber-assassin-slash','Bandai 30MF Class Up Armor A-11 (Liber Assassin Slash) - Newtype','<p>Unleash unparalleled speed and precision with the Liber Assassin Slash, an elite enhancement in the 30 Minutes Fantasy series! This Class Up Armor set transforms the Liber Assassin (sold separately) into a deadly master of dual-wield combat, equipped for rapid, lethal strikes. By utilizing the &quot;Armor Cross&quot; [Armor Replacement] system, this set elevates your existing character into a high-tier assassin, enhancing both style and combat performance. The included weapons are designed for fast and fluid attacks:  Two longswords for powerful and precise slashes Two short swords for rapid dual-wielded strikes  With a Water Element Core, this upgrade symbolizes fluid, unpredictable movement and enhanced agility, making the Liber Assassin Slash a force to be reckoned with. The face design and color scheme are unique to this set, offering a distinct aesthetic that sets it apart from the Assassin Slash of the Lausanne Empire (sold separately). Product Features  Made of plastic Part of the 30 Minutes Fantasy series Upgrades Liber Assassin (sold separately) to Liber Assassin Slash Includes longswords and short swords for dynamic combat poses Compatible with other 30MF kits for limitless customization  Box Contents  Longsword (x1) Short swords (x2) Armor parts set Armament parts set Joint parts set Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Fantasy\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 20:01:09','2026-02-09 20:01:09'),
(1955,650,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/tcWQRabGblS5QvXcXSKS/h/30mf-class-up-armor-a-12-rosan-assassin-slash','Bandai 30MF Class Up Armor A-12 (Rosan Assassin Slash) - Newtype','<p>Enhance your stealth and precision with the Rosan Assassin Slash, an elite upgrade in the 30 Minutes Fantasy series! This Class Up Armor set is designed to elevate the Rosan Assassin (sold separately) to an advanced assassin role, bringing enhanced armor, weapons, and versatility to your character. Using the &quot;Armor Cross&quot; [Armor Replacement] system, this set transforms your existing Rosan Assassin into the formidable Rosan Assassin Slash, equipping it for faster, deadlier, and more agile combat. The included weaponry consists of:  Two longswords for powerful and precise strikes Two short swords for swift dual-wield combat  Designed for stealth and speed, this class-up kit allows dual-wielding combat poses, making it ideal for fast-paced battles and assassination missions. The &quot;Element Core&quot; attribute is Water, symbolizing fluid, unpredictable movement and mystical energy. The armor and face design have been uniquely crafted, giving this set a distinct aesthetic compared to the Republic of Liber&#039;s Assassin Slash (sold separately). Product Features  Made of plastic Part of the 30 Minutes Fantasy series Upgrades Rosan Assassin (sold separately) to Rosan Assassin Slash Includes longswords and short swords for dynamic combat poses Compatible with other 30MF kits for limitless customization  Box Contents  Longsword (x1) Short swords (x2) Armor parts set Armament parts set Joint parts set Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Fantasy\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 20:02:10','2026-02-09 20:02:10'),
(1956,655,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/qd9UANmkXX9zhiKGFyxM/h/30mf-customize-structure-1','Bandai 30MF Customize Structure 1 - Newtype','<p>Bring your 30 Minutes Fantasy scenes to life with the Customize Structure 1 set from Bandai! This accessory pack adds a variety of fantasy creatures and scenic elements, allowing you to craft dynamic interactions between your 30MF characters and their environment. From mischievous slimes to curious birds and mushrooms, each element is carefully designed to complement your models while encouraging imaginative customization. Many of the monster parts can also be used as modular accessories, giving you endless possibilities to personalize your builds. Product Features  Part of the 30MF (30 Minutes Fantasy) accessory line Includes mushroom, bird, and three types of slime monsters to populate your diorama with life and character. Comes with a signpost, log, and rock to create immersive environments that tell a story. Some monster components can be used as modular accessories to enhance your 30MF figures.  Compatible with 30MF and 30MM figures   Box Contents  Mushroom monster Slimes Bird Rock formation Signpost Log Assembly instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Fantasy\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 20:03:09','2026-02-09 20:03:09'),
(1957,633,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/crXhlbinDnA4WkLU6EUj/h/30mf-item-shop-1-knight-option','Bandai 30MF Item Shop 1 (Knight Option) - Newtype','<p>Expand your customization options with the Item Shop Knight Option Set from the 30 Minutes Fantasy (30MF) series! This versatile set is packed with weapons and items to enhance your model builds, providing even more ways to personalize your collection. Featuring face, shoulder, and chest armor parts in two different designs, this set allows for diverse customization of your 30MF figures. Also included are two Treasure Chests—one in gray and one in clear blue—with lids that open and close, as well as two Potions to add even more fantasy-themed elements. The kit comes with 30 Minutes Fantasy joint parts, making it compatible with the 30 Minutes Sisters (30MS) series, allowing for easy part-swapping and endless customization possibilities. Product Features:   Material: Made of plastic  Series: Part of the 30 Minutes Fantasy series  Compatibility: Works with most 30MF and 30MS model parts  Customization: Includes a variety of weapons and armor for expanded customization Figures not included  Instructions: May or may not include English translation  Box Contents:  Pieces to build:  Kite Shield  Armor parts set (face, shoulder, chest) 2 Potions  2 Treasure Chests (gray and clear blue) Joint parts set Joint parts for 30MS set Instructions    Elevate your 30MF and 30MS model builds with this highly customizable Item Shop Knight Option Set, perfect for fantasy-themed creations!</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Fantasy\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 20:04:11','2026-02-09 20:04:11'),
(1958,638,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/S6Zk0h4AWPabm5nBpoav/h/30mf-item-shop-2-fighter-option','Bandai 30MF Item Shop 2 (Fighter Option) - Newtype','<p>Expand your 30 Minutes Fantasy (30MF) lineup with Bandai&#039;s 30MF Item Shop 2 (Fighter Option)! This versatile set enhances your Class-Up Armor collection with a wide variety of weapons, armor, and items. The set includes shoulder and chest armor parts for added customization, along with two types of face parts for unique character expressions. Equip your fighter with a lance or twin sword, which can be connected with joint parts for a powerful dual weapon setup. For added realism, a wooden box with an open-and-close lid and wooden mugs are also included to bring your fantasy world to life! Box Contents:  Lance Twin Sword (1 set) Armor parts (1 set) Wooden mugs (2) Wooden box Joint part</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Fantasy\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 20:05:11','2026-02-09 20:05:11'),
(1959,651,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/suqSELZK26ObfACxKLQ1/h/30mf-item-shop-3-weapon-option','Bandai 30MF Item Shop 3 (Weapon Option) - Newtype','<p>Expand your 30 Minutes Fantasy collection with the 30MF Item Shop 3 (Weapon Option) set, designed to enhance customization and display options for your characters! This versatile set introduces new weapons and an innovative Weapon Rack, providing a functional storage and display system for your figures and accessories. The Armor Cross [Armor Modification] system allows seamless integration of weapons and parts, while the Weapon Rack offers modular customization, enabling vertical, horizontal, and multi-angle arrangements for a dynamic and organized display. The included armaments feature a knife, scimitar, longsword, and mace—the mace can even transform into a Horseman’s Flail with interchangeable parts, adding versatility to your character’s combat loadout. Product Features  Made of plastic Part of the 30 Minutes Fantasy series Includes a modular Weapon Rack for storing accessories Weapons are compatible with the Armor Cross [Armor Modification] system Can be combined with other 30MF kits for even more customization  Box Contents  Longsword Scimitar Knife Mace set (transforms into Horseman’s Flail) Weapon Rack Joint parts Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Fantasy\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 20:06:14','2026-02-09 20:06:14'),
(1960,647,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/ysYj9Do7pUj7oIbcHKSf/h/30mf-liber-assassin','Bandai 30MF Liber Assassin - Newtype','<p>Become a master of stealth and precision with the Liber Assassin, the latest addition to the 30 Minutes Fantasy series! This starter set features a versatile silhouette body and armor &amp;amp; weapon parts, allowing you to easily transform your figure into an elusive and deadly assassin. Designed with the same form as the 30MF Liber Knight (sold separately), this model boasts a human-like, flexible design, making it perfect for stealth operations and close-quarters combat. The movable shafts in the head and neck allow for expressive posing, while the shoulder joint structure maintains a sleek silhouette, even during fast-paced movements. The chest, torso, and waist feature movable axes and a sliding waist joint mechanism, ensuring smooth and natural mobility for dynamic action stances. Equipped with dual daggers, the Liber Assassin is built for speed and silent eliminations. The armor system attaches via back-mounted joints, ensuring fluid movement with no restrictions. The Element Core attribute is Water, enhancing the character’s mystic abilities for swift strikes and evasive maneuvers. The face design and coloring are unique to this set, setting it apart from Silhouette and Assassin models from the Lausann Empire (sold separately). Product Features  Made of plastic Part of the 30 Minutes Fantasy series Highly articulated silhouette body for agile and stealthy posing Includes dual daggers for lethal close-combat attacks Compatible with other 30MF kits for endless customization  Box Contents  Liber Assassin body 2 Daggers Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Fantasy\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 20:08:10','2026-02-09 20:08:10'),
(1961,646,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/H4CxPXbMO9dupP84Hvl5/h/30mf-liber-bishop','Bandai 30MF Liber Bishop - Newtype','<p>From Bandai’s 30 Minutes Fantasy series, the Liber Bishop arrives with a base &quot;Silhouette&quot; [body] and a variety of armor and weapon parts. This set lets you customize the body into a Bishop role, complete with its unique water-based Element Core. The &quot;Silhouette&quot; [body] supports a wide range of articulation, featuring movable shafts in the head and neck, plus a sliding mechanism at the waist joint for natural poses. A special shoulder joint structure preserves the body line in bold poses, and the armor can be flexibly attached via joints on the back. With its distinct face design and coloring, this Liber Bishop stands apart from other 30MF releases, making it a valuable addition for collectors wanting to expand their fantasy lineup. Product Features  Made of plastic Part of the 30 Minutes Fantasy series Multiple points of articulation upon assembly Includes armor and weapons for the Liber Bishop form Element Core: Water  Box Contents  Pieces to build Liber Bishop 4 Interchangeable hands Armor set Armament set Staff Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Fantasy\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 20:09:11','2026-02-09 20:09:11'),
(1962,635,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/VAbQrfKYrNRagaXXjiqk/h/30mf-liber-fighter','Bandai 30MF Liber Fighter - Newtype','<p>Product Features  Fantasy Job Creation: Part of Bandai&#039;s &quot;30 Minutes Fantasy (30MF)&quot; series, this starter set allows you to craft your own fantasy-themed character. Fully Articulated Silhouette: The base Silhouette offers highly flexible, human-like movements, perfect for dynamic poses and creative customization. Enhanced Body Design: Movable axes in the head, neck, chest, torso, and waist ensure natural posing, while shoulder joints maintain a streamlined silhouette even during bold movements. Complete Transformation: Combine the included armor and weapon parts to transform the Silhouette into the Liber Fighter. The design is versatile and compatible with various accessories for added customization. Distinct Features: The Liber Fighter features unique face designs and coloring, distinguishing it from the Rozen Empire Silhouette and Fighter.  Box Contents  Axe Round Shield Armor Parts (x1 set) Hand Parts (x1 set) Joint Parts (x1 set)  Unleash your creativity and build your ultimate fantasy warrior with the Liber Fighter starter kit today!</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Fantasy\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 20:10:11','2026-02-09 20:10:11'),
(1963,632,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/bwW17U5q9MKRI3tZb0HH/h/30mf-liber-holy-knight','Bandai 30MF Liber Holy Knight - Newtype','<p>For the North American release of the 30 Minutes Fantasy line, Bandai presents the Liber Holy Knight as its own complete set, perfect for those who prefer not to purchase the Liber Knight and Class-Up Armor separately! This kit is still fully compatible with other 30 Minutes Fantasy and 30 Minutes Missions products, allowing for the same fantastic level of customization and interchangeability. Product Features:  Made of plastic Part of the 30 Minutes Fantasy series Highly articulated for dynamic posing Compatible with other 30MF and 30MM kits for endless customization English translation of instructions may not be included  Box Contents:  Liber Holy Knight figure pieces Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Fantasy\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 20:12:10','2026-02-09 20:12:10'),
(1964,629,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/bwW17U5q9MKRI3tZb0HH/h/30mf-liber-holy-knight','Bandai 30MF Liber Holy Knight - Newtype','<p>For the North American release of the 30 Minutes Fantasy line, Bandai presents the Liber Holy Knight as its own complete set, perfect for those who prefer not to purchase the Liber Knight and Class-Up Armor separately! This kit is still fully compatible with other 30 Minutes Fantasy and 30 Minutes Missions products, allowing for the same fantastic level of customization and interchangeability. Product Features:  Made of plastic Part of the 30 Minutes Fantasy series Highly articulated for dynamic posing Compatible with other 30MF and 30MM kits for endless customization English translation of instructions may not be included  Box Contents:  Liber Holy Knight figure pieces Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Fantasy\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 20:14:10','2026-02-09 20:14:10'),
(1965,642,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/UPmB4jL8NqJN2LUnkfUl/h/30mf-liber-priest','Bandai 30MF Liber Priest - Newtype','<p>Bandai expands its 30 Minutes Fantasy (30MF) lineup with the Liber Priest, a kit allowing you to create your own fantasy-based figure. The set includes a base silhouette (elementary body), along with armor and weapon parts to form the Liber Priest. The silhouette shares the same design as the Liber Knight, featuring easy articulation for dynamic poses, including movable axes on the head and neck, as well as sliding joints in the chest, torso, and waist. The shoulder and waist armor can be attached via joints on the back, and the Element Core attribute is Water. Product Features  Fully articulated silhouette for natural posing Comes with armor parts and a staff for the Liber Priest form Features Water Element Core Compatible with other 30MF sets for expanded customization Snap-fit assembly without glue required  Box Contents  Staff Armor parts (1 set) Hand parts (1 set) Joint parts (1 set)</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Fantasy\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 20:15:11','2026-02-09 20:15:11'),
(1966,639,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/PkWoeYBZKtyetY0xnDHm/h/30mf-rosan-fighter','Bandai 30MF Rosan Fighter - Newtype','<p>The Rosan Fighter joins Bandai&#039;s 30 Minutes Fantasy (30MF) series, allowing you to create your own custom fantasy character! This starter set features a base Silhouette (body) along with armor and weapon parts. Designed for seamless articulation, the Silhouette offers flexible, human-like movement, making it perfect for creating bold, dynamic poses. The movable axes on the head and neck allow for natural positioning, while the chest, torso, and waist joint mechanisms work together for enhanced range of motion. The shoulder joints have been meticulously engineered to maintain the body’s clean silhouette in every pose. This Rosan Fighter set includes a more substantial Silhouette compared to the separately sold Rosan Knight, making it the ideal foundation for your fantasy creation. Combine the Silhouette with armor and weapon parts to complete the Rosan Fighter, complete with Earth Element Core attributes. The shoulder and waist armor attach via joint parts for flexible movement, and weapons like the Axe and Round Shield can be mounted on the back or waist for added customization. Product Features:  Starter set with Silhouette, armor, and weapons Fully articulated body for natural poses Includes Earth Element Core details Compatible with other 30MF and 30MM series parts Unique design and coloring, distinct from other sets  Box Contents:  Axe Round Shield Armor parts (1 set) Hand parts (1 set) Joint parts (1 set)</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Fantasy\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 20:16:12','2026-02-09 20:16:12'),
(1967,649,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/ZAViAavnNAO48O2LXQxD/h/30mf-rosan-lancer','Bandai 30MF Rosan Lancer - Newtype','<p>Enter the battlefield with the Rosan Lancer, the latest addition to the 30 Minutes Fantasy series, where you can create and customize your own fantasy character and job! This starter set provides a versatile silhouette body and armor &amp;amp; weapon parts, allowing you to easily transform your figure into a mighty Lancer equipped for battle. Built upon the same form as the 30MF Rosan Knight (sold separately), this model features a flexible, human-like design that allows for dynamic posing and customization. Movable shafts in the head and neck enable natural expressiveness, while a specialized shoulder joint structure maintains the figure’s silhouette even during bold action stances. The chest, torso, and waist are equipped with movable axes and a sliding joint mechanism, ensuring fluid movement for realistic combat displays. Equipped with a lance and shield, the Rosan Lancer is built for high-speed offense and defense. The armor system is attached through back-mounted joints, allowing for unrestricted motion in battle. The Element Core attribute is Lightning, imbuing the character with mystical energy to strike down foes. This model kit features a unique face design and exclusive coloration, setting it apart from Silhouette and Lancer models from the Republic of Liber (sold separately). Product Features  Made of plastic Part of the 30 Minutes Fantasy series Highly articulated silhouette body for expressive posing Includes a lance and shield for realistic combat poses Compatible with other 30MF kits for endless customization  Box Contents  Rosan Lancer body Lance Shield Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Fantasy\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 20:17:11','2026-02-09 20:17:11'),
(1968,644,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/TJGBBHrf6Arryb8Tjkp2/h/30mf-rosan-priest','Bandai 30MF Rosan Priest - Newtype','<p>The 30 MINUTES FANTASY series introduces the Rosan Priest starter set, featuring the versatile &quot;Silhouette&quot; [body] as its foundation. This body, also used in the 30MF Rosan Night model, allows for dynamic and flexible posing with movable joints in the head, neck, shoulders, torso, and waist. The set includes armor and weapon parts to transform the &quot;Silhouette&quot; into the Rosan Priest, themed with a fiery &quot;Element Core&quot; attribute. The Rosan Priest’s unique face design and coloring make it distinct from other Silhouette and Priest models. It’s a customizable addition for fantasy collectors and builders. Product Features  Made of plastic Part of the 30 Minutes Fantasy series Multiple points of articulation upon assembly Interchangeable parts and accessories  Instructions may or may not include English translation   Box Contents  Pieces to build  Rosan Priest 4 Interchangeable hands Armor set Staff   Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Fantasy\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 20:19:10','2026-02-09 20:19:10'),
(1969,652,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/DVp7ChxV8Kj2X7QlPBzv/h/30mf-class-up-armor-a-16-rosan-enchanter','Bandai 30MF Class Up Armor A-16 (Rosan Enchanter) - Newtype','<p>Upgrade your fantasy warrior to new heights with the Class-Up Armor Rosan Enchanter accessory set from the 30 Minutes Fantasy series! Designed to enhance and customize your figure, this set includes detailed armor and weapon parts that transform the Rosan Wizard (sold separately) into the shadowy Rosan Enchanter— a dual-wielding battle mage clad in armor and flowing mantle. With high compatibility and creative flexibility, this accessory pack allows builders to take their fantasy character to the next level of customization and storytelling. Whether for display or imaginative world-building, the Rosan Enchanter adds depth to your collection. Figures not included. Rosan Wizard sold separately. Product Features  Made of plastic Part of the 30 Minutes Fantasy series Designed to upgrade the Rosan Wizard model kit (sold separately) Enhances customization with armor and weapons   Box Contents  Armor and mantle parts set Sword Short staff handle Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Fantasy\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 20:20:09','2026-02-09 20:20:09'),
(1970,608,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/bYdqaW7crV0rAh4NjBFH/h/30mm-07-arquebus-add-ve-40a-open-faith-armored-core-vi-fires-of-rubicon','Bandai 30MM 07 Arquebus ADD VE-40A Open Faith (Armored Core VI Fires of Rubicon) - Newtype','<p>The Arquebus ADD VE-40A Open Faith from Armored Core VI: Fires of Rubicon joins Bandai’s 30 Minutes Missions lineup! This formidable unit, developed by the powerful Arquebus Corporation, is recreated in striking detail, blending the iconic aesthetics of the game with the modular design philosophy of the 30MM series—offering simple assembly, superb articulation, and extensive customization. Open Faith features a shared structural system with other 30MM kits, allowing seamless integration of head, core, arm, and leg components for true cross-compatibility. The unit is equipped with an array of weapons, including the VP-66EG energy weapon, VED-67LLA laser launcher (in both stored and deployed forms), VE-60SNA, and Vvc-70VPM. The 3mm joint system allows shoulder and some left-hand weapons to be swapped or customized with ease, replicating in-game loadouts or crafting original combinations. Also included are effect parts for dynamic displays, plus armor parts compatible with the separately sold Action Base 7 for elevated posing possibilities. Product Features  Made of plastic Based on the Armored Core VI: Fires of Rubicon video game Part of the 30 Minutes Missions series Multiple points of articulation Interchangeable parts and accessories  Box Contents  Pieces to build Arquebus ADD VE-40A Open Faith VP-66EG energy weapon VED-67LLA laser launcher (both stored and deployed) VE-60SNA Vvc-70VPM Effect parts Armor and display connection parts Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"30 Minutes Missions\", \"brand\": \"Armored Core\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Armored Core VI: Fires Of Rubicon\"}','2026-02-09 20:21:09','2026-02-09 20:21:09'),
(1971,222,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/bYdqaW7crV0rAh4NjBFH/h/30mm-07-arquebus-add-ve-40a-open-faith-armored-core-vi-fires-of-rubicon','Bandai 30MM 07 Arquebus ADD VE-40A Open Faith (Armored Core VI Fires of Rubicon) - Newtype','<p>The Arquebus ADD VE-40A Open Faith from Armored Core VI: Fires of Rubicon joins Bandai’s 30 Minutes Missions lineup! This formidable unit, developed by the powerful Arquebus Corporation, is recreated in striking detail, blending the iconic aesthetics of the game with the modular design philosophy of the 30MM series—offering simple assembly, superb articulation, and extensive customization. Open Faith features a shared structural system with other 30MM kits, allowing seamless integration of head, core, arm, and leg components for true cross-compatibility. The unit is equipped with an array of weapons, including the VP-66EG energy weapon, VED-67LLA laser launcher (in both stored and deployed forms), VE-60SNA, and Vvc-70VPM. The 3mm joint system allows shoulder and some left-hand weapons to be swapped or customized with ease, replicating in-game loadouts or crafting original combinations. Also included are effect parts for dynamic displays, plus armor parts compatible with the separately sold Action Base 7 for elevated posing possibilities. Product Features  Made of plastic Based on the Armored Core VI: Fires of Rubicon video game Part of the 30 Minutes Missions series Multiple points of articulation Interchangeable parts and accessories  Box Contents  Pieces to build Arquebus ADD VE-40A Open Faith VP-66EG energy weapon VED-67LLA laser launcher (both stored and deployed) VE-60SNA Vvc-70VPM Effect parts Armor and display connection parts Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"30 Minutes Missions\", \"brand\": \"Armored Core\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Armored Core VI: Fires Of Rubicon\"}','2026-02-09 20:21:12','2026-02-09 20:21:12'),
(1972,8,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/x4JXf4lgnpL68kKEHLap/h/30mm-balam-industries-bd-011-melander-armored-core-vi-fires-of-rubicon','Bandai 30MM Balam Industries BD-011 Melander (Armored Core VI Fires of Rubicon) - Newtype','<p>BD-011 Melander from Armored Core VI: Fires of Rubicon joins Bandai’s 30 MINUTES MISSIONS model kit series! Designed for simple assembly and customizable play, this kit captures the essence of the Melander frame, featuring modular head, core, arms, and legs that share a common structure for easy interchangeability. This model utilizes a 3mm joint system, allowing attachment of shoulder-mounted and left-hand weapons, expanding display possibilities. With multiple points of articulation, the BD-011 Melander is highly posable, making it perfect for recreating your favorite in-game moments. Order yours today! Product Features  Made of plastic Based on Armored Core VI: Fires of Rubicon  Part of the 30 MINUTES MISSIONS series Modular frame system for customization Multiple points of articulation Interchangeable parts and accessories  Box Contents  Pieces to build BD-011 Melander MG-014 LUDLOW weapon Joint parts set Decal sheet Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"30 Minutes Missions\", \"brand\": \"Armored Core\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Armored Core VI: Fires Of Rubicon\"}','2026-02-09 20:23:09','2026-02-09 20:23:09'),
(1973,223,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/kXITi5s6nvwN8mY7WEsa/h/30mm-balam-industries-bd-011-melander-liger-tail-g1-michigan-armored-core-vi-fires-of-rubicon','Bandai 30MM Balam Industries BD-011 Melander Liger Tail/G1 Michigan (Armored Core VI: Fires of Rubicon) - Newtype','<p>From Armored Core VI Fires of Rubicon, G1 Michigan’s AC Liger Tail joins Bandai&#039;s 30 Minutes Missions series! Designed for simple assembly and customization flexibility, this kit brings the iconic AC to life with its detailed structure and compatibility with other 30MM parts. The head, core, arms, and legs utilize the signature 30MM framework, ensuring easy building while staying faithful to the game’s design. The inclusion of 3mm joints allows for seamless attachment of shoulder and left-hand weapons, enabling endless customizations. The Liger Tail comes equipped with an impressive arsenal, making it perfect for recreating battle-ready poses straight from the game. Product Features:  Based on Armored Core VI Fires of Rubicon  Compatible with 30MM series for easy customization Simple assembly with detailed weaponry Highly posable and versatile  Box Contents:  DF-GA-08 HU-BEN DF-ET-09 TAI-YANG-SHOU BML-G2/P17SPL-16 (1 set) SONGBIRDS (1 set) Joint parts (1 set) Stickers (2 types)</p>','{\"line\": \"30 Minutes Missions\", \"brand\": \"Armored Core\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Armored Core VI: Fires Of Rubicon\"}','2026-02-09 20:24:13','2026-02-09 20:24:13'),
(1974,224,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/gU2OE98eYjPDb3VHyqVk/h/30mm-01-rad-cc-2000-orbiter-nightfall-armored-core-vi-fires-of-rubicon','Bandai 30MM 01 RaD CC-2000 Orbiter Nightfall (Armored Core VI Fires of Rubicon) - Newtype','<p>From Armored Core VI: Fires of Rubicon, Raven&#039;s formidable RaD CC-2000 Orbiter Nightfall is now available as a 30 Minutes Missions plastic model kit! Designed for simple assembly and extensive customization, this model faithfully recreates its appearance in the game while maintaining high articulation for dynamic posing. The PB-033M Ashmead left-hand weapon features replacement parts to replicate its injection state, adding extra detail and realism. Additionally, alternate head parts allow you to reproduce the assault boost mode, making this kit an exciting addition to any Armored Core collection! Product Features  5.11 inches tall (13cm) Made of plastic Based on the Armored Core VI: Fires of Rubicon video game Part of the 30 Minutes Missions series Multiple points of articulation Interchangeable parts and accessories  Box Contents  Pieces to build CC-2000 Orbiter Nightfall Knightfall Weapon set PB-033M Ashmead injection state reproduction parts Alternate head parts Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"30 Minutes Missions\", \"brand\": \"Armored Core\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Armored Core VI: Fires Of Rubicon\"}','2026-02-09 20:26:12','2026-02-09 20:26:12'),
(1975,226,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/gU2OE98eYjPDb3VHyqVk/h/30mm-01-rad-cc-2000-orbiter-nightfall-armored-core-vi-fires-of-rubicon','Bandai 30MM 01 RaD CC-2000 Orbiter Nightfall (Armored Core VI Fires of Rubicon) - Newtype','<p>From Armored Core VI: Fires of Rubicon, Raven&#039;s formidable RaD CC-2000 Orbiter Nightfall is now available as a 30 Minutes Missions plastic model kit! Designed for simple assembly and extensive customization, this model faithfully recreates its appearance in the game while maintaining high articulation for dynamic posing. The PB-033M Ashmead left-hand weapon features replacement parts to replicate its injection state, adding extra detail and realism. Additionally, alternate head parts allow you to reproduce the assault boost mode, making this kit an exciting addition to any Armored Core collection! Product Features  5.11 inches tall (13cm) Made of plastic Based on the Armored Core VI: Fires of Rubicon video game Part of the 30 Minutes Missions series Multiple points of articulation Interchangeable parts and accessories  Box Contents  Pieces to build CC-2000 Orbiter Nightfall Knightfall Weapon set PB-033M Ashmead injection state reproduction parts Alternate head parts Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"30 Minutes Missions\", \"brand\": \"Armored Core\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Armored Core VI: Fires Of Rubicon\"}','2026-02-09 20:28:10','2026-02-09 20:28:10'),
(1976,9,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/VhIkbmTzhPpsZ2g0G1pd/h/30mm-rad-cc-3000-wrecker-milk-tooth','Bandai 30MM RaD CC-3000 Wrecker Milk Tooth - Newtype','<p>RaD CC-3000 Wrecker Milk Tooth from Armored Core VI: Fires of Rubicon joins Bandai’s 30 Minutes Missions (30MM) model-kit series! Built with the series’ signature simple assembly and custom play features, this highly articulated model faithfully recreates the head, core, arms, and legs with a common structure for ease of modification. Designed for ultimate customization, the kit includes 3mm joints to attach both shoulder weapons and left-handed weapons, offering various dynamic display options. Get ready to expand your Armored Core collection—order yours today! Product Features  Based on Armored Core VI: Fires of Rubicon  Highly articulated upon assembly Customizable with 3mm joint compatibility Part of the 30 Minutes Missions (30MM) series Includes multiple weapons and accessories  Box Contents  Pieces to build RaD CC-3000 Wrecker Milk Tooth WB-0000 BAD COOK WB-0010 DOUBLE TROUBLE BML-G2/P19SPL-12 SB-033M MORLEY Joint parts set Decal sheet Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"30 Minutes Missions\", \"brand\": \"Armored Core\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Armored Core VI: Fires Of Rubicon\"}','2026-02-09 20:29:10','2026-02-09 20:29:10'),
(1977,225,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/TY1HTS3MKqlDp0g6qdhF/h/armored-core-schneider-nachtreiher-40e-steel-haze','Kotobukiya Armored Core Schneider Nachtreiher/40E Steel Haze - Newtype','<p>The V.I.O.S. Schneider Nachtreiher/40E Steel Haze from Armored Core VI: Fires of Rubicon is the first release in Kotobukiya’s new Variable Infinity Overed Scale (V.I.O.S.) series, delivering massive presence, extreme detail, and unmatched articulation. Piloted by V.IV Rusty, this lightweight bipedal AC is recreated with game-accurate proportions, interchangeable armor and weapon systems, and multi-color molded parts that look stunning straight out of the box. With deployable modes, firing configurations, and deep customization options, this premium plastic model kit is built for serious mecha fans and Armored Core collectors. Product Features  Oversized scale with ultra-high detail and advanced articulation Fully interchangeable core, arms, legs, and weapon systems Deployable core, firing-mode weapons, and transformable equipment  Compatible with Flying Base Neo via 5.0mm joints Includes V.IV Rusty emblem decals for authentic markings  Box Contents  Parts to build Steel Haze Various Weapons and Weapons Parts (burst rifle, handgun, laser slicer, etc) Plasma Missile Launcher Firing Mode Parts  Specialized Weapon Connection Parts Decal Sheet (V.IV Rusty Emblem) Assembly Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"Armored Core\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 20:30:13','2026-02-09 20:30:13'),
