(1979,621,'newtype',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-09 20:31:11','2026-02-09 20:31:11'),
(1980,627,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/6AIY5qXSHllLlcTw23fU/h/30ms-op-10-option-parts-set-10-reaper-armor','Bandai 30MS OP-10 Option Parts Set 10 (Reaper Armor) - Newtype','<p>From the 30 Minutes Sisters line comes a new deathly terrifying way to customize your warriors: the Reaper Armor Set! Filled with numerous joint pieces and four merciless weapons, this is one weapon set you won&#039;t want to miss out on!      Product Features  Made of plastic Part of the &quot;30 Minutes Sisters&quot; series Compatible with other &quot;30MS&quot; series parts Scissor blades separate into two swords The large sword blade is flexible and can be used as tail armor Figures not included (sold separately)        Box Contents  Pieces to build:  Scythe Scissor Swords Large sword Support mecha Color C thigh parts Joint pieces     Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Sisters\"}','2026-02-09 20:33:11','2026-02-09 20:33:11'),
(1981,623,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/DgHNkwXZ2f7lh5yJzWUG/h/30mm-1-144-option-parts-set-24-multi-object-1','Bandai 30MM 1/144 Option Parts Set 24 (Multi Object 1) - Newtype','<p>Option Parts Set 24 (Multi Object 1) expands your battlefield scenes with a variety of military vehicles and environment pieces designed to enhance the 30MM world. Featuring finely molded details like windows and tires, all parts use standard 3mm joints for easy integration with existing 30MM kits. Product Features  Includes multiple 1/144 scale vehicles and scene accessories Highly detailed molding for realistic displays Uses standard 3mm joints for full 30MM compatibility Ideal for dioramas, base-building, and world-setting  Box Contents  Heavy Tank ×2 Light Tank ×2 Light Transport Vehicle ×2 Light Armored Vehicle ×2 Small Tank ×2 Large Tent Large Container Medium Container Water Tower ×2</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Missions\", \"scale\": \"1/144\"}','2026-02-09 20:34:09','2026-02-09 20:34:09'),
(1982,624,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/70PS42TY6TFPADNPbFm9/h/30ms-op-04-option-parts-set-4-stealth-unit','Bandai 30MS OP-04 Option Parts Set 4 (Stealth Unit) - Newtype','<p>Add to your 30 Minutes Sisters model kits with this Sealth Armor Set!  Figure not included      Product Features  Made of plastic Part of the 30 Minutes Sisters Series Perfect for customizing        Box Contents  Pieces to build stealth armor Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Sisters\"}','2026-02-09 20:35:11','2026-02-09 20:35:11'),
(1983,622,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/l6KWIblW5vO0xFl3knH9/h/30ms-sis-a00-tiasha-color-b','Bandai 30MS SIS-A00 Tiasha (Color B) - Newtype','<p>Add to your 30 Minutes Sisters collection with this SIS-A00 Tiasha model kit! Once complete she is highly poseable and includes a variety of accessories. Plus Tiasha is compatible with other 30 Minutes Missions items, perfect for customizing your kits!      Product Features  Made of plastic Molded-in color Part of the 30 Minutes Sisters series Compatible with 30 Minutes Missions items Pair with the Flight Armor for optimal customization (sold separately)         Box Contents  Pieces to build  SIS-A00 Tiasha 3 Interchangeable faces Left and right grip hands Left and right weapon-holding hands Sword Shield   Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Sisters\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 20:36:10','2026-02-09 20:36:10'),
(1984,625,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/8snHR8tFVlX5c5UhiAxu/h/30ms-sis-ac19b-siana-amarcia-vivace-form','Bandai 30MS Sis-Ac19B Siana-Amarcia (Vivace Form) - Newtype','<p>Siana-Amarcia (Vivace Form) is the latest &quot;30Minutes Sisters&quot; (30MS) figure kit from Bandai! This all-in-one kit includes a character body, 3 types of facial expression parts, and armor parts. Face parts use tampo printing. You can enjoy changing the expression according to the scene. A new hairstyle type part is included. Comes with armor inspired by underwater equipment. Armor can be opened and closed. &quot;30 MINUTES SISTERS&quot; has a lineup of face parts, hairstyle parts, and body parts for each part. You can recombine it with parts sold separately to create your favorite sister. 30 MINUTES series uses a 3mm diameter shaft. Parts from &quot;30 MINUTES MISSIONS&quot; can also be installed as an option.     Product Features  Made of plastic Part of the &quot;30 Minutes Sisters&quot; series Compatible with &quot;30 Minutes Missions&quot; parts        Box Contents  Pieces to build:  Siana-Amarcia 3 Face parts Armor set Hand parts 30mm Armor joint parts     Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Sisters\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 20:37:12','2026-02-09 20:37:12'),
(1985,628,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/OqNoexHyUgw7USLEbjGG/h/30ms-sis-dc88w-eliene-elierica-elegante-form','Bandai 30MS SIS-Dc88w Eliene-Elierica [Elegante Form] - Newtype','<p>Eliene-Elierica (Elegant Form) is the newest member of Bandai&#039;s &quot;30MS&quot; (30 Minutes Sisters) figure-kit lineup! This all-in-one kit includes parts to build the figure, three interchangeable faces with tampo printing, and armor parts! Assembly is smooth, with the runner parts arranged optimally to facilitate assembly and workflow! Her three faces include a standard expression, a smile, and an aiming face with one eye closed. Her wings can move on multiple axes, giving her tons of expressiveness! The wings can also be transformed into a large bow gun by rearranging them on her back. The arrow shaft is made of metal. Newly designed hairstyle parts are included, too, and the included base allows her to be displayed floating. She can also use other &quot;30MS&quot; parts so that you can create a custom figure!    Product Features  Made of plastic Part of the &quot;30 Minutes Sisters&quot; series Multiple points of articulation Interchangeable parts and accessories        Box Contents  Pieces to build:  Eliene-Elierica Armor parts set Joint parts set Armament set     Display Stand Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Sisters\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 20:39:11','2026-02-09 20:39:11'),
(1986,620,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/nHCK3PXKS2f2F85cdnku/h/30ms-sis-g00-01-rishetta-color-a','Bandai 30MS SIS-G00 01 Rishetta (Color A) - Newtype','<p>Add to your 30 Minutes Sisters collection with this SIS-G00 Rishetta model kit! Once complete she is highly posable and includes a variety of accessories. Plus Rishetta is compatible with other 30 Minute Missions items, perfect for customizing your kits!      Product Features  Made of plastic Molded-in color Part of the 30 Minutes Sister series Compatible with other 30 Minute Missions items Pair with the Speed Armor for optimal customization (sold separately)         Box Contents  Pieces to build  SIS-G00 Rishetta 3 Interchangeable faces Armor set Left and right grip hands Left and right weapon holding hands   Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Sisters\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 20:40:13','2026-02-09 20:40:13'),
(1987,626,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/tmO92bDTFYKLAcfEI80B/h/30ms-sis-t00-06-lirinel-color-a','Bandai 30MS SIS-T00 06 Lirinel (Color A) - Newtype','<p>The newest member of Bandai&#039;s 30MS (30 Minutes Sisters) figure kit lineup is here! This all-in-one kit includes parts to build the highly posable Lirinel, three different faces, and bunny-themed armor parts. She&#039;s easy to assemble, and the parts are molded in color, so you don&#039;t need paint. She&#039;s approximately 125mm tall, making her the smallest in the series!         Product Features  Made of plastic Molded in color Part of the &quot;30 Minutes Sisters&quot; series Compatible with &quot;30 Minute Missions&quot; items        Box Contents  Pieces to build:  SIS-T00 Lirinel 3x Interchangeable face parts Set of armor parts Headgear bangs parts Posing skirt parts Set of hand parts Set of joint parts   Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Sisters\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 20:42:15','2026-02-09 20:42:15'),
(1988,656,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/qBe9xoTTx1IKSfS0wJOt/h/30ms-tiasha-dahlia-wear-color-b','Bandai 30MS Tiasha (Dahlia Wear) [Color B] - Newtype','<p>Featuring fresh color coordination and updated parts, this version of Tiasha allows even more customization possibilities across the 30MS lineup.  She features a highly articulated body, enabling a wide range of expressive poses. The Dahlia Wear outfit elegantly layers armor and fashionable accessories, striking the perfect balance between strength and beauty. The face parts have been pre-painted for a lively finish right out of the box. With the 30MS system, her head, body, arms, and legs are all compatible with other 30 Minutes Sisters kits, offering limitless combinations and creativity.      Product Features  Made of plastic Molded-in color Part of the 30 Minutes Sisters series Includes 3 pre-painted face parts for expressive posing Dahlia Wear armor set with layered design and detailed sculpting High articulation for dynamic and natural movement Fully compatible with other 30MS and 30MM series kits for mix-and-match customization         Box Contents  Pieces to build Tiasha Optional face parts Armor and weapon parts Joint parts Interchangeable hands Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"30 Minutes Sisters\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 20:43:13','2026-02-09 20:43:13'),
(1989,295,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/Su3hp9fB9JnLrHhlLeGr/h/action-base-1-black','Bandai Action Base 1 Black - Newtype','<p>This display stand for holding 1/100 scale Gundam models, includes various adapters and holders to fit almost any Gundam kit! It assembles just like building a Gundam model itself and features a black material.      Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of black plastic Action base for 1/100 scale models Comes with various adaptors        Box Contents  Pieces to build Action Base Instructions</p>',NULL,'2026-02-09 20:44:12','2026-02-09 20:44:12'),
(1990,293,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/QT5YCEZ48YSYoZ49VSBE/h/action-base-1-clear','Bandai Action Base 1 Clear - Newtype','<p>Bandai&#039;s Action Base is designed to hold kits from their SD Gundam, 1/144 scale models, HGUC, HG Gundam Seed, 1/100 scale models, MG, and Real Robot Revolution series. No other display bases from other companies come close what this amazing display base allows you to do! Action Base 1 is a plastic injection snap-fit assembly kit that requires very little work to assemble. No cement or paint required! The octagon base and the square part that can be connected to any one of its sides come with cool mechanical detailing and panel lines, plus a total of 10 holes for placing the support pole for the main stand to adjust the main stand&#039;s height. The support pole has an ingenious locking mechanism that allows it to extend or retract and is strong enough to hold the main stand in place. The main stand itself can also be extended upwards to pose your kit in a much higher position. The set comes with three different sizes (8mm, 9mm, and 11mm) of U-shaped holders, peg-type holders, and screw-on type holders (two screws and a nut are included) for attaching the main stand to the crotch of the kit. When using the U-shaped or screw-on holders, double-sided tape (small quantity included) should be applied in between the crotch of the kit and the holders to hold it in place. A name plate is included that can be attached to any one of the holes on the base. (The package notes that there may be cases of a kit not able to fit.) Each Action Base 1 can be attached to up to six other Action Base 1s for you to create an amazing display filled with Gundam kits or other robot kits striking cool action poses! Check out the other color variations, linked below!</p>',NULL,'2026-02-09 20:45:11','2026-02-09 20:45:11'),
(1991,294,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/s90sD60gA2LOletnYzWG/h/action-base-1-white','Bandai Action Base 1 White - Newtype','<p>Display and pose your Gundam model kits with this stand for holding 1/100 scale Gundam models. Included are various adapters and holders to fit almost any Gundam kit! It assembles just like building a Gundam model itself!      Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of white plastic Action base for 1/100 scale models Comes with various adaptors        Box Contents  Pieces to build Action Base Instructions</p>',NULL,'2026-02-09 20:45:13','2026-02-09 20:45:13'),
(1992,292,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/BFAtPeOWpbKT0wDmKLL6/h/action-base-2-black','Bandai Action Base 2 Black - Newtype','<p>Perfect for displaying small-scale Gundam model kits, Action Base 2 is designed to hold kits from Bandai&#039;s HGUC, FG, HG Gundam 00, HG Gundam Seed, 1/144-scale models, and SD Gundam series. No other display bases from other companies come close to what this amazing display base allows you to do! Action Base 2 is a plastic injection snap-fit assembly kit that requires very little work to assemble. No cement or paint required! The trapezium bases (two included) come with cool mechanical detailing and panel lines, with one hole per base for placing the stand. The stand can be extended upwards for posing your kit in a much higher position, and the angle of the stand can also be adjusted to lift or lower your kit. The stand can also be used on Action Base 1 to pose two kits on a single base in close combat! The set comes with two different sizes (6mm and 7mm) of U-shaped holders, two peg-type holders, and one screw-on type holder (four screws and three nuts are included) for attaching the main stand to the crotch of your kit. When using the U-shaped or screw-on holders, double-sided tape should be applied in between the crotch of the kit and the holders to help hold it in place. (The package notes that there may be cases of a kit not able to fit.) Each Action Base 2 (two trapezium bases combined) can be attached to up to six other Action Base 2s for you to create an amazing display filled with Gundam kits or other robot kits striking cool action poses! Check out the other color variations, linked below!</p>',NULL,'2026-02-09 20:46:12','2026-02-09 20:46:12'),
(1993,285,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/xoDNovbUawjxGXdKcm5s/h/action-base-4-black','Bandai Action Base 4 Black - Newtype','<p>Black Action Base 4 A new type of action base for 1/100 models that comes with unobtrusive base arms and can display all kinds of poses, including standing and action poses. The Action Base 4 will include a long base arm and 3 bases. Sub-arms can be used to hold weapons and other accessories.  Compatible with figure-rise effect parts and Action Base 5 to connect multiple stands together like a chain!  Runner x 4 action base set for 1/100, 1/144 scale models, in black color.It includes a support pole (long), 3 bases, plenty of joint parts and support parts.The height of the support pole can be finely adjusted. It also has a lock mechanism to keep the position. In addition, it is made so that the support pole and legs do not clash, making it possible to position the model&#039;s legs more freely.By separating the support pole it&#039;s possible to display 2 models next to each other, to combine the base with Action Base 4 and 5 so that you can display kits of different scale together, and to enjoy a variety of display possibilities.The support pole and joint parts keep the model secured on the ground. If you fold the support pole into a tilted V shape it will also stand out less. In addition, by using sub poles you can display weapons as well.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-09 20:47:12','2026-02-09 20:47:12'),
(1994,286,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/dnDe0rS89fTY24gSeHOz/h/action-base-4-clear','Bandai Action Base 4 Clear - Newtype','<p>Clear Action Base 4 A new type of action base for 1/100 models that comes with unobtrusive base arms and can display all kinds of poses, including standing and action poses. The Action Base 4 will include a long base arm and 3 bases. Sub-arms can be used to hold weapons and other accessories.  Compatible with figure-rise effect parts and Action Base 5 to connect multiple stands together like a chain!  Runner x 4 In addition, it is made so that the support pole and legs do not clash, making it possible to position the model&#039;s legs more freely.By separating the support pole it&#039;s possible to display 2 models next to each other, to combine the base with Action Base 4 and 5 so that you can display kits of different scale together, and to enjoy a variety of display possibilities.The support pole and joint parts keep the model secured on the ground. If you fold the support pole into a tilted V shape it will also stand out less. In addition, by using sub poles you can display weapons as well.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-09 20:48:10','2026-02-09 20:48:10'),
(1995,532,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/yzojE6JF1uuPvV6ICllZ/h/action-base-5-black','Bandai Action Base 5 Black - Newtype','<p>These action bases for 1/144 models feature unobtrusive base arms and can display all kinds of poses, including standing and action poses. The Action Base 5 includes a long base arm and 1 base. Sub-arms can be used to hold weapons and other accessories. It&#039;s also compatible with figure-rise effect parts and Action Base 4 to connect multiple stands together like a chain!      Product Features  5 inches (12.7cm) 1/144 scale Action base for 1/144 scale figures Compatible with Figure-rise effect parts and Action Base 4 Includes U-shaped, peg-type, and pinching holders Includes long base arm, base, and 2 runners        Box Contents  Long base arm Base 2 runners</p>',NULL,'2026-02-09 20:49:09','2026-02-09 20:49:09'),
