(2009,260,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/n7T60spBfIs3JnJrhUCo/h/mephisto-prototype-color-megalomaria-unlimited-universe','Kotobukiya Mephisto [Prototype Color] (Megalomaria Unlimited Universe) - Newtype','<p>Kotobukiya’s Megalomaria Unlimited Universe welcomes back its devilish antihero—Mephisto—now available in his striking Prototype Color version! Molded in Hexa Black, Hexa Gray, and Clear Turquoise Green, this release features a subdued yet vivid palette that’s perfect for customizing and seamlessly integrating with parts from Hexa Gear, M.S.G, and other Kotobukiya kits. Designed with over 50 points of articulation, Mephisto boasts a range of dynamic movement. The single-joint knee bends deeply, aided by an internal axis in the shin that allows him to sit upright—ideal for grounded or beast-like stances. Movable toe joints support low or aggressive poses, while independently moving knee armor adds layered detail and adjustability. His shoulders utilize multi-axis joints, allowing for wide range motion—he can even cross his arms. Hands can fold inward nearly 180°, and his larger joint structure compared to female-type figures ensures a solid grip on a variety of weapons. This kit includes seven different hand types, including weapon-holding hands, clenched fists, and expressive open palms, perfect for customizing combat stances or character gestures. Product Features  Approximately 18cm (7 inches) tall From Megalomaria Unlimited Universe  Compatible with Hexa Gear, M.S.G, and other Kotobukiya kits 54 points of articulation, including deeply bending knees and movable toe joints Shoulder joints allow forward extension for crossed-arm poses Includes seven different hand parts for a range of weapon and action poses Durable build with enhanced stability and weapon-holding capability   Box Contents  Pieces to build Mephisto in Prototype Color 7 types of interchangeable hand parts  Waist armor part with connection for Flying Base (sold separately)  Assembly instructions</p>','{\"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 21:04:10','2026-02-09 21:04:10'),
(2010,189,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/RuzBmrWbUZN1E3ebuEhd/h/aerpla-kun-3d-rubber-mascot-keychain','Bandai AerPla-Kun 3D Rubber Mascot Keychain - Newtype','<p>Carry a piece of Gunpla spirit wherever you go with the AerPla-Kun 3D Rubber Mascot Keychain! This adorable and expressive rubber charm brings a fun twist to the world of plastic models. With its bold detailing and stylized 3D form, AerPla-Kun is instantly recognizable and perfect for fans of all ages. Attach it to your keys, backpack, model kit case, or display it alongside your Gunpla collection—it’s the perfect combination of fandom and functionality. Made from durable, high-quality rubber with a metal keyring attachment, this mascot is ready to follow you on your next build or convention visit. Features:   Official AerPla-Kun character in 3D rubber mascot form   High-quality rubber with vibrant detailing and layered depth   Sturdy metal keyring and clasp for secure attachment   Great for keychains, bags, lanyards, or collectible displays   A must-have for Gunpla builders and collectors</p>','{\"line\": \"Keychain\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 21:05:09','2026-02-09 21:05:09'),
(2011,208,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/vAf7wzNMVLCZgWikaQHe/h/megami-device-asra-archer-kagekoromo','Kotobukiya Megami Device Asra Archer Kagekoromo - Newtype','<p>“Megami Device” is the ultimate plastic model kit series combining Bishoujo-style beauties and heavy-duty weapons and armor. Each character has a main body, or “machinika,” designed by Masaki Apsy along with a huge array of interchangeable parts to outfit her as you like, and the collaboration designer this time is Nidy-2D-. The latest lady joining the line is the incredible ASRA ARCHER! Archer can be displayed in either “Unarmed Mode” without her fierce white, red, and gold mechanical armor or in “Armed Mode” fully outfitted for battle. The machinika body is fully articulated for extreme poseability and it can even be seated in natural poses; it also comes equipped with 3mm diameter attachment points that can mount parts from Kotobukiya’s M.S.G. series, Frame Arms, Frame Arms Girls, and other models. Asra Archer also comes with several types of pre-painted face parts, various weapons such as a sword and poseable longbow, multiple sets of hands, and decals for eyes, markings, and more! Sculpted by Apsy Masaki, Noritaka Fukumoto, and Shunichi Karashima, Asra stands 5 ½ inches tall fully assembled. Display this weapon master machinika alone or alongside other Megami Device ladies, and mix and match their parts to create your own ultimate warrior! Model Specifications:・3 different pre-painted face parts per character.・Interchangeable “Armed Mode” and “Unarmed Mode” parts designed with an archer motif.・Use with ASRA NINJA (sold separately) to create full armor “Samurai Mode”.・Basic body is incredibly articulated, allowing for more natural posing options (such as when posing with weapons or when sitting down).・Various bonus weapon parts are included.・The model is equipped with several 3mm connection points, making it compatible with existing M.S.G, Frame Arms, and Frame Arms Girl weapons and armor.・PVC made hand parts (5 per hand) are included which are compatible with M.S.G, Frame Arms, and Frame Arms Girl series.・Newly designed marking and eye decals are included. What is “Megami Device?”Kotobukiya’s Megami Device series is a line of 14 cm (5½”) plastic model kits that come with a range of weapons and equipment that allow you to enjoy building and customizing your own Megami Device to use in robot battles. Each character has a main body, or “machinika,” designed by Masaki Apsy, while the models’ unique armor and mechanics are designed in collaboration with a variety of guest illustrators. The kits come with multi-colored parts and face parts pre-printed with tampography, making them easy to assemble with no paint required. The kits are equipped with 3mm joints, making them compatible with all of the weapons in the Megami Device line as well as Kotobukiya’s other plastic model kit series!</p>','{\"brand\": \"Megami Device\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 21:06:11','2026-02-09 21:06:11'),
(2012,207,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/OIhQ1clNVC9cHpL7eUZU/h/megami-device-asra-nine-tails','Kotobukiya Megami Device Asra Nine-Tails - Newtype','<p>Megami Device ASRA Nine Tails is back for a limited re-release! Megami Device is a series of plastic model kits that allow you to assemble your own fully poseable model and equip her with weapons and armor! This ASRA unit comes with all-new accessories and can be customized with M.S.G (Model Support Goods) for optimal customization options. Assemble weapons and armor to the model to enjoy creating your own unique display! Asra Nine-Tails has a main body, or &quot;machinika,&quot; designed by Nidy 2D, and includes a huge array of interchangeable parts to customize her as you like!    Product Features  5.51 inches (14cm) Made of plastic Can be displayed with or without armor Equipped with several 3mm connection points        Box Contents  Pieces to build:  Asra Nine-Tails 5x Pairs of hands 3x Face plates     Spear weapon Decals for the eyes and other markings Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"Megami Device\"}','2026-02-09 21:08:10','2026-02-09 21:08:10'),
(2013,201,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/3NW1DwqcVvucZ2FzWzgp/h/megami-device-asra-ninja-kagekoromo','Kotobukiya Megami Device Asra Ninja Kagekoromo - Newtype','<p>“Megami Device” is a plastic model kit series combining Bishoujo-style beauties and heavy-duty weapons and armor. Each character has a main body, or “machinika,” designed by Masaki Apsy along with a huge array of interchangeable parts to outfit her as you like! The latest character to join this series is ASRA NINJA designed by Nidy-2D-! Model Specifications:・3 different pre-painted face parts per character.・Interchangeable “Armed Mode” and “Unarmed Mode” parts.・Use with SOL Road Runner (sold separately) to create full armor mode.・Basic body is incredibly articulated, allowing for more natural posing options (such as when posing with weapons or when sitting down).・Various bonus weapon parts are included.・The model is equipped with several 3mm connection points, making it compatible with existing M.S.G, Frame Arms, and Frame Arms Girl weapons and armor.・PVC made hand parts (5 per hand) are included which are compatible with M.S.G, Frame Arms, and Frame Arms Girl series.・Newly designed marking and eye decals are included.   What is “Megami Device?”Kotobukiya’s Megami Device series is a line of 14 cm (51/2”) plastic model kits that come with a range of weapons and equipment that allow you to enjoy building and customizing your own Megami Device to use in robot battles. Each character has a main body, or “machinika,” designed by Masaki Apsy, while the models’ unique armor and mechanics are designed in collaboration with a variety of guest illustrators. The kits come with multi-colored parts and face parts pre-printed with tampography, making them easy to assemble with no paint required. The kits are equipped with 3mm joints, making them compatible with all of the weapons in the Megami Device line as well as Kotobukiya’s other plastic model kit series!</p>','{\"brand\": \"Megami Device\"}','2026-02-09 21:09:11','2026-02-09 21:09:11'),
(2014,195,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/Vd0YPbWZikqox8WW63Kb/h/megami-device-auv-amaterasu-eclipse','Kotobukiya Megami Device Auv Amaterasu Eclipse - Newtype','<p>The divine warrior descends in shadow—AUV Amaterasu Eclipse joins the Megami Device series with an all-new, darkly captivating form. Inspired by the Japanese legend of Amano-Iwato, this version of Amaterasu sheds her sacred white regalia for a mysterious deep purple and black color scheme, suggesting power, secrecy, and a more seductive presence. This unique interpretation is based on the popular AUV Amaterasu Regalia, now transformed into a dramatic eclipse of her former self. Designed by the acclaimed Nidy-2D- and built on the ultra-poseable Machinika body by Masaki Apsy, this kit features incredible articulation and expressive design. The model can be built in her regal “Armed Mode” or stripped down to “Unarmed Mode” to highlight her feminine form and enhanced flexibility. Product Features  Three newly designed pre-painted facial expressions: masked, smug, and distressed Exclusive eye-mask face adds an air of mystery  Includes bonus twintails from AUV Susanowo Regalia for enhanced impact Reconfigurable armor, cape, and weapon parts allow for multiple display forms Massive clear-effect weapons and cape parts can be dynamically posed  3mm connection points support cross-compatibility with M.S.G, Frame Arms, Frame Arms Girl, Hexa Gear, Sousai Shojo Teien, Arcanadea, and more Includes eye and body decals for detailed finishing   Box Contents  Parts to build AUV Amaterasu Eclipse Three pre-painted face parts: eye-mask, smug, and distressed Interchangeable parts for Armed and Unarmed modes Twintail hair parts Weapons and effect parts Interchangeable hands and joints Eye and marking decal sheets Instruction manual</p>','{\"brand\": \"Megami Device\", \"scale\": \"1/1\"}','2026-02-09 21:10:10','2026-02-09 21:10:10'),
(2015,204,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/naIk5x0Tz7kgezVpDhDT/h/megami-device-auv-tsukuyomi-regalia','Kotobukiya Megami Device Auv Tsukuyomi Regalia - Newtype','<p>Inspired by the Japanese legend of the Three Noble Children, the next divine warrior to join the Megami Device lineup—following the acclaimed Auv Amaterasu and Auv Susanowo—is the celestial moon deity herself: Auv Tsukuyomi. Clad in majestic Regalia armor, Tsukuyomi enters the series with an deathly silhouette rivaling the presence and volume of the Susanowo Guren and Souen kits, while incorporating a wealth of newly sculpted parts that give her a distinct personality all her own. Designed by Nidy-2D-, the creative force behind the ASRA and AUV series, Tsukuyomi Regalia blends underworld lunar motifs with intricate mechanical styling. Underneath the ornate armor, the highly flexible “machineca” body engineered by Masaki Apsy allows for expressive posing—ranging from graceful, goddess-like stances to dynamic battle choreography. The kit also includes an inventive bonus feature: Tsukuyomi’s signature great scythe can be reassembled into Kugutsu, a charming skeletal support mech that stands by her side. With Armed and Unarmed Mode configurations, premium pre-painted faces, pure white Skin Color C, and broad compatibility with Kotobukiya’s expansive customization ecosystem, Auv Tsukuyomi Regalia stands as a divine centerpiece model—an elegant lunar goddess ready for display, play, or creative kitbashing. Product Features  Newly sculpted parts for Tsukuyomi—including face, hair, chest, and armor—distinct from Amaterasu and Susanowo  Signature great scythe converts into Kugutsu, a cute skeletal support mech Three pre-painted faceplates Switchable Armed Mode and Unarmed Mode  Includes multiple weapons and joints for varied combat scenes Fully compatible with M.S.G., Frame Arms/FA Girl, Hexa Gear, Sousai Shoujo Teien, Arcanadea, and Megalomaria   Box Contents  Parts to build Auv Tsukuyomi Regalia armor set Great scythe Kugutsu transformation parts Alternate face plates Interchangeable hands Alternate hair parts  Eye &amp;amp; marking decals Display base Instruction manual</p>','{\"brand\": \"Megami Device\", \"scale\": \"1/1\"}','2026-02-09 21:11:14','2026-02-09 21:11:14'),
(2016,203,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/gobzFgplwroJ3zzizilL/h/megami-device-x-alice-gear-aegis-ayaka-ichijo-ei-shun','Kotobukiya Megami Device X Alice Gear Aegis Ayaka Ichijo (EI-SHUN) - Newtype','<p>The latest model to join Kotobukiya’s original Megami Device series is the Another Version of Ayaka Ichijo, Ayaka Ichijo [Ei-shun], from the popular mobile game, Alice Gear Aegis! As an added bonus, the kit comes with a present code to receive an item in the game designed by Humikane Shimada! The base model for Ayaka Ichijo [Ei-shun] underwent a renewal from the standard Ayaka Ichijo. To further match the character’s look in the game, newly sculpted three face parts and bangs are included in this kit. As part of the Megami Device series, the model consists of the base “machinika” body designed by Masaki Apsy and a variety of unique armor and weapons. With the newly sculpted face parts and bangs, the eye decals have been renewed with R66’s charm, keeping the model kit as close to the original as possible. Model Specifications:  The kit will include a present code for use in the game. The kit includes three different newly sculpted pre-printed face parts. The included new SP is of clear yellow coloring. With the signature gear, the included dual swords, a single sword, SP, etc. will allow users to enjoy recreating various combat scenes. A cleaning robot in a new color is included as a bonus part. The model can be constructed with her signature gear in “Armed Mode,” or without gear in “Unarmed Mode.” The model is equipped with 3mm connection joints and includes compatible head parts for users to customize with the existing M.S.G, FrameArms, Frame Arms Girl, Hexa Gear, and Sousai Shojo Teien plastic model kit series. The kit includes a variety of decals for the eyes and other markings.</p>','{\"brand\": \"Megami Device\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 21:13:12','2026-02-09 21:13:12'),
(2017,123,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/NkMDMbUt2csyOXzO1B7m/h/mg-msn-06s-sinanju-animation-color','Bandai MG MSN-06S Sinanju (Animation Color) - Newtype','<p>Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn anime, the Sinanju model kit is in 1/100 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once complete. Sinanju comes with a Beam Rifle with grenade launcher attachment, a pair of Beam Axes and Beam Sabers and a shield. Both a sheet of waterslide decals and foil stickers are provided so you can choose which one you prefer for the model. The bazooka used in episode 6 is also included and can combine with the rifle for a menacing weapon.      Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of plastic From Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn Fully articulated figure once complete        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Sinanju  Beam rifle Pair of Beam axes Pair of Beam sabers Shield Bazooka   Decals Stickers Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Unicorn\"}','2026-02-09 21:15:10','2026-02-09 21:15:10'),
