(2019,113,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/s3lwLrjTfPhRh5mIVk9d/h/sdbb-371-gundam-age-2','Bandai SDBB 371 Gundam AGE-2 - Newtype','<p>From the anime series Mobile Suit Gundam AGE comes an SD Gundam model kit of AGE-2 Gundam AGE-2, able to be built in Normal and Double Bullet forms!      Product Features  Made of PE and PS Part of the SD Gundam figure series Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam AGE anime Recreates Normal and Double Bullet versions        Box Contents  Pieces to build  AGE-2 Gundam AGE-2 Normal Double Bullet parts   Foil seals Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"SD - Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\", \"series\": \"Gundam Age\"}','2026-02-09 21:16:14','2026-02-09 21:16:14'),
(2020,111,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/hsYTdG8hTEk6c7UMBRtt/h/sdbb-372-gundam-age-3','Bandai SDBB 372 Gundam AGE-3 - Newtype','<p>From the anime series Mobile Suit Gundam AGE comes an SD Gundam model kit of AGE-3 Gundam AGE-3, able to be built in Normal, Fortress, or Orbital forms!      Product Features  Made of PE and PS Part of the SD Gundam figure series Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam AGE anime Recreates Normal, Fortress, and Orbital versions        Box Contents  Pieces to build  AGE-3 Gundam AGE-3 Normal Fortress parts Orbital parts   Foil seals Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"SD - Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\", \"series\": \"Gundam Age\"}','2026-02-09 21:18:12','2026-02-09 21:18:12'),
(2021,43,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/jUiLoe58epVHKcCA5L1f/h/sdbb-399-versal-knight-gundam','Bandai SDBB 399 Versal Knight Gundam - Newtype','<p>From the era of legend, the Versal Knight Gundam is making its appearance to the LegendBB line! The LegendBB line utilizes unique gimmicks and a super cute &quot;Super Deformed&quot; size. Articulated and including weapons, this Gundam kit is ready to assemble and add to your collection!      Product Features  3.5 inches (8.9cm)  Made of plastic Super Deformed style Colored molding  No glue required to assemble        Box Contents  PIeces to build   Versal Knight Gundam Electromagnetic lance Versal sword Sheath Knight flyer Mantle   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"SD - Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 21:19:13','2026-02-09 21:19:13'),
(2022,227,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/EzUvuYPum8ajfJCLpbM4/h/best-mecha-collection-rx-78-2-gundam-revival-ver','Bandai Best Mecha Collection RX-78-2 Gundam (REVIVAL Ver.) - Newtype','<p>The RX-78-2 Gundam, an iconic mecha from Mobile Suit Gundam, makes its return in the Best Mecha Collection series! This 1/144 scale model celebrates over 40 years of Gundam history, incorporating advanced technology such as Iropla, touch gate, and snap-fit assembly to enhance the building experience while retaining its classic retro design. The model&#039;s sophisticated part configuration reproduces the color coding of the entire body in meticulous detail, with a structural design that conceals joint connections from the front. Two Beam Saber types, attached to the backpack, and a Beam Rifle allow for dynamic posing, while a shield adds to its iconic appearance. Product Features:   Scale: 1/144  Material: Made of plastic  Source: Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam anime  Series: Part of the Best Mecha Collection   Articulation: Multiple points of articulation for posing  Assembly: Advanced technologies like Iropla, touch gate, and snap fit  Detail: Sophisticated part configuration for accurate color reproduction  Box Contents:  Pieces to build RX-78-2 Gundam figure  Beam Rifle 2 Beam Saber types Shield  Instructions (may or may not include English translation)  Revisit the legacy of Gundam with the RX-78-2 Gundam Best Mecha Collection Model Kit, blending classic design with modern engineering for a nostalgic yet innovative building experience!</p>','{\"line\": \"NG - No Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\"}','2026-02-09 21:21:10','2026-02-09 21:21:10'),
(2023,211,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/P6znFbT7qSyiKxJvs8Tx/h/megami-device-bullet-knights-executioner-bride','Kotobukiya Megami Device Bullet Knights Executioner Bride - Newtype','<p>Megami Device is a plastic model kit series combining Bishoujo-style beauties and heavy-duty weapons and armor. Each character has a main body, or “machinika,” designed by Masaki Apsy along with a huge array of interchangeable parts to outfit her as you like! The latest character to join the series is Bullet Knights Exorcist Bride, based on character art by Yasutaka Isegawa!      Product Features  5.91 inches (15cm) 1/1 Scale Made of PS, ABS, POM and PVC Based on character art by Yasutaka Isegawa Compatible with existing M.S.G, Frame Arms, and Frame Arms Girl weapons and armor “Machinika” body base boasts an impressive range of flexibility        Box Contents  Pieces to build Bullet Knight Exorcist Bride 2 Alternate face plates Decals Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"Megami Device\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 21:23:09','2026-02-09 21:23:09');
INSERT INTO `product_external_contents` VALUES
(2024,212,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/TFbwLueDMiHcDcS1CnGj/h/megami-device-bullet-knights-exorcist-widow','Kotobukiya Megami Device Bullet Knights Exorcist Widow - Newtype','<p>Megami Device is a plastic model kit series combining Bishoujo-style beauties and heavy-duty weapons and armor. Each character has a main body, or “machinika,” designed by Masaki Apsy along with a huge array of interchangeable parts to outfit her as you like! The latest character to join the series is Bullet Knights Exorcist Widow, based on character art by Yasutaka Isegawa!      Product Features  5.91 inches (15cm) 1/1 Scale Made of PS, ABS, POM and PVC Based on character art by Yasutaka Isegawa Compatible with existing M.S.G, Frame Arms, and Frame Arms Girl weapons and armor “Machinika” body base boasts an impressive range of flexibility        Box Contents  Pieces to build Bullet Knight Exorcist Widow 2 Alternate face plates Decals Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"Megami Device\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 21:24:14','2026-02-09 21:24:14'),
(2025,196,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/IVzN30uhpRZhrL3xoBV0/h/megami-device-bullet-knights-launcher-hell-blaze','Kotobukiya Megami Device Bullet Knights Launcher Hell Blaze - Newtype','<p>-This kit is a color variation of BULLET KNIGHTS LAUNCHER, with an updated colorscheme and new decals.-The kit also includes stickers that make it easy to recreate the markings and designs onthe model.-Launcher’s oversized launcher and shield can be attached to the arms that extend from her back. The kit also comes with special bases for the equipment for even more support.-The weapon can be reconfigured into “Ride Mode” to serve as a vehicle for the Megami.-The launcher can be separated into three parts, and the arms on the back have several points of articulation, allowing the model to be displayed in a variety of poses.-The tube that extends from the back of Launcher’s head is created with wire, allowing itto be bent and displayed in different designs.-The kit includes decals for the eyes and metallic decals for the markings.-The kit comes with three interchangeable face parts.-The model can be built in knight inspired “Armed Mode,” or without her armor in“Unarmed Mode.”-The “Machinika” body base boasts an impressive range of flexibility, allowing it to be displayed in a variety of natural poses.-The model is equipped with several 3mm connection points, making it compatible withexisting M.S.G, Frame Arms, and Frame Arms Girl weapons and armor.</p>','{\"brand\": \"Megami Device\"}','2026-02-09 21:26:12','2026-02-09 21:26:12'),
(2026,202,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/ZK16W3ffhVgS6QMcelmv/h/megami-device-buster-doll-knight','Kotobukiya Megami Device - Buster Doll Knight - Newtype','<p>Introducing the second entry in Kotobukiya’s groundbreaking Machineca Block2-M series: BUSTER DOLL KNIGHT—a fully reimagined Megami Device unit that pushes the limits of beauty, articulation, and modular design. Crafted by Masaki Apsy, the new Block2-M Machineca frame is a complete structural overhaul designed for ease of assembly, enhanced proportions, and seamless compatibility with interchangeable parts. At the center of this innovation is Buster Doll Knight, a concept brought to life by Megami Device producer Toriwo Toriyama, mecha designer Task, and character illustrator Parsley, blending knightly aesthetics with futuristic elegance. Whether displayed in fully armed regalia or stripped down to its sleek base form, Buster Doll Knight stands as a testament to modular beauty and next-gen engineering.    Product Features  Features the newly developed Machineca Block2-M frame, designed from scratch for better articulation, improved proportions, and maximum modularity. Comes with three pre-painted facial expressions and blank face parts for custom decal use. Can be built in Armed or Unarmed Mode Weapon-holding hands support both round and square grips. Includes a newly designed base for enhanced display stability. Fully compatible with existing M.S.G, Frame Arms, Frame Arms Girl, Hexa Gear, Sousai Shojo Teien, and Arcanadea model kit lines via standard 3mm ports.         Box Contents  Buster Doll body Costume armor set Three pre-painted facial expressions Blank face parts Interchangeable hand set  Display base Eye decals and marking decals Instruction manual</p>','{\"brand\": \"Megami Device\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 21:28:12','2026-02-09 21:28:12'),
(2027,209,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/lBhreCECHwWHsxa4kHqh/h/megami-device-buster-doll-paladin-darkness-claw','Kotobukiya Megami Device - Buster Doll Paladin Darkness Claw - Newtype','<p>The popular BUSTER DOLL Paladin returns in a bold new color variant—DARKNESS CLAW—bringing a fresh edge to the Megami Device lineup. As part of the next-generation BUSTER DOLL series, this model features the advanced Machinika Block2-M body, boasting updated proportions, streamlined assembly, and exceptional poseability. The DARKNESS CLAW version enhances the base Paladin with a sleek swimsuit-inspired color palette paired with deep-toned armor to set it apart from the original. The skin tone uses Pale Skin Color C, optimized for the striking contrast between soft complexion and sharp armored elements. Matching the aesthetic of BUSTER DOLL Knight DARKNESS CLAW, the armaments are fully cross-compatible, perfect for custom kitbashing. This kit comes with three newly sculpted, pre-painted faceplates, allowing expressive display options. The armor is built with a multi-layered structure and includes uniform-inspired parts like a school blazer-style chest piece. You can build her in either &quot;Armed Mode&quot;, decked out in full gear, or &quot;Unarmed Mode&quot; to showcase the refined base body. All three hand types are made from hard plastic, with the weapon-holding hand specifically designed to grip both round and square weapons without adapters. Customization is limitless with 3mm connection points and compatibility across a wide range of series including M.S.G, Frame Arms Girl, HEXA GEAR, ARCANADEA, Sousai Shojo Teien, and Megalomaria. A newly designed, sturdy display stand is included for dynamic posing support. Product Features  Assembled: 7 inches tall (17.6cm) 1/1 Scale Made of ABS, POM, and PS Part of the Megami Device series Highly poseable with updated articulation  Box Contents    Pieces to build Buster Doll Paladin DARKNESS CLAW Armed Mode parts Unarmed Mode parts 3 Pre-painted faceplates Swimsuit-style and school blazer costume parts Plastic hand sets Display stand Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"Megami Device\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 21:30:10','2026-02-09 21:30:10'),
(2028,206,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/lBhreCECHwWHsxa4kHqh/h/megami-device-buster-doll-paladin-darkness-claw','Kotobukiya Megami Device - Buster Doll Paladin Darkness Claw - Newtype','<p>The popular BUSTER DOLL Paladin returns in a bold new color variant—DARKNESS CLAW—bringing a fresh edge to the Megami Device lineup. As part of the next-generation BUSTER DOLL series, this model features the advanced Machinika Block2-M body, boasting updated proportions, streamlined assembly, and exceptional poseability. The DARKNESS CLAW version enhances the base Paladin with a sleek swimsuit-inspired color palette paired with deep-toned armor to set it apart from the original. The skin tone uses Pale Skin Color C, optimized for the striking contrast between soft complexion and sharp armored elements. Matching the aesthetic of BUSTER DOLL Knight DARKNESS CLAW, the armaments are fully cross-compatible, perfect for custom kitbashing. This kit comes with three newly sculpted, pre-painted faceplates, allowing expressive display options. The armor is built with a multi-layered structure and includes uniform-inspired parts like a school blazer-style chest piece. You can build her in either &quot;Armed Mode&quot;, decked out in full gear, or &quot;Unarmed Mode&quot; to showcase the refined base body. All three hand types are made from hard plastic, with the weapon-holding hand specifically designed to grip both round and square weapons without adapters. Customization is limitless with 3mm connection points and compatibility across a wide range of series including M.S.G, Frame Arms Girl, HEXA GEAR, ARCANADEA, Sousai Shojo Teien, and Megalomaria. A newly designed, sturdy display stand is included for dynamic posing support. Product Features  Assembled: 7 inches tall (17.6cm) 1/1 Scale Made of ABS, POM, and PS Part of the Megami Device series Highly poseable with updated articulation  Box Contents    Pieces to build Buster Doll Paladin DARKNESS CLAW Armed Mode parts Unarmed Mode parts 3 Pre-painted faceplates Swimsuit-style and school blazer costume parts Plastic hand sets Display stand Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"Megami Device\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 21:31:10','2026-02-09 21:31:10'),
(2029,210,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/uFpqpN7KqPFjfYZtClAI/h/megami-device-buster-doll-tank','Kotobukiya Megami Device - Buster Doll Tank - Newtype','<p>Introducing the third release in Kotobukiya’s transformative Machineca Block2-M series, Buster Doll Tank charges into the Megami Device lineup with a bold design and unmatched modularity. With a newly engineered frame by Masaki Apsy, this model is built from the ground up for superior articulation, customization, and ease of assembly. Developed as part of a fresh initiative led by Megami Device producer Toriwo Toriyama, this system-integrated design features mechanical elements by Task and character design by renowned illustrator Parsley, bringing to life a fierce, tank-inspired warrior with a modern twist. Combining raw power and adaptability, Buster Doll Tank is ready for any display or customization you throw her way—whether fully armored in combat or elegantly poised in minimal form.    Product Features  New Machineca Block2-M body for enhanced poseability, durability, and easier assembly. Includes costume armor styled after a sailor uniform and alternate parts for a base body configuration. Comes with three pre-painted facial expressions and blank faces for users who prefer custom decals. Configurable in Armed Mode or Unarmed Mode  New hand designs with versatile grips for both round and square-handled weapons. Includes a revised display base for extra stability in dynamic poses or heavy loadouts. Features 3mm joint compatibility, allowing seamless mixing with parts from M.S.G, Frame Arms, Frame Arms Girl, Hexa Gear, Sousai Shojo Teien, and Arcanadea series.         Box Contents  Buster Doll Tank body (Machineca Block2-M frame) Multi-layered tank-style armor set Sailor uniform-inspired costume parts 3 pre-painted facial expressions Blank face parts Interchangeable hand parts set Alternate chest and waist parts for base body Newly designed display base Eye and marking decals Instruction manual</p>','{\"brand\": \"Megami Device\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 21:33:10','2026-02-09 21:33:10'),
(2030,232,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/cgXTaT0TjGBEssfHd5Us/h/charzaku-kun-3d-rubber-mascot-keychain','Bandai CharZaku-Kun 3D Rubber Mascot Keychain - Newtype','<p>Carry a piece of Gunpla spirit wherever you go with the CharZaku-Kun 3D Rubber Mascot Keychain! This adorable and expressive rubber charm brings a fun twist to the world of plastic models. With its bold detailing and stylized 3D form, CharZaku-Kun is instantly recognizable and perfect for fans of all ages. Attach it to your keys, backpack, model kit case, or display it alongside your Gunpla collection—it’s the perfect combination of fandom and functionality. Made from durable, high-quality rubber with a metal keyring attachment, this mascot is ready to follow you on your next build or convention visit. Features:   Official CharZaku-Kun character in 3D rubber mascot form   High-quality rubber with vibrant detailing and layered depth   Sturdy metal keyring and clasp for secure attachment   Great for keychains, bags, lanyards, or collectible displays   A must-have for Gunpla builders and collectors</p>','{\"line\": \"Keychain\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 21:34:11','2026-02-09 21:34:11'),
(2031,530,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/zrWqseaVAEWs8mqzSCUQ/h/entry-grade-rx-78-2','Bandai Entry Grade RX-78-2 - Newtype','<p>The Entry Grade RX-78-2 Gundam, based on the anime series Mobile Suit Gundam, is the ultimate introduction item for GunPla. Consisting of only 74 parts, the plastic is color molded requiring no paint, snaps together requiring no glue, uses easy twist off parts requing no tools, and now doesn&#039;t even require stickers for tiny details!  The RX-78-2 Gundam comes armed with a beam rifle and shield.      Product Features  4.13 inches (10.49cm) Made of plastic From Mobile Suit Gundam Easy to build Requires no glue, tools, or paint        Box Contents  Pieces to build  RX-78-2 Gundam Beam rifle Shield   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"Entry Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\"}','2026-02-09 21:36:09','2026-02-09 21:36:09'),
(2032,48,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/qlAqH6RQIkrksaACqzwh/h/entry-grade-mbf-02-strike-rouge','Bandai Entry Grade MBF-02 Strike Rouge - Newtype','<p>Cagalli’s Strike Rouge from Mobile Suit Gundam Seed joins Bandai’s Entry Grade lineup with easy assembly and quality design. Featuring outstanding color reproduction and articulation, this kit offers a seamless building experience for beginners and experienced modelers alike. Product Features  High-quality Entry Grade model kit with color-accurate parts Wide range of motion for bold and dynamic poses Includes marking stickers, including Cagalli’s personal emblem Compatible with parts from Option Parts Set Gunpla 15 (Cavalier Aifrid) and Option Parts Set 10 Gunpla 01 (Aile Striker)  Box Contents  Beam rifle Shield Stickers</p>','{\"line\": \"Entry Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed\"}','2026-02-09 21:37:12','2026-02-09 21:37:12'),
(2033,606,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/QFwVxi0xF592tXSARC0t/h/entry-grade-wing-gundam','Bandai Entry Grade Wing Gundam - Newtype','<p>From the iconic anime series Mobile Suit Gundam Wing, the legendary Wing Gundam soars into the Entry Grade lineup—a perfect blend of beginner-friendly assembly and high-quality design! This model kit features exceptional poseability, dynamic proportions, and vibrant color separation—all achieved without the need for stickers or tools. Thanks to touch-gate technology, parts can be easily removed by hand without nippers, making this kit ideal for first-time builders and seasoned hobbyists alike.      Product Features  Color-accurate build with no stickers required—thanks to expertly engineered parts separation Highly poseable with a simplified yet dynamic articulation system Touch-gate system allows parts to be removed easily by hand, no tools necessary Low part count, high impact—a perfect entry-level kit without sacrificing detail Includes iconic Buster Rifle and Shield for signature Wing Gundam poses         Box Contents  Pieces to build Wing Gundam Buster Rifle Shield Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"Entry Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Wing\"}','2026-02-09 21:39:10','2026-02-09 21:39:10'),
(2034,601,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/U1QAHfKuXlryFcimMpSJ/h/rg-36-rx-93-hi-nu-gundam','Bandai RG 36 RX-93 Hi-Nu Gundam - Newtype','<p>From the manga Mobile Suit Gundam: Char&#039;s Counterattack - Beltorchika&#039;s Children, this Hi-ν Gundam models comes in 1/144 scale and features loads of accessories to create all of your favorite poses!      Product Features  1/144 scale Made of plastic Fully articulated once complete From the Mobile Suit Gundam: Char&#039;s Counterattack - Beltorchika&#039;s Children manga        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Hi-ν Gundam Backpack Beam rifle Shield Bazooka   3 Pairs of hands Extra right hand 3 Beam sabers 2 Saber blades Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"RG - Real Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Char\'s Counterattack\"}','2026-02-09 21:40:12','2026-02-09 21:40:12'),
(2035,597,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/kQUesY0APoGBo0k0StyK/h/entry-grade-kirby','Bandai Entry Grade Kirby - Newtype','<p>Joining the Entry Grade lineup is the video game icon, Kirby! This easy to assemble model kit requires no glue, no paint, or even tools to assemble! Parts twist off and snap together creating an amazingly detailed figure when assembled.      Product Features  Made of plastic From Kirby Easy to build Requires no glue, tools, or paint        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Kirby Warp star pedestal   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"Entry Grade\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 21:41:14','2026-02-09 21:41:14'),
(2036,81,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/xergWzJVbElkEZ1bRjcS/h/sdex-standard-02-gat-x105-aile-strike-gundam','Bandai SDEX-Standard 02 GAT-X105 Aile Strike Gundam - Newtype','<p>The Aile Strike Gundam from the animated TV series, Gundam Seed, re-appears as a new member of the SD EX-Standard line. Featuring newer proportion to allow for full bodied limbs and more articulation, the Aile Strike is ready to recreate its iconic poses in a cute way! Includes beam rifle, beam saber, Aile Striker backpack and shield. Runner x 5, sticker, Instruction ManualApprox 3&quot; Tall</p>','{\"line\": \"SD - Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed\"}','2026-02-09 21:42:13','2026-02-09 21:42:13'),
(2037,80,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/ahi6UOwPykwwh9oPynTg/h/sdex-standard-03-gundam-exia','Bandai SDEX-Standard 03 Gundam Exia - Newtype','<p>Gundam Exia, commencing armed intervention! Joining the SD EX-Standard series is a revitalization of the main Gundam from the Gundam 00 TV series. The new EX-Standard series has stronger proportions for the limbs which allow increased articulation, and also cross compatibility with HG kits first seen in the SD Build Fighters models. Exia features its iconic GN Sword, GN Blades, shield, and beam saber. Runner x 5, sticker, Instruction ManualApprox 3&quot; Tall</p>','{\"line\": \"SD - Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 21:43:11','2026-02-09 21:43:11'),
(2038,78,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/U9GzVy0DVcUQH57GpMAY/h/sdex-standard-15-unicorn-gundam-02-banshee-norn-destroy-mode','Bandai SDEX-STANDARD 15 Unicorn Gundam 02 Banshee Norn (Destroy Mode) - Newtype','<p>Unicorn Gundam 02 Banshee Norn of &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn&quot; is being released as the 15th SD Gundam EX-Standard! With its stylish proportions and ease of assembly, this is a kit everyone will love! The runners and stickers are arranged by color to accurately recreate the model&#039;s color scheme. Add this to your SD collection and make sure to keep an eye out for more future models in the line up!       Product Features  4 inches (10.16cm) Model Kit The 15th SD Gundam EX-Standard! Easy to assemble        Box Contents  Parts to build the SD EX-Standard 015 Unicorn Gundam 02 Banshee Norn (Destroy Mode) Beam Magnum Revolving launcher Armed armor DE 4 Runners Foil seal Instruction manual</p>','{\"line\": \"SD - Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 21:44:14','2026-02-09 21:44:14'),
(2039,288,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/Oaz5ySoNM69IG61UfS7W/h/sdex-standard-10-gundam-barbatos','Bandai SDEX-Standard 10 Gundam Barbatos - Newtype','<p>Part of the SD Gundam EX-Standard product line, the Gundam Barbatos has been recreated with an emphasis on articulation and enhanced proportion at an attractive price.       Product Features  Approximately 3 inches tall Created with emphasis on articulation and enhanced proportion         Box Contents  SD EX-Standard Gundam Barbatos model kit Mace Long-range cannon Sword that can be mounted on back Runner x 5 Instruction manual</p>','{\"line\": \"SD - Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\", \"series\": \"Iron-Blooded Orphans\"}','2026-02-09 21:46:10','2026-02-09 21:46:10'),
(2040,69,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/UGUtnpvzUngHjixG1boK/h/sdex-standard-13-sinanju','Bandai SDEX-Standard 13 Sinanju - Newtype','<p>Product Size: 4&quot;The Sinanju, a main MS from &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn&quot; is being released as the 13th SD Gundam EX-Standard! With it&#039;s stylish proportions and ease of assembly this is a kit everyone will love! The runners and stickers are arranged by color to accurately recreate the model&#039;s color scheme. Add this to your SD collection and make sure to keep an eye out for more future models in the line up! More popular mobile suits are set to launch one after another. Set includes beam rifle and shield. Runner x4. Foil seal x1. Instruction manual x1.</p>','{\"line\": \"SD - Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 21:47:10','2026-02-09 21:47:10'),
(2041,297,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/GzLoo6KI80AXzBnZPgh2/h/figure-rise-standard-fumina-hoshino','Bandai Figure-Rise Standard Fumina Hoshino - Newtype','<p>From &quot;Gundam Build Fighters Try&quot; comes a &quot;Figure-rise Standard&quot; model kit of Fumina Hoshino! Stand about 6 inches tall when complete, Fumina is dressed in her iconic outfit from the show which includes an optional jacket!      Product Features  Approximately 6 inches (15.25cm) Made of plastic From the &quot;Gundam Build Fighters Try&quot; series Dressed in her iconic outfit!        Box Contents  Pieces to build:  Fumina Hoshino 3x Face plates 4x Hands Petit&#039;gguy Jacket parts     Instructions Stickers Water decals Display base</p>','{\"line\": \"Figure-rise\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"series\": \"Gundam Build Fighters\"}','2026-02-09 21:48:11','2026-02-09 21:48:11'),
(2042,55,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/a9k2zsicq1DOREfQPKso/h/full-mechanics-1-100-forbidden-gundam','Bandai Full Mechanics 1/100 Forbidden Gundam - Newtype','<p>The Forbidden Gundam from &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam SEED&quot; joins Bandai&#039;s &quot;FULL MECHANICS&quot; model-kit lineup! This kit achieves high-density detail and ease of assembly. It&#039;s loaded with dense mechanical modeling, from the inside of the exhaust port to the mold behind the armor. The place parts of the Jufunshuren &quot;Nidhoggr&quot; have two types of surface finish to express the difference in texture; the energy cable connected to the backpack is reproduced with the attached varnish tube. The &quot;Geschmeidig Panzer&quot; energy deflection armor has a flexible arm and a shield. Multiple axes of movement are provided at the connecting part of the backpack so the angle of movement can be adjusted. The collar is movable in conjunction with the rotation of the chest intake block. With a structure in which the head sinks according to the movement, the backpack moves without interfering and transforms into a high-speed assault form with minimal motion!    Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of plastic From the &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam SEED&quot; anime series Part of the &quot;Full Mechanics&quot; line Highly detailed        Box Contents  Pieces to build:  Forbidden Gundam &quot;Nidhoggr&quot; Heavy Scythe Action base joint     Varnish tube Seal Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"Full Mechanics 1/100\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed\"}','2026-02-09 21:50:15','2026-02-09 21:50:15'),
(2043,59,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/vfGEhh6KZHyuDs8SAnqV/h/full-mechanics-gat-x370-raider-gundam','Bandai Full Mechanics GAT-X370 Raider Gundam - Newtype','<p>The all-new Mobile Suit Gundam Raider Gundam is being brought to the 1/100 Full Mechanics series! The mechanical detailing on these kits brings authentic details that cannot be fully realized in the anime.      Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of plastic  From the Mobile Suit Gundam SEED anime Poseable figure once assembled Can be displayed with Full Mechanics Calamity Gundam (sold separately)         Box Contents  Pieces to build  Raider Gundam Shield gun Mjolnir Pedestal for Mjolnir   Support parts for MA form display One set of joint parts for reproducing the Calamity boarding scene Sticker Marking sticker Lead wire Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"Full Mechanics 1/100\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed\"}','2026-02-09 21:52:12','2026-02-09 21:52:12'),
(2044,298,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/LsCT6brhEq5DRB3e23HZ/h/gmpla-kun-3d-rubber-mascot-keychain','Bandai GMPla-Kun 3D Rubber Mascot Keychain - Newtype','<p>Carry a piece of Gunpla spirit wherever you go with the GMPla-Kun 3D Rubber Mascot Keychain! This adorable and expressive rubber charm brings a fun twist to the world of plastic models. With its bold detailing and stylized 3D form, GMPla-Kun is instantly recognizable and perfect for fans of all ages. Attach it to your keys, backpack, model kit case, or display it alongside your Gunpla collection—it’s the perfect combination of fandom and functionality. Made from durable, high-quality rubber with a metal keyring attachment, this mascot is ready to follow you on your next build or convention visit. Features:   Official GMPla-Kun character in 3D rubber mascot form   High-quality rubber with vibrant detailing and layered depth   Sturdy metal keyring and clasp for secure attachment   Great for keychains, bags, lanyards, or collectible displays   A must-have for Gunpla builders and collectors</p>','{\"line\": \"Keychain\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 21:53:11','2026-02-09 21:53:11'),
(2045,188,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/GNJ8o0FQ8DYDmxxSG8y6/h/godhand-pn-125-nipper','GodHand Godhand PN-125 Nipper - Newtype','<p>Beginner / all purpose nipper from Godhand.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-09 21:54:11','2026-02-09 21:54:11'),
(2046,187,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/IDkPmY1qmmRfUwKSICuP/h/godhand-spn-120-ultimate-nipper','GodHand SPN-120 Ultimate Nipper - Newtype','<p>The SPN-120 Ultimate Nipper is widely regarded as the gold standard, designed for unparalleled precision and clean cuts. Engineered in Japan with expert craftsmanship, these professional-grade side cutters feature an ultra-thin single-blade design that delivers a ultra-smooth finish with minimal stress on the plastic. Ideal for serious modelers, the SPN-120 makes removing parts from runners effortless, reducing sanding and cleanup while preserving fine details. Its ergonomic grip and razor-sharp cutting edge ensure comfort and control even during long building sessions. Usage Precautions  Designed only for plastic model runners – do not use on metal, polycarbonate, or resin, as this may damage the blade. Rated for material width of &amp;lt;3mm (PS, PP, ABS) or &amp;lt;1mm (clear/translucent plastic). Avoid twisting or cutting thick gates in one motion; instead, cut in two stages for best results. The cutting edge is extremely sharp and delicate — store with the blade guard attached when not in use. Keep out of reach of children and handle with care to prevent injury.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-09 21:55:11','2026-02-09 21:55:11'),
(2047,192,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/qquiKXiwpJwmS2r98hbW/h/nu-gunpla-kun-3d-rubber-mascot-keychain','Bandai Nu-GunPla-Kun 3D Rubber Mascot Keychain - Newtype','<p>Carry a piece of Gunpla spirit wherever you go with the Nu-GunPla-Kun 3D Rubber Mascot Keychain! This adorable and expressive rubber charm brings a fun twist to the world of plastic models. With its bold detailing and stylized 3D form, Nu-GunPla-Kun is instantly recognizable and perfect for fans of all ages. Attach it to your keys, backpack, model kit case, or display it alongside your Gunpla collection—it’s the perfect combination of fandom and functionality. Made from durable, high-quality rubber with a metal keyring attachment, this mascot is ready to follow you on your next build or convention visit. Features:   Official Nu-GunPla-Kun character in 3D rubber mascot form   High-quality rubber with vibrant detailing and layered depth   Sturdy metal keyring and clasp for secure attachment   Great for keychains, bags, lanyards, or collectible displays   A must-have for Gunpla builders and collectors</p>','{\"line\": \"Keychain\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 21:55:15','2026-02-09 21:55:15'),
(2048,283,'newtype',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-09 21:56:12','2026-02-09 21:56:12'),
(2049,38,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/UZ65JahVf6WxlDesxzF7/h/hg-msv-01-msv-mbf-02-strike-rouge-iwsp','Bandai HG MSV 01 MSV MBF-02 Strike Rouge + IWSP - Newtype','<p>Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam SEED anime, the Strike Rouge IWSP model kit is in 1/144 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once complete. The Strike Rouge IWSP includes overhead cannons, beam rifle, gattling shield, beam saber, and 2 side mounted swords. The Strike Rouge itself has been molded in the pink colors used by Cagali during the final battles of Gundam Seed. IWSP pack can separate and is compatible with other Strike “HG SEED” 1/144 models.      Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic From Mobile Suit Gundam SEED Destiny MSV        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Strike Rouge IWSP Overhead cannons Beam rifle Gattling shield Beam saber 2 Side mounted swords   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed\"}','2026-02-09 21:57:12','2026-02-09 21:57:12'),
(2050,2,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/TYcx4UBHVAteB9QwVKdq/h/hgseed-13-mbf-p03-gundam-astray-blue-frame','Bandai HGSEED 13 MBF-P03 Gundam Astray Blue Frame - Newtype','<p>This Gundam Astray (blue frame) is a high-grade model superbly molded in color and featuring a snap-fit assembly for ease of building! It&#039;s nicely engineered and exceptionally poseable thanks to matching blue polycaps (instead of the standard grey!). It can even drop to one knee to use the included shoulder-mount bazooka! Foil stickers for shiny bits and clear stickers for other markings are also included for added detail.    Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic Based on &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam SEED Astray&quot;  Fully articulated figure once complete         Box Contents  Pieces to build: Gundam Astray Blue Frame Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed Astray\"}','2026-02-09 21:58:13','2026-02-09 21:58:13'),
(2051,281,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/eH7GUbcF2I86rdFjlnu6/h/delpi-decal-hg-black-knight-squad-shi-vea','Delpi Decal HG Black Knight Squad Shi-ve.A - Newtype','<p>HG 1/144 Black Knight Squad Shi-ve.A Decals High-quality waterslide decals from Delpi! **Refer to product images for instructions on decal placement.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-09 22:00:14','2026-02-09 22:00:14'),
(2052,56,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/6Blz84WpgrXAlwGchp3q/h/g-rework-hg-bolinoak-sammahn-decals','G-Rework HG Bolinoak-Sammahn Decals - Newtype','<p>HG Bolinoak-Sammahn Decals.It is highly recommended to use setter / softer solutions with these water decals.</p>','{\"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Zeta Gundam\"}','2026-02-09 22:03:11','2026-02-09 22:03:11'),
(2053,13,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/5FP1HQAlQLK4GF5ZntPx/h/hgwfm-23-demi-barding','Bandai HG 23 Demi Barding - High Grade Witch From Mercury - Newtype','<p>The Demi Barding, as seen in &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam: The Witch from Mercury,&quot; gets a new 1/144-scale HG model kit from Bandai! It&#039;s equipped with its characteristic large backpack. The thrusters attached to its legs can be moved forward to store the beam saber. The beam rifle can also be held with both hands by moving the auxiliary grip!    Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic From the &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam: The Witch from Mercury&quot; anime series Part of the High Grade model kit line        Box Contents  Pieces to build:  Demi Barding Beam rifle 2 Beam Sabers Backpack     Stickers Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"The Witch From Mercury\"}','2026-02-09 22:04:12','2026-02-09 22:04:12'),
(2054,4,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/WhX3nP8Dc8e7xOuMSTt1/h/hgce-258-zgmf-a-42s2-destiny-gundam-spec-ii-zeus-silhouette','Bandai HGCE 258 ZGMF/A-42S2 Destiny Gundam Spec II & Zeus Silhouette - Newtype','<p>The Destiny Gundam Spec II joins Bandai&#039;s &quot;HG (High Grade)&quot; lineup, now equipped with its incredible Zeus Silhouette armament! The Zeus Silhouette is a powerhouse on its own, capable of transforming into a massive standalone MA form over 50cm long and displayable on the included action base. With dynamic features such as opening and closing hatches and interchangeable parts to showcase missile warheads, this kit takes detail to the next level. The HG Destiny Gundam Spec II is molded in vibrant colors and includes clear parts for the Wings of Light, Palma Fiocina effect, beam shield, and beam boomerang. A complete arsenal featuring the Arondight beam sword and high-energy long-range beam cannon ensures this Gundam is ready for battle. Product Features  1/144 Scale Highly detailed and articulated once assembled Zeus Silhouette can transform into a standalone MA form Includes clear parts for stunning visual effects Comes with an array of weapons and accessories Includes multiple display base options for dynamic posing  Box Contents  High-energy beam rifle Shield Beam shield Arondight beam sword High-energy long-range beam cannon Beam boomerang parts (x2) Palma Fiocina effect parts (x1 set) Palma Fiocina hand parts (x1 set) Wings of Light effect parts (x1 set) Zeus Silhouette missile parts (x1 set) Display bases (x2) Joint parts for display (x1 set) Stickers</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed Freedom\"}','2026-02-09 22:06:13','2026-02-09 22:06:13'),
(2055,186,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/U151iVrVq8zRhSuedm1Z/h/g-rework-hg-duel-blitz-gundam-decals','G-Rework HG Duel Blitz Gundam Decals - Newtype','<p>HG 1/144 Duel Blitz Gundam Decals High-quality waterslide decals from G-Rework! **Refer to product images for instructions on decal placement.</p>','{\"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\"}','2026-02-09 22:07:12','2026-02-09 22:07:12'),
(2056,7,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/PZVBqxyjJDq8OiHxxkBc/h/delpi-decal-hg-gfred','Delpi Decal HG GFreD - Newtype','<p>HG 1/144 Decals 57mm X 85mm</p>',NULL,'2026-02-09 22:09:14','2026-02-09 22:09:14'),
(2057,605,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/8jgmC1FgVefhZOZGXVyu/h/gd-139-hg-gquuuuuux-multiuse-1','Bandai GD-139 HG GQuuuuuuX Multiuse 1 - Newtype','<p>New to the &quot;Gundam Decal&quot; lineup comes a sheet of water transfer decals that can be used for your 1/144 scale models!  While markings may be used with any models, this sheet contains markings designed for GQuuuuuuX, Police Zaku, and Sugai&#039;s Gelgoog.  Versatile water transfer decals that include markings for unit insignia. Set includes decals and markings suitable for the HG GQuuuuuuX line.</p>','{\"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"series\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam GQuuuuuuX\"}','2026-02-09 22:10:10','2026-02-09 22:10:10'),
(2058,277,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/j60w4JvJiBzC1QHkGG27/h/hgibo-002-graze-standard-commander-type','Bandai HGIBO 002 Graze Standard / Commander Type - Newtype','<p>Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam Iron-Blooded Orphans anime, this Graze Standard Type (Commander Type) model kit is in the 1/144 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once built.       Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of PS, PE, and PVC Based on Mobile Suit Gundam Iron-Blooded Orphans  Part of the High Grade Universal Century model kit line        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Graze Standard Type (Commander Type) Axe Rifle   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Iron-Blooded Orphans\"}','2026-02-09 22:11:15','2026-02-09 22:11:15'),
(2059,213,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/vXyhg5CyaKBli42zrYMt/h/hggbm-011-gundam-00-command-qan-t-desert-type','Bandai HGGBM 011 Gundam 00 Command QAN[T] (Desert Type) - Newtype','<p>From the Gundam Build Series 10th Anniversary video &quot;Gundam Build Metaverse,&quot; the GNT-0000SDV Gundam 00 Command QAN[T] is now available as an HG model kit! A customized Mobile Suit with elements of the SD Command Gundam added! The figure adopts a desert-type design, and numerous ranged weapons such as missile launchers, heavy machine guns, and arm shields are included. Slashing weapons like the &quot;Command Sword&quot; are also included, and two combat knives are stored in the arms shield!    Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic Based on &quot;Gundam Build Metaverse&quot;  Part of the High Grade series Multiple points of articulation Interchangeable parts and accessories        Box Contents  Pieces to build:  Gundam 00 Command QAN[T] Command Sword Arms Shield 2x Combat knives Heavy machine gun Missile launcher Hand parts     Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Build Metaverse\"}','2026-02-09 22:14:11','2026-02-09 22:14:11'),
(2060,14,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/3fgAyouB3iwYIlxcFJ8K/h/delpi-decal-hg-gundam-aerial','Delpi Decal HG Gundam Aerial - Newtype','<p>Premium 1/144 scale waterslide decals by Delpi!  HG Gundam Aerial [Normal Version]  Bandai HGWFM Gundam Aerial model kit not included (sold separately).</p>','{\"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"series\": \"The Witch From Mercury\"}','2026-02-09 22:16:17','2026-02-09 22:16:17'),
(2061,268,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/e6kFpgBCwUTXACW2kKH8/h/hgag-027-gundam-age-fx','Bandai HGAG 027 Gundam AGE-FX - Newtype','<p>Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam AGE anime, this Gundam AGE-FX model kit is in the 1/144 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once built. The kit includes a clear ring display stand that allows effect parts to be displayed in different positions. The AGE-FX also has a removable Core Fighter and comes armed with a large Bazooka and Rifle.      Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam AGE anime Fully articulated figure once complete        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Gundam AGE-FX  Effect part display stand Bazooka Rifle   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Age\"}','2026-02-09 22:17:13','2026-02-09 22:17:13'),
(2062,214,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/UYvhyi1DRm9yvAyRHYMv/h/hggbm-012-gundam-amazing-barbatos-lupus','Bandai HGGBM 012 Gundam Amazing Barbatos Lupus - Newtype','<p>The Amazing Barbatos Lupus, as seen in the 10th-anniversary video &quot;Gundam Build Metaverse,&quot; gets a new 1/144-scale HG (High Grade) model kit from Bandai! The main body and booster can be separated or combined. The booster and mace can also be combined into a weapon. The mace can be mounted on the back. The claw, which can be separated from the booster and attached to the arm, is equipped with an unfolding and rotating gimmick. A lead wire is used for the tail blade, and the grip of the mace can be expanded to reproduce its shooting mode. The gun barrel can be attached, detached, and rotated in 90-degree increments. A base for display is included.    Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic Based on &quot;Gundam Build Metaverse&quot;  Part of the High Grade series Multiple points of articulation Interchangeable parts and accessories        Box Contents  Pieces to build:  Gundam 00 Command QAN[T] Command Sword Arms Shield 2x Combat knives Heavy machine gun Missile launcher Hand parts     Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Build Metaverse\"}','2026-02-09 22:19:10','2026-02-09 22:19:10'),
(2063,258,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/UYvhyi1DRm9yvAyRHYMv/h/hggbm-012-gundam-amazing-barbatos-lupus','Bandai HGGBM 012 Gundam Amazing Barbatos Lupus - Newtype','<p>The Amazing Barbatos Lupus, as seen in the 10th-anniversary video &quot;Gundam Build Metaverse,&quot; gets a new 1/144-scale HG (High Grade) model kit from Bandai! The main body and booster can be separated or combined. The booster and mace can also be combined into a weapon. The mace can be mounted on the back. The claw, which can be separated from the booster and attached to the arm, is equipped with an unfolding and rotating gimmick. A lead wire is used for the tail blade, and the grip of the mace can be expanded to reproduce its shooting mode. The gun barrel can be attached, detached, and rotated in 90-degree increments. A base for display is included.    Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic Based on &quot;Gundam Build Metaverse&quot;  Part of the High Grade series Multiple points of articulation Interchangeable parts and accessories        Box Contents  Pieces to build:  Gundam 00 Command QAN[T] Command Sword Arms Shield 2x Combat knives Heavy machine gun Missile launcher Hand parts     Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Build Metaverse\"}','2026-02-09 22:20:11','2026-02-09 22:20:11'),
(2064,215,'newtype',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-09 22:21:11','2026-02-09 22:21:11'),
(2065,287,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/4ruA2KUPyogeef784xo0/h/hgibo-023-gundam-gusion-rebake-full-city','Bandai HGIBO 023 Gundam Gusion Rebake Full City - Newtype','<p>An upgraded form of the Gundam Gusion with shield scissors that can be handheld or stored on the rear and 2 knuckle shields. Also includes alternate head.       Product Features  5 inches (12.7cm) Upgraded form of the Gundam Gusion Features shield scissors that can be hend-held or stored on the rear Includes an alternate head and 2 knuckle shields        Box Contents  Parts to build  Gundam Gusion Shield scissors Alternate head 2 Knuckle shields   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Iron-Blooded Orphans\"}','2026-02-09 22:22:11','2026-02-09 22:22:11'),
(2066,3,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/HVDBI2E4lcjI9dQUvXC9/h/hg-ew-03-gundam-heavyarms-custom','Bandai HG EW-03 Gundam Heavyarms Custom - Newtype','<p>XXXG-01H2 Gundam H-Arms Custom features its signature double twin Gatling guns as well as a full plethora of micro missile pods. Missile hatches on shoulders swivel open while leg missiles use replacement parts to simulate open and closed hatches. Small-scale version of the boy-I’ve-got-a-lot-of-missiles-on-me mecha from the OVA (Original Video Animation) series “Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz.” Chest and shoulder hatches open. Back-mounted guns can be gripped (includes three versions of the hands). Specifically designed to be able to be posed in some of the more memorable ways it was seen in the series.</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz\"}','2026-02-09 22:23:11','2026-02-09 22:23:11'),
(2067,607,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/SPTNJKCc7Yqzw8mfJXfC/h/hg00-067-gn-010-gundam-zabanya','Bandai HG00 067 GN-010 Gundam Zabanya - Newtype','<p>The Zabaniya from the anime &quot;Awakening of the Trailblazer&quot; is now an HG model kit from Bandai! The Zabaniya comes with many &#039;GN Bits&#039;, such as the Rifle Bit II, Pistol Bit, Holster Bit as well as GN Missile Pods! Polycaps for the joints and marking stickers are also provided.      Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic Based on &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam 00&quot; series Part of the High Grade series Multiple points of articulation Interchangeable parts and accessories        Box Contents  Pieces to build:  Gundam Zabanya GN Bits     Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam 00\"}','2026-02-09 22:24:12','2026-02-09 22:24:12'),
(2068,153,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/DHcs7n9Xv3OvtORfsDuX/h/hgce-249-gyan-strom-agnes-giebenrath-custom','Bandai HGCE 249 Gyan Strom (Agnes Giebenrath Custom) - Newtype','<p>Introducing a High Grade kit of Agnes Giebenrath&#039;s Gyan Strom from the movie &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam SEED Freedom&quot;! The kit is equipped with a specialized internal structure, the &quot;SEED Action System,&quot; for capturing iconic action poses from the film. Thanks to the sliding mechanism in the shoulder armor connection, it also features enhanced arm articulation. The distinctive beam axe, designed uniquely for this suit, can be mounted to the waist by swapping in the included storage grip. The movable wings allow you to position the missile launcher forward. You can recreate the Gatling&#039;s extended state by deploying the chest armor and inserting the Gatling parts. It also includes a Heat Rod part that can be equipped on the right arm. Lastly, the Gyan Strom includes effect parts that can be attached to the shield for added dynamic display options!    Product Features  Made of ABS and PVC From the &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam SEED Freedom&quot; anime film Part of the High Grade line Highly detailed        Box Contents  Piece to build:   Gyan Strom Beam Axe Heat Rod Part Beam Saber Beam Rifle 2x Beam Gatlings Shield Effect Parts set Joint Parts Hand Parts set     Decal sheet Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed Freedom\"}','2026-02-09 22:26:16','2026-02-09 22:26:16'),
(2069,154,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/0NAVyARA1HraEoUSlLL7/h/g-rework-hg-infinite-justice-gundam-type-ii-decals','G-Rework HG Infinite Justice Gundam Type II Decals - Newtype','<p>HG 1/144 Infinite Justice Gundam Type II Decals High-quality waterslide decals from G-Rework! **Refer to product images for instructions on decal placement.</p>','{\"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed Freedom\"}','2026-02-09 22:28:13','2026-02-09 22:28:13'),
(2070,70,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/ipQMJRNYwvihueVGTgs7/h/hgibo-024-julieta-s-mobile-reginlaze','Bandai HGIBO 024 Julieta\'s Mobile Reginlaze - Newtype','<p>From the Iron-Blooded Orphans anime comes this HG 1/144 scale model kit of Julieta&#039;s Mobile Reginlaze. Once completed the figure is fully articulated and will make a wonderful addition to any Gundam collection!      Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic Based on Mobile Suit Gundam: Iron-Blooded Orphans Part of the High Grade HG lineup        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Julieta&#039;s Mobile Reginlaze Rifle 2 Gauntlets 2 Twin Piles   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Iron-Blooded Orphans\"}','2026-02-09 22:29:14','2026-02-09 22:29:14'),
(2071,51,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/PPkXqK6IABVUMjgRN1V0/h/g-rework-hg-lightning-buster-gundam-decals','G-Rework HG Lightning Buster Gundam Decals - Newtype','<p>HG 1/144 Lightning Buster Gundam Decals High-quality waterslide decals from G-Rework!</p>','{\"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed Freedom\"}','2026-02-09 22:32:12','2026-02-09 22:32:12'),
(2072,52,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/5amA7azi96ioCM9KeJsH/h/hgce-250-zgmf-a-262pd-p-mighty-strike-freedom-gundam','Bandai HGCE 250 ZGMF/A-262PD-P Mighty Strike Freedom Gundam - Newtype','<p>Introducing a High Grade kit of the new Mighty Strike Freedom Gundam from the movie &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam SEED Freedom&quot;! Recreate iconic action poses from the movie with the specialized internal structure of the &quot;SEED Action System.&quot; The individual hip joint connections in both legs allow for upward and downward swinging, enabling you to achieve dynamic and precise posing. Features a Real Metallic Gloss Injection material for the gold parts, enhancing their metallic luster. The wings have extensive individual articulation and can recreate expanded configurations. The white wings have 8 sliding joints for replicating the deployed state. For added realism, 3D metallic stickers are included for a luminous effect. The blade parts of the included &quot;Futsunomitama&quot; sword showcase different textures with two surface finishes.  The &quot;Proud Defender&quot; can be removed and displayed separately, and you can recreate the forehead cannon&#039;s deployed state through part replacement. The hip rail gun can be extended to replicate a simultaneous firing position. Comes with an array of armaments, including beam sabers, beam shields, and even a grip for replicating connected beam saber states.    Product Features  Made of ABS and PVC From the &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam SEED Freedom&quot; anime film Part of the High Grade line Highly detailed        Box Contents  Pieces to build:   Mighty Strike Freedom Gundam Sword (Futsunomitama) 2x Beam Rifles 2x Beam Sabers Grip for Saber Connection Beam Shield Head Part Hand Parts Set   3D Metallic Sticker Decal sheet Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed Freedom\"}','2026-02-09 22:34:12','2026-02-09 22:34:12'),
(2073,49,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/zunhJk3EV6tzGSlw7Pvr/h/g-rework-hg-murasame-kai-decals','G-Rework HG Murasame Kai Decals - Newtype','<p>HG 1/144 HG Murasame Kai Decals High-quality waterslide decals from G-Rework!</p>','{\"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed Freedom\"}','2026-02-09 22:36:14','2026-02-09 22:36:14'),
(2074,228,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/4HGy6s3GvpIwIh4eExez/h/delpi-decal-hg-psycho-gundam-mk-ii','Delpi Decal HG Psycho Gundam Mk-II - Newtype','<p>HG 1/144 Decals 110mm X 110mm (2 sheets)You can choose to produce either the Neo Zeon or Titans version.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-09 22:39:11','2026-02-09 22:39:11'),
(2075,119,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/DqzCO2nTEdYe1mjOkXZJ/h/hgseed-r02-gat-x102-duel-gundam-assault-shroud','Bandai HGSEED R02 GAT-X102 Duel Gundam Assault Shroud - Newtype','<p>To coincide with the 10th anniversary of &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam SEED,&quot; Bandai has rereleased this hugely popular HG kit of the Duel Gundam Assault Shroud in a &#039;remastered&#039; color that reflects those seen on the Blu-ray release! A stand attachment and marking stickers are also included!    Product Features  Made of plastic From the &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam SEED&quot; series Action Base Not Included        Box Contents  Pieces to build: Duel Gundam Assault Shroud Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed\"}','2026-02-09 22:40:13','2026-02-09 22:40:13'),
(2076,57,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/Zi4RJDKHFkeXp7dB0X1O/h/delpi-decal-hg-rising-freedom-gundam','Delpi Decal HG Rising Freedom Gundam - Newtype','<p>HG 1/144 Rising Freedom Gundam Decals High-quality waterslide decals from Delpi! **Refer to product images for instructions on decal placement.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-09 22:43:13','2026-02-09 22:43:13'),
(2077,68,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/lDc2RTeOZZUrY4XjzJ92/h/hgce-201-zgmf-x20a-strike-freedom-gundam-revive','Bandai HGCE 201 ZGMF-X20A Strike Freedom Gundam (Revive) - Newtype','<p>An updated design of the Strike Freedom from &quot;Gundam Seed Destiny&quot; recreated with new proportion and part separation technology. Includes 2 beam rifles that can also combine, hip mounted rail guns that can fold back for storage, beam shield, and 2 beam sabers.       Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic Part of the High Grade Cosmic Era series From the Gundam SEED Destiny anime        Box Contents  Pieces to build   Strike Freedom Gundam​ Beam shield 2 Beam sabers Foil sticker   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed Destiny\"}','2026-02-09 22:44:14','2026-02-09 22:44:14'),
(2078,99,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/NaBuqif8u8VA1f0MQKEY/h/hgbf-017-wing-gundam-fenice-rinascita','Bandai HGBF 017 Wing Gundam Fenice Rinascita - Newtype','<p>The Wing Gundam Fenice Rinascita from Gundam Build Fighters is ready for battle! In addition to an array of weapons, Wing Gundam Fenice Rinascita has the ability to transform from its robot form to a flying bird form.      Product Features  5 inches (12.7cm) 1/144 scale Made of plastic Based on the Gundam Build Fighters anime Transforms from robot to bird mode        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Wing Gundam Fenice Rinascita Buster rifle with detachable second gun Beam sword Beam saber 2 Beam mantles   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Build Fighters\"}','2026-02-09 22:46:11','2026-02-09 22:46:11'),
(2079,205,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/ffsOQ1HpVmxSQxN5fGW8/h/hg-ashsaviour','Bandai HG Ashsaviour - Newtype','<p>From the Super Robot Wars OG series, the Ashsaviour arrives in 1/144 scale as part of the HG (High Grade) model kit collection. This meticulously designed model brings the iconic Ashsaviour to life, featuring incredible details and articulation. This kit is equipped with all the essential features that define the Ashsaviour&#039;s combat power. The deployable Sword Breaker, one of the Ashsaviour’s signature weapons, is included with a display base to showcase it in its extended form. The Hulbert Launcher, a key weapon, has a fully unfolding barrel to recreate dramatic action poses, while a special warhead part allows you to simulate the Fire Dagger attack, adding even more excitement to your display. The kit also includes the Gun Rapier and Laser Blades, expanding the combat options and ensuring that you can fully capture the Ashsaviour’s battle-ready versatility. For those who love dynamic posing, the set includes an Action Base 7, which grants even greater flexibility in showcasing this fearsome mecha in motion. Product Features  Made of plastic Based on the Super Robot Wars OG: Original Generations video game Part of the High Grade (HG) classification Multiple points of articulation Interchangeable parts and accessories  Instructions may or may not include English translation   Box Contents  Pieces to build  Ashsaviour Hulbert launcher Gun rapier 2 Laser blades Action base   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Super Robot (Getter/Mazinger)\", \"scale\": \"non\", \"series\": \"Super Robot Wars\"}','2026-02-09 22:47:12','2026-02-09 22:47:12'),
(2080,220,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/QM6A1n3j2AMQ37gssbJX/h/g-rework-hg-votoms-burglarydog-ex-part-set-2-decals','G-Rework HG VOTOMS Burglarydog + EX Part Set 2 Decals - Newtype','<p>High-quality waterslide decals from G-Rework!</p>','{\"brand\": \"Armored Trooper Votoms\", \"scale\": \"1/144\"}','2026-02-09 22:49:11','2026-02-09 22:49:11'),
(2081,219,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/LCtAWJagH9f79wvIKFo5/h/hg-dygenguar','Bandai HG DyGenGuar - Newtype','<p>The &quot;DyGenGuar,&quot; which boasts a deep-rooted popularity from its appearances in the &quot;Super Robot Wars OG&quot; series, now joins the HG model-kit lineup from Bandai in an anime-style design courtesy of Masami Obari! Two types of its sword, the &quot;Sanshiki Zankanto,&quot; are included -- normal and unfolded. Its various special moves, like the &quot;Dynamic Knuckle&quot; and &quot;General Blaster,&quot; can be expressed with powerful poses! The model is molded in different colors so that you can get an accurate result post-assembly. The back is expanded, and the thruster can be exposed. Various hand parts and a display base are included, too!    Product Features  Made of plastic From the &quot;Super Robot Wars OG&quot; video game Part of the &quot;High Grade&quot; line Highly detailed        Box Contents  Pieces to build:  DyGenGuar 2x Participation type sword Participation ceremony slashing ship sword (unfolded) Set of hand parts Display base     Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Super Robot (Getter/Mazinger)\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Super Robot Wars\"}','2026-02-09 22:50:12','2026-02-09 22:50:12'),
(2082,217,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/DLEaEZbTkyblFX3S5TMX/h/hg-gunleon','Bandai HG Gunleon - Newtype','<p>From the Super Robot Wars OG: Original Generation video game, the Gunleon joins Bandai&#039;s High Grade (HG) model kit line! Packed with a variety of weapon parts and accessories, this kit allows for dynamic poses and endless customization. One of the standout features is the massive Riot Jarenti weapon, measuring an impressive 9 inches in length when assembled, making it even larger than the Gunleon model itself. Complete with interchangeable parts and a detailed design, this kit is a must-have for fans of the series. Product Features  Made of plastic Based on Super Robot Wars OG: Original Generation  Part of the High Grade model kit line Features several weapon accessories for customization Includes articulated parts for dynamic posing Instructions may or may not contain English translation  Box Contents  Pieces to build Gunleon Riot Jarenti weapon 2 Gigue Guns Chain Decutter deployed parts Head parts set Magna mode parts set Set of hand parts Plastic sticker Jewel sticker Action Base 7 Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Super Robot (Getter/Mazinger)\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Super Robot Wars\"}','2026-02-09 22:52:12','2026-02-09 22:52:12'),
(2083,218,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/fOsWFpYpyXIkV7Xd2ijt/h/hg-huckebein-mk-iii','Bandai HG Huckebein Mk-III - Newtype','<p>From the &quot;Super Robot Wars OG&quot; series, the long-awaited Huckebein Mk-III is here! Recreate dynamic poses reminiscent of the series with a wide range of articulation and an array of equipped weaponry. It has armaments like the Graviton and Photon Rifles, interchangeable hand parts, and a display base. The grip of the Beam Sword can be attached to the rear skirt, the Photon Rifle can be mounted on the rear waist, and the Fang Slasher can be detached from the left arm and displayed in its extended form. The Multi-Trace Missile includes opening hatches on the containers and the ability to attach/detach from the back platform. The waist is movable with articulation gimmicks installed in the neck, chest, and abdomen. Enjoy dynamic action poses with its wide range of articulation!    Product Features  Made of plastic Based on the &quot;Super Robot Wars OG: Original Generation&quot; video game Part of the High Grade model kit line Features several weapon accessories for customization        Box Contents  Pieces to build:  Huckebein Mk-III Alternate pair of hands Graviton rifle Photon rifle Fang Slasher Multi-trace missiles 2x Beam swords     Display base Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Super Robot (Getter/Mazinger)\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Super Robot Wars\"}','2026-02-09 22:54:10','2026-02-09 22:54:10'),
(2084,221,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/V9uEKfvUMkb7rgvA9UxJ/h/armored-trooper-votoms-scopedog-turbo-custom-chirico-ver-d-style','Kotobukiya Armored Trooper Votoms Scopedog Turbo Custom (Chirico Ver.) - D Style - Newtype','<p>From the iconic real-robot anime Armored Trooper VOTOMS comes the Scopedog Turbo Custom, reimagined in Kotobukiya’s super-deformed D-STYLE format! This compact yet fully armed version features the custom unit piloted by the stoic hero Chirico Cuvie, complete with distinctive equipment and design details from the series. Despite its stylized proportions, the kit retains high mechanical detail and sharp panel lining. Molded in color and engineered for easy snap-fit assembly, the Scopedog Turbo Custom features movable joints, opening cockpit hatch, and includes a seated Chirico pilot figure for an added touch of authenticity. Perfect for fans of VOTOMS, SD mecha lovers, or builders looking for a fun and fierce desktop companion. Product Features:   Non-scale SD (super-deformed) plastic model kit   Based on Armored Trooper VOTOMS   Includes Turbo Custom parts unique to Chirico’s unit   Movable limbs and functional cockpit hatch   Color-molded parts   Includes unpainted seated Chirico Cuvie figure   Snap-fit assembly (no glue required)   Box Contents:   Pieces to build Scopedog Turbo Custom (Chirico Ver.)   Turbo backpack unit and weapons   Seated pilot figure: Chirico Cuvie   Optional hand parts   Instruction manual</p>','{\"line\": \"D Style\", \"brand\": \"Armored Trooper Votoms\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 22:55:12','2026-02-09 22:55:12'),
(2085,216,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/TItqIHvlHfktXtppYlRY/h/hg-wei-ritter','Bandai HG Weißritter - Newtype','<p>From Super Robot Wars OG: Original Generations, the Weissritter joins the High Grade classification model kit lineup! This articulated model kit allows for dynamic posing, capturing the iconic look and firepower of the legendary mecha. With its Okstand Launcher and Triple Beam Cannon, you can recreate action-packed battle scenes straight from the game. Add Weissritter to your collection today! Product Features  Made of plastic High Grade (HG) classification Based on Super Robot Wars OG: Original Generations  Multiple points of articulation Includes weaponry and interchangeable parts  Box Contents  Pieces to build Weissritter Okstand Launcher Triple Beam Cannon Hand parts set Action Base 7 Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Super Robot (Getter/Mazinger)\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Super Robot Wars\"}','2026-02-09 22:57:11','2026-02-09 22:57:11'),
(2086,41,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/EqC4ZcqzON7fixILTWtB/h/hgbc-015-lightning-back-weapon-system','Bandai HGBC 015 Lightning Back Weapon System - Newtype','<p>The Lightning Back Weapon System is designed for the Lightning Gundam, this booster conforms to all the standards of the Build Custom series! Streamlined support mechanism designed for easy kit Included:  Beam Cannon Unit x2 Rifle x1 Shield x1 Missile Pod x1</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Build Fighters\"}','2026-02-09 22:58:13','2026-02-09 22:58:13'),
(2087,62,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/Ek0RCIS5PNjebZuOwpMr/h/hgbd-r-001-earthree-gundam','Bandai HGBD:R 001 Earthree Gundam - Newtype','<p>From Gundam Build Divers RE:Rise, Hiroto&#039;s RX-78 inspired Core Gundam becomes the Earthree Gundam when docked with the Earth Armor. The Planets System, themed after the Milky Way, allows various Core Gundam equipment and armor customizations making it compatible with upgrade items that change the appearance and specs of the unit.  Earthree Gundam comes with rifle and shield.      Product Features  5 inches (12.70cm) Made of plastic From Gundam Build Divers RE:Rise Highly articulated figure once built Can be displayed as the RX-78 inspired Core Gundam Can transform to ship mode        Box Contents  Pieces to build    Earthree Gundam Rifle Shield</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Build Divers Re:Rise\"}','2026-02-09 23:00:12','2026-02-09 23:00:12'),
(2088,155,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/kb2DZqkZ2sAKTDh6czw6/h/hgbd-r-033-gundam-aegis-knight','Bandai HGBD:R 033 Gundam Aegis Knight - Newtype','<p>From Bandai Spirits, Aegis Knight, the successor to the Justice Knight, stands in 1/144 scale and becomes a highly articulated figure one complete. Standing over 5 inches tall, Aegis Knight can convert between Assault Mode, Flight Mode, and MS mode.      Product Features  5.51 inches (14cm) Made of plastic From Gundam Build Divers Re:Rise Highly articulated once built Can convert to three modes        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Gundam Aegis Knight  Lance Shield Beam saber Beam effects   Foil stickers</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Build Divers Re:Rise\"}','2026-02-09 23:01:14','2026-02-09 23:01:14'),
(2089,100,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/OZEFqqhNSMcB2Ql4hm9H/h/hgbf-005-beargguy-iii','Bandai HGBF 005 Beargguy III - Newtype','<p>HGBF Beargguy III</p>','{\"line\": \"Petit\'GGuy\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-09 23:03:12','2026-02-09 23:03:12'),
(2090,103,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/n0YEc2nxMyW4OXW7AuEH/h/hgbf-001-build-strike-gundam-full-package','Bandai HGBF 001 Build Strike Gundam Full Package - Newtype','<p>From the new anime Gundam Build Fighters, a Gunpla of the main character appears. A Gunpla created by Sei Iori, based on Strike Gundam from Mobile Suit Gundam SEED. A set of Build Strike Gundam and Build Booster. By combining them, it becomes Build Strike Gundam Full Package. Includes a full set of weapons as follows: a beam rifle, enhanced beam rifle, large-size beam cannon, beam saber, and Chobham shield. The color of Gundam and the scenes in the anime can be reproduced simply by building it. Runner x9, Foil sticker x1, Instruction manual x1</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"scale\": \"1/144\"}','2026-02-09 23:04:13','2026-02-09 23:04:13'),
(2091,95,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/w7JTjkkyEWB2cHBEm7H1/h/hgbf-010-gm-sniper-k9','Bandai HGBF 010 GM Sniper K9 - Newtype','<p>This GM Sniper K9 version not only has a rifle larger than any other GM Sniper but also a K9 companion that can attach to its back! As a bonus, all the base parts from the original GM Sniper II (including the 0080 weapons) are included. GM Sniper’s custom model is equipped with a large beam sniper rifle. Equipped with K9 Dog Pack.</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Build Fighters\"}','2026-02-09 23:05:13','2026-02-09 23:05:13'),
(2092,89,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/dGIQX7NVLzNZ2jySW9yR/h/hgbf-016-gundam-amazing-exia','Bandai HGBF 016 Gundam Amazing Exia - Newtype','<p>Based on the Gundam Build Fighters anime, the Amazing Exia model kit is in 1/144 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once complete. The Amazing Exia features a Sword weapon and shield parts.      Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic From the Gundam Build Fighters anime Fully articulated figure once complete        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Gundam Amazing Exia GN Drive backpack Trans-Am Booster backpack 2 Trans-Am GN Blades Amazing GN Sword Amazing GN Blade Beam Saber Amazing GN Shield 3 Alternate hands   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Build Fighters\"}','2026-02-09 23:07:12','2026-02-09 23:07:12'),
(2093,92,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/qJ0gWZ7IZMcjWlNbvDS4/h/hgbf-013-gundam-exia-dark-matter','Bandai HGBF 013 Gundam Exia Dark Matter - Newtype','<p>Based on the Gundam Build Fighters series, this evil version of the Gundam Exia is in 1/144 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once built. The model kit uses the original HG Exia R2 to create a heavy combat use design.      Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of ABS, PE, PS Based on Gundam Build Fighters Part of the High Grade Build Fighters model kit line        Box Contents  Pieces to build Gundam Exia Dark Matter Foil sticker Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Build Fighters\"}','2026-02-09 23:08:13','2026-02-09 23:08:13'),
(2094,88,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/NaBuqif8u8VA1f0MQKEY/h/hgbf-017-wing-gundam-fenice-rinascita','Bandai HGBF 017 Wing Gundam Fenice Rinascita - Newtype','<p>The Wing Gundam Fenice Rinascita from Gundam Build Fighters is ready for battle! In addition to an array of weapons, Wing Gundam Fenice Rinascita has the ability to transform from its robot form to a flying bird form.      Product Features  5 inches (12.7cm) 1/144 scale Made of plastic Based on the Gundam Build Fighters anime Transforms from robot to bird mode        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Wing Gundam Fenice Rinascita Buster rifle with detachable second gun Beam sword Beam saber 2 Beam mantles   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Build Fighters\"}','2026-02-09 23:09:13','2026-02-09 23:09:13'),
(2095,82,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/To7lwIoqy0lx7HNEDNnp/h/hgbf-043-kamiki-burning-gundam','Bandai HGBF 043 Kamiki Burning Gundam - Newtype','<p>The Kamiki Burning Gundam from Gundam Build Fighters Try is ready for battle! In addition to an array of weapons, Kamiki Burning Gundam features a sword that can be mounted on the rear waist and a flame effect part.      Product Features  5 inches (12.7cm) 1/144 scale Made of plastic Based on the Build Fighters Try anime        Box Contents  Piece to build   Kamiki Burning Gundam Sword Flame effect part    Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Build Fighters\"}','2026-02-09 23:10:13','2026-02-09 23:10:13'),
(2096,17,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/GalBnMsEE5t51VXmjywK/h/hgbf-040-lightning-z-gundam','Bandai HGBF 040 Lightning Z Gundam - Newtype','<p>This completely remodeled Zeta Gundam appears in the Gundam Build Fighters Try TV series and comes with the ability to mount its back wings on its arms to produce a powerful phoenix attack.      Product Features  Approx 5 inches tall 1/144 Scale Made of plastic High Grade        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Lightning Z Gundam Beam rifle Shield Beam wing effect parts   Seal Instruction manual.</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Build Fighters\"}','2026-02-09 23:12:13','2026-02-09 23:12:13'),
(2097,98,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/TIi9Hd5HBdkGDvGXE6ZI/h/hgbf-007-sengoku-astray-gundam','Bandai HGBF 007 Sengoku Astray Gundam - Newtype','<p>The Sengoku Astray Gundam from Gundam Build Fighters is ready for battle! In addition to an array of weapons, Sengoku Astray Gundam features two katanas mounted on additional hidden arms in the shoulder binders, this custom Gundam also features a devil shield on its back.      Product Features  1/144 scale Made of plastic Based on the Gundam Build Fighters anime        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Sengoku Astray Gundam Kiku-ichimonji katana Kotetsu katana Devil shield   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Build Fighters\"}','2026-02-09 23:13:14','2026-02-09 23:13:14'),
(2098,96,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/6l6hyAG7o4HbWps5D45Y/h/hgbf-009-star-build-strike-gundam-plavsky-wing','Bandai HGBF 009 Star Build Strike Gundam Plavsky Wing - Newtype','<p>The Star Build Strike Gundam Plavsky Wing from Gundam Build Fighters is ready for battle! In addition to an array of weapons, Star Build Strike Gundam Plavsky Wing includes beam wing effects, a beam rifle, 2 beam sabers, a shield, and a rear beam cannon.       Product Features  5 inches (12.7cm) 1/144 scale Made of plastic Based on the Gundam Build Fighters anime        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Star Build Strike Gundam Plavsky Wing Beam wing effects Beam rifle 2 Beam sabers Shield 2 Rear beam cannons Display base   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Build Fighters\"}','2026-02-09 23:14:14','2026-02-09 23:14:14'),
(2099,85,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/VjcL1wZCLREeZs8jYzO5/h/hgbf-034-transient-gundam','Bandai HGBF 034 Transient Gundam - Newtype','<p>Based on Gundam Build Fighters Honoo, this model kit of Transient Gundam is in 1/144 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once complete. The model kit includes two giant lances and features a white an blue color scheme.      Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of PS and PE Based on Gundam Build Fighters Honoo Part of the High Grade Build Fighters model kit line        Box Contents  Pieces to build   Transient Gundam 2 Lances Pedestal Alternate hand parts   Foil seal Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Build Fighters\"}','2026-02-09 23:15:15','2026-02-09 23:15:15'),
(2100,86,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/j7TJgwvd9h1ls44Irb3I/h/hgbf-028-try-burning-gundam','Bandai HGBF 028 Try Burning Gundam - Newtype','<p>The Try Burning Gundam from Gundam Build Fighters Try is ready for battle! In addition to an array of weapons, Try Burning Gundam includes the fiery punch, kick, back, and flame effect parts as well as four different types of hands showcasing martial arts gestures.       Product Features  5 inches (12.7cm) 1/144 scale Made of plastic Based on the Build Fighters Try video shorts Action Base not included        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Try Burning Gundam Fiery punch Fiery kick Fiery back Flame effect parts 4 Types of hand parts   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Build Fighters\"}','2026-02-09 23:16:15','2026-02-09 23:16:15'),
(2101,72,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/gIm646TC8M7EG81wgami/h/fg-1-144-ms-06f-j-zaku','Bandai FG 1/144 MS-06F/J Zaku - Newtype','<p>The First Grade (FG) kits were released as part of the Gundam 20th Anniversary Big Bang Project in 1999 as a modern remake of the original 1980s 1/144 kits. The kits are molded in one color and contain no polycaps, but feature snap-fit assembly of current kits.</p>','{\"line\": \"FG - First Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\"}','2026-02-09 23:17:14','2026-02-09 23:17:14'),
(2102,83,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/TnEoVV8rI2teS50IW7Ke/h/hgce-192-zgmf-x10a-freedom-gundam-revive','Bandai HGCE 192 ZGMF-X10A Freedom Gundam (Revive) - Newtype','<p>The popular Freedom Gundam re-appears in the HG line with wonderful new proportion and increased range of movement to replicate its signature appearances from the Gundam Seed TV series.      Product Features  Approx 5 inches tall 1/144 Scale Made of plastic High Grade Action Base not included        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Freedom Gundam Beam rifle Beam shield Beam sabers Rail guns Shoulder beam cannons   Foil sticker Instruction manual</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed\"}','2026-02-09 23:18:15','2026-02-09 23:18:15'),
(2103,126,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/DpcxdVXCxEN8HyrHUKDc/h/hgfc-110-god-gundam','Bandai HGFC 110 God Gundam - Newtype','<p>The GF13-017NJII God Gundam is here as a 1/144 scale model kit! Once complete you can pose this figure with the variety of accessories it arrives with for endless, action-packed scenes! The iconic God Finger attack is represented with clear orange hand parts! A great addition to any Mobile Suit Gundam collection.      Product Features  1/144 scale Made of plastic Part of the High Grad model kit line Transforms to Hyper Mode        Box Contents  Pieces to build  GF13-017NJII God Gundam 3 Sets of hands God Finger hands 2 Beam sabers Corelander   Stickers Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"G Gundam\"}','2026-02-09 23:20:12','2026-02-09 23:20:12'),
(2104,296,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/HnxLl9ylOFSCVGRedmi3/h/hguc-144-base-jabber-unicorn-ver','Bandai HGUC 144 Base Jabber (Unicorn Ver.) - Newtype','<p>This E.F.S.F Sub Flight System, also known as the Base Jabber, consists of some very large (for an HGUC) parts but don&#039;t let that fool you.  There&#039;s plenty of detail to be found.  The Base Jabber is designed to work with a variety of 1/144 scale HG kits and even comes with foil marking stickers for extra detail.  It is able to mount to a Bandai Action Base or can stand on its own thanks to included landing gear parts. Pictured on the box art is the 1/144 HGUC RGM-96X Jesta Gundam which is sold separately.</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Unicorn\"}','2026-02-09 23:21:12','2026-02-09 23:21:12'),
(2105,34,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/ZGZ33euQtCn6px9ZnxXe/h/hguc-007-rx-75-guntank','Bandai HGUC 007 RX-75 Guntank - Newtype','<p>Add to your model kit collection with this RX-75 Guntank Gundam! Once this snap-assembly kit is complete you can pose the arms, cannons and head, plus the tracks are easy to attach and give an accurate appearance to the Guntank Gundam.      Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic From Mobile Suit Gundam Part of the High Grade model kit series        Box Contents  Pieces to build RX-75 Guntank Gundam Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\"}','2026-02-09 23:22:14','2026-02-09 23:22:14'),
(2106,27,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/MP5EicVMcP57mU2i0duG/h/hguc-100-unicorn-gundam-destroy-mode','Bandai HGUC 100 Unicorn Gundam (Destroy Mode) - Newtype','<p>The titular mobile suit from the OVA series “Gundam Unicorn,” as a 1/144 model kit. Features translucent pink/red plastic to replicate its psyco frame and is equipped with beam magnum and shield. Impressive articulation at a small scale, it can be put into iconic poses from the anime.       Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of PS, PE, and PVC Based on Gundam Unicorn Part of the High Grade Universal Century model kit line        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Unicorn Gundam (Destroy Mode)  Beam magnum Shield   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Unicorn\"}','2026-02-09 23:23:16','2026-02-09 23:23:16'),
(2107,129,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/08a0FlPXHOKa1DEzatHN/h/hguc-103-rgz-95-rezel','Bandai HGUC 103 RGZ-95 ReZEL - Newtype','<p>The transformable mass-production ReZEL from &quot;Gundam Unicorn&quot; is now offered as part of the HGUC line. The ReZEL is capable of switching between its Mobile Suit mode and Wave Rider mode. The RGZ-95 is loaded with armament and they are all included here such as its Beam Rifle, Beam Saber, built in 60mm Vulcans and Grenade Launcher, and Beam Cannon which it also uses as a shield. Plenty of poly-caps are used ensuring great articulation and easy transformation between modes.</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Unicorn\"}','2026-02-09 23:25:13','2026-02-09 23:25:13'),
(2108,270,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/ln88wBen854Kbqpje3Bw/h/hguc-111-zz-gundam','Bandai HGUC 111 ZZ Gundam - Newtype','<p>Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam ZZ anime, this ZZ Gundam model kit is in 1/144 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once built.      Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of PS, PE, and PVC Based on Mobile Suit Gundam ZZ Part of the High Grade Universal Century model kit line        Box Contents  Pieces to build ZZ Gundam Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam ZZ\"}','2026-02-09 23:27:12','2026-02-09 23:27:12'),
(2109,291,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/3z0iG8rKbI0XNssAI4sN/h/hguc-116-sinanju','Bandai HGUC 116 Sinanju - Newtype','<p>Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn anime, this MSN-06S Sinanju model kit is in 1/144 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once built.       Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of PS, PE, and PVC Based on Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn Part of the High Grade Universal Century model kit line        Box Contents  Pieces to build MSN-06S Sinanju Grenade Launcher Beam Rifle Beam Axe  2 Deployed hilts 2 Storage hilts   2 Beam Sabers Shield Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Unicorn\"}','2026-02-09 23:28:13','2026-02-09 23:28:13'),
(2110,39,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/66Q6Jea5YDubDvW3lzXq/h/hguc-117-gouf-custom','Bandai HGUC 117 Gouf Custom - Newtype','<p>Based on Mobile Suit Gundam: The 08th MS Team, this Gouf Custom model kit is in 1/144 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once built.       Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of PS, PE, and PVC Based on Mobile Suit Gundam: The 08th MS Team Part of the High Grade Universal Century model kit line        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Gouf Custom 35 MM machine gun Gatling gun Heat Saber Shield   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"The 08th MS Team\"}','2026-02-09 23:29:13','2026-02-09 23:29:13'),
(2111,118,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/XBcwHnyXub9GL7GQ1uGz/h/hguc-134-rx-0-unicorn-02-banshee-destroy-mode','Bandai HGUC 134 RX-0 Unicorn 02 Banshee (Destroy Mode) - Newtype','<p>From the anime series, Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn comes a 1/144 scale model kit of the Unicorn Gundam 02 Banshee in Destroy mode configuration! The model kit is fully poseable once assembled and features translucent frame parts.       Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of PE and PS From the anime series Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn Fully poseable figure once assembled        Box Contents  Pieces to build   Unicorn Gundam 02 Banshee Shield 2 Beam sabers Beam Magnum   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Unicorn\"}','2026-02-09 23:30:16','2026-02-09 23:30:16'),
(2112,117,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/wFTcXgHufjgsNQ9RTVRQ/h/hguc-136-delta-gundam','Bandai HGUC 136 Delta Gundam - Newtype','<p>From the Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn comes this 1/144 scale model of the MSN-001 Delta Gundam.       Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic  Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn series  Part of the High Grade Universal Century model kit line  Action Base not included        Box Contents  Pieces to build   Delta Gundam Large rifle Shield 2 Beam sabers   Foil decals Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Unicorn\"}','2026-02-09 23:31:15','2026-02-09 23:31:15'),
(2113,116,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/zyFFHDLGlkgkm44mCscO/h/hguc-139-juaggu-unicorn-ver','Bandai HGUC 139 Juaggu (Unicorn Ver.) - Newtype','<p>From the anime series, Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn comes a 1/144 scale model kit of the Juaggu (Unicorn ver.) Gundam! The model kit is fully poseable once assembled.      Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of PE and PS From the anime series Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn Fully poseable figure once assembled        Box Contents  Pieces to build Juaggu (Unicorn Ver.) Foil Seal Lead wire Marking seal PET sheet Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Unicorn\"}','2026-02-09 23:33:13','2026-02-09 23:33:13'),
(2114,114,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/q7yLLiLAwhBixbd122J6/h/hguc-141-rsa-96-anksha','Bandai HGUC 141 RSA-96 Anksha - Newtype','<p>During the events of Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn, the Earth Federation employed the RAS-96 Anksha, a Mass Production Transformable Mobile Suit, to defend their massive atmospheric transport ships such as the Garuda. The RAS-96 Anksha is the successor to the NRX-044 Asshimar developed by the Titans, of which it shares its iconic circular Mobile Armor Mode. To reduce production costs, the RAS-96 Anksha adopted many components from the readily available RGM-89 Jegan. These changes give the RAS-96 Anksha an appearance closer to standard Federation Mobile Suits than its predecessor. The HGUC RAS-96 Anksha model kit includes:  Shield Binder x2 Beam Saber x2 Display Stand</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Unicorn\"}','2026-02-09 23:34:16','2026-02-09 23:34:16'),
(2115,23,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/QP2RllJwAIzGEs3U1xXa/h/hguc-155-rx-90-g-ez-8-gundam-ez8','Bandai HGUC 155 RX-90[G]Ez-8 Gundam Ez8 - Newtype','<p>Gundam RX-79[G] EZ-8 is here in 1/144th scale as part of the High Grade model kit line up! Once complete you can pose in a wide range of action-packed scenes with a variety of accessories! This kit is the perfect addtion to any Mobile Suit Gundam collection.      Product Features  1/144 scale Made of plastic Highly articulated Part of the High Grade model kit line        Box Contents  Pieces to build   RX-79[G] EZ-8 Gundam Shield 2 Guns Jet pack Beam saber   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"The 08th MS Team\"}','2026-02-09 23:36:12','2026-02-09 23:36:12'),
(2116,269,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/nWdunqEu46k8sU6a24y6/h/hguc-157-pmx-000-messala','Bandai HGUC 157 PMX-000 Messala - Newtype','<p>Large transformable model kit of the Messala, the first of villain Paptimus Scirroco&#039;s original creations, from &quot;Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam&quot; featuring opening missile pods, claw arm and beam sabers. Transformation between robot to mobile armor mode is accomplished through part swapping and comes with a custom stand to store extra parts. This will be only the second model kit of this design to ever be released in 27 years.</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Zeta Gundam\"}','2026-02-09 23:37:13','2026-02-09 23:37:13'),
(2117,106,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/JgJibzCF55NGjnJPWm1u/h/hguc-158-base-jabber-type-89','Bandai HGUC 158 Base Jabber Type 89 - Newtype','<p>Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn episode 6, comes this 1/144 scale model of the base jabber from the sub-flight system. When the tank on the back is removed, the MS mounting surface is exposed, and MS can be mounted on both front and back sides. (Other models are not included)      Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam UC anime Tank can be removed to reveal mounting surface Other models are not included        Box Contents  Pieces to build Type 89 Base Jabber Action base 1 compatible joint Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Unicorn\"}','2026-02-09 23:38:13','2026-02-09 23:38:13'),
(2118,290,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/qWVHQmsME8AuvRosKAsb/h/hguc-161-zogok-unicorn-ver','Bandai HGUC 161 Zogok (Unicorn Ver.) - Newtype','<p>Based on Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn, this Zogok (Unicorn Ver.) model kit is in 1/144 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once built.       Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of PS, PE Based on Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn Part of the High Grade Universal Century model kit line        Box Contents  Pieces to build   Zogok (Unicorn Ver.)  Heat Saber Backpack 2 Strum Faust Boomerang Cutter   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Unicorn\"}','2026-02-09 23:39:14','2026-02-09 23:39:14'),
(2119,101,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/nEoORZ2OVjltXsBeSIoL/h/hguc-164-nemo-unicorn-desert-color-ver','Bandai HGUC 164 Nemo (Unicorn Desert Color Ver.) - Newtype','<p>The HGUC MSA-003 Nemo Unicorn Desert Color Version is precisely that! It’s the updated design of the MSA-003 Nemo in Desert Deployment colors as seen in the Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn animated series. Anaheim originally developed the Nemo to support the limited number of Mobile Suits possessed by the AEUG during the Gryps War. Ten years later, the Earth Federation still had a large number of Nemo MS in operation. The HGUC MSA-003 Nemo Unicorn Desert Color Version features an alternate color pattern to repaint the recycled Mobile Suits. Here is what comes along with the MSA-003 Nemo Unicorn Desert Color Version:  90mm GM Rifle BOWA·BR-S-85-C2 Beam Rifle Shield Beam Saber x2</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Unicorn\"}','2026-02-09 23:40:14','2026-02-09 23:40:14'),
(2120,22,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/lUAm4jL7JjfYnsDbi1dq/h/hguc-167-gundam-f91','Bandai HGUC 167 Gundam F91 - Newtype','<p>From the anime Mobile Suit Gundam F91 comes a model kit of the F91 Gundam F91 in 1/144 scale! The model kit is fully poseable once assembled and comes armed with a beam rifle, two beam sabers, a beam launcher, and a beam shield.      Product Features  1/144 scale Made of PE and PS From the anime series Mobile Suit Gundam Fully poseable figure once assembled Comes armed with a beam rifle, 2 beam sabers, beam launcher, and beam shield        Box Contents  Pieces to build  F91 Gundam F91 Beam rifle 2 Beam sabers Beam launcher Beam shield   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam F91\"}','2026-02-09 23:41:14','2026-02-09 23:41:14'),
(2121,97,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/rLQK0SKPsbGLRQOXKQDL/h/hguc-170-silver-bullet','Bandai HGUC 170 Silver Bullet - Newtype','<p>Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn anime, this Silver Bullet Gundam model kit is in the 1/144 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once built.       Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of PS, PE, and PVC Based on Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn Part of the High Grade Universal Century model kit line        Box Contents  Pieces to build Silver Bullet Gundam  Anti-ship missiles Beam Launcher Beam Saber Beam Rifle Shield Hand parts   Beam Hands  Wires Joint parts Display stand   Foil Seal  Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Unicorn\"}','2026-02-09 23:42:15','2026-02-09 23:42:15'),
(2122,40,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/XT9x0ShbQGY8vy6EWqpV/h/hguc-173-amx-014-doven-wolf','Bandai HGUC 173 AMX-014 Doven Wolf - Newtype','<p>The formidable Doven Wolf, as seen in Mobile Suit Gundam ZZ, joins the High Grade Universal Century line in! This powerful Neo Zeon mobile suit combines overwhelming firepower with a bulky, menacing silhouette—and Bandai’s HG kit captures every detail. Featuring excellent articulation for its size and armored design, the kit includes its signature wired beam cannons mounted on flexible leads, allowing for dynamic attack poses. Also included are beam sabers, a beam rifle, and additional hand parts for varied display options. Color-separated parts and foil stickers help recreate its screen-accurate appearance without the need for paint. Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic Based on Mobile Suit Gundam ZZ  Includes wired beam cannons, beam rifle, and beam sabers Flexible leads for effect poses with remote weaponry  Snap-fit construction; color-separated parts Compatible with action bases (sold separately)   Box Contents  Parts to build Doven Wolf Beam rifle, beam sabers, wired beam cannons Interchangeable hand parts Foil stickers Assembly instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam ZZ\"}','2026-02-09 23:43:15','2026-02-09 23:43:15'),
(2123,273,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/MlClq0VhhdTbMW6p12Ru/h/hguc-018-rx-78-gp01fb-gundam','Bandai HGUC 018 RX-78 GP01FB Gundam - Newtype','<p>Based on Mobile Suit Gundam 0083: Stardust Memory, the RX-78GP01-Fb Gundam Zephyranthes Full Burnern model kit is in 1/144 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once complete. The RX-78GP01-Fb Gundam Zephyranthes comes with a shield and beam rifle and features a removeable core fighter.      Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic From Mobile Suit Gundam 0083: Stardust Memory Fully articulated figure once complete        Box Contents  Pieces to build RX-78GP01-Fb Gundam Zephyranthes Core Fighter II Full Burnern Beam Saber Beam Rifle Shield Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam 0083: Stardust Memory\"}','2026-02-09 23:44:16','2026-02-09 23:44:16'),
(2124,35,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/Sy5vhf0yHSu7B0je3t7P/h/hguc-020-rgm-79-gm','Bandai HGUC 020 RGM-79 GM - Newtype','<p>Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam anime series, this RGM-79 GM model kit is in 1/144 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once built.       Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of PS, PE, and PVC Based on Mobile Suit Gundam Part of the High Grade Universal Century model kit line        Box Contents  Pieces to build RGM-79 GM Beam Spray Gun Beam Saber Backpack Shield Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\"}','2026-02-09 23:46:14','2026-02-09 23:46:14'),
(2125,36,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/HnxLl9ylOFSCVGRedmi3/h/hguc-144-base-jabber-unicorn-ver','Bandai HGUC 144 Base Jabber (Unicorn Ver.) - Newtype','<p>This E.F.S.F Sub Flight System, also known as the Base Jabber, consists of some very large (for an HGUC) parts but don&#039;t let that fool you.  There&#039;s plenty of detail to be found.  The Base Jabber is designed to work with a variety of 1/144 scale HG kits and even comes with foil marking stickers for extra detail.  It is able to mount to a Bandai Action Base or can stand on its own thanks to included landing gear parts. Pictured on the box art is the 1/144 HGUC RGM-96X Jesta Gundam which is sold separately.</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Unicorn\"}','2026-02-09 23:47:12','2026-02-09 23:47:12'),
(2126,63,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/grg4LbJcYDPxtATzQNJE/h/hguc-229-penelope','Bandai HGUC 229 Penelope - Newtype','<p>The huge mobile suit featured in Hathaway&#039;s Flash, the Penelope was recreated with an updated modern design styling supervised by Hajime Katoki. Standing over 9 inches tall when completed, the Penelope surpasses the height of most MG models despite being only 1/144 scale, and features a dense substructure layered by many parts. The Penelope can separate from its flight unit to its original Oddyseus Gundam base form and features beam rifle, shield, and beam sabers.      Product Features  9.5 inches (24.13cm) 1/144 Scale Part of the High Grade Universal Century model kit series Based on the Penelope&#039;s appearance in Hathaway&#039;s Flash Can separate from its flight unit to its original Oddyseus Gundam base form        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Penelope Beam rifle Shield Beam sabers Display stand for fixed flight unit   Stickers Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Hathaway\"}','2026-02-09 23:48:17','2026-02-09 23:48:17'),
(2127,32,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/sve0xTIrhRvnf70f2ijF/h/hguc-031-amx-107-bawoo-mass-production','Bandai HGUC 031 AMX-107 Bawoo Mass Production - Newtype','<p>The AMX-107 Bawoo makes its (re)appearance in 1/144 scale in the HGUC line, this time molded in green instead of red! This kit transforms from flight to fight mode just like it does in Gundam ZZ. Includes:  AMX-107 Bawoo Beam Rifle Beam Saber Manipulators  Trigger-finger (right only) Weapon-holding (1 pair)   a sheet of foil stickers a sheet with a single sticker decal</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam ZZ\"}','2026-02-09 23:49:16','2026-02-09 23:49:16'),
(2128,600,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/LVcJIoNP3iCT0U8vsqYX/h/hguc-042-orx-005-gaplant','Bandai HGUC 042 ORX-005 Gaplant - Newtype','<p>Featuring enhanced transformation gimmicks and an included display stand, this kit is ready to pose! Its main weapons are the massive shoulder cannons, but an extra beam saber is also included.       Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic Part of the High Grade Universal Century model kit line        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Gaplant Beam saber Display stand   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Zeta Gundam\"}','2026-02-09 23:50:17','2026-02-09 23:50:17'),
(2129,147,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/HnxLl9ylOFSCVGRedmi3/h/hguc-144-base-jabber-unicorn-ver','Bandai HGUC 144 Base Jabber (Unicorn Ver.) - Newtype','<p>This E.F.S.F Sub Flight System, also known as the Base Jabber, consists of some very large (for an HGUC) parts but don&#039;t let that fool you.  There&#039;s plenty of detail to be found.  The Base Jabber is designed to work with a variety of 1/144 scale HG kits and even comes with foil marking stickers for extra detail.  It is able to mount to a Bandai Action Base or can stand on its own thanks to included landing gear parts. Pictured on the box art is the 1/144 HGUC RGM-96X Jesta Gundam which is sold separately.</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Unicorn\"}','2026-02-09 23:52:12','2026-02-09 23:52:12'),
(2130,37,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/mu5vhg8l0kboQ63phBem/h/hguc-059-ms-09-dom-ms-09r-rick-dom','Bandai HGUC 059 MS-09 Dom/MS-09R Rick-Dom - Newtype','<p>Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam anime, this MS-09 Dom &amp;amp; MS-09R Rick-Dom model kit is in the 1/144 scale and allows you to recreate either the Dom or its space-variant the Rick Dom through the use of different parts. Once the model is complete it becomes a fully articulated figure.       Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of PS, PE, and PVC Based on Mobile Suit Gundam anime Part of the High-Grade Universal Century model kit line        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Dom or Rick-Dom Bazooka Beam saber   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\"}','2026-02-09 23:53:13','2026-02-09 23:53:13'),
