(2133,42,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/bUzpp3Dphm0uO9AOj8Cz/h/hguc-083-jagd-doga-gyunei-guss-custom','Bandai HGUC 083 Jagd Doga (Gyunei Guss Custom) - Newtype','<p>Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam: Char&#039;s Counterattack film, the Jagd Doga (Gyunei Guss Custom) model kit is in 1/144 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once complete. Jagd Doga comes armed with several pieces of weaponry.      Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic From Mobile Suit Gundam: Char&#039;s Counterattack Fully articulated figure once complete        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Jagd Doga Beam saber with attached heat knife 2 Triple missile launchers Beam assault rifle   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Char\'s Counterattack\"}','2026-02-09 23:56:14','2026-02-09 23:56:14'),
(2134,138,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/OOSjViAA3GCItMoAzm6W/h/hguc-086-rx-93-nu-gundam','Bandai HGUC 086 RX-93 Nu Gundam - Newtype','<p>From the anime film Mobile Suit Gundam: Char&#039;s Counterattack, this is the final Gundam of Amuro Ray. It features individually articulated remote Fin Funnel weapons that can detach. Beam rifle, bazooka, custom beam saber and hidden beam saber are also included. The shield contains micro missiles and beam cannon.      Product Features  1/144 Scale From Mobile Suit Gundam: Char&#039;s Counterattack anime Features Artictulated Fin Funnel Weapons Has a hidden beam saber        Box Contents  Pieces to build  RX-93 Gundam Fin Funnel weapons Beam rifle Bazooka Beam saber</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Char\'s Counterattack\"}','2026-02-09 23:58:13','2026-02-09 23:58:13'),
(2135,136,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/HnxLl9ylOFSCVGRedmi3/h/hguc-144-base-jabber-unicorn-ver','Bandai HGUC 144 Base Jabber (Unicorn Ver.) - Newtype','<p>This E.F.S.F Sub Flight System, also known as the Base Jabber, consists of some very large (for an HGUC) parts but don&#039;t let that fool you.  There&#039;s plenty of detail to be found.  The Base Jabber is designed to work with a variety of 1/144 scale HG kits and even comes with foil marking stickers for extra detail.  It is able to mount to a Bandai Action Base or can stand on its own thanks to included landing gear parts. Pictured on the box art is the 1/144 HGUC RGM-96X Jesta Gundam which is sold separately.</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Unicorn\"}','2026-02-09 23:59:12','2026-02-09 23:59:12'),
(2136,46,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/bHXsxzhLAMsKB9Uw8ULr/h/hguc-091-geara-doga','Bandai HGUC 091 Geara Doga - Newtype','<p>The AMS-119 Geara Doga makes up the majority of Neo Zeon’s military force during the events of Mobile Suit Gundam: Char’s Counterattack. Like its predecessor, the MS-06 Zaku II, the AMS-119 Geara Doga used a multitude of equipment loadouts to take on specific combat roles. The AMS-119 Geara Doga offered very few advantages over other Mass-Produced MS but was easy to manufacture and cost-effective. This HGUC rendition builds into the AMS-119 Geara Doga in its most basic form. Included with the AMS-119 Geara Doga for accessories:  Beam Machine Gun Folding Shield Beam Tomahawk Beam Tomahawk (Standby) Sturm Faust x4</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Char\'s Counterattack\"}','2026-02-10 00:00:14','2026-02-10 00:00:14'),
