(2139,60,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/VfIUzZMDgknPSzFzTkHV/h/hguc-235-baund-doc','Bandai HGUC 235 Baund Doc - Newtype','<p>Celebrating 35 years of Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam, Bandai Spirits presents the 1/144 scale Baund Doc model kit. Standing over 7 inches tall, Baund Doc can transform from mobile suit to mobile armor.      Product Features  Approximately 7.50 inches tall (19cm) Made of plastic From Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam Transform from mobile suit to mobile armor        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Baund Doc Beam saber Scattering mega particle cannon  Designated display base    Stickers</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Zeta Gundam\"}','2026-02-10 00:04:12','2026-02-10 00:04:12'),
(2140,16,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/xk3OBjLhfXTO1defqZgF/h/hguc-200-hyaku-shiki-revive','Bandai HGUC 200 Hyaku-Shiki (Revive) - Newtype','<p>Piloted by Quatro Vageena in Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam, Hyaku-Shiki has been revived for the HGUC series. The characteristic gold color from the anime has been reproduced using metallic-colored plastic.       Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of PS, PE, and ABS From Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam Part of the High-Grade Universal Century model kit line Multiple eye stickers for creating different camera eye settings Action Base not included        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Hyaku-Shiki Beam rifle Clay bazooka 2 Beam sabers   Marking stickers</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Zeta Gundam\"}','2026-02-10 00:05:19','2026-02-10 00:05:19'),
(2141,594,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/9o8d1ORMfjiH9gUnHeOS/h/hguc-190-rx-77-2-guncannon-revive','Bandai HGUC 190 RX-77-2 Guncannon (Revive) - Newtype','<p>Add to your model kit collection with this 1/144 scale RX-77-2 Guncannon! Once complete it is highly poseable and comes with a variety of accessories to create endless, action-packed scenes!      Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic Part of the High Grade model kit line Highly poseable        Box Contents  Pieces to build  RX-77-2 Guncannon Rifle 2 Shoulder cannons Additional hand parts   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\"}','2026-02-10 00:07:17','2026-02-10 00:07:17'),
(2142,197,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/SfD8fH3kyYgKCb2JY9tf/h/frame-arms-girl-hresvelgr-invert','Kotobukiya Frame Arms Girl Hresvelgr=Invert - Newtype','<p>From the Frame Arms Girl anime, HRESVELGR=INVERT makes her debut in Kotobukiya’s Frame Arms Girl lineup! This unique version of HRESVELGR=ATER, which appears in the anime, is reimagined with an updated color scheme. The model kit offers two skin tone options: one based on her anime appearance and the other to match HRESVELGR=ATER. Additionally, the clear parts are enhanced with a striking red polarized coating. Product Features:  5.91 inches (15 cm) Made of PS, PE, ABS, POM, and PVC materials Highly articulated for dynamic posing Transforms into three modes: Normal Mode, Sidewinder Mode, and Airbike Mode English translation of instructions may not be included  Box Contents:  HRESVELGR=INVERT figure Armor set Helmet Weapons 4 Face plates Decals MB-42R Flying Base Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"Frame Arms Girl\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-10 00:09:14','2026-02-10 00:09:14'),
(2143,194,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/7igVgmJZq33oBOe08BcO/h/5mm-kamiyasu-sanding-stick-set-a','GodHand 5mm Kamiyasu Sanding Stick Set A - Newtype','<p>Long-lasting cutting power. Highly durable sanding sponge. Assorted set best for roughing and shaping. The GodHand Kamiyasu Sanding Stick 5mm Assortment Set A includes #120, #240, and #400 for roughing and shaping. The 5mm thickness with a firm texture is ideal for flattening and shaving loose surfaces. The sanding sponge is made of a highly durable fabric file. Unlike sandpaper, the fabric file is general-purpose and applicable to various situations, such as surface processing of curved and flat surfaces. Various lineups are available to satisfy many applications. The sanding sponges are color-coded and number-printed for easy identification. They are printed with water-resistant ink, which does not dissolve easily during water polishing.  The 5mm thickness with a firm texture is ideal for flattening and shaving loose surfaces. Ideal for sharpening inverted R surfaces and sharpening in confined spaces Set A includes #120, #240, and #400 for roughing and shaping File with long-lasting cutting power Excellent cost performance for long-lasting use after removal of cutting dust Resists wrinkling even when folded Possible to cut into the desired shape Hard to tear, so easy to pick up and use with tweezers Dry and wet polishing compatible Color-coded and printed letters on the sanding sponge enable easy identification  Product Details:  Thickness: approx. 5 mm Dimensions: approx. 105 x 20 mm Grit: #120 x 1pc, #240 x 2pcs, #400 x 2pcs  ⚠NOTE  Soaking in water for a long time or exposure to solvents such as lacquer may cause the adhesive to dissolve and peel off Please keep out of reach of children Please wear protective glasses and a dust mask during use Scratches and dirt on the file surface are not a problem in use Please note that printing may peel off if used with force</p>',NULL,'2026-02-10 00:10:16','2026-02-10 00:10:16'),
(2144,193,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/p2TmphrUC4wtARWplpPw/h/5mm-kamiyasu-sanding-stick-set-b','GodHand 5mm Kamiyasu Sanding Stick Set B - Newtype','<p>Long-lasting cutting power. Highly durable sanding sponge. Assorted set best for roughing and shaping. The GodHand Kamiyasu Sanding Stick 5mm Assortment Set B includes #600, #800, and #1000 for roughing and shaping. The 5mm thickness with a firm texture is ideal for flattening and shaving loose surfaces. The sanding sponge is made of a highly durable fabric file. Unlike sandpaper, the fabric file is general-purpose and applicable to various situations, such as surface processing of curved and flat surfaces. Various lineups are available to satisfy many applications. The sanding sponges are color-coded and number-printed for easy identification. They are printed with water-resistant ink, which does not dissolve easily during water polishing.  The 5mm thickness with a firm texture is ideal for flattening and shaving loose surfaces. Ideal for sharpening inverted R surfaces and sharpening in confined spaces Set B includes #600, #800, and #1000 for roughing and shaping File with long-lasting cutting power Excellent cost performance for long-lasting use after removal of cutting dust Resists wrinkling even when folded Possible to cut into the desired shape Hard to tear, so easy to pick up and use with tweezers Dry and wet polishing compatible Color-coded and printed letters on the sanding sponge enable easy identification  Product Details:  Thickness: approx. 5 mm Dimensions: approx. 105 x 20 mm Grit: #600 x 2pcs, #800 x 2pcs, #1000 x 1pc  ⚠NOTE  Soaking in water for a long time or exposure to solvents such as lacquer may cause the adhesive to dissolve and peel off Please keep out of reach of children Please wear protective glasses and a dust mask during use Scratches and dirt on the file surface are not a problem in use Please note that printing may peel off if used with force</p>',NULL,'2026-02-10 00:12:14','2026-02-10 00:12:14'),
(2145,659,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/eweDZD7vjcUCBfV7f5Lw/h/moderoid-linebarrel-overdrive','Good Smile Company Moderoid Linebarrel Overdrive - Newtype','<p>Linebarrel Overdrive from &quot;Linebarrels of Iron&quot; is now a &quot;MODEROID&quot; plastic model kit from Good Smile Company! It has several articulation points for posability after assembly, and it can be displayed in &quot;Overdrive&quot; mode using interchangeable parts. It comes with the &quot;Executor&quot; weapon, two swords, and interchangeable hands. The Executor connects to the tail stabilizer with a lead wire. The Overdrive mode can also be created by rearranging some parts! Decals for its markings are included. It&#039;s molded in different colors with some pre-painted parts, so it&#039;s easy to get a great result just by assembling it without the need for paint!    Product Features  7.09 inches (18cm) Made of plastic From the &quot;Linebarrels of Iron&quot; manga series Part of the &quot;Moderoid&quot; line Fully articulated figure when complete        Box Contents  Pieces to build:  Linebarrel Overdrive Interchangeable parts Interchangeable hand parts Executor weapon 2x Swords   Decals Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"Moderoid\", \"brand\": \"Linebarrels of Iron\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-10 00:13:15','2026-02-10 00:13:15'),
(2146,128,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/y6L4YTh7RmjTPFoeeOCN/h/mega-1-48-scale-rx-0-unicorn-gundam-destroy-mode','Bandai MEGA 1/48 Scale RX-0 Unicorn Gundam (Destroy Mode) - Newtype','<p>Mega Size Rx-0 Unicorn Gundam (destroy Mode)</p>','{\"line\": \"Mega Size\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/48\", \"series\": \"Gundam Unicorn\"}','2026-02-10 00:15:14','2026-02-10 00:15:14'),
(2147,156,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/ANUiFL4h8hAeyDJm6hsT/h/mg-00-qan-t-full-saber','Bandai MG 00 QAN[T] Full Saber - Newtype','<p>The variant of the 00 QAN[T] featured in Mobile Suit Gundam 00V: Battlefield Record will be joining the MG series!  The &quot;GN Sword IV Full Saber&quot; and armaments with various functions can be recreated using newly designed parts. The back section of the kit can be equipped with a GN condenser and a stand for the GN Sword IV is also included. A new head antenna designed to resemble Kanetake Ebikawa&#039;s design images will be included as a bonus part.      Product Features  7 inches (17.78cm) Made of plastic From Mobile Suit Gundam 00V: Battlefield Record New head antenna designed to resemble Kanetake Ebikawa&#039;s design Fully articulated once complete        Box Contents  Pieces to build  00 Qan[T] GN Sword IV 3 GN Gun blades GN Sword V GN Sword bits GN Shield Weapon display base   Sticker sheet Foil sticker sheet Dry decal sheet Instruction</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam 00\"}','2026-02-10 00:16:13','2026-02-10 00:16:13'),
(2148,157,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/PDi0MedUFKhxmTOQ75iU/h/mg-00-n-0000-gnr-010-xn-00-xn-raiser','Bandai MG 00 N-0000+GNR-010/XN 00 XN Raiser - Newtype','<p>From the &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam 00V&quot; side story, the 00 XN Raiser is coming to the MG line-up! A combination of the 00 Gundam and the XN Raiser, the 00 XN Raiser comes equipped with a pair of GN Buster Sword III units that can be combined into one weapon! The 00 XN Raiser&#039;s arm pylons can open and close and can hold the GN Sword II and GN Beam Sword. It is also possible to mount the GN Beam Sword. 4 types of battle styles can be reproduced for added display value. Switch between multiple battle modes instantly. One LED unit (green) can be mounted on the head (batteries LR41 x2 sold separately). Water-slide decals for added detailing are included.       Product Features  7 inches (17.78cm) once assembled Plastic model kit From the &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam 00V&quot; side story Comes equipped with a pair of GN Buster Sword III units LED unit (green) can be mounted on the head (batteries LR41 x2 sold separately)        Box Contents  1/100 00 XN Raiser parts 2 GN Buster Sword III units GN Beam Saber GN Shield Decals</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam 00\"}','2026-02-10 00:17:16','2026-02-10 00:17:16'),
(2149,109,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/kb2DZqkZ2sAKTDh6czw6/h/hgbd-r-033-gundam-aegis-knight','Bandai HGBD:R 033 Gundam Aegis Knight - Newtype','<p>From Bandai Spirits, Aegis Knight, the successor to the Justice Knight, stands in 1/144 scale and becomes a highly articulated figure one complete. Standing over 5 inches tall, Aegis Knight can convert between Assault Mode, Flight Mode, and MS mode.      Product Features  5.51 inches (14cm) Made of plastic From Gundam Build Divers Re:Rise Highly articulated once built Can convert to three modes        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Gundam Aegis Knight  Lance Shield Beam saber Beam effects   Foil stickers</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Build Divers Re:Rise\"}','2026-02-10 00:19:13','2026-02-10 00:19:13'),
(2150,21,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/YpinKzeogvTcmRPJYn5g/h/mg-gat-x105-aile-strike-gundam-ver-rm','Bandai MG GAT-X105 Aile Strike Gundam Ver. RM - Newtype','<p>Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam SEED anime, the Aile Strike Gundam model kit is in 1/100 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once complete. Aile Strike Gundam comes with a beam rifle, 2 armor Schneiders, shield and 2 beam sabers. A stand resembling the launch bay of the Archangel ship has been included to recreate take off and aerial action poses and includes sitting and standing figures of Kira Yamato and Mu La Flaga.       Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of plastic From Mobile Suit Gundam SEED Fully articulated figure once complete        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Aile Strike Gundam Aile Striker Beam rifle 2 Armor Schneiders Shield 2 Beam saber 2 Kira Yamoto figures  Sitting Standing   2 Mwu la Flaga figures  Sitting Standing   Stand   Decals Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed\"}','2026-02-10 00:20:17','2026-02-10 00:20:17'),
(2151,158,'newtype',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-10 00:21:14','2026-02-10 00:21:14'),
(2152,112,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/hNHJUfi67nIq1UkfLuJH/h/mg-gat-x207-blitz-gundam','Bandai MG GAT-X207 Blitz Gundam - Newtype','<p>Based on the Gundam Seed anime, the Infinite Blitz Gundam model kit is in 1/100 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once complete. Blitz Gundam comes with a Triceros shield system, removeable beam saber, Glepnir anchor, and features a new gimmick that allows portions of the armor to open for deployment of the Mirage Colloid particles.      Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of plastic From Mobile Suit Gundam SEED Fully articulated figure once complete        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Blitz Gundam Triceros shield system Removeable beam saber Glepnir anchor   Foil Sticker sheet Tetron Sticker sheet Dry Transfer Markings Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed\"}','2026-02-10 00:22:13','2026-02-10 00:22:13'),
(2153,94,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/vYsUVbp3BoXUX8jeZuVp/h/mg-build-strike-gundam-full-package','Bandai MG Build Strike Gundam Full Package - Newtype','<p>Based on the Gundam Build Fighters anime, the Build Strike Gundam is ready for battle! The build booster can be separated to reproduce the flight form. It is also possible to connect to the attached pedestal via a joint and decorate with the build booster alone.      Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of plastic From the Gundam Build Fighters anime Fully articulated figure once complete        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Build Strike Gundam Build Booster Beam Rifle Beam cannon Shield Base   Decals Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Build Fighters\"}','2026-02-10 00:23:16','2026-02-10 00:23:16'),
(2154,110,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/3bVruFtyemKICZ6Etzum/h/mg-gat-x103-buster-gundam','Bandai MG GAT-X103 Buster Gundam - Newtype','<p>Based on the Gundam Seed anime, the Buster Gundam model kit is in 1/100 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once complete. Buster Gundam comes with a high-energy rifle and gun launcher that can be combined into a very large projectile gun. Hatches for missile pods can be opened to reveal individual colored missiles.       Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of plastic From Mobile Suit Gundam SEED Fully articulated figure once complete        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Buster Gundam  High-energy rifle Gun launcher   Foil sticker Decal Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed\"}','2026-02-10 00:25:13','2026-02-10 00:25:13'),
(2155,159,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/oZe7NWiqwGry9gFQVXbT/h/mg-gat-x102-duel-gundam-assault-shroud','Bandai MG GAT-X102 Duel Gundam [Assault Shroud] - Newtype','<p>Based on the Gundam Seed Destiny anime, the Duel Gundam model kit is in 1/100 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once complete. Duel Gundam comes with the upgraded Assault Shroud armor, a shoulder rifle, and an openable hatch that reveals missile pods, plus movable thrusters.       Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of plastic From Mobile Suit Gundam SEED Destiny Fully articulated figure once complete        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Duel Gundam Rail Bazooka Beam Rifle Shoulder rifle Shield 2 Beam Sabers Assault Shroud armor Hand parts Yzak Jule mini figure   Decals Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed Destiny\"}','2026-02-10 00:26:16','2026-02-10 00:26:16'),
(2156,137,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/ZZRe8zhm5x6n1cRGVUu5/h/mg-zgmf-x56s-force-impulse-gundam','Bandai MG ZGMF-X56S Force Impulse Gundam - Newtype','<p>Based on the Gundam Seed Destiny anime, the Force Impulse Gundam model kit is in 1/100 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once complete. Force Impulse Gundam comes with a flight backpack that can be attached to the Mobile Suit and also Silhouette Flyer. Included are a beam rifle, shield, daggers, and beam sabers. Also it contains an Anti-Ship Sword that can be used to replicate the showdown the Freedom Gundam. The Gundam can separate into its various components to allow docking with Core Splendor.      Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of plastic From Gundam Seed Destiny anime Fully articulated figure once complete        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Force Impulse Gundam Flight backpack Silhouette flyer Beam rifle Shield Daggers Beam sabers Anti-Ship Sword 2 Mini pilot figures   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed Destiny\"}','2026-02-10 00:28:12','2026-02-10 00:28:12'),
(2157,266,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/JSlc7h3yn8lFZ5NU7WbD/h/mg-geara-doga','Bandai MG Geara Doga - Newtype','<p>Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam: Char&#039;s Counterattack film, the Geara Doga model kit is in 1/100 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once complete. Geara Doga comes with a full loadout of weapons including a shield, 2 types of beam machine guns, 4 Sturm Fausts, and a beam saber/axe. The head comes with interchangeable parts between general model and captain model and can be equipped with an LED unit (sold separately).       Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of plastic From Mobile Suit Gundam: Char&#039;s Counterattack Fully articulated figure once complete Can be equipped with an LED unit (sold separately)         Box Contents  Pieces to build  Geara Doga  2 Beam machine guns 4 Sturm Faust Beam saber/axe Shield   Sticker Decal Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Char\'s Counterattack\"}','2026-02-10 00:29:14','2026-02-10 00:29:14'),
(2158,160,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/hefSzkuJUHTgSod4ZYIz/h/mg-gundam-age-1-normal','Bandai MG Gundam AGE-1 Normal - Newtype','<p>Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam AGE anime this AGE-1 Gundam AGE-1 Normal model kit is in 1/100 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once built. The Gundam AGE-1 Normal comes with a DODS rifle, beam sabers, and shield.      Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of plastic Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam AGE anime Fully articulated figure once complete Stand not included        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Gundam AGE-1 Normal Beam rifle Shield Beam sabers   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Age\"}','2026-02-10 00:30:16','2026-02-10 00:30:16'),
(2159,161,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/a8bwzpRkdThG9AUPQeWN/h/mg-mbf-p03d-gundam-astray-blue-frame-d','Bandai MG MBF-P03D Gundam Astray Blue Frame D - Newtype','<p>This master grade model kit features the Gundam Astray Blue Frame D, a unit secretly constructed at Ame-no-Mihashira from the Gundam Seed Astray manga series. The Gundam Astray Blue Frame D is armed with ten Dragoon Swords, a backpack with an Aile Striker, two twin guns, and a long sword. Both standing and sitting pilot figures are also included.      Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of plastic From the Gundam Seed Astray manga series Fully articulated figure once complete        Box Contents  Pieces to build   Gundam Astray Blue Frame D 10 Dragoon Swords Backpack with an Aile Striker 2 Twin guns Long sword Standing pilot figure Sitting pilot figure   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed Astray\"}','2026-02-10 00:32:16','2026-02-10 00:32:16'),
(2160,162,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/IRtDuvY3WpijDnm1rlch/h/mg-gundam-avalanche-exia','Bandai MG Gundam Avalanche Exia - Newtype','<p>Mission start! The variant of GN-001 Gundam Exia, suited with the Avalanche armor in the side-story &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam 00V: Battlefield Record&quot;, is appearing in the MG line-up! Skilled and accurate detailing on this kit make it one to collect! Highly poseable and featuring several unique gimmicks, this kit allows you to recreate memorable battle scenes! Switch to high-mobility mode by deploying the dash unit to the kit&#039;s legs to reproduce high speed movement!       Product Features  7 inches (17.78cm) Made of plastic From Mobile Suit Gundam 00V: Battlefield Record Skilled and accurate detailing Highly poseable and featuring several unique gimmicks Switch to high-mobility mode by deploying the dash unit        Box Contents  Pieces to build Gundam Avalanche Exia GN Long Blade GN Short Blade GN Beam Dagger 2 GN Beam Sabers GN Base GN Sword Kai 2 GN Beam Swords Shield Decals</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam 00\"}','2026-02-10 00:34:15','2026-02-10 00:34:15'),
(2161,5,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/Xk6YwEL0UJ62VCfHY1kf/h/hgibo-033-gundam-barbatos-lupus-rex','Bandai HGIBO 033 Gundam Barbatos Lupus Rex - Newtype','<p>A ferocious repaired form of Gundam Barbatos Lupus that has been created as a result of the intense damage from fighting the Mobile Armor Hashmal. Its massive arms that reflect its pilot&#039;s feral nature of combat have been recreated along with razor tipped claws on the hands and Hashmal&#039;s tail weapon that can extend from the back with the use of a wire. Also includes forearm compartments that open and close to reveal sub-arms for grasping additional weapons from the various IBO MS Option Sets. The largest mace for Barbatos has been included and includes retracting gimmick to store on rear skirt armor.      Product Features  5 inches (12.7cm) 1/144 Scale Made of PS, PE, and PVC From Mobile Suit Gundam: Iron-Blooded Orphans anime series Includes forearm compartments that open and close to reveal sub-arms for grasping additional weapons The largest mace for Barbatos has been included and includes retracting gimmick to store on rear skirt armor        Box Contents  Parts to build:  Gundam Barbatos Lupus Rex Ultra-Large Mace Tail Blade   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Iron-Blooded Orphans\"}','2026-02-10 00:35:14','2026-02-10 00:35:14'),
(2162,596,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/YD03l1xNrvTVBaUT2D64/h/mg-gundam-deathscythe-hell-ew','Bandai MG Gundam Deathscythe Hell EW - Newtype','<p>The iconic bat wings of the Endless Waltz version of Deathscythe Hell bring nostalgia to many a Gundam Fan in the U.S. Now available as a Master Grade, this version of Deathscythe Hell contains the latest MG technology offering superior plastic engineering, accuracy, and posability. New wing gimick allows for various extreme poses and contains various warning signs and markerings. Scythe is molded in bright transclucent green plastic and has spots to be slotted into the swappable hands. Action base connectors included for aerial posing.      Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of ABS and PVC Based on the Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz anime Part of the Master Grade model kit series Features wing gimmick for incredible articulation, decals, markings, interchangeable hands, and action base connectors Action Base not included        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Deathscythe Hell Wings Wing gimmicks Interchangeable hands Beam Scythe   Action base connectors Pilot figure Decals Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz\"}','2026-02-10 00:36:14','2026-02-10 00:36:14'),
(2163,163,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/atCqyhi1jm31JtdIz2eq/h/gd-98-mg-gundam-epyon-ver-ew-decals','Bandai GD-98 MG Gundam Epyon Ver. EW Decals - Newtype','<p>MG Gundam Epyon Ver. EW Decal</p>',NULL,'2026-02-10 00:37:16','2026-02-10 00:37:16'),
(2164,131,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/5YAdZfUIvIgxhtZNsoVI/h/mg-gn-001-gundam-exia','Bandai MG GN-001 Gundam Exia - Newtype','<p>This version of the Gundam Exia from Gundam 00 is faithfully recreated in stunning proportion and flexibility. Green translucent plastic complete with laser etched engravings recreate its GN condenseres while special holographic film replicates the GN cables dotting its body. This kit also includes a GN Long Blade, a GN Short Blade, two GN Beam Daggers, two GN Beam Sabers, a GN Sword that can switch between rifle and gun mode, plus a GN Shield with sides that can slide out.      Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of plastic From Mobile Suit Gundam 00 Fully articulated figure once complete        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Gundam Avalanche Exia GN Long Blade GN Short Blade 2 GN Beam Dagger 2 GN Beam Sabers GN Sword Shield   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam 00\"}','2026-02-10 00:38:15','2026-02-10 00:38:15'),
(2165,15,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/WQBB4fbmWQBWS4rfbfkE/h/mg-gundam-f91-ver-20','Bandai MG Gundam F91 (Ver. 2.0) - Newtype','<p>From the animated movie Gundam F91 comes a refined version of the MG Gundam F91 as part of the GunPla Evolution project! Careful research was conducted to recreate the physical appearance and its various action gimmicks, including an LED housing in the chest backpack assembly (white LED sold separately) to mimic the Metal Peel-off Effect (MPE) in the anime. The F91&#039;s face open gimmick has been implemented and can split open to the sides or displayed with a solid piece. Shoulder fins and leg thrusters have a deployment mechanism allowing for various angle adjustments. Its weapons include a beam rifle, 2 beam sabers, beam launcher, beam shield, deployable VSBR units, and display base stand. Display it together with the RE-100 Vigna Ghina!      Product Features  6 inches (15.24cm) 1/100 Scale Made of plastic From the Gundam F91 movie Improved from the first version Features action gimmicks, LED housing, opening face gimmick, shoulder fins and leg thrusters, and various weapons Action Base and LED Unit not included        Box Contents  Pieces to build  F91 Gundam F91 Beam rifle 2 Beam sabers Beam launcher Beam shield 6 Interchangeable hands Deployable VSBR units Display base   Dry decal Stickers Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam F91\"}','2026-02-10 00:40:14','2026-02-10 00:40:14'),
(2166,24,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/SaSQJuv1JzuDhKCPsDwj/h/gd-100-mg-xxxg-01h-gundam-heavyarms-verew-decals','Bandai GD-100 MG XXXG-01H Gundam Heavyarms Ver.EW Decals - Newtype','<p>MG Heavyarms Ver. EW  Decal</p>',NULL,'2026-02-10 00:41:13','2026-02-10 00:41:13'),
(2167,61,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/dS1EU4ZX7kBJE1oJOtaC/h/mg-gn-003-gundam-kyrios','Bandai MG GN-003 Gundam Kyrios - Newtype','<p>The transforming MS GN-003 Gundam Kyrios joins the Master Grade model kit line-up—based on illustrations by creator Takayuki Yanase! Transform to MA Mode features locking tabs throughout the body using the GN Frame structure introduced in the MG Dynames (sold separately). Its hands can be stowed away during transformation, while the wireless grip can be switched between the GN Beam Submachine Gun and GN Hand Missile Units—just like in the anime series! This set also includes pieces to build the GN Shield with an unfolding gimmick and spike. Combine this Master Grade unit with the compatible green LED set (sold separately) for a seriously awesome display!      Product Features  7.44 inches (18.9cm) 1/100 Scale Made of plastic Part of the Master Grade model kit series From the Mobile Suit Gundam 00 anime Based on illustrations by creator Takayuki Yanase        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Gundam Kyrios Hands GN Beam Submachine Gun GN Shield GN Hand Missile Units Tail Booster Tail Unit   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam 00\"}','2026-02-10 00:42:17','2026-02-10 00:42:17'),
(2168,47,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/7wdBCVIt2hZpU2U3eykG/h/mg-gundam-vidar','Bandai MG Gundam Vidar - Newtype','<p>The MG Gundam Vidar is a Master Grade model kit that captures the advanced engineering and sleek design of Mobile Suit Gundam: Iron-Blooded Orphans. Under the supervision of mecha designer Ippei Katabe, this updated Gundam Frame offers enhanced articulation, making it ideal for dynamic and expressive poses. This kit includes functional hunter edges on the toes and heels, movable knee armor and verniers, and an innovative blowback gimmick for the handgun, adding realism to your display. The burst saber features a purging effect, and interchangeable parts allow for cockpit display variations. Don&#039;t miss this highly detailed and customizable addition to your collection! Product Features  1/100 scale Made of plastic Based on Mobile Suit Gundam: Iron-Blooded Orphans  Master Grade (MG) classification Highly articulated for dynamic posing Interchangeable parts and accessories  Box Contents  Pieces to build ASW-G-XX Gundam Vidar Burst Saber set Rifle 2 Handguns 2 Figure types Joint parts set Hand parts set Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Iron-Blooded Orphans\"}','2026-02-10 00:44:13','2026-02-10 00:44:13'),
(2169,124,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/ANUiFL4h8hAeyDJm6hsT/h/mg-00-qan-t-full-saber','Bandai MG 00 QAN[T] Full Saber - Newtype','<p>The variant of the 00 QAN[T] featured in Mobile Suit Gundam 00V: Battlefield Record will be joining the MG series!  The &quot;GN Sword IV Full Saber&quot; and armaments with various functions can be recreated using newly designed parts. The back section of the kit can be equipped with a GN condenser and a stand for the GN Sword IV is also included. A new head antenna designed to resemble Kanetake Ebikawa&#039;s design images will be included as a bonus part.      Product Features  7 inches (17.78cm) Made of plastic From Mobile Suit Gundam 00V: Battlefield Record New head antenna designed to resemble Kanetake Ebikawa&#039;s design Fully articulated once complete        Box Contents  Pieces to build  00 Qan[T] GN Sword IV 3 GN Gun blades GN Sword V GN Sword bits GN Shield Weapon display base   Sticker sheet Foil sticker sheet Dry decal sheet Instruction</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam 00\"}','2026-02-10 00:45:13','2026-02-10 00:45:13'),
(2170,18,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/VCRxhmjMJM8l4WA5u4Jf/h/mg-hyaku-shiki-ver-20','Bandai MG Hyaku-Shiki (Ver. 2.0) - Newtype','<p>Created to celebrate the 30th anniversary of the Zeta Gundam TV series and complete the Gundam Team trio of the Zeta Gundam and Gundam MK II, the Hyaku-Shiki re-appears in the MG line! Featuring a slimmer profile with stylish new proportion, it contains under-gated parts to reduce appearance of visible cut marks and a special finish over the plastic to replicate its fantastic gold appearance! The vestigial transformation in the legs and wings has been included to provide accuracy to its involvement in the abandoned transformable Delta Gundam project. Different sensor parts in the eyes are included to replicate neutral, activation, and scanning sensor appearance.      Product Features  Approx 7.3&quot; Tall 1/100 Scale Made of plastic Master Grade Action Base not included        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Hyaku Shiki Beam rifle Clay Bazooka Beam sabers Parts to retrofit the older Ballute Pack release to fit on the 2.0 version   Sticker Tetron sticker Instruction manual.</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Zeta Gundam\"}','2026-02-10 00:47:14','2026-02-10 00:47:14'),
(2171,135,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/apGHEK2IklVMmHEbMa8i/h/mg-zgmg-x19a-infinite-justice-gundam','Bandai MG ZGMG-X19A Infinite Justice Gundam - Newtype','<p>Based on the Gundam Seed Destiny anime, the Infinite Justice Gundam model kit is in 1/100 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once complete. Infinite Justice comes with a beam rifle that can be mounted on its back skirt armor, two &quot;Super Lacerta&quot; Beam Sabers that can combine to form a double-bladed beam weapon, and a left arm-mounted shield that stores a detachable &quot;Shining Edge&quot; Beam Boomerang and Grapple Stinger (a bendable wire is provided to display it in mid-deployment). Beam effect parts for the Beam Sabers, &quot;Griffon&quot; Beam Blades connecting the knees and feet, Beam Boomerang, and shield are provided as well.      Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of plastic From Mobile Suit Gundam SEED Destiny Fully articulated figure once complete        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Infinite Justice Gundam Beam rifle 2 Super Lacerta Beam Sabers Left arm-mounted shield Shining Edge Beam Boomerang Grapple Stinger Beam effect parts Griffon&quot; Beam Blades Shield  Mini figure   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed Destiny\"}','2026-02-10 00:48:16','2026-02-10 00:48:16'),
(2172,65,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/apGHEK2IklVMmHEbMa8i/h/mg-zgmg-x19a-infinite-justice-gundam','Bandai MG ZGMG-X19A Infinite Justice Gundam - Newtype','<p>Based on the Gundam Seed Destiny anime, the Infinite Justice Gundam model kit is in 1/100 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once complete. Infinite Justice comes with a beam rifle that can be mounted on its back skirt armor, two &quot;Super Lacerta&quot; Beam Sabers that can combine to form a double-bladed beam weapon, and a left arm-mounted shield that stores a detachable &quot;Shining Edge&quot; Beam Boomerang and Grapple Stinger (a bendable wire is provided to display it in mid-deployment). Beam effect parts for the Beam Sabers, &quot;Griffon&quot; Beam Blades connecting the knees and feet, Beam Boomerang, and shield are provided as well.      Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of plastic From Mobile Suit Gundam SEED Destiny Fully articulated figure once complete        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Infinite Justice Gundam Beam rifle 2 Super Lacerta Beam Sabers Left arm-mounted shield Shining Edge Beam Boomerang Grapple Stinger Beam effect parts Griffon&quot; Beam Blades Shield  Mini figure   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed Destiny\"}','2026-02-10 00:50:13','2026-02-10 00:50:13'),
(2173,230,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/rBpZdn1frAJ9OzifJcVC/h/mg-mbf-02vv-gundam-astray-turn-red','Bandai MG MBF-02VV Gundam Astray Turn Red - Newtype','<p>A variant of the Gundam Astray Red Frame featured in the side story &quot;Gundam Seed VS Astray&quot; appears in MG form! Its characteristic red and white inverted colors along with giant V-Fin, chin guard, and original backpack have been faithfully recreated! Gundam Astray Turn Red features 2 Tactical Arms packs that can convert between massive buster sword and stationary chain gun. A small display base is provided to help balance the weight of the Tactical Arms. Hip mounted Armor Schneiders beam rifle, and shield round off its arsenal. Beam rifle and shield parts can be retrofitted on the MG Astray Red Frame to show its original form!      Product Features  7 inches (17.78cm) Made of plastic Featured in the side story Gundam Seed VS Astray Arms packs can convert between massive buster sword and stationary chain gun Display base is provided to help balance the weight of the Tactical Arms        Box Contents  Pieces to build Gundam Astray Turn Red 2 Tactical Arms packs Display base Armor Schneiders beam rifle Shield</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed Astray\"}','2026-02-10 00:52:13','2026-02-10 00:52:13'),
(2174,603,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/Gy6qQcWFIsUGHa2RqsDY/h/mg-musha-gundam-mk-ii','Bandai MG Musha Gundam Mk-II - Newtype','<p>This design of Musha Gundam Mk-II is featured in the Dynasty Warriors Gundam video game series and features gold stylized markings all over its body and Japanese themed weapons, including: two Kotetsu Maru swords, the Shoruy Maru gun and the Senkou Maru Naginata.       Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of plastic From the Dynasty Warriors: Gundam video game Fully articulated figure once complete        Box Contents  Pieces to build Musha Gundam Mk-II Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\"}','2026-02-10 00:53:13','2026-02-10 00:53:13'),
(2175,259,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/TnxTB7CmZTXxCydgbdiT/h/mg-rx-9-c-narrative-gundam-c-packs-verka','Bandai MG RX-9/C Narrative Gundam C-Packs [Ver.Ka] - Newtype','<p>Bandai, in collaboration with the one and only Hajime Katoki, releases the Psycho Frame test machine Narrative Gundam C-Packs from &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam Narrative&quot; as a Master Grade Ver.Ka model kit! The thickness of the clear parts of the Psycho Frame has been adjusted. Details are engraved on the front, back, and sides for a deep, three-dimensional shape. Depending on the angle from which it&#039;s viewed, it reflects light like a crystal! A gray Psycho Frame that does not activate &quot;NT-D&quot; is included and can be used selectively. The hip joints are movable for each block, and the fins on the back of the knees sink as the knees move, so the legs can be bent deeply without interference! By rotating the nose, the core block can transform into a bird-like core fighter. It also comes with a &quot;C-equipped Beam Rifle,&quot; an improved version of the Jegan rifle. With parts replacement, you can reproduce both types, and two 1/100 scale figurines of Jona Bashta—sitting and standing—are included! **MG MSN-06S Sinanju Stein (Narrative) [Ver.Ka] pictured is not included (sold separately).    Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of plastic Based on the &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam Narrative&quot; anime film Part of the Master Grade model kit line        Box Contents  Pieces to build:  Narrative Gundam Shield Beam rifle Beam rifle reproduction parts for Jegan 2x Beam sabers Body reproduction parts set Set of landing gear parts for core fighters Set of hand parts     2x Types of figures Set of 3D metallic seals Set of water transfer decals Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Narrative\"}','2026-02-10 00:56:14','2026-02-10 00:56:14'),
(2176,267,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/IEhgSq763UBuozl3HgQ9/h/rage-nucleon-bc-t01-1-100-rx-93-nu-gundam-verka-high-mobility-backpack','Rage Nucleon BC-T01 1/100 RX-93 Nu Gundam Ver.Ka High Mobility Backpack - Newtype','<p>1 Backpack (Fin funnels NOT included) 1 Head kit (V-Fin NOT included) 1 pair of heels  Upgrade kit for Bandai MG RX-93 Nu Gundam Ver.Ka</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Char\'s Counterattack\"}','2026-02-10 00:58:13','2026-02-10 00:58:13'),
