(2179,599,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/tSdfCPhT0PwaUftZm5gu/h/mg-rgz-95-rezel-commander-type','Bandai MG RGZ-95 ReZEL (Commander Type) - Newtype','<p>From Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn, the mass-production transformable mobile suit RGZ-95 ReZEL joins Bandai’s Master Grade lineup in its Commander configuration. Developed from the Zeta Gundam lineage and fielded by the Earth Federation Forces, the Commander Type features enhanced equipment and distinctive head and backpack units that set it apart on the battlefield. This 1/100 scale kit faithfully recreates the ReZEL Commander Type’s sharp proportions and complex transformation system. The mobile suit can be converted between MS Mode and Wave Rider Mode through part reconfiguration, capturing its high-mobility role without compromising stability or detail. Color-separated runners and finely molded parts allow for an accurate appearance straight out of the box. Armed with the versatile Beam Rifle, Beam Sabers, and an integrated Mega Beam Launcher, the ReZEL Commander Type is equipped for both mid-range and high-output combat. With a fully articulated inner frame, the model supports dynamic poses in both mobile suit and transformed forms. Combining engineering complexity with refined aesthetics, the MG ReZEL (Commander Type) offers a rewarding build and an impressive display piece for fans of Gundam Unicorn and transformable mobile suits. Product Features  From Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn  Fully articulated inner frame Transforms between MS Mode and Wave Rider Mode Accurate Commander Type head and backpack units High-detail, color-separated parts  Snap-fit assembly; painting optional  Box Contents  Parts to build RGZ-95 ReZEL (Commander Type) Beam Rifle Mega Beam Launcher Beam Saber ×2 Shield Hand parts (multiple types) Transformation parts Foil stickers &amp;amp; marking decals Assembly instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Unicorn\"}','2026-02-10 01:00:15','2026-02-10 01:00:15'),
(2180,598,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/GPxaUA4vXaXWp6nkuqXB/h/mg-rms-099-rick-dias-quattro-bajeena-ver','Bandai MG RMS-099 Rick Dias (Quattro Bajeena Ver.) - Newtype','<p>The Master Grade &quot;Rick-Dias&quot; has been hugely popular, and here&#039;s its fantastic follow-up: the red version piloted by not-quite-incognito Char Aznable -- er, we mean, Quattro Bajeena!  Beautifully molded in full color and with snap-fit assembly, it&#039;s got all the detail and posability we&#039;ve come to expect from a Master Grade kit. It&#039;s comprised of about 191 parts, plus polycaps, rub-on transfers, and stickers, which are included for super detail! No metal parts or screws, making it more accessible to build. With individually-jointed fingers, a cockpit that opens and closes, and lots of weaponry -- this kit is a dream for any fan who shares Quattro/Char&#039;s fondness for kick-butt crimson &#039;bots!    Product Features  1/100 Scale  Made of plastic From the &quot;Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam&quot; series Part of the MG model kit line Highly detailed        Box Contents  Pieces to build:  RMS-099 Rick Dias (Quattro Bajeena Ver.) 300mm Clay Bazooka Ballute System    Dry Transfers Marking Stickers Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Zeta Gundam\"}','2026-02-10 01:01:13','2026-02-10 01:01:13'),
(2181,165,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/bTN5Buzf6Gzjvlngt1Be/h/g-rework-mg-dom-15-rick-dom-15-decals','G-Rework MG Dom 1.5 / Rick Dom 1.5 Decals - Newtype','<p>High-quality waterslide decals from G-Rework It is highly recommended to use setting and softening solutions with these decals.</p>','{\"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\"}','2026-02-10 01:02:13','2026-02-10 01:02:13'),
(2182,115,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/RZgBtvw41nTT25v8ppFc/h/mg-rx-0-unicorn-gundam-02-banshee','Bandai MG RX-0 Unicorn Gundam 02 Banshee - Newtype','<p>Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn series, the Unicorn Gundam 02 Banshee model kit is in 1/100 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once complete. Unicorn Gundam 02 Banshee has been faithfully reproduced and comes armed with several pieces of weaponry.      Product Features  15.35 inches tall (39cm) 1/100 Scale Made of plastic Can transform between Destroy and Unicorn Modes Includes weapon accessories Action Base not included        Box Contents  Pieces to build  RX-0 Unicorn Gundam 02 Banshee 4 Beam saber handles 2 Beam saber parts 2 Pilot figures (standing and sitting) Action base attachment Transformable V-fin 2 Static V fin (Unicorn/Destroy)   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Unicorn\"}','2026-02-10 01:03:16','2026-02-10 01:03:16'),
(2183,151,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/GPFFCyRRjRndbnwCgMPL/h/g-rework-mg-rx-79g-ez-8-gundam-decals','G-Rework MG RX-79G Ez-8 Gundam Decals - Newtype','<p>High-quality waterslide decals from G-Rework</p>','{\"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\"}','2026-02-10 01:06:14','2026-02-10 01:06:14'),
(2184,166,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/M1JqKlH76VIul4FwgpPa/h/fortune-meow-mg-rx-93-v2-hi-nu-gundam-verka-gk','Fortune Meow MG RX-93-v2 Hi-Nu Gundam Ver.Ka GK - Newtype','<p>Resin Conversion Kit.   Included: Color Instruction Manual, Waterslides, Photo-Etched Parts, Body Kit, Weapon, Fin-Funnel &amp;amp; Backpack  Need:   Bandai MG RX-93-v2 Hi-Nu Gundam Ver.Ka for Inner Frame  This Kit is Unpainted and Unassembled. This product is for Advanced Modeler and the images shown are for reference. Please take the actual product as the standard.</p>','{\"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Char\'s Counterattack\"}','2026-02-10 01:10:14','2026-02-10 01:10:14'),
(2185,167,'newtype',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-10 01:10:16','2026-02-10 01:10:16'),
(2186,54,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/uwMZAkayJwZ97K8CufKY/h/delpi-decal-mg-sinanju-stein-narrative-verka','Delpi Decal MG Sinanju Stein Narrative Ver.Ka - Newtype','<p>MG 1/100 Sinanju Stein Narrative Ver.Ka Decals 110mm X 170mm Same as the manual</p>',NULL,'2026-02-10 01:12:17','2026-02-10 01:12:17'),
(2187,144,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/MXKFv5eGpMzoS2nW4n6k/h/mg-zgmf-x20a-strike-freedom-gundam-full-burst-mode','Bandai MG ZGMF-X20A Strike Freedom Gundam Full Burst Mode - Newtype','<p>The savior’s sword, clad in its gold majesty, descends from the sky in MG form! Kira Yamato’s Strike Freedom from the Gundam Seed Destiny anime series comes with its full load of armaments, including dual rifles that can combine, beam sabers that connect at the ends, rail guns, a chest cannon, and its iconic pair of Super Dragoon wings. This Full Burst version features an extra stand with holders for the Dragoon pods to be displayed suspended in flight and has a special gold-coated titanium finish frame.      Product Features  1/100 Scale Part of the Master Grade model kit line Based on the Gundam SEED Destiny anime series Comes with pieces to build its weapons and accessories Includes Full Burst Mode effects Special gold-coated titanium finish frame        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Strike Freedom Gundam Full Burst Mode pieces Dual rifles Beam sabers Rail guns Chest cannon Super Dragoon wings Display base Extra stand holders   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed Destiny\"}','2026-02-10 01:14:14','2026-02-10 01:14:14'),
(2188,105,'newtype',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-10 01:14:16','2026-02-10 01:14:16'),
(2189,77,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/Bn98EIIj1kNWioy0TOie/h/mg-v2-gundam-verka','Bandai MG V2 Gundam Ver.Ka - Newtype','<p>Ranked #1 for the most requested Master Grade model in a poll from 2010, the Victory 2 Gundam from Mobile Suit Victory Gundam finally reappears after a long and carefully planned development period by esteemed mecha designer Hajime Katoki! With a focus on replicating its complicated transformation in the chest, the V2 MG carries a careful balance between form and function fitting for the 35th anniversary of GunPla. Besides its full transformation feature, it includes an additional Core Fighter to display both chest and leg flyers and eye sensor enhancement in the head.      Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of ABS, PE, PET, and PS Part of the Master Grade model kit line From the Mobile Suit Victory Gundam anime Fully transformable        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Victory 2 Gundam Ver. Ka 2 Gundam heads 2 Beam sabers  Fan attachment   Beam rifle  Grenade launcher equipment   Beam shield 2 Core Fighters  Base attachment pieces     3 Figures  Pilot Uso Ewin Pilot Marbet Fingerhat Standing Shahkti Kareen   Water slide decals Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\"}','2026-02-10 01:16:17','2026-02-10 01:16:17'),
(2190,257,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/e7KmRy1zht0re8Jspj3L/h/mg-wing-gundam-zero-ew-verka','Bandai MG Wing Gundam Zero EW Ver.Ka - Newtype','<p>Joining the Master Grade (MG) series from Bandai Spirits is the Wing Gundam Zero EW Ver.Ka from the anime series Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz. The Gundam MG 1/100 Wing Gundam Zero EW (Ver.Ka) model kit has been created under the full supervision of Hajime Katoki and features new molding. Each of the joints went through an intense examination to recreate the unfolding and interactive gimmicks for the white wings and firing poses. An incredible new feature allows the Twin Buster Rifle to be stored in the wings, and the transformation into the Neo Bird Mode has been recreated.      Product Features  Approx 6.57 inches (16.69cm) tall 1/100 Scale From the anime series Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz Plastic model kit        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Wing Gundam Zero EW Twin Buster rifle 2 Beam Sabers Shield Pedestal   Foil Sticker Water Transfer Decal Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz\"}','2026-02-10 01:18:17','2026-02-10 01:18:17'),
(2191,168,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/ReVrfK3QdPdJVbIwQNSZ/h/gd-92-mg-shenlong-ver-ew-decals','Bandai GD-92 MG Shenlong Ver. EW Decals - Newtype','<p>MG Shenlong Ver. EW Decal Gundam Water decals by Bandai open up detail options to any build. Gundam decals are designed to enhance the visuals of any model kit.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-10 01:19:17','2026-02-10 01:19:17'),
(2192,25,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/Fcr2hRBJHtWI1Wup2d5A/h/mg-xxxg-01w-wing-gundam-ew-ver','Bandai MG XXXG-01W Wing Gundam Ew Ver. - Newtype','<p>This is a repackaged version of the MG Wing Gundam Ver.Ka to commemorate the release of the Gundams from the Gundam Wing series into the EW ver. MG line up! The difference between this and the older version is that the white parts are no longer off-white, so the visual style will be much cleaner. Also, new marking decals designed by Hajime Katoki are included so you can customize the looks to your liking. Keep building your Gundam Wing MG collection with the eponymous Gundam today!</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Wing\"}','2026-02-10 01:20:16','2026-02-10 01:20:16'),
(2193,169,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/CuJcXghJika5m7wdzr9a/h/photo-etch-mg-zeta-gundam-verka','SH Studio Photo Etch MG Zeta Gundam Ver.Ka - Newtype','<p>1/100 MG Zeta Gundam Ver.Ka Photo Etch parts from SH Studio! Features:  One set of stainless steel etching plates One set of full-color instruction manuals Sturdy packaging envelope  Notes on Metal Etching Plates: The metal plates are finely polished silver steel, which can be used directly on the model. Alternatively, apply a metal filler primer, then paint it in your desired color. Application of photo etch parts may require additional tools such as glue, hobby knives, and various etching clip pliers. These should be purchased separately.</p>','{\"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Zeta Gundam\"}','2026-02-10 01:21:18','2026-02-10 01:21:18'),
(2194,170,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/40IXHlZxaZfep1Dpoyug/h/mg-zz-gundam-verka','Bandai MG ZZ Gundam Ver.Ka - Newtype','<p>The next mobile suit to make its way to the Master Grade line-up is the ZZ Gundam Ver. Ka, as part of the 30th anniversary of &quot;ZZ Gundam!&quot; ! This newly designed version, overseen by renown mecha designer Hajime Katoki, is based around the elongated proportions in the Enhanced ZZ and Full Armor ZZ Gundam variants that appeared in the latter half of the anime series &quot;ZZ Gundam&quot;. The ZZ Gundam Ver. Ka. is fully transformable! Combine the Core Base, Core top, and Core Fighter to create the G-Fortress! Mechanical detailing in the shoulders, knees, and waist utilize improved joints and sliding mechanisms for even more dynamic posing capabilities. Certain parts feature a special finish to further hi-light certain aspects of the kit.      Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of PS, PE, and PVC Based on Mobile Suit Gundam ZZ No glue required        Box Contents  Pieces to build  ZZ Gundam Interchangeable hands 2 Core fighters Multi-tube missile launchers Double beam rifle 2 Hyper beam sabers   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam ZZ\"}','2026-02-10 01:23:17','2026-02-10 01:23:17'),
(2195,272,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/CiprL4HQVQRD5ZNk2smW/h/mg-amx-004-qubeley','Bandai MG AMX-004 Qubeley - Newtype','<p>The special Mobile Suit used by Haman Khan in Zeta Gundam features gloss injection plastic, binders with mechanical detail to replicate flight sequences, and individually molded funnels that can be mounted in its rear skirt. Qubeley also comes with molded hands in addition to the articuled versions for more expressive hand gestures. Beam sabers can be stored in the wrists as seen in the show.      Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of PS and PE Master Grade model kit Based on the Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam and Gundam ZZ        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Qubeley Beam sabers Alternate hands   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Zeta Gundam\"}','2026-02-10 01:24:15','2026-02-10 01:24:15'),
(2196,139,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/eXNhGT2tbOoLSHUcnMnP/h/gd-43-mg-destiny-gundam-decals','Bandai GD-43 MG Destiny Gundam Decals - Newtype','<p>GD-043 MG Destiny Gundam Gundam Multiuse Water decals by Bandai open up detail options to any build. Gundam decals are designed to enhance the visuals of any model kit. Update your grunt suits with squad numbers or add a warning sign near a hatch or thruster. No instructions are necessary. Gundam Multi-use decals are made for you to decide.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-10 01:25:16','2026-02-10 01:25:16'),
(2197,29,'newtype',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-10 01:25:17','2026-02-10 01:25:17'),
(2198,148,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/KsAZ1WQrZjoeO6vXz38I/h/rg-42-gf13-017nj-shining-gundam','Bandai RG 42 GF13-017NJ Shining Gundam - Newtype','<p>From the classic Mobile Fighter G Gundam anime series comes the 1/144 scale Shining Gundam model kit! Featuring newly designed armor pieces for precise details, this Real Grade (RG) model offers premium articulation for dynamic action poses. Don&#039;t miss the chance to add this legendary Gundam to your collection! Other figures and accessories shown not included (sold separately). Product Features  1/144 scale Made of ABS and PVC Highly detailed with newly worked armor pieces Multiple points of articulation for dynamic posing Part of the Real Grade (RG) line Interchangeable parts and accessories  Box Contents  Pieces to build Shining Gundam Hand parts set 2 Beam sabers Decal sheet Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"RG - Real Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"G Gundam\"}','2026-02-10 01:27:16','2026-02-10 01:27:16'),
(2199,33,'newtype',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-10 01:28:13','2026-02-10 01:28:13'),
(2200,149,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/KsAZ1WQrZjoeO6vXz38I/h/rg-42-gf13-017nj-shining-gundam','Bandai RG 42 GF13-017NJ Shining Gundam - Newtype','<p>From the classic Mobile Fighter G Gundam anime series comes the 1/144 scale Shining Gundam model kit! Featuring newly designed armor pieces for precise details, this Real Grade (RG) model offers premium articulation for dynamic action poses. Don&#039;t miss the chance to add this legendary Gundam to your collection! Other figures and accessories shown not included (sold separately). Product Features  1/144 scale Made of ABS and PVC Highly detailed with newly worked armor pieces Multiple points of articulation for dynamic posing Part of the Real Grade (RG) line Interchangeable parts and accessories  Box Contents  Pieces to build Shining Gundam Hand parts set 2 Beam sabers Decal sheet Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"RG - Real Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"G Gundam\"}','2026-02-10 01:29:13','2026-02-10 01:29:13'),
(2201,133,'newtype',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-10 01:30:14','2026-02-10 01:30:14'),
(2202,142,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/EGPTvRs8MoTCcc0VoDFG/h/mg-ms-06s-char-s-zaku-ver-20','Bandai MG MS-06S Char\'s Zaku (Ver. 2.0) - Newtype','<p>Based on the original Mobile Suit Gundam anime, the Char&#039;s custom unit model kit is in 1/100 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once complete. Char&#039;s Zaku II (Ver. 2.0) comes with machine gun, bazooka and heat hawk and crane vehicle.      Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of plastic Based on the original Mobile Suit Gundam anime Fully articulated figure once complete        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Char&#039;s Zaku II (Ver. 2.0) Machine gun Bazooka Heat hawk Crane vehicle Stickers Mini pilot figure   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\"}','2026-02-10 01:31:17','2026-02-10 01:31:17'),
(2203,182,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/AlNigndK7KnLg2lF9kMm/h/mg-msm-04-acguy','Bandai MG MSM-04 Acguy - Newtype','<p>The world has long been waiting for a Master Grade Acguy; now that it&#039;s here, you won&#039;t be disappointed! A brand-new MG frame was designed for this unique mobile suit, over which you install the &quot;armor&quot; parts; the joints all feature polycaps and are superbly designed, so that the Acguy can take on just about any pose you&#039;ve seen it take in the series, including the cute curled-up crouch with its arms around its knees! A one-touch spring switch will release the claws on the right &quot;hand&quot;, causing them to pop out quite menacingly! Two sets of &quot;effect parts&quot; are included, too -- one features missiles coming out of the Acguy&#039;s left &quot;hand&quot;, and the other portrays the aquatic jet-streams from the thrusters under the Acguy&#039;s feet. A custom stand is included so you can display the Acguy swimming; and a total of six figures are included -- one seated pilot, that can be placed into the cockpit, one standing pilot, and one guy in scuba gear who can be displayed swimming along with the Acguy; plus the three annoying adorable little kids, Katsu, Retsu, and Kikka. The Acguy&#039;s parts are all molded in colored plastic and snap together for assembly; no paint is required (though painting would definitely improve the overall appearance of the finished model). All the figures, however, will require paint. Stickers and dry transfers are included for a perfect finish.      Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of plastic From Mobile Suit Gundam anime Part of the Master Grade model kit line        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Acguy Replacement claw wrist Extended arm Replacement mono eye shield Movable mono eye Replacement lifting ramp Zion operator plate Head Vulcan launch effect  2 Large 2 Small   Right arm mega gun artillery effect Left arm 6 missile launcher launch effect Unpainted Katsu figure Unpainted Retsu figure Unpainted Kikka figure 3 Additional unpainted figures Display stand   Marking stickers Dry transfers Paint</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\"}','2026-02-10 01:32:16','2026-02-10 01:32:16'),
(2204,185,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/WvYFpHpCNGqX95HcsJR7/h/mg-msm-07s-z-gok','Bandai MG MSM-07S Z\'Gok - Newtype','<p>Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam anime series, this Char&#039;s Custom MSM-07S Z&#039;Gok model kit is in 1/100 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once built. The model kit is designed to allow for flexibility and poseability that equals what you see in the animated series. The belows on the legs and arms also streatch out for added reach and flexibility.       Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of plastic Based on Mobile Suit Gundam Part of the Master Grade model kit line        Box Contents  Pieces to build Char&#039;s Z&#039;Gok Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\"}','2026-02-10 01:34:15','2026-02-10 01:34:15'),
(2205,152,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/poU1MDnrXhYkHzsvE2kt/h/mg-msn-02-zeong','Bandai MG MSN-02 Zeong - Newtype','<p>Certainly the opinion may be split on the design of the Zeong, but its dramatic role in the original series sealed its place in Gundam lore forever. The stand that Bandai has necessarily included allows you to display the kit at various angles. The hands can be removed with cables provided, of course, and separate stands are provided for those, too. The head comes off and arms are posable as well. Did we mention each hand has over 30 pieces in it??</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\"}','2026-02-10 01:35:17','2026-02-10 01:35:17'),
(2206,609,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/aTxhho32gZvuRH1Be2Br/h/hggto-024-ms-06s-zaku-ii-red-comet-ver','Bandai HGGTO 024 MS-06S Zaku II (Red Comet Ver.) - Newtype','<p>As seen in &quot;Gundam The Origin&quot; and the original Gundam TV series the red Zaku used by Char Aznable returns in a new package along with new armaments!        Product Features  5 inches (12.70cm) Made of plastic From Mobile Suit Gundam: The Origin Char Red Comet version 2 Forms of Heat Hawks        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Zaku II (Char Red Comet Ver.) 2 Machine guns Bazooka 2 Bazooka magazines Anti-Ship rifle Heat Hawk extended Heat Hawk stored   Stickers</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam: The Origin\"}','2026-02-10 01:37:14','2026-02-10 01:37:14'),
(2207,150,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/Epw8j3rT9UvhUkZIcPGG/h/mg-rgm-79-g-gm-ground-type','Bandai MG RGM-79[G] GM Ground Type - Newtype','<p>This Master Grade (MG) model kit features the Ground GM from 08th MS Team in camoflage coloring. Weapons from original Ground GM release including machine gun, beam rifle, rocket launcher, shield, and beam sabers included.      Product Features  1/100 scale Made of PE and PS From Mobile Suit Gundam: The 08th MS Team Fully poseable figure once assembled        Box Contents  Pieces to build  RGM-79[G] GM Ground Type Machine gun Beam rifle Rocket launcher Shield Beam sabers   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"The 08th MS Team\"}','2026-02-10 01:38:14','2026-02-10 01:38:14'),
(2208,171,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/NDI4NHYSIxD5vhOnvbCv/h/mg-rx-78-gp03s-gundam-gp03-stamen','Bandai MG RX-78 GP03S Gundam GP03 (Stamen) - Newtype','<p>From the Mobile Suit Gundam 0083: Stardust Memory anime comes Master Grade model kit of the iconic Gundam Stamen in 1/100 scale! Includes a folding bazooka, beam rifle, beam saber and folding shield. The core fighter is detachable. Armor is detachable to expose the skeleton and hydraulics.      Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of plastic Part of the Master Grade model kit line From Mobile Suit Gundam 0083: Stardust Memory        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Gundam Stamen Folding bazooka Beam rifle Beam saber Folding shield   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam 0083: Stardust Memory\"}','2026-02-10 01:39:14','2026-02-10 01:39:14'),
(2209,143,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/NulPq0SJ75tecBszwXwt/h/mg-gat-x105e-strike-noir-gundam','Bandai MG GAT-X105E Strike Noir Gundam - Newtype','<p>Strike Noir Gundam, the protagonists of Mobile Suit Gundam Seed CE73-Stargazer, has been added to the MG series.  With new wrist joints, it is easier to pose than ever before while using the many weapons that are included as part of this kit!       Product Features  1/100 Scale  Made of plastic From the Mobile Suit Gundam Seed CE73-Stargazer anime Fully articulated once complete Action Base not included        Box Contents  Pieces to build   Strike Noir Gundam  2 High Energy Beam rifles  2 Shorty Beam Rifles Large Beam Rifle 2 Swords 2 Sword effects Rocket anchor 8 Hands   Decal sheet Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed Stargazer\"}','2026-02-10 01:40:15','2026-02-10 01:40:15'),
(2210,145,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/nB3sfcRvQf3jjCBj0Bzk/h/mg-zgmf-x20a-strike-freedom-gundam','Bandai MG ZGMF-X20A Strike Freedom Gundam - Newtype','<p>Based on the Gundam Seed Destiny anime, the Strike Freedom Gundam model kit is in 1/100 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once complete. Strike Freedom Gundam comes with its full load of armaments including dual rifles that can combine, beam sabers that connect at ends, rail guns, chest cannon, and detachable Super DRAGOON wings.      Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of plastic From Mobile Suit Gundam SEED Destiny Fully articulated figure once complete        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Strike Freedom Gundam Dual rifles Beam sabers Rail guns Chest cannon Detachable Super DRAGOON wings 2 Mini-figures Display Base   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed Destiny\"}','2026-02-10 01:42:15','2026-02-10 01:42:15'),
(2211,134,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/C31bp5KEoE5yh7dfhmjm/h/mg-zgmf-x56s-sword-impulse-gundam','Bandai MG ZGMF-X56S/β Sword Impulse Gundam - Newtype','<p>Piloted by Shinn Asuka and Lunamaria Hawke, the Sword variant of the Impulse Gundam from Gundam SEED Destiny joins the Master Grade model kit series in 1/100 scale! Build its 2 massive anti-ship swords and combine at the hilt to recreate scenes from the anime. This set also includes pieces to build its beam rifle, shield, and beam boomerangs. Impulse Gundam can also separate into its modular components to recreate docking sequences seen in the show!      Product Features  1/100 scale Made of PVC and ABS Based on the Gundam SEED Destiny anime series Part of the Master Grade model kit line Sword Impulse version        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Sword Impulse Gundam 2 Excalibur Anti-ship swords 2 Sword effects Beam rifle Shield Beam boomerangs 2 Boomerang effects Sword Silhouette Flyer   Decal sheet Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed Destiny\"}','2026-02-10 01:44:16','2026-02-10 01:44:16'),
(2212,127,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/zEuWcG3Fgpe6Vn9mBiHe/h/mg-rx-0-unicorn-gundam-red-or-green-twin-frame-edition-titanium-finish','Bandai MG RX-0 Unicorn Gundam (Red or Green Twin Frame Edition) (Titanium Finish) - Newtype','<p>Kit builds ONE Unicorn Gundam with alternate color Psychoframes included. Bandai Japan presents a special plated version of the Gundam Unicorn to commemorate the conclusion of Gundam Unicorn RE:0096 animated series. This kit comes with both red and green Psycoframe parts to build your favorite Gundam Unicorn incarnation. The outer armor has been electroplated to for a vibrant metallic finish. This kit also includes a beam magnum, 2 beam sabers, a hyper bazooka, 24 runners, a marking sticker, tetron sticker, foil sticker, and instruction manual.      Product Features  7.5 inches (19cm) 1/100 scale From the anime series Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn RE:0096 Featuring the RX-0 Unicorn Gundam with a titanium, metallic finish when completed Comes with both red and green Psycoframe parts to build either Unicorn Gundam Includes a beam magnum, 2 beam sabers, hyper bazooka, 24 runners, marking sticker, tetron sticker, foil sticker, and instruction manual        Box Contents  Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn titanium finish model kit Red Psycoframe Green Psycoframe Beam magnum 2 beam sabers Hyper bazooka 24 runners Marking sticker Tetron sticker Foil sticker Instruction manual</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Unicorn\"}','2026-02-10 01:47:15','2026-02-10 01:47:15'),
(2213,172,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/e7KmRy1zht0re8Jspj3L/h/mg-wing-gundam-zero-ew-verka','Bandai MG Wing Gundam Zero EW Ver.Ka - Newtype','<p>Joining the Master Grade (MG) series from Bandai Spirits is the Wing Gundam Zero EW Ver.Ka from the anime series Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz. The Gundam MG 1/100 Wing Gundam Zero EW (Ver.Ka) model kit has been created under the full supervision of Hajime Katoki and features new molding. Each of the joints went through an intense examination to recreate the unfolding and interactive gimmicks for the white wings and firing poses. An incredible new feature allows the Twin Buster Rifle to be stored in the wings, and the transformation into the Neo Bird Mode has been recreated.      Product Features  Approx 6.57 inches (16.69cm) tall 1/100 Scale From the anime series Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz Plastic model kit        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Wing Gundam Zero EW Twin Buster rifle 2 Beam Sabers Shield Pedestal   Foil Sticker Water Transfer Decal Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz\"}','2026-02-10 01:48:14','2026-02-10 01:48:14'),
(2214,30,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/X7ztqcSnmRgyeqeeyLOZ/h/mg-xxxg-00w0-wing-gundam-zero-custom','Bandai MG XXXG-00W0 Wing Gundam Zero Custom - Newtype','<p>Joining the Master Grade (MG) series from Bandai Spirits is the Wing Gundam Zero EW from the anime series Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz. The model has been created under the full supervision of Hajiome Katoki and comes with its Twin Buster Rifle which can combine for its iconic shooting pose. A custom display stand, two beam sabers and deployable shoulder machine cannons are also included.      Product Features  1/100 Scale From the anime series Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz Custom display stand included Includes scale figure (unpainted) of Heero Yui        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Wing Gundam Zero EW Twin Buster Rifle 2 Beam sabers Shoulder machine cannons Display stand   Heero Yui figure (unpainted) Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz\"}','2026-02-10 01:49:17','2026-02-10 01:49:17'),
(2215,31,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/Yc1k8pJvs1v8aBWapt5m/h/mg-xxxg-01w-wing-gundam-verka','Bandai MG XXXG-01W Wing Gundam Ver.Ka - Newtype','<p>Joining the Master Grade (MG) series from Bandai Spirits is the Wing Gundam Ver. Ka from the anime series Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz. Wing Gundam gets the &quot;Katoki&quot; treatment and includes over 260 pieces, with ever piece coming molded in color meaning no paint is needed. The model can also transform into bird mode.      Product Features  1/100 Scale From the anime series Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz Plastic model kit Can transform into bird mode        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Wing Gundam Ver. Ka Buster rifle Beam Sabers Energy caps   Foil Stickers Transfer Decals Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Wing\"}','2026-02-10 01:51:14','2026-02-10 01:51:14'),
(2216,146,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/LVrEYUVusAlLbbov3aK3/h/mg-yms-15-gyan','Bandai MG YMS-15 Gyan - Newtype','<p>This knight-like mobile suit from the original Gundam TV series includes a massive beam sword with an LED light up feature. The shield contains a large number of bombs and missiles that can be seen under the outer armor and includes effect parts to simulate weapons being launched. The set also comes with a 1/20 scale unpainted figure of M&#039;Quve.      Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of plastic Part of the Master Grade model kit line Based on the original Gundam series Comes with an LED beam saber that lights up and 1/20 scale unpainted figure of M&#039;Quve        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Gyan Beam saber Shield   M&#039;Quve figure Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\"}','2026-02-10 01:52:14','2026-02-10 01:52:14'),
(2217,262,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/hjyLBGBhICDigNL8OK0N/h/delpi-decal-mgex-strike-freedom-gundam-gold-holo','Delpi Decal MGEX Strike Freedom Gundam - [Gold HOLO] - Newtype','<p>Premium 1/100 scale waterslide decals by Delpi!  MGEX Strike Freedom Gundam [Holographic Version - GOLD]  Model kit not included (sold separately).</p>','{\"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed Destiny\"}','2026-02-10 01:54:16','2026-02-10 01:54:16'),
(2218,173,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/YvNO7xYH5IAMfB9d8UZy/h/mgsd-freedom-gundam','Bandai MGSD Freedom Gundam - Newtype','<p>Bandai&#039;s taken the incredible plamo technology of the Master Grade (MG) series and condensed it into the body of an SD Gundam! The first kit in the high-end &quot;MGSD&quot; lineup is the Freedom Gundam, packed with the most mobility, gimmicks, and details in the history of the SD series!  When built, the MGSD Freedom Gundam is approximately 115mm (4.53 in) in height, with many parts of the internal frame equipped with movable gimmicks for smooth articulation. The main camera and twin eyes are made of a double-layered structure with clear parts. Bandai&#039;s new &quot;Real Metallic Gloss Injection&quot; technology is used in various parts to achieve a metallic effect. New &quot;Reflection Cut&quot; mechanism is used on the clear parts inside the wing binder. Molding color of the external armor is of a 2-tone color composition to add more precision. The head is movable on three axes. The internal structure allows for various dynamic poses, such as chin tilting and facial protrusion. Multiple movable axes built into the torso allow for a wide range of left/right swinging and forward/backward tilting motion. Pivotal hip joints significantly increase the range of motion of the legs. Swing mechanism at the shoulder joints enhances the range of motion of the arms. Forearms are equipped with an extension gimmick, allowing the arms to be bent to a further angle. Knee armor and verniers behind the knees are interlocked when bending the legs to ensure a full range of motion. In addition, the movable toes allow for a natural kneeling position despite being an SD!     Product Features  4.53 inches (11.5cm) Made of plastic Based on &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam SEED&quot; anime series Part of the MGSD model kit series        Box Contents  Pieces to build:  MGSD Freedom Gundam Wings Beam rifle Shield 2x Beam saber parts     Reflective Stickers Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MGSD - Master Grade Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed\"}','2026-02-10 01:56:13','2026-02-10 01:56:13'),
(2219,261,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/s5aUGuMGUB4fnqwwiCuV/h/mgsd-gundam-barbatos','Bandai MGSD Gundam Barbatos - Newtype','<p>Introducing the Gundam Barbatos from the groundbreaking &quot;MGSD&quot; series, a new dimension of SD High-End brand that combines the technology of MG (Master Grade) with the SD Gundam framework! Standing approximately 115mm tall, the SD-scale rendition of Gundam Barbatos faithfully captures the iconic &quot;Gundam Frame&quot; features. The head and neck can be articulated in four axes, allowing for various dynamic poses such as tilting the chin or looking up toward the sky. The Barbatos is equipped with a wide range of motion by incorporating movable axes within the torso, enabling swinging from left to right and forward and backward tilting. The movement of the chest is synchronized with the expansion and contraction of the side abdominal cylinders. The shoulder connection utilizes a swing mechanism, enhancing the range of motion for the arms. The cylinder on the elbow moves in tandem with the arm, providing synchronized articulation. Featuring the unique MGSD original gimmick, pulling down the lower part of the shoulder armor activates the linked expansion of the central armor. The knee armor moves in conjunction with the bending of the legs, while the armor on the back of the knee can move independently without hindering the leg&#039;s motion. The twin eyes are created using a double-layer structure, combining intricately detailed internal and clear parts for a stunning visual effect. MGSD original clear parts with precision-shaped processing, designed to reflect light efficiently, are employed on the chest, knees, and shoulders, introducing a shining technique. The Barbatos also utilizes the &quot;Real Metallic Gloss Injection&quot; material in glossy injection molding, enhancing the metallic sheen on the fine details. The backpack allows mounting a sword, a 300mm smoothbore gun, and a mace. The 300mm smoothbore gun can be transformed into a storage state by extending the barrel and rotating it 180 degrees. The mace features an MGSD original gimmick where pushing the handle extends the tip and unfolds four blades in synchronized motion.    Product Features  4.53 inches (11.5cm) Made of plastic From &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam: Iron-Blooded Orphans&quot;  Part of the MGSD series No adhesives are required for assembly Interchangeable parts and accessories        Box Contents  Pieces to build:  Gundam Barbatos Mace Sword 300mm Smoothbore cannon Joint parts     Decal sheet Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MGSD - Master Grade Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\", \"series\": \"Iron-Blooded Orphans\"}','2026-02-10 01:57:21','2026-02-10 01:57:21'),
(2220,604,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/D2JglkyzgypkCQDgCu3G/h/mgsd-wing-gundam-zero-ew','Bandai MGSD Wing Gundam Zero EW - Newtype','<p>Bandai adds the Wing Gundam Zero from Mobile Suit Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz to their high-end SD brand, MGSD! The main wings of the Wing Binder combine mobility and beauty, deploying to reveal silver parts inside and clear parts with reflection-cut processing. When the upper wings of the secondary wings are pulled up, the lower wings deploy in tandem, allowing you to recreate the Wing Gundam Zero&#039;s iconic atmospheric entry pose! This kit features the first-ever variable mechanism in the MGSD series, enabling two Neo Bird forms: the Outer Atmospheric Mode with folded main wings and the Atmospheric Mode with deployed main wings. Each armor part features a deployment gimmick, with dynamic movement across the head unit, shoulder armor, and skirt allowing for full range of motion. The Twin Buster Rifle includes a barrel-extension gimmick and a joint deployment mechanism that connects to the arm for increased holding power. The MGSD series&#039; unique frame structure ensures a detailed internal frame with smooth articulation, layered camera details, and multi-layered clear and internal parts for a realistic appearance. Product Features  SD-style detail and articulation: High-end design with MG-level features Variable Mechanism: Recreate two Neo Bird forms (Outer Atmospheric and Atmospheric) Dynamic Wings: Deployable Wing Binder with stunning reflective and clear parts Multi-layered detail: Realistic camera structures and internal frame  Box Contents  Wing Gundam Zero Twin Buster Rifle Shield Effect parts (x2) Marking stickers</p>','{\"line\": \"MGSD - Master Grade Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\", \"series\": \"Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz\"}','2026-02-10 01:59:15','2026-02-10 01:59:15'),
(2221,658,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/bIxgdq6xPT63PMX2ms9B/h/moderoid-side-gr-arklaud-titanomachia','Good Smile Company Moderoid SIDE:GR Arklaud (Titanomachia) - Newtype','<p>A new SIDE:GR entry from “Titanomachia,” the original project by modeler, designer, producer, and multimedia creator NAOKI, joins the MODEROID plastic model kit series. This release brings the α Grade Grim Reaper Arklaud, one of the feared 13 Blades of the Feyetoll Empire, into detailed 3D form with close supervision from NAOKI himself. Designed at 1/48 scale and standing approximately 195mm tall, Arklaud features a fully articulated frame that supports dynamic combat poses while preserving the sharp, mechanical aesthetic unique to Titanomachia. The kit includes a robust selection of weapons and display options, allowing builders to recreate Arklaud’s imposing battlefield presence. Arklaud comes equipped with the massive great sword Ascalon, which can be mounted to either the left or right thruster using interchangeable mount parts, and the beam rifle Greif Schnabel, which can be displayed in its powerful Burst Mode through parts replacement. Interchangeable components also allow the mecha to be displayed with or without shoulder hardpoints, giving builders flexibility in customizing its silhouette. Adding further depth to the display, two pilot miniature figures in matching scale are included, enhancing the sense of scale and immersion within the Titanomachia universe. With color-separated runners and MODEROID’s user-friendly construction, Arklaud offers both visual impact and rewarding build satisfaction. Product Features  Based on Arklaud from NAOKI’s original work Titanomachia  1/48 scale, approx. 195mm in height Includes great sword Ascalon and beam rifle Greif Schnabel Optional shoulder hardpoints Includes two 1/48-scale pilot figures Snap-fit assembly; painting optional   Box Contents  Parts to build Arklaud Interchangeable hand parts Great sword Ascalon Beam rifle Greif Schnabel Mount and Burst Mode parts Shoulder hardpoint parts Pilot miniature figures ×2 Assembly instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"Moderoid\", \"scale\": \"1/48\", \"series\": \"Titanomachia\"}','2026-02-10 02:01:16','2026-02-10 02:01:16'),
(2222,657,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/rJKsbqkUV0mTCXqNC5ZY/h/moderoid-side-gr-edelstein-ii-zwei-titanomachia','Good Smile Company Moderoid SIDE:GR Edelstein II (Zwei) (Titanomachia) - Newtype','<p>The MODEROID Titanomachia series begins with the impressive α Grade Grim Reaper: Edelstein II (Zwei), a 10m-class large humanoid weapon designed by NAOKI. This 1/48 scale plastic model kit stands approximately 6.9 inches tall and is fully articulated for dynamic posing. Bringing the world of Titanomachia to life, this kit is a must-have for fans of mecha and model building alike. Under the close supervision of designer NAOKI, the Edelstein II (Zwei) features meticulous detail and interchangeable parts for a variety of weapon configurations. The included rifle can be displayed in multiple forms, while two blades attach to the waist for added realism. Two pilot mini-figures in the same scale are also included (painting required for miniatures). Product Features:   Height: Approximately 6.9 inches (17.5 cm)  Material: Made of plastic  Series: Based on the Titanomachia series by NAOKI  Part of: The MODEROID line of model kits  Articulation: Fully articulated joints for posing after assembly  Customization: Includes weapons and pilot mini-figures  Box Contents:  Pieces to build SIDE  Edelstein II (Zwei)   Rifle with interchangeable parts 2 Blades (attachable at waist) 2 Pilot mini-figures (unpainted)  Instructions: May or may not include English translation  Bring the epic mecha battles of Titanomachia into your collection with this finely detailed and highly poseable MODEROID Edelstein II model kit!</p>','{\"line\": \"Moderoid\", \"brand\": \"Titanomachia\", \"scale\": \"1/48\"}','2026-02-10 02:03:15','2026-02-10 02:03:15'),
(2223,611,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/UF3Vav8Q62xQ9zp7DTVJ/h/easycutting-mat-type-b','Infini Model Easycutting Mat - Type B - Newtype','<p>This is not like any other products. Please check it up carefully.Our cutting matte is not produced using mold. We manufacture them by scribing the acrylic plate using Universal Laser.After that, we do the primer treatment, orange color coating, UV drying in order. 1.Easy Cutting Mat Type B B type can cut masking tape in any size you want easily without ruler. Straight line for art knife, circle cutter is needed for curves and circles. Cutting mat type B requires circle cutter, so it will come in handy if you prepare Circle cutter as well. Circle cutter got sold out pretty well in Korea.There are some brands that produce circle cutter such as Olfa, but the best circle cutter that Suits with easy cutting is the one made by Platz, Japan.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-10 02:06:14','2026-02-10 02:06:14'),
