(2235,602,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/cecApgxwg8OqZEo8leYu/h/option-parts-set-gunpla-01-aile-striker','Bandai Option Parts Set Gunpla 01 - Aile Striker - Newtype','<p>This option parts set from Bandai includes everything you need to convert your Entry Grade 1/144 Strike Gundam into the Aile Strike Gundam! 3mm and C-type joint parts are included and can be selected depending on the model, making this set compatible with other Entry Grade and HG kits! A wealth of armaments, such as a bazooka and the &quot;Grand Slam,&quot; are also included! *Model kits shown in product photos are not included (sold separately).    Product Features  Made of plastic From the &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam SEED&quot; anime series Part of the &quot;GUNPLA&quot; line Compatible with High Grade series models        Box Contents  Pieces to build:  Aile Striker 2x Beam Saber Energy pack Joint parts set Grand slam Bazooka Anti-aircraft shotgun     Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed\"}','2026-02-10 02:37:16','2026-02-10 02:37:16'),
(2236,280,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/5IiWKldLCj8qufR5peSX/h/option-parts-set-gunpla-02-launcher-striker-sword-striker','Bandai Option Parts Set Gunpla 02 - Launcher Striker & Sword Striker - Newtype','<p>This option parts set from Bandai includes everything you need to convert your 1/144 Strike Gundam into the Launcher Strike Gundam or Sword Strike Gundam! 3mm and C-type joint parts are included and can be selected depending on the model, making this set compatible with other Entry Grade and HG kits! A wealth of armaments, such as a bazooka and the &quot;Grand Slam,&quot; are also included! You can recreate Perfect Strike Gundam by combining it with the Option Parts Set Gunpla 01 - Aile Striker! *Entry Grade GAT-X105 Strike Gundam shown in photos not included (sold separately).    Product Features  Made of plastic From the &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam SEED&quot; anime series Part of the &quot;GUNPLA&quot; line Compatible with Entry Grade &amp;amp; High Grade series model kits        Box Contents  Pieces to build:  Launcher striker Sword Striker Effect parts set Joint parts set Lead wire      Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed\"}','2026-02-10 02:38:18','2026-02-10 02:38:18'),
(2237,279,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/qf3dn4pWiAuufIApFviU/h/option-parts-set-gunpla-14-gunbarrel-striker','Bandai Option Parts Set Gunpla 14 - Gunbarrel Striker - Newtype','<p>The Gunbarrel Striker from Mobile Suit Gundam Seed MSV joins Bandai’s Option Parts Set series! Transforming from its fighter plane form to a backpack, it can attach to various Gunpla for added customization. Parts replacement allows you to deploy the Gunbarrel for more dynamic displays, and the clear canopy adds a realistic touch. Combine with the 1/144-scale Entry Grade Strike Gundam to recreate the Gunbarrel Strike Gundam! Product Features  Transforms between fighter plane and backpack modes Clear canopy for added detail Parts replacement for Gunbarrel deployment Compatible with various 1/144-scale Gunpla kits Combine with EG Strike Gundam (sold separately) to form Gunbarrel Strike Gundam  Box Contents  Gunbarrel Striker Gatling Gun Gunbarrel Bullet Turret (x4) Joint Parts (x1 set)</p>','{\"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\"}','2026-02-10 02:40:13','2026-02-10 02:40:13'),
(2238,67,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/7JEXE8RGCWQpRiBbvSLa/h/hgibo-029-mobile-armor-hashmal','Bandai HGIBO 029 Mobile Armor Hashmal - Newtype','<p>Bandai Japan presents this mysterious, large-scale mobile weaponry available for the High Grade series from the anime series Mobile Suit Gundam: Iron-Blooded Orphans. Its size is spectacular even compared with the HG Gundam Barbatos Lupus! This model kit includes 8 runners, wire, a foil sticker, and instruction manual.      Product Features  8 inches (20.3cm) 1/144 Scale Made of plastic From the anime series Mobile Suit Gundam: Iron-Blooded Orphans Featuring a fully articulated large size Mobile Armor figure when completed        Box Contents  Pieces to build Mobile Armor Hasmall Wire Foil sticker Instruction manual</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Iron-Blooded Orphans\"}','2026-02-10 02:41:16','2026-02-10 02:41:16'),
(2239,265,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/KOB6qijmUHxEh7EzO760/h/hgibo-035-gundam-kimaris-vidar','Bandai HGIBO 035 Gundam Kimaris Vidar - Newtype','<p>Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam Iron-Blooded Orphans anime, this Gundam Kimaris Vidar model kit is in the 1/144 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once built.       Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of PS, PE, and PVC Based on Mobile Suit Gundam Iron-Blooded Orphans  Part of the High Grade model kit line Action Base not included        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Gundam Kimaris Vidar Drill lance Sword  Sub-arm shield unit Drill knee blade   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Iron-Blooded Orphans\"}','2026-02-10 02:42:17','2026-02-10 02:42:17'),
(2240,66,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/YT76F8oEZL0iRD4OJVU6/h/hgibo-031-helmwige-reincar','Bandai HGIBO 031 Helmwige Reincar - Newtype','<p>From the Iron-Blooded Orphans Gundam anime, comes this HG 1/144 scale model kit of Helmwige Reincar. Once completed the figure is fully articulated and will make a wonderful addition to any Gundam collection!      Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of PS, PE, and PVC Based on Mobile Suit Gundam Iron-Blooded Orphans  Part of the High Grade model kit line        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Helmeig Reincar Valkyrie Buster Sword   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Iron-Blooded Orphans\"}','2026-02-10 02:44:13','2026-02-10 02:44:13'),
(2241,76,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/qIoIy9QlKfHwWWKoC0uo/h/hgibo-009-man-rodi','Bandai HGIBO 009 Man Rodi - Newtype','<p>From the Iron-Blooded Orphans anime comes this HG 1/144 scale model kit of Man Rodi. Once completed the figure is fully articulated and will make a wonderful addition to any Gundam collection!      Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic From Mobile Suit Gundam: Iron-Blooded Orphans Part of the High Grade (HG) model kit lineup  Action Base not included        Box Contents  Pieces to build   Man Rodi Submachine gun Clever   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Iron-Blooded Orphans\"}','2026-02-10 02:45:15','2026-02-10 02:45:15'),
(2242,593,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/H89BWCUV8LtNeLPuyPLZ/h/hgibo-034-reginlaze-julia','Bandai HGIBO 034 Reginlaze Julia - Newtype','<p>From the Iron-Blooded Orphans anime comes this HG 1/144 scale model kit of Reginlaze Julia. Once completed the figure is fully articulated and will make a wonderful addition to any Gundam collection!      Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic Based on Mobile Suit Gundam: Iron-Blooded Orphans Part of the High Grade HG lineup        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Reginlaze Julia  2 Swords Stand   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"HG - High Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Iron-Blooded Orphans\"}','2026-02-10 02:46:17','2026-02-10 02:46:17'),
(2243,183,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/mmTRnAefuegbPw5ow4lt/h/pg-ms-06f-zaku-ii','Bandai PG MS-06F Zaku II - Newtype','<p>This Perfect Grade Gundam model kit features the MS-06F Zaku II! Presented in 1/60 scale this highly detailed model kit is sure to impress. Based off the Zaku II from the Mobile Suit Gundam anime.      Product Features  1/60 Scale Made of plastic Based on the Zaku II from Mobile Suit Gundam Includes machine gun and Heat Hawk        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Zaku II Machine gun Heat Hawk   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"PG - Perfect Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/60\", \"series\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\"}','2026-02-10 02:48:16','2026-02-10 02:48:16'),
(2244,141,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/A3jfi5xpBLV81YImVGNE/h/gmd-1-60-ms-06r-1a-zaku-ii-shin-matsunaga-gk','SH Studio GMD 1/60 MS-06R-1A Zaku II Shin Matsunaga GK - Newtype','<p>Shin Matsunaga&#039;s Zaku variant strikes a contrast against the typical Zaku colorways, and GM Dream brings this to us in great detail at 1/60 - PG scale. Also, our bundle includes a pretty sweet bazooka. This is a resin conversion kit, which will require a base kit. This is not for beginners. Includes:   Zaku II Shin Matsunaga Resin Conversion Kit   Zaku II Shin Matsunaga Bazooka   Requires:  Bandai PG Zaku II MS-06S or MS-06F or SH Studio 1/60 Frame Type B Advanced modeling skills</p>','{\"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/60\", \"series\": \"Gundam: The Origin\"}','2026-02-10 02:50:14','2026-02-10 02:50:14'),
(2245,130,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/8q0W5dRIDplgZOwCuz3T/h/sdbb-364-00-qan-t','Bandai SDBB 364 00 Qan[T] - Newtype','<p>■ The protagonist of the movie &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam OO&quot;, Double O Quanta appeared as a BB fighter. ■ The lens part is reproduced with clear parts. ■ You can play with the optional double-o riser, weapons parts of Gundam Exia. ■ A dedicated base for sparkle green with image of GN particles attached. Molded product × 4, seal × 1</p>','{\"line\": \"SD - Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\", \"series\": \"Gundam 00\"}','2026-02-10 02:50:18','2026-02-10 02:50:18'),
(2246,125,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/I0LruxSR32nl8B8u8j1I/h/pg-zgmf-x20a-strike-freedom-gundam','Bandai PG ZGMF-X20A Strike Freedom Gundam - Newtype','<p>With its expandable &quot;Super Dragoons,&quot; the Strike Freedom Gundam is the largest PG kit ever released! Completely new molds for the time were used in the production of this kit, and Bandai had outdone itself in engineering! Made of so many small (and not so small) parts, particularly in the joints and armor where the gold frame parts are viewable. Bandai has designed newer, sturdier joints to hold this hefty kit once it is completed, and it includes weapons and accessories such as the &quot;Beam Shield, &quot;two &quot;Beam Rifles,&quot; two &quot;Railguns,&quot; eight &quot;Super Dragoons,&quot; a display base, and an LED unit for the head!  Plus, Katoki Hajime&#039;s notorious plethora of markings! Are you game?    Product Features  1/60 Scale Made of plastic Based on Mobile Suit Gundam SEED Destiny Features LED light effect (CR1220 battery for LED sold separately)         Box Contents  Pieces to build:  Strike Freedom Gundam 8x Dragoon wings 2x Beam Rifles 2x Railguns Beam Shield     LED light Decal Sheet Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"PG - Perfect Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/60\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed Destiny\"}','2026-02-10 02:53:14','2026-02-10 02:53:14'),
(2247,184,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/ra34tbK4AMAdJtKt9Lka/h/pg-wing-gundam-zero-custom','Bandai PG Wing Gundam Zero Custom - Newtype','<p>From the Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz anime movie comes a Perfect Grade model kit of the iconic Wing Gundam Zero Custom in 1/60 scale! This huge kit includes 14 individual feather pieces for the wings, two beam sabers, two huge beam rifles, and features LED light-up eyes and chest piece along with a die-cast metal hip joint for further stabilization.      Product Features  1/60 Scale Made of ABS, die-cast, PE, PET, and PS Based on the Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz anime movie Part of the Perfect Grade model kit line Requires a battery for LED light-up eyes (not included)         Box Contents  Pieces to build  Wing Gundam Zero Custom 2 Beam rifles 2 Beam sabers   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"PG - Perfect Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/60\", \"series\": \"Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz\"}','2026-02-10 02:54:14','2026-02-10 02:54:14'),
(2248,231,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/HHwPxeykyKPLvA8cI9CZ/h/plamax-1-24-sv-01-x-ath-02-strike-dog','Max Factory PLAMAX 1/24 SV-01 X / ATH-02 Strike Dog - Newtype','<p>The legendary soft vinyl kit is back, now transformed into a fully articulated plastic model! Originally released in 1993, the iconic &quot;Strike Dog&quot; soft vinyl kit, cherished by Votoms fans for its sharp design, perfect proportions, and meticulous detailing, has been upgraded with modern technology. This new version retains the original’s aesthetic but features revamped joints and a redesigned cockpit for improved articulation and realism. The kit comes in five different runner colors, allowing for easy assembly without the need for painting, though additional paintwork can enhance its look to match the series even more closely. Max Factory’s Strike Dog is a modern revival that brings nostalgia and innovation together! Product Features:  Approximately 6.9 inches tall (17.5 cm) Made of plastic From the Armored Trooper Votoms anime series Part of the PLAMAX model kit line Highly articulated for dynamic posing Snap-fit assembly for ease English translation of instructions may not be included  Box Contents:  Strike Dog model pieces Solid Shooter Epsilon figure 4 Right hand parts Water-slide decals Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"PLAMAX\", \"brand\": \"Armored Trooper Votoms\", \"scale\": \"1/24\"}','2026-02-10 02:55:16','2026-02-10 02:55:16'),
(2249,198,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/Qq0WZcYCzVxSkumtBE06/h/plamax-divine-arsenal-aa-zeus-sky-thunder','Good Smile Company PLAMAX Divine Arsenal AA-ZEUS - Sky Thunder - Newtype','<p>From Yu-Gi-Oh!, the mighty Divine Arsenal AA-ZEUS – Sky Thunder joins the PLAMAX plastic model series! This fully articulated kit brings the iconic card to life with precise modeling, sharp details, and dynamic proportions. Standing at an impressive 190mm tall and 200mm wide, this kit captures the overwhelming presence of AA-ZEUS in three dimensions. By adjusting the massive flight unit and using interchangeable parts, builders can recreate the epic battle scene from the Yu-Gi-Oh! Card Game 25th Anniversary Special Video. The runners are molded in seven different colors, making it possible to achieve an accurate finish with simple assembly and sticker application. For advanced modelers, additional painting can bring out even greater detail, allowing for a more faithful recreation of the original card illustration.    Product Features  Approx. 190mm tall × 200mm wide when completed From Yu-Gi-Oh!  Adjustable flight unit &amp;amp; interchangeable parts for dynamic posing Recreate the 25th Anniversary Special Video battle scene Seven-color molded runners with stickers for easy completion         Box Contents  Pieces to build AA-ZEUS Flight unit parts Interchangeable parts for dynamic posing Stickers for detailing Assembly instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"PLAMAX\", \"brand\": \"Yu-Gi-Oh!\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-10 02:56:15','2026-02-10 02:56:15'),
(2250,256,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/ULL1zwvNeFhhU5t5S8xf/h/pokemon-ceruledge','Bandai Pokémon Ceruledge - Newtype','<p>Ceruledge from Pokémon joins the Pokémon Select Series model kit lineup from Bandai! This Fire/Ghost-type Pokémon features a simple and intuitive assembly, making it perfect for both beginners and experienced builders. With multiple points of articulation, you can pose Ceruledge in dynamic battle stances. Once completed, the model stands approximately 4.25 inches tall, making it a compact yet striking addition to any Pokémon collection. Product Features  Approx. 4.25 inches (10.8cm) tall Made of plastic Based on the Pokémon franchise Part of the Pokémon Select Series Easy-to-assemble snap-fit model kit  Box Contents  Pieces to build Ceruledge Stand Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"Entry Grade\", \"brand\": \"PokÃ©mon\"}','2026-02-10 02:57:16','2026-02-10 02:57:16'),
(2251,241,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/zYKswFUP2VEuVx4A6jXU/h/pokemon-cinderace','Bandai Pokémon Cinderace - Newtype','<p>The 50th item in the Pokemon model line is Cinderace! Build your own Cinderace pokémon as an easy-to-assemble model kit! Once complete, Cinderace has multiple points of articulation.      Product Features  8.07 inches (20.50cm) Made of plastic From Pokemon Becomes an articulated figure once complete        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Cinderace  Attack effect with stand Base   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"Entry Grade\", \"brand\": \"PokÃ©mon\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-10 02:58:16','2026-02-10 02:58:16'),
(2252,235,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/4FAxD625NfDz5CsOfrF7/h/pokemon-model-kit-quick-07-eevee-sleeping-pose','Bandai Pokémon Model Kit Quick!! 07 Eevee (Sleeping Pose) - Newtype','<p>A simple kit where you can easily imagine what the completed kit will look like after seeing the runners. Snaps together without any glue!      Product Features  4.53 inches (11.5cm) long Made of plastic Molded color parts Requires no tools, glue, or paint        Box Contents  Pieces to build Eevee Decals Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"Entry Grade\", \"brand\": \"PokÃ©mon\"}','2026-02-10 02:59:17','2026-02-10 02:59:17'),
(2253,253,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/9i3feQuJ4iAWbhsCv1t8/h/pokemon-gardevoir','Bandai Pokémon Gardevoir - Newtype','<p>Build your own Gardevoir pokémon as an easy-to-assemble model kit! Once complete, Gardevoir&#039;s head can move, and with the additional hand and arm parts a variety of poses can be recreated.      Product Features  Made of plastic Molded color parts Easy to assemble        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Gardevoir Arm parts (left and right) Hand parts (left and right)   2 Foil decals Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"Entry Grade\", \"brand\": \"PokÃ©mon\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-10 03:01:14','2026-02-10 03:01:14'),
