(2255,255,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/ycbq7V4MKVBBUwI3Skuy/h/pokemon-meowscarada','Bandai Pokémon Meowscarada - Newtype','<p>Meowscarada from Pokémon joins the Pokémon Select Series model kit lineup from Bandai! This Grass/Dark-type Pokémon is brought to life in a fun and easy-to-assemble kit, perfect for fans and model builders of all levels. With multiple points of articulation, Meowscarada can be posed in a variety of dynamic battle stances. Once completed, the model stands approximately 4.25 inches tall, making it a compact yet detailed addition to any Pokémon collection. Product Features  Approx. 4.25 inches (10.8cm) tall Made of plastic Based on the Pokémon franchise Part of the Pokémon Select Series Easy-to-assemble snap-fit model kit  Box Contents  Pieces to build Meowscarada Stand Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"Entry Grade\", \"brand\": \"PokÃ©mon\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-10 03:03:16','2026-02-10 03:03:16'),
