(2265,244,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/bK1vraa05QC4LwOrzCq6/h/pokemon-model-kit-quick-12-alcremie','Bandai Pokémon Model Kit Quick!! 12 Alcremie - Newtype','<p>Alcremie is now part of Bandai&#039;s &quot;Pokemon Model Kit Quick!!&quot; lineup! He&#039;s easy and fun to assemble, with pre-colored parts that can be removed from the sprues by hand. Stickers are included for his markings. A simple kit where you can easily imagine what the completed kit will look like after seeing the runners. Snaps together without any glue! ** Pokémon Model Kit Quick!! 05 Scorbunny not included (sold separately) **         Product Features  3.4 inches (8.7cm Made of plastic From the Pokemon series Part of the &quot;Quick!!&quot; model kit line No tools, glue, or paint required!        Box Contents  Pieces to build Alcremie Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"Entry Grade\", \"brand\": \"PokÃ©mon\"}','2026-02-10 03:14:18','2026-02-10 03:14:18'),
(2266,245,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/Bh64h14GeIoFui3kPjy4/h/pokemon-model-kit-quick-14-tepig','Bandai Pokémon Model Kit Quick!! 14 Tepig - Newtype','<p>Tepig from &quot;Pokemon&quot; joins the &quot;Plamo Collection Quick!!&quot; model-kit lineup from Bandai!  Ideal for beginners, the kit includes parts that can be removed from the runners without tools. The parts are all in color, too, and are easy to assemble. Stickers are included for his eyes and markings, too. When you&#039;re done, you&#039;ll have an adorable figure to display. Perfect for youngsters, and also for anyone who&#039;d just like a relaxing activity!    Product Features  Approximately 3.23 inches (8.2cm) long Made of plastic Based on the &quot;Pokemon&quot; franchise Simple and easy to build No need for tools        Box Contents  Pieces to build:  Tepig    Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"Entry Grade\", \"brand\": \"PokÃ©mon\"}','2026-02-10 03:15:16','2026-02-10 03:15:16'),
(2267,246,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/hTmfTd7bCZTV2P0pIe7B/h/pokemon-model-kit-quick-16-pikachu-sitting-pose','Bandai Pokémon Model Kit Quick!! 16 Pikachu (Sitting Pose) - Newtype','<p>Pikachu, in a cute sitting pose, joins the &quot;Pokemon Plamo Collection Quick!!&quot; from Bandai! Easy assembly without tools! The overall height is about 82mm. Enjoy charming, cute poses that you will want to collect. Both easy assembly and colorful finish are achieved by dividing special parts. The moment you see the runner, the finished product comes to mind. Touch gate system without tools.       Product Features  Approx. 3.23 inches (8.2cm) Made of plastic From the &quot;Pokemon&quot; franchise Part of the &quot;Quick!!&quot; model kit line Easy to assemble        Box Contents  Pieces to build: Pikachu Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"Entry Grade\", \"brand\": \"PokÃ©mon\"}','2026-02-10 03:16:17','2026-02-10 03:16:17'),
(2268,247,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/gZHVhKOfm3ahK3maXmKW/h/pokemon-model-kit-quick-18-sprigatito','Bandai Pokémon Model Kit Quick!! 18 Sprigatito - Newtype','<p>Easy assembly without tools! Sprigatito is the latest from &quot;Pokemon&quot; to land in Bandai&#039;s &quot;Pokemon Plamo Collection Quick!!&quot; model kit lineup! This model kit is easy to assemble and colorful, with careful parts division. The parts are removed easily from the gates, and stickers are included!       Product Features  Approx. 3.4 inches (8.6cm) Made of plastic From the &quot;Pokemon&quot; franchise Part of the &quot;Quick!!&quot; model kit line Easy to assemble        Box Contents  Pieces to build: Sprigatito Stickers Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"Entry Grade\", \"brand\": \"PokÃ©mon\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-10 03:18:14','2026-02-10 03:18:14'),
(2269,248,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/BaQIBs87XNuvCOcWzgMe/h/pokemon-model-kit-quick-19-quaxly','Bandai Pokémon Model Kit Quick!! 19 Quaxly - Newtype','<p>Easy assembly without tools! Quaxly from &quot;Pokemon&quot; joins Bandai&#039;s &quot;Pokemon Plamo Quick!!&quot; lineup! It&#039;s super-easy to assemble, making it ideal for beginning modelers! The parts are molded in color and removed from the gates with just a touch, without the need for tools. Quaxly&#039;s characteristic glossy hair is represented with a carefully molded part, and stickers are included for his features and markings!       Product Features  Approx. 3.4 inches (8.6cm) Made of plastic From the &quot;Pokemon&quot; franchise Part of the &quot;Quick!!&quot; model kit line Easy to assemble        Box Contents  Pieces to build: Quaxly Stickers Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"Entry Grade\", \"brand\": \"PokÃ©mon\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-10 03:19:16','2026-02-10 03:19:16'),
(2270,249,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/yzaMSpSS1tElCrmXmtPt/h/pokemon-model-kit-quick-20-fuecoco','Bandai Pokémon Model Kit Quick!! 20 Fuecoco - Newtype','<p>Bring the adorable Fire-type starter Pokémon, Fuecoco, to your collection with this easy-to-assemble Quick Model Kit! Designed for hassle-free construction, no tools are required—just snap the parts together using the touch gate method to create a colorful and detailed figure. Standing at 3.46 inches tall, this compact and charming collectible is perfect for Pokémon fans of all ages, offering both simplicity and style. Product Features  Height: 3.46 inches (8.8cm) Made of plastic Based on the Pokémon series Part of the Pokpla series No tools required for assembly  Box Contents  Pieces to build Fuecoco Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"Entry Grade\", \"brand\": \"PokÃ©mon\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-10 03:20:17','2026-02-10 03:20:17'),
