(2272,263,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/xfGGbv3OQReIt12rJaNC/h/pokemon-riolu-lucario','Bandai Pokémon Riolu & Lucario - Newtype','<p>From Bandai Spirits, Riolu &amp;amp; Lucario join the Pokemon model kit line up. Riolu will be an unarticulated model piece while Lucario features articulation that allows him to recreate the Aura Sphere charging pose!      Product Features  4.72 inches (12cm) Made of plastic Molded color parts Requires no tools, glue, or paint Semi-translucent Aura Sphere        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Riolu  Lucario   Aura sphere Aura sphere stand Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"Entry Grade\", \"brand\": \"PokÃ©mon\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-10 03:23:14','2026-02-10 03:23:14'),
(2273,254,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/DUpLibQq12d5VaMnUlMe/h/pokemon-scizor','Bandai Pokémon Scizor - Newtype','<p>Scizor, the fan-favorite Pokémon, makes its grand debut in Bandai&#039;s Pokémon PlaMo Collection Select Series! This plastic model kit is designed for easy assembly, requiring no tools, making it perfect for fans of all ages. Scizor features three interchangeable arm parts with varying angles, allowing for dynamic and customizable poses. Its iconic scissor-like claws can be opened and closed for added realism. This kit also includes a motion effect part and base, enabling action-packed display options straight out of battle. Add Scizor to your Pokémon model kit collection today! Box Contents:  Arm parts (left and right, x1 set) Base Motion effect part Stickers</p>','{\"line\": \"Entry Grade\", \"brand\": \"PokÃ©mon\"}','2026-02-10 03:24:15','2026-02-10 03:24:15'),
(2274,251,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/m8nsaVgKjxNRoI1td45Q/h/pokemon-xerneas','Bandai Pokémon Xerneas - Newtype','<p>From the popular &quot;Pokémon&quot; franchise comes the &quot;Pokémon Select Series&quot; Xerneas model kit from Bandai! This model kit features the memorable legendary Pokemon Xerneas in an easy-to-assemble kit! With various movable axes, it is capable of multiple poses. Make sure to add it to your collection!      Box Contents   Pieces to build:  Xerneas     Display Stand Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"Entry Grade\", \"brand\": \"PokÃ©mon\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-10 03:25:13','2026-02-10 03:25:13'),
(2275,26,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/ORgXMoTmiAIowzsims9X/h/rg-01-rx-78-2-gundam','Bandai RG 01 RX-78-2 Gundam - Newtype','<p>The debut of the Real Grade line starts with the oldest Gundam in the books - the RX-78-2.  This new line reimagines classic designs as if they were to be made in the real world.  Exquisite color separation and surface detail brings the RX-78 to life in the smaller 1/144 scale form factor.  Armor pieces layer over a ready-molded inner frame for easy assembly and maximum articulation.      Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic Part of the Real Grade model kit line Based on Mobile Suit Gundam        Box Contents  Pieces to build   RX-78-2 Gundam Beam rifle Bazooka Shield Core Fighter   Amuro Ray figurine (Standing) Decals Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"RG - Real Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\"}','2026-02-10 03:27:14','2026-02-10 03:27:14'),
(2276,120,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/2c2PwkZzgyocP2vuL0I1/h/rg-05-zgmf-x10a-freedom-gundam','Bandai RG 05 ZGMF-X10A Freedom Gundam - Newtype','<p>Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam SEED anime, the Freedom Gundam model kit is in 1/144 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once complete. The Freedom Gundam also includes interchangeable hands for holding different weaponry. Special marking stickers are provided to simulate the realistic placement of maintenance hatches and ports.       Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic From Mobile Suit Gundam Fully articulated figure once complete        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Freedom Gundam  2 Beam Sabers Anti-Beam Shield  Beam Rifle  Mini Pilot figure Interchangeable hands   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"RG - Real Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\"}','2026-02-10 03:28:13','2026-02-10 03:28:13'),
(2277,108,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/B2zJPkiYnwL8SQZJlkqV/h/rg-10-msz-006-zeta-gundam','Bandai RG 10 MSZ-006 Zeta Gundam - Newtype','<p>Based on the Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam anime, the Zeta Gundam model kit is in 1/144 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once complete and can also be posed in waverider mode without the use of additional parts. Zeta Gundam comes armed with several pieces of weaponry. Additional features include a landing gear for Wave Rider mode as well as grenade packs and a shield underside weapon. Beam saber effect parts may be inserted into the muzzle of the beam rifle as well      Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic From Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam Fully articulated figure once complete        Box Contents  Pieces to build Zeta Gundam Stickers Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"RG - Real Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Zeta Gundam\"}','2026-02-10 03:28:17','2026-02-10 03:28:17'),
(2278,107,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/pCoorYhlzojwOYmOwSlW/h/rg-11-zgmf-x42s-destiny-gundam','Bandai RG 11 ZGMF-X42S Destiny Gundam - Newtype','<p>Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam SEED Destiny anime, the Destiny Gundam model kit is in 1/144 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once complete. The Destiny Gundam also includes a full load out of weapons including beam rifle, palm cannons, high energy beam cannon, composite shield, beam shield, anti-ship sword, and the Flash Edge-2, a hybrid beam boomerang and beam saber.      Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic From Mobile Suit Gundam SEED Destiny Fully articulated figure once complete        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Destiny Gundam Beam rifle Palm cannons High energy beam cannon Composite shield Beam shield Anti-ship sword 2 Flash Edge-2 beam weapons   Decal sheet Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"RG - Real Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed Destiny\"}','2026-02-10 03:30:14','2026-02-10 03:30:14'),
(2279,122,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/YpinKzeogvTcmRPJYn5g/h/mg-gat-x105-aile-strike-gundam-ver-rm','Bandai MG GAT-X105 Aile Strike Gundam Ver. RM - Newtype','<p>Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam SEED anime, the Aile Strike Gundam model kit is in 1/100 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once complete. Aile Strike Gundam comes with a beam rifle, 2 armor Schneiders, shield and 2 beam sabers. A stand resembling the launch bay of the Archangel ship has been included to recreate take off and aerial action poses and includes sitting and standing figures of Kira Yamato and Mu La Flaga.       Product Features  1/100 Scale Made of plastic From Mobile Suit Gundam SEED Fully articulated figure once complete        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Aile Strike Gundam Aile Striker Beam rifle 2 Armor Schneiders Shield 2 Beam saber 2 Kira Yamoto figures  Sitting Standing   2 Mwu la Flaga figures  Sitting Standing   Stand   Decals Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"MG - Master Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/100\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed\"}','2026-02-10 03:31:13','2026-02-10 03:31:13'),
(2280,595,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/5M4PUcgkRuauHnQA8TFy/h/delpi-decal-rg-force-impulse-gundam-spec-ii','Delpi Decal RG Force Impulse Gundam [Spec II] - Newtype','<p>RG 1/144 Force Impulse Gundam [Spec II] Decals High-quality waterslide decals from Delpi! **Refer to product images for instructions on decal placement.</p>',NULL,'2026-02-10 03:33:21','2026-02-10 03:33:21'),
(2281,19,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/8q0W5dRIDplgZOwCuz3T/h/sdbb-364-00-qan-t','Bandai SDBB 364 00 Qan[T] - Newtype','<p>■ The protagonist of the movie &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam OO&quot;, Double O Quanta appeared as a BB fighter. ■ The lens part is reproduced with clear parts. ■ You can play with the optional double-o riser, weapons parts of Gundam Exia. ■ A dedicated base for sparkle green with image of GN particles attached. Molded product × 4, seal × 1</p>','{\"line\": \"SD - Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\", \"series\": \"Gundam 00\"}','2026-02-10 03:34:15','2026-02-10 03:34:15'),
(2282,174,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/55Z719JXoOzpGphCVw32/h/gd-138-rg-god-gundam','Bandai GD-138 RG God Gundam - Newtype','<p>New to the &quot;Gundam Decal&quot; lineup comes a sheet of water transfer decals that can be used for your 1/144 scale models!  Versatile water transfer decals that include markings for unit insignia. Set includes decals and markings suitable for RG God Gundam</p>','{\"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"series\": \"G Gundam\"}','2026-02-10 03:35:16','2026-02-10 03:35:16'),
(2283,282,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/rlFyuesDwAEZAdUDjhKx/h/rg-38-gundam-epyon','Bandai RG 38 Gundam Epyon - Newtype','<p>&quot;Gundam Epyon&quot; from &quot;New Mobile Report Gundam Wing&quot; is commercialized as a completely new RG model! Equipped with a new movable gimmick optimized to swing the beam sword powerfully and naturally! Adopted RG original arrangement with pterosaur motif!  The torso can swing on 2 + 1 axes, and the abdomen can be expanded forward to improve compatibility when bending forward. We adopt lock mechanism to hip joint. Both deformation and movement are compatible, and it is possible to swing robustly and widely. A wide range of expressions can be added to poses with the movable axis added to the upper part of the wrist and the movable forearm roll. Shoulder armor deploys, allowing you to raise your arms while keeping your shoulders in position. It also supports powerful poses that raise the beam sword with both hands. Blade follows the movement of the knee and does not interfere with natural kneeling. The wing parts are linked with the movement of the wings. The height of the wings can be adjusted by moving the base shaft. In MA mode, the corners and mouth can be opened to express facial expressions. A pull-out ball movement is built into the shin to realize the movement of the neck. The movable axis of the thigh creates a flexible neck movement like a pterosaur. Advanced MS joint is adopted for the heat rod. Realizes a sharp form like a sword and flexible movement that draws a spiral. The cable that connects the beam sword and the mount latch uses a lead wire.  Accessories  Beam sword x 1 Beam sword holder x 1 Shield x 1  Heat rod x 1 Hand parts x 1 type Display joint x 2 types (for MS/MA) Lead wire x 1 Realistic decal × 1</p>','{\"line\": \"RG - Real Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\"}','2026-02-10 03:37:14','2026-02-10 03:37:14'),
(2284,91,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/JKDBFulkUN6myVmZnj02/h/g-rework-rg-gundam-exia-decals','G-Rework RG Gundam Exia Decals - Newtype','<p>High-quality 1/144 scale waterslide decals from G-Rework!</p>','{\"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam 00\"}','2026-02-10 03:38:15','2026-02-10 03:38:15'),
(2285,278,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/Cxzqpg1jQljiZ9rEJTMs/h/rg-02-ms-06s-zaku-ii','Bandai RG 02 MS-06S Zaku II - Newtype','<p>Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam anime, the MS-06S Zaku II Commander Type Char Aznable Custom model kit is in 1/144 scale and becomes a fully articulated figure once complete. The Zaku II packs an amazing level of detail (think MG or PG) into an HG-size kit, complete with dynamic action and moving features.       Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic From Mobile Suit Gundam Fully articulated figure once complete        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Char&#039;s Zaku II Char Aznable mini figure   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"RG - Real Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\"}','2026-02-10 03:40:14','2026-02-10 03:40:14'),
(2286,71,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/4pd8W8BDonVcjIQ2KjsV/h/g-rework-rg-msn-06s-sinanju-decals','G-Rework RG MSN-06S Sinanju Decals - Newtype','<p>High-quality 1/144 scale waterslide decals from G-Rework!</p>','{\"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\"}','2026-02-10 03:42:18','2026-02-10 03:42:18'),
(2287,73,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/MJgsbLmyGusN3DOLiY8d/h/rg-21-00-qan-t','Bandai RG 21 00 QAN[T] - Newtype','<p>A new Real Grade from the Gundam 00 universe! The successor to the Exia and 00 Gundam, the 00 Quanta (Qan[t]) incorporates the Real Grade line&#039;s philosophy of utilizing real world inspiration for the fictional technologies of the Gundam universe. To recreate the GN Drive docking and the GN Shield&#039;s range of movement as seen in the Gundam 00 movie, &quot;Awakening of the Trailblazer&quot;, a series of mechanical mounts and swinging joints have been utilized. Frame features special modifications to allow the wrist to run parallel with the arm so the sword can be held horizontally. All weapon gimmicks including conversion between sword and rifle forms have been faithfully recreated.       Product Features  Approximately 5 inches tall 1/144 scale Use of mechanical mounts and swinging joints        Box Contents  Pieces to build  00 Qan[t]   Sticker Instruction manual</p>','{\"line\": \"RG - Real Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\"}','2026-02-10 03:44:16','2026-02-10 03:44:16'),
(2288,11,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/dAbY0xzrgLVC7474zWO3/h/rg-40-rx-78-2-gundam-ver-20','Bandai RG 40 RX-78-2 Gundam [Ver. 2.0] - Newtype','<p>The Grandfather of them all, the RX-78-2 Gundam, gets the 2.0 treatment from Bandai in Real Grade form! The latest design interior frame, featuring an image of a semi-monocoque structure, allows you to replicate the construction of the mobile suit, as seen in the original Mobile Suit Gundam series. The joint structure, which pays homage to the original design, adopts a new structure that bends neatly at the discernable joints by reinterpreting the movable axis. The legs are a reconsideration of the &quot;MS Gundam for hand-to-hand combat&quot; and use joints with a composite frame to draw an outline close to human-like even when moving. The model kit was designed to minimize the appearance of mounting holes and integrate them seamlessly with the rest of the model. The head of complex color is thoroughly replicated by color coding according to the mold color. The eyes, primary camera, magazine drum, and check ducts have been added with precise detail. The panel line, which reflects support from the mechanism, is divided into functional blocks. It is designed with the image of an actual split line. The exterior design, which combines the latest interpretation and a return to the character&#039;s origin, not only adds small and intricate details but also considers the shape of the main silhouette. Edges and curved surfaces are well-defined, and by constructing the white of the main body with a two-tone molding color, RX-78-2 Gundam is re-imagined. As an original gimmick of the Real Grade line, the chest armor covering the cockpit uses a mechanism that opens and closes. Box Contents  Pieces to build:  RX-78-2 Gundam Beam Rifle 2x Beam Sabers Shield Hyper Bazooka Core Fighter Landing Gear parts set Hand parts set     Realistic decals Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"RG - Real Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\"}','2026-02-10 03:47:13','2026-02-10 03:47:13'),
(2289,175,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/KsAZ1WQrZjoeO6vXz38I/h/rg-42-gf13-017nj-shining-gundam','Bandai RG 42 GF13-017NJ Shining Gundam - Newtype','<p>From the classic Mobile Fighter G Gundam anime series comes the 1/144 scale Shining Gundam model kit! Featuring newly designed armor pieces for precise details, this Real Grade (RG) model offers premium articulation for dynamic action poses. Don&#039;t miss the chance to add this legendary Gundam to your collection! Other figures and accessories shown not included (sold separately). Product Features  1/144 scale Made of ABS and PVC Highly detailed with newly worked armor pieces Multiple points of articulation for dynamic posing Part of the Real Grade (RG) line Interchangeable parts and accessories  Box Contents  Pieces to build Shining Gundam Hand parts set 2 Beam sabers Decal sheet Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"RG - Real Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"G Gundam\"}','2026-02-10 03:48:14','2026-02-10 03:48:14'),
(2290,64,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/00SVHz00WyqCOllbIlcE/h/gd-112-rg-unicorn-gundam-decals','Bandai GD-112 RG Unicorn Gundam Decals - Newtype','<p>RG 1/144 Unicorn Gundam Decal</p>',NULL,'2026-02-10 03:49:18','2026-02-10 03:49:18'),
(2291,6,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/0w6WWTehvPoHdiEiDPr3/h/rg-17-wing-gundam-zero-ew','Bandai RG 17 Wing Gundam Zero EW - Newtype','<p>The Wing Gundam Zero Endless Waltz model kit joins the 1/144 scale Real Grade lineup and becomes a fully articulated figure when completed. This version of the Wing Gundam Zero EW is built on a &quot;Zero Frame,&quot; which allows for amazing posability. Some of the feathers on the model&#039;s wings are also poseable thanks to unique joints. The model comes with two buster rifles which can be joined to form one giant weapon.       Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic Part of the Real Grade line Fully articulated once complete Colored plastic means paint is not required but can enhance the model Twin buster rifle can become two rifles        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Wing Gundam Zero Twin buster rifle  Beam saber   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"RG - Real Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz\"}','2026-02-10 03:50:16','2026-02-10 03:50:16'),
(2292,87,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/0w6WWTehvPoHdiEiDPr3/h/rg-17-wing-gundam-zero-ew','Bandai RG 17 Wing Gundam Zero EW - Newtype','<p>The Wing Gundam Zero Endless Waltz model kit joins the 1/144 scale Real Grade lineup and becomes a fully articulated figure when completed. This version of the Wing Gundam Zero EW is built on a &quot;Zero Frame,&quot; which allows for amazing posability. Some of the feathers on the model&#039;s wings are also poseable thanks to unique joints. The model comes with two buster rifles which can be joined to form one giant weapon.       Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic Part of the Real Grade line Fully articulated once complete Colored plastic means paint is not required but can enhance the model Twin buster rifle can become two rifles        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Wing Gundam Zero Twin buster rifle  Beam saber   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"RG - Real Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz\"}','2026-02-10 03:52:13','2026-02-10 03:52:13'),
(2293,75,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/0w6WWTehvPoHdiEiDPr3/h/rg-17-wing-gundam-zero-ew','Bandai RG 17 Wing Gundam Zero EW - Newtype','<p>The Wing Gundam Zero Endless Waltz model kit joins the 1/144 scale Real Grade lineup and becomes a fully articulated figure when completed. This version of the Wing Gundam Zero EW is built on a &quot;Zero Frame,&quot; which allows for amazing posability. Some of the feathers on the model&#039;s wings are also poseable thanks to unique joints. The model comes with two buster rifles which can be joined to form one giant weapon.       Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic Part of the Real Grade line Fully articulated once complete Colored plastic means paint is not required but can enhance the model Twin buster rifle can become two rifles        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Wing Gundam Zero Twin buster rifle  Beam saber   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"RG - Real Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz\"}','2026-02-10 03:53:14','2026-02-10 03:53:14'),
(2294,102,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/fs6B9pd2RiWgpx6kK2u5/h/rg-14-zgmf-x20a-strike-freedom','Bandai RG 14 ZGMF-X20A Strike Freedom - Newtype','<p>Based on the anime series Mobile Suit Gundam SEED Destiny, the Strike Freedom Gundam joins the Real Grade model kit line! Included with the kit are Stike Freedom&#039;s beam rifles, rail guns, chest cannon, beam sabers, beam shield and deployable DRAGOON pods.       Product Features  1/144 Scale Made of plastic Based on the Gundam SEED Destiny anime Part of the Real Grade model kit line Does not include a stand        Box Contents  Pieces to build Strike Freedom Gundam Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"RG - Real Grade\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"1/144\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed Destiny\"}','2026-02-10 03:55:15','2026-02-10 03:55:15'),
(2295,90,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/mC1XoZSgjFdcrZvG9ZPb/h/sdgg-char-s-custom-ms-collection','Bandai SDGG Char\'s Custom MS Collection - Newtype','<p>From SD Gundam G Generation F comes an SD Gundam model kit set of Char&#039;s Custom mobile suits. A unique five-in-one set of SD Gundam kits, all molded in Char-colors representing five of the Mobile Suits that Char has flown in his career. You get the Gundam, Zaku, Dom, Z&#039;Gok, and Gelgoog. All come with weapons, and have numerous opening gimmicks, etc. Great desktop mascots!      Product Features  Made of plastic Based on SD Gundam G Generation F Part of the SD Gundam line Instructions may or may not include English translation        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Zaku II Gelgoog Z&#039;Gok Dom RX-72-2  Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"SD - Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-10 03:56:14','2026-02-10 03:56:14'),
(2296,264,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/N3WWEXPeeqhmUyoxKrBv/h/rg-evangelion-unit-01-dx-transport-platform-set','Bandai RG Evangelion Unit-01 DX Transport Platform Set - Newtype','<p>A new frontier of the Real Grade (RG) series starts with the introduction of the Multipurpose Humanoid Decisive Weapon, Artificial Human Evangelion. The first release is the EVA Unit-01 from Rebuild of Evangelion. The Real Grade line makes these larger than life characters “real”, this RG Evangelion kit features intricate linked parts construction to represent the relaxation and contraction of muscle fibers resulting in a very close emulation of human-joints. The movement of the spine and shoulder blades are linked to the armor parts and follow the movement of the arms and chest, shifting as needed to prevent parts from obstructing each other. From this, realistic humanoid crouching and running poses can be re-created for EVA Unit-01. This kit includes a recreation of the transport platform that launches the Eva units as well as special AT Field penetration hand parts and PET effect for AT Field. Includes Entry Plug, Pallet Rifle, 2 Progressive Knives, Umbilical Cable, and 7 types of hands in different expressions.      Product Features  6.89 inches (17.5cm) From the “Rebuild of Evangelion” movies Made of plastic Figure is poseable when assembled Includes a recreation of the transport platform that launches the Eva units Also includes special AT Field penetration hand parts and PET effect for AT Field        Box Contents  Pieces to build  EVA Unit-01 Transport platform   Special AT Field penetration hand parts PET effect for AT Field Entry Plug Pallet rifle 2 Progressive knives Umbilical cable 7 Interchangeable hands</p>','{\"line\": \"RG - Real Grade\", \"brand\": \"Neon Genesis Evangelion\", \"scale\": \"1/144\"}','2026-02-10 03:57:21','2026-02-10 03:57:21'),
(2297,53,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/8OAsFkZGdBzqd0sciak5/h/sdcs-20-gbm-gundam-calibarn','Bandai SDCS 20 GBM Gundam Calibarn - Newtype','<p>The Gundam Calibarn from &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam: The Witch From Mercury&quot; is now an SD Gundam Cross Silhouette (SDCS) model kit from Bandai! Parts to duplicate the rainbow-colored shine that covers the whole body shell when the &quot;Permet Score&quot; exceeds level 8 are included! The non-emitting shell unit is reproduced with smoked black parts, and the red shell unit representing &quot;Permet Score 5&quot; is also reproduced with stickers! You can use the SD or CS frames in the upper body to select your favorite head and body shape. Interchangeable hands, including hands for holding weapons, and flat hands are included. The &quot;Bit-on&quot; form that attaches the &quot;Bit Stave&quot; to the body is also reproduced, and the &quot;Quadra Thruster&quot; at the rear of the &quot;Variable Rod Rifle&quot; can be opened and closed. The legs have movable parts that can also be transformed into high maneuver mode!    Box Contents  Pieces to build:  Gundam Calibarn Variable rod rifle Escutcheon 2x Beam saber grips Hand parts set     Marking Stickers Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"SD - Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\", \"series\": \"The Witch From Mercury\"}','2026-02-10 03:59:15','2026-02-10 03:59:15'),
(2298,50,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/vy8jipZbqQCVXhaAvgbE/h/sdcs-21-mighty-strike-freedom-gundam','Bandai SDCS 21 Mighty Strike Freedom Gundam - Newtype','<p>The Mighty Strike Freedom Gundam from the Mobile Suit Gundam SEED Freedom anime has been brought to life in three dimensions with the SD Cross Silhouette series. This series features two unique frame types: the taller head body (CS) and the shorter head body (SD). The model&#039;s details are captured in a striking gold color. Decal options are provided to choose whether or not to include pupils. The &quot;Proud Defender&quot; can mimic flight modes, and the wing armor slides and moves to simulate an extended state. It comes with the anti-ship sword &quot;Futsuno Mitama,&quot; and it&#039;s possible to equip it with both the sword and the beam saber. The forehead beam cannon&#039;s firing mode is replicated by the opening and closing of vents. Additionally, the beam saber and beam rifle can be connected, enhancing the model&#039;s dynamic display possibilities.      Product Features  Made of plastic Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam SEED Freedom anime Part of the SD Gundam Cross Silhouette series Multiple points of articulation Interchangeable parts and accessories        Box Contents    Mighty Strike Freedom Gundam Anti-ship Sword (Futsuno Mitama) 2 Beam Rifles 2 Beam Sabers</p>','{\"line\": \"SD - Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\", \"series\": \"Gundam Seed Freedom\"}','2026-02-10 04:01:13','2026-02-10 04:01:13'),
(2299,58,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/KVaw26IKG0ixtqUE8vq9/h/sdcs-19-unicorn-gundam-02-banshee-destroy-mode-banshee-norn-parts-set','Bandai SDCS 19 Unicorn Gundam 02 Banshee [Destroy Mode] & Banshee Norn Parts Set - Newtype','<p>The Unicorn Gundam 2 Banshee in Destroy Mode joins the &quot;SD Gundam Cross Silhouette&quot; model-kit lineup from Bandai! It comes with a smaller SD frame and a slightly taller CS frame with more realistic proportions; a wealth of weapons that can reproduce the Banshee and Banshee Norn are included too! Three types of Armed Armor and a revolving launcher are included, all newly molded. 3D metallic seals for the Armed Armor BS are included, as are two types of eye expression stickers.    Product Features  Made of plastic Based on the &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn&quot; anime series Part of the SD Gundam Cross Silhouette series Highly detailed Includes parts and accessories        Box Contents  Pieces to build:  Banshee/Banshee Norn Armed Armor BS Armed Armor VN Armed Armor DE Armed Armor XC Beam magnum Revolving launcher 2x Beam saber     Eye stickers 3D Metallic stickers Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"SD - Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\", \"series\": \"Gundam Unicorn\"}','2026-02-10 04:02:24','2026-02-10 04:02:24'),
(2300,289,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/wterrtvejnOf2FWv8BIz/h/sdex-standard-08-00-gundam','Bandai SDEX-Standard 08 00 Gundam - Newtype','<p>Part of the new SD Gundam EX-Standard product line the 00 Gundam has been recreated with an emphasis on articulation and enhanced proportion.      Product Features  Product Size: 3&quot; 00 Gundam Has Been Recreated With an Emphasis on Articulation        Box Contents  Swords Shields  Runner X4  Sticker  Instruction Manual</p>','{\"line\": \"SD - Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\", \"series\": \"Gundam 00\"}','2026-02-10 04:03:17','2026-02-10 04:03:17'),
(2301,176,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/GP81LBhwpuFNcHQ0ktrd/h/sdex-standard-19-gundam-aerial','Bandai SDEX-Standard 19 Gundam Aerial - Newtype','<p>The Gundam Aerial from &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam: The Witch of Mercury&quot; gets a new SD Gundam EX model kit from Bandai! It&#039;s adorably super-deformed, yet stylish and highly detailed, with a high degree of posability. It comes with its beam saber, beam rifle and shield. The rifle can be stowed on the back, and the shield can be separated and connected to the shoulder, too!    Product Features  Made of plastic Super Deformed model kit Articulated figure once completed From the &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam: The Witch From Mercury&quot; anime series        Box Contents  Piece to build  Gundam Aerial Beam saber Beam rifle Shield   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"SD - Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\", \"series\": \"The Witch From Mercury\"}','2026-02-10 04:05:19','2026-02-10 04:05:19'),
(2302,10,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/rNgztmhlTXIzbA66T8eS/h/sdex-standard-01-rx-78-2-gundam','Bandai SDEX-Standard 01 RX-78-2 Gundam - Newtype','<p>The SD EX-Standard series is a revitalization of the Super Deformed Gundam style, which features chibi sized Gundams. The new EX-Standard series has stronger proportions for the limbs which allow increased articulation, and also cross compatibility with HG kits first seen in the SD Build Fighters models. The first unit launching is the iconic RX-78-2 from the very first Gundam series. Includes beam rifle, beam saber, and shield. Runner x 5, sticker, Instruction ManualApprox 3&quot; Tall</p>','{\"line\": \"SD - Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\", \"series\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\"}','2026-02-10 04:06:17','2026-02-10 04:06:17'),
(2303,275,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/QGDshPJdIM5rIXs7oFNJ/h/sdex-standard-17-sazabi','Bandai SDEX-Standard 17 Sazabi - Newtype','<p>From the animated film Mobile Suit Gundam: Char&#039;s Counterattack comes the Mobile Suit Sazabi as a Super Deformed model kit! When completed, this Gundam stands around 3 inches tall and includes pieces to build its weapon and shield.      Product Features  3.34 inches (8.5cm) Part of the SD EX-Standard model kit line Based on the Mobile Suit Gundam: Char&#039;s Counterattack movie Features the Sazabi in Super Deformed mode Action Base not included        Box Contents  Pieces to build  SD Sazabi Beam Shot Rifle Beam Tomahawk Shield   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"SD - Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\", \"series\": \"Char\'s Counterattack\"}','2026-02-10 04:08:14','2026-02-10 04:08:14'),
(2304,276,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/M1rp6lWHgYzNoxyJXOK0/h/sdex-standard-18-wing-gundam-zero','Bandai SDEX-Standard 18 Wing Gundam Zero - Newtype','<p>Wing Gundam Zero of Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz is being released as an SD Gundam EX-Standard model kit! With its stylish proportions and ease of assembly, this is a kit everyone will love!      Product Features  Made of plastic Super deformed model kit Articulated figure once completed From Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Wing Gundam Zero Shield Twin Buster Rifle Beam Saber   Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"SD - Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\", \"series\": \"Gundam Wing\"}','2026-02-10 04:09:16','2026-02-10 04:09:16'),
(2305,79,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/45Fua4fQqzU098WNMZPF/h/sdex-standard-04-wing-gundam-zero-ew','Bandai SDEX-Standard 04 Wing Gundam Zero (EW) - Newtype','<p>The SD EX-Standard line welcomes the always popular Wing Gundam Zero ver EW from Gundam Wing Endless Waltz! Featuring full bodied limbs, more normal proportion, and increased articulation, its iconic Twin Buster Rifle firing pose can be faithfully recreated while still maintaining the SD line&#039;s cuteness! Twin Buster Rifles can also separate to be held in each hand and model comes with beam saber. Runner x 5, sticker, Instruction ManualApprox 3&quot; Tall</p>','{\"line\": \"SD - Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-10 04:10:15','2026-02-10 04:10:15'),
(2306,44,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/uZIL5VYGsYPIbDhVMlGU/h/sd-sangoku-soketsuden-04-cao-cao-wing-gundam','Bandai SD Sangoku Soketsuden 04 Cao Cao Wing Gundam - Newtype','<p>From the SD Sangoku Soketsuden comes the Cao Cao Wing Gundam. As the young CEO of the Blue Wing Corporation and leader of the Wei Area, he possesses his own unique set of values and seeks to know more about Liu Bei Unicorn Gundam. His two blades can be combined to form Sou-souhaken. Memories can attach onto the back of the model and it comes with a blue memory part.      Product Features  3.50 inches (8.90cm) Made of plastic From the SD Sangokuden Soketsuden series Blades can be combined to form Sou-souhaken Memories can attach onto the back of the model  Red and yellow memories not included        Box Contents  Pieces to build Cao Cao Wing Gundam  2 Blades Blue memory part Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"SD - Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\", \"series\": \"Gundam World Sangoku Soketsuden\"}','2026-02-10 04:11:17','2026-02-10 04:11:17'),
(2307,20,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/JCxdSGI5SurUoWzSlzbr/h/sdbf-030-star-winning-gundam','Bandai SDBF 030 Star Winning Gundam - Newtype','<p>Add to your Gundam collection with this SDBF Star Winning Gundam Model Kit from Bandai Spirits!       Product Features  Made of plastic Part of the SDBF series Action Base not included        Box Contents  Pieces to build  Star Winning Gundam  Beach machine gun blade 2 Large effect parts 2 Small effect parts   Instructions</p>','{\"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\", \"series\": \"Gundam Build Fighters\"}','2026-02-10 04:12:15','2026-02-10 04:12:15'),
(2308,177,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/l5FLEKYEcHU60oGISpe7/h/sdw-heroes-38-captain-qan-t-gf','Bandai SDW Heroes 38 Captain Qan[T] GF - Newtype','<p>A new hero joins the SDW Heroes model kit lineup! This impressive kit incorporates clear parts throughout its body, including its shield, for a visually striking appearance. Featuring high-density mechanical detailing, this model showcases the unique aesthetic of SD Gundam, bringing a compact yet powerful presence to your collection. Equipped with a versatile arsenal, Captain Qan[T] GF includes three different weapons:  Rifle – A standard firearm for precision attacks. Railgun – A high-powered long-range weapon. Shield – Designed with transparent elements for a dramatic effect.  This kit also offers expandability—pair it with the separately sold GF Gundam Astraea Type-B and SDW Heroes GF Gundam Astraea Type-F to unlock additional customization and special features! Product Features  Made of plastic Based on the SD Gundam World Heroes anime Part of the SDW Heroes series Includes three types of weaponry for varied display options Multiple points of articulation upon assembly  Box Contents  Pieces to build Captain Qan[T] GF Rifle Shield Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"SD - Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\", \"series\": \"SD Gundam World Heroes\"}','2026-02-10 04:13:17','2026-02-10 04:13:17'),
(2309,178,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/mar3CYEonDWZBpGWi5o3/h/sdw-heroes-39-gf-gundam-astraea-type-b','Bandai SDW Heroes 39 GF Gundam Astraea Type-B - Newtype','<p>A new hero has entered the SDW Heroes model kit lineup! This impressive unit is equipped with a large, high-volume armament mounted on its back, further amplifying its striking mechanical presence. With intricate detailing and a high-density mechanical design, this model kit captures the essence of the SD Gundam World Heroes series. The included beam saber can be attached to the shield, adding versatility and dynamic display options. For even greater customization, pair this kit with SDW Heroes Captain Qan[T] GF and SDW Heroes GF Gundam Astraea Type-F (sold separately) to expand display possibilities and enhance its gimmicks. Product Features  Made of plastic Based on the SD Gundam World Heroes anime Part of the SDW Heroes series Features a massive armament mounted on its back Includes interchangeable parts for customization Multiple points of articulation for dynamic posing  Box Contents  Pieces to build Gundam Astraea Type-B Beam Saber Shield Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"SD - Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\", \"series\": \"SD Gundam World Heroes\"}','2026-02-10 04:14:15','2026-02-10 04:14:15'),
(2310,179,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/FSDsKdsYPDmRjpFqmSnU/h/sdw-heroes-40-gf-gundam-astraea-type-f','Bandai SDW Heroes 40 GF Gundam Astraea Type-F - Newtype','<p>A new hero enters the SDW Heroes model kit lineup! This formidable unit boasts large, dedicated shoulder and leg attachments, enhancing its commanding presence on the battlefield. The high-density mechanical detailing, a signature of SD Gundam designs, ensures that every aspect of this kit is intricately crafted. Adding to its versatility, the beam saber can be conveniently mounted onto the shield, providing multiple display and combat options. For even greater customization, pair this kit with SDW Heroes Captain Qan[T] GF and SDW Heroes GF Gundam Astraea Type-B (sold separately) to unlock expanded gimmicks and enhanced display possibilities. Product Features  Made of plastic Based on the SD Gundam World Heroes anime Part of the SDW Heroes series Equipped with large shoulder and leg units for an imposing look Includes interchangeable parts and accessories for customization Multiple points of articulation for dynamic poses  Box Contents  Pieces to build Gundam Astraea Type-F Beam Saber Shield Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"SD - Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-10 04:15:17','2026-02-10 04:15:17'),
(2311,180,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/IzLXoRj3wM9upGWJpHeu/h/sdw-heroes-25-leif-gundam-gp04','Bandai SDW Heroes 25 Leif Gundam GP04 - Newtype','<p>Leif Gundam is a new hero with a distinctive cloak and shoulder silhouette and a phantom prototype GP04 motif! His silhouette changes completely when you replace the cloak parts. In addition to the dedicated dagger, a shield for Knight Strike Gundam (sold separately) is also included. Part of the cloak can be attached to Knight Strike Gundam, too!    Product Features  Made of plastic  Based on the SD Gundam World Heroes: The Legend of the Dragon Knight anime Articulated figure once complete Includes a shield for Knight Strike Gundam (sold separately)         Box Contents  Pieces to build:   Leif Gundam GP04 Cape set Quartet Dagger Sincerity Shield     Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"SD - Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\", \"series\": \"SD Gundam World Heroes\"}','2026-02-10 04:16:17','2026-02-10 04:16:17'),
(2312,12,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/RdF0pnUbmWbje67bkIio/h/sdw-heroes-36-musha-gundam-the-78th','Bandai SDW Heroes 36 Musha Gundam The 78th - Newtype','<p>The new generation of Musha Gundam proudly enters the &quot;SDW Heroes&quot; battle lineup with new &quot;Kirako&quot; parts! The &quot;Kirako&quot; parts are made with an in-mold technology that simultaneously performs injection molding and film attachment to produce parts with a rich, gleaming appearance!  &quot;Kira steel&quot; is used for the sword, and the stance of drawing a sword from its sheath can be easily reproduced thanks to his elbows&#039; superior range of motion!    Product Features  Made of plastic  Articulated figure once complete Based on the &quot;SD Gundam World Heroes&quot; anime        Box Contents  Pieces to build:  78th Musha Gundam figure Sword Sheath     Decal sheet Instructions</p>','{\"line\": \"SD - Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-10 04:18:15','2026-02-10 04:18:15'),
(2313,181,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/U7dBxhn6clvTSeJ3auH2/h/sdw-heroes-27-zhao-yun-00-gundam-command-package','Bandai SDW Heroes 27 Zhao Yun 00 Gundam [Command Package] - Newtype','<p>Zhao Yun from &quot;SD Gundam World Sangoku Sojuden&quot; is now available in a new form, with the new Command Package giving him a larger and more impressive form! Some of the hatches can be opened and closed, and each part, including the wing, is equipped with a common 3mm shaft and many 4mm diameter ball joints for posability. He can be attached to the SD Sangoku Soketsuden Trinity Bike (sold separately). The characteristic effect parts are molded in clear yellow as well!      Product Features  4.50 inches (11.43cm) Made of plastic From the &quot;SDW Heroes&quot; series Shoulders and caps can be flexibly articulated Action Base not included        Box Contents  Pieces to build:    Zhao Yun 00 Gundam Command Package    Stickers</p>','{\"line\": \"SD - Super Deformed\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-10 04:19:16','2026-02-10 04:19:16'),
(2314,200,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/ZhDOdRyGdDrERpgemYyK/h/megami-device-sol-raptor-beast-mode','Kotobukiya Megami Device Sol Raptor Beast Mode - Newtype','<p>The sleek and agile SOL Raptor returns in an all-new form—Beast Mode—from Kotobukiya’s hit collaboration with the mobile game Alice Gear Aegis! This enhanced model kit delivers an upgraded arsenal, a fierce new color scheme, and multiple configuration options that push the boundaries of customization and dynamic posing. Beast Mode features a dramatic loadout overhaul, headlined by multi-missile launchers that sacrifice stealth for overwhelming firepower. The model’s aircraft-inspired design is enhanced with new armor and wing parts, boosting both its visual presence and play value.  Built on the flexible Machineca body, SOL Raptor Beast Mode offers a natural range of motion—perfect for dynamic action poses, kneeling, or seated stances. As with other Kotobukiya kits, this model is fully compatible with the M.S.G, Frame Arms, Frame Arms Girl, Hexa Gear, Sousai Shojo Teien, Arcanadea, and Megalomaria series via 3mm connection points. Included are three pre-painted face parts, eye and body marking decals, and a variety of customizable accessories that allow the kit to shift between “Armed Mode” (with armor) and “Unarmed Mode” (without armor). Several wing configurations enable expressive airborne poses or close-range battle displays. For an extra dash of creativity, parts can be rearranged to form a horned owl-inspired mecha, showcasing the adaptability of this beastly unit. A special present code is also included, unlocking exclusive in-game gear for SOL Raptor in Alice Gear Aegis. Product Features  New Beast Mode color scheme with added volume and weapons Equipped with multi-missile launchers for powerful attacks Comes with 3 pre-painted face parts and eye/body decals Flexible Machineca base body allows natural, expressive articulation Fully compatible with other Kotobukiya original kits via 3mm joints Includes present code for exclusive Alice Gear Aegis in-game gear   Box Contents  SOL Raptor Beast Mode model kit Three pre-painted face parts Missile launchers, wing components, and weapon accessories  Eye and body marking decals Present code for Alice Gear Aegis in-game gear Instruction manual</p>','{\"brand\": \"Megami Device\", \"scale\": \"1/1\"}','2026-02-10 04:21:16','2026-02-10 04:21:16'),
(2315,199,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/hAOdNjJErpNuYVqbEkqs/h/megami-device-x-alice-gear-aegis-sugumi-kanagata','Kotobukiya Megami Device X Alice Gear Aegis Sugumi Kanagata - Newtype','<p>The latest model to join Kotobukiya’s original Megami Device series is top actress Sugumi Kanagata from the popular mobile game, Alice Gear Aegis!  As an added bonus, the kit comes with a present code to receive an item in the game as well as a code to watch a special OVA only included in this kit. Sugumi’s character design was made by Pyramid, and the gear parts design used in this model kit were made by Kanetake Ebikawa! The complex color scheme of the in-game design is recreated through the detailed division of parts which makes this model easy to assemble without painting. This model comes with a rifle, a one-handed sword, various gears, and even an SP weapon for added protection! As part of the Megami Device series, the model consists of the base “machinika” body designed by Masaki Apsy and a variety of unique armor and weapons. While making balance adjustments to the overall body, the distinctive ★4 costume has been perfectly recreated. Eye decals have been renewed with R66’s charm, keeping the model kit as close to the original as possible. Model Specifications:  The kit will include a code to watch an all-new Alice Gear Aegis OVA.  The kit will include a present code for use in the game. The kit includes three different pre-printed face parts. The Tops Gear can be adjusted to look similar to that in the game. Powerful effect parts are made of clear plastic parts.  The kit includes a variety of gear parts and SP weapon parts, allowing users to recreate a variety of combat scenes. The model can be constructed with her signature gear in “Armed Mode,” or without armor and weapons in “Unarmed Mode.” The model is equipped with several 3mm connection points, making it compatible with existing M.S.G, Frame Arms, Frame Arms Girl, Hexa Gear, and Sousai Shojo Teien A14:D52parts. The kit includes a variety of decals for the eyes and other markings.</p>','{\"brand\": \"Megami Device\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-10 04:23:15','2026-02-10 04:23:15'),
(2316,660,'newtype',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-10 04:23:16','2026-02-10 04:23:16'),
(2317,662,'newtype',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-10 04:23:17','2026-02-10 04:23:17'),
(2318,661,'newtype',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-10 04:24:14','2026-02-10 04:24:14'),
(2319,191,'newtype','https://newtype.us/p/gYjahQRbWe34v6RK2m0r/h/zakupla-kun-3d-rubber-mascot-keychain','Bandai Zakupla-Kun 3D Rubber Mascot Keychain - Newtype','<p>Carry a piece of Gunpla spirit wherever you go with the Zakupla-Kun 3D Rubber Mascot Keychain! This adorable and expressive rubber charm brings a fun twist to the world of plastic models. With its bold detailing and stylized 3D form, Zakupla-Kun is instantly recognizable and perfect for fans of all ages. Attach it to your keys, backpack, model kit case, or display it alongside your Gunpla collection—it’s the perfect combination of fandom and functionality. Made from durable, high-quality rubber with a metal keyring attachment, this mascot is ready to follow you on your next build or convention visit. Features:   Official Zakupla-Kun character in 3D rubber mascot form   High-quality rubber with vibrant detailing and layered depth   Sturdy metal keyring and clasp for secure attachment   Great for keychains, bags, lanyards, or collectible displays   A must-have for Gunpla builders and collectors</p>','{\"line\": \"Keychain\", \"brand\": \"Mobile Suit Gundam\", \"scale\": \"non\"}','2026-02-10 04:25:14','2026-02-10 04:25:14'),
(2320,190,'newtype',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-02-10 04:25:16','2026-02-10 04:25:16');
